ttings, Controls, Full screen, Help, Save\\n   *  session (while the page is recorded: E.session), Quit */\\n  _pauseActs(acts) {\\n    const g = this._game, fs = g.fullscreen, M = g.o.menu || {}, quit = M.quit === false ? null : M.quit || 'title', help = this._o.screens && this._o.screens.help;\\n    if (this._std && HOOKS.pause) HOOKS.pause(this, acts);\\n    if (this._std || this._items().length) acts.push(['Settings', () => this.show('settings')]);\\n    if (!this._std) { if (help) acts.push(['Help', () => this.show('help')]); return; }\\n    acts.push(['Controls', () => this.show('controls')]);\\n    if (g.o.fullscreen !== false && fs.supported && !fs.standalone) acts.push([fs.on ? 'Leave full screen' : 'Full screen', () => { fs.toggle(); }]);\\n    if (help) acts.push(['Help', () => this.show('help')]);\\n    // a recorded page (?record=1) saves its session from the menu: a phone has no console (the share sheet, or a download).\\n\",\"total_lines\":14974}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"670c566e-a035-42ac-a894-b06335bb33a2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_24","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan is set. I am beginning to write the game.\n\nThe codebase will be written in large chunks. The core architecture is being designed so activities run both visually and in headless tests. A strict script load order is planned: engine first, then readable, mocap, fitclips, data, balance, rigs, audio, and UI.\n\nThe script order now includes activities, scenes, and boot.js. The file layout will be kept as planned to reduce errors. A shared activity runner is being designed: G.runActivity will read contestant intents, step balance, call the activity update, and return results when time expires. Each activity module will register itself with G.activity.\n\nThe scene generator will create one scene per activity. Each scene is pausable and uses the activity's view and camera. The update loop drives a phase machine through card, demo, count, play, and results. Tests can skip the card intro by passing skipIntro: true.\n\nThe test harness will iterate over every activity, tier, and skill to validate star counts via snapshots. Each run uses skipIntro and a fixed duration. A full rules test suite would require roughly 576,000 steps across all combinations.\n\nHeadless rig solving could take roughly 170 seconds across all test frames. The scoring logic does not need the body, so I will benchmark quickly and skip mocap sampling in headless mode when no drawing is needed. The real activity update still runs to validate scores.\n\nRig updates will run every step by default. Headless tests may optimize to every fourth frame if profiling shows slowdown. A single stork run will be profiled first.\n\nA four-contestant class scene is being designed for testing. Three players will be added via game.addPlayer and driven by script input to score and podium. A fake hub client is also being drafted for headless testing.\n\nThe fake hub client is being completed with send, progress, result, time, and rng methods. A timing issue was spotted: the game currently checks AIHub.active during construction, so a headless test must set that flag before the game script loads. The plan is to either run the game twice or defer the check to start().\n\nThe game constructor now uses `autoPause` and `live` flags based on the session state. A headless test will load the engine and game in a fresh Node VM with a stubbed AIHub before any scripts run. Without a real session, the page starts at the title scene and `AIHub.connect()` returns null.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bc3ed490-b914-498b-8114-7617018d0a24-42","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Controller or keyboard required|touch: 'never'|need-pad|data-sys=need","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5689,"output_tokens":1573,"cache_read_input_tokens":140288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"8f501b6f-a73a-4b5d-8d31-100eb8246a11"}
