'plank' | 'timber' | 'plaster' | 'hedge' | 'none' | any material id or '#hex pattern'\"},{\"line_number\":752,\"content\":\"- `new E.TileMap({ types[id].roof })`: the top's material: 'speckle' (default) | 'plain' | 'tiles' (roof shingles) | 'slab' (paving) | 'leaves' | 'grass' | any material id or '#hex pattern'\"},{\"line_number\":753,\"content\":\"- `new E.TileMap({ floorTex })`: floorTex(x, y, floorTag, view) -> [r, g, b] or [r, g, b, glow]\"},{\"line_number\":754,\"content\":\"- `new E.TileMap({ floorMat, floorMats })`: a material for the floor, floorMats: { tag: material } for tagged cells (in place of floorTex)\"},{\"line_number\":755,\"content\":\"- `new E.TileMap({ block })`: ['water', 'lava'] floor tags nobody can walk on (or put block: true in a legend entry)\"},{\"line_number\":756,\"content\":\"- `new E.TileMap({ chunks })`: bake the floor in squares near the camera (true, false; by default a map of more than 128 x 128 cells)\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"29e2452c-0f0f-41f7-bba1-ec7361932bd7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_28","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Gamepad axes[1] maps to padMove y, with positive values pointing downward.\n\nDefined the input coordinate system: padMove[0] is right, and uy = -padMove[1] makes stick up positive y. Keyboard WASD maps to forward (+y), back (-y), left, and right. The lean input uses input.move(), which returns x right and y down.\n\nMouse input scales pointer offset from screen centre by 1/3 of the screen height, with up mapped to forward. The device source will be determined by checking the last device type first, then falling back to compare mouse activity against the last key press time.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6f96071c-ed62-4e60-a4b5-52de6c5bc6b3-48","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function rng|E\\.rng =","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":5}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6f96071c-ed62-4e60-a4b5-52de6c5bc6b3-49","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":160,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1483,"output_tokens":671,"cache_read_input_tokens":156032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"9855a354-5418-41e5-9c2a-ee8aef6b41e7"}
