{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3f0ea72e-9216-40f5-a571-a9bad39d55e8-57","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/* FITCLIPS: an animation set in my-3D2dge's readable format (written by the tools in tools/; clips may be edited by hand).\\n * Mesh2Motion (CC0), Quaternius (CC0), CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (free for all uses)\\n * 23 clips, 560 key poses. Played by src/mocap/mocap.js with src/mocap/readable.js. \\\"sources\\\" holds the proportions\\n * each library was measured with; \\\"fit\\\" each clip's average and worst body-point error against its capture (mm).\\n * my-3D2dge readable clip. Times in seconds; every other number is a whole number. Rig frame: forward, right, up.\\n * L and R are the figure's own sides. Directions are percentages and need not add up: [100, 0, 0] and [50, 0, 0] agree.\\n * hips   [forward, right, up]   the pelvis, in percent of standing hip height (100 = standing, 55 = sitting on a chair)\\n * body   [turn, lean, tilt]     the pelvis, degrees: turn + = toward the right, lean + = forward, tilt + = toward the right\\n * chest  [turn, lean, tilt]     the chest, relative to the pelvis        head [turn, lean, tilt]  relative to the chest\\n10→ * shL shR    [reach, shrug]     degrees the shoulder swings forward (into a punch or an aim) and up, from rest\\n * armL armR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  which way the arm points from the shoulder to the fist, in chest space\\n *            (out + = away from the body on that side; [0, 0, -100] hangs down, [100, 0, 0] punches ahead);\\n *            bend = elbow bend in degrees (0 = straight); twist = degrees the elbow swings round the arm from its\\n *            natural direction (back and down)\\n * legL legR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  hip to ankle in pelvis space; bend: the knee; twist: from pointing forward\\n * footL footR [down, out, toes]   degrees the foot points down from standing, turns outward, and the toes bend up\\n * blade  [forward, right, up]   (sword clips) the direction of a blade held in the right fist, in chest space\\n * root   [forward, right]       (clips that travel) how far the whole body has moved, in percent of standing hip height\\n */\\n20→(window.MOCAP = window.MOCAP || {})[\\\"FITCLIPS\\\"] = {\\n\\\"set\\\": \\\"FITCLIPS\\\",\\n\\\"format\\\": 1,\\n\\\"credit\\\": \\\"Mesh2Motion (CC0), Quaternius (CC0), CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (free for all uses)\\\",\\n\\\"from\\\": [\\\"MESH2MOTION\\\",\\\"CMU\\\",\\\"CMU_111\\\",\\\"CMU_22\\\"],\\n\\\"fps\\\": 30,\\n\\\"sources\\\": {\\\"M2M_QUATERNIUS\\\":{\\\"file\\\":\\\"human-base-animations.glb\\\",\\\"rig\\\":\\\"unreal\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Quaternius, via Mesh2Motion\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"Quaternius' Universal Animation Library 1 and 2 as Mesh2Motion re-exported them on its human rig (human-base-animations.glb). Library 1's clips run 25% longer than in Quaternius' own files, and a few are trimmed or end back on their feet. Each clip's orig names the Quaternius clip it was made from\\\",\\\"license\\\":\\\"CC0 1.0\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/Mesh2Motion/mesh2motion-app\\\",\\\"rest\\\":{\\\"H0\\\":877.17,\\\"hipZ\\\":897.3,\\\"ankleZ\\\":103.14,\\\"Pr\\\":[[0.96886,0.22946,0.09309],[-0.23046,0.97308,0],[-0.09058,-0.02145,0.99566]],\\\"Cr\\\":[[0.97145,0.22912,-0.06163],[-0.22961,0.97328,-0.001],[0.05975,0.01512,0.9981]],\\\"Hr\\\":[[0.96186,0.03059,-0.27182],[-0.04535,0.99781,-0.04819],[0.26975,0.05868,0.96114]],\\\"hip\\\":{\\\"L\\\":[51.5,-89,15.4],\\\"R\\\":[51.5,89,15.4]},\\\"spine\\\":[[21.3,5,136.4],[3.6,0.8,124],[8.3,2,141],[9.9,2.5,165.1]],\\\"neckSeg\\\":[52.3,12.4,87.7],\\\"clav\\\":{\\\"L\\\":[105.2,-18.8,-42],\\\"R\\\":[105.2,18.8,-42]},\\\"cv\\\":{\\\"L\\\":[-119.4,-186.3,-0.9],\\\"R\\\":[-154.8,158,6.8]},\\\"topH\\\":[0,0,67.3],\\\"faceH\\\":[119.9,0,3.9],\\\"up\\\":274.44,\\\"fore\\\":272.64,\\\"knuck\\\":119.81,\\\"fist\\\":