{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_82","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `_next` state is entered at the start of the next step, before the input tick.\n\nThe queued scene change only takes effect after the next step begins. A test must advance one extra frame to verify the new scene.\n\nThe test will verify the flag is false at 9.9 seconds and true at 10.0 seconds. The attract flag will be set immediately when the timer fires, but the scene transition will wait for the next step. Once triggered, the flag stays true to prevent double-firing. Entering the title scene resets the idle timer.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-84322926-3cef-4a27-9d18-b4c589d7de84-68","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"class Shell","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2865,"output_tokens":471,"cache_read_input_tokens":163712,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"8852d25d-fb46-47b2-bb73-1a09e6fe5a71"}
