{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_85","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Game constructor creates a system shell when the menu parameter is not false.\n\nA custom shell replaces the system one. The menu items array must be created at boot time after G.dev is defined. The Restart Session menu item will return to the current member's bungalow or island, or the title screen if none exists.\n\nRestart Session will resume the current activity if the player is already playing, otherwise return to the island. The Quit menu item will autosave before exiting to the title screen. Deep links with a #hub hash will route to the round scene when no session is active.\n\nDeep links will support #act/stork/1 for free play jumps, #day/3 to set the day and island, and #ending to jump to an ending with a member. VM tests must provide location with hash and search fields so session.js does not throw. The engine checks for document, addEventListener, and navigator, all of which must exist in test environments.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5496441b-04af-47a4-90a2-d13dda765e37-71","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"const store|localStorage","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":497,"output_tokens":611,"cache_read_input_tokens":168704,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"14ee5367-c3b0-4172-826f-7cb104534e39"}
