{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_123","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Menu items are concatenated into pause actions.\n\nButton items will use `['Label', fn]` format. Menu controls map plain names to actions and hide unused ones with `false`. The engine converts these into `input.names`.\n\nI verified the engine maps `menu.controls` to `input.names`. I will name essential controls and hide only unused ones. I also plan to add anisotropic scaling to balance.js.\n\nI will retest the engine after the balance.js edit. I am drafting lines.js with 150+ strings across multiple categories.\n\nVerbatim lines must appear exactly as written. I have chosen twelve activity names. I will write in a dense but readable style. The test runner only prints failures and a count line, so game console output would pollute the output. Engine warnings should go to console.warn.\n\nThe log dev tool will write to a global string variable instead of console.log. Tests can then read that string directly. This keeps the test runner output clean.\n\nThe test runner will wrap the game in a VM with a silent console. This prevents any game output from reaching the real console. The runner catches exceptions and prints only failures.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bb956c9d-96f4-4f20-9aa9-3604b2ed8123-49","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function warn\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5521,"output_tokens":1007,"cache_read_input_tokens":168960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"f2744e1e-dadf-49dc-95f1-5d8dc6ca84a1"}
