{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_141","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The game must call AIHub.\n\nReady() must fire after boot without a key press, or the harness will press Enter. During the ~6 second play period, ghosts and progress must be sent. timeUp() expects a result with status 'played'. The first player is exempt from ghost sending but still needs progress reported.\n\nGhosts and progress should be sent as soon as the round begins, including during the 3-second countdown. The harness may timeUp after that countdown ends.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-35555d32-c7df-417a-922c-37f39e20d39d-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"goAt","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/vendor/session.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-35555d32-c7df-417a-922c-37f39e20d39d-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":2700,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-35555d32-c7df-417a-922c-37f39e20d39d-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":3040,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4813,"output_tokens":729,"cache_read_input_tokens":117120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"4f052bae-ca68-417e-a6da-061ed40c333b"}
