{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_165","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have enough information to write the code.\n\nWriting play.js, world.js, and boot.js. Screen dimensions and pointer coordinates are available. Mouse lean will be calculated from the centre offset divided by height times reach. Key input will use input.down() for both action buttons and WASD keys.\n\nThe lean value must be read after the test input hook sets padMove. This requires placing the read in a step hook or at the start of scene update, since tick zeros padMove and input hooks run before scene update.\n\nBoot's input hook would read padMove as zero because the test hook runs later. The lean value will be captured in a step hook registered at boot, before scene update.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4820b4a0-8c10-4cbe-ac63-9cb7821227cb-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":3960,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4820b4a0-8c10-4cbe-ac63-9cb7821227cb-25","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"value\\(a\\)|prototype\\.value","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4820b4a0-8c10-4cbe-ac63-9cb7821227cb-26","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":2688,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11736,"output_tokens":897,"cache_read_input_tokens":104192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"8d8