{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_167","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A dialog update at speed 1e6 reaches its full length before the confirm check.\n\nOne confirm tap advances the page immediately. Both onChoice and onDone fire when a choice is confirmed.\n\nOnly one callback will be set per dialog. Choice dialogs use onChoice alone to advance scenes. Non-choice dialogs use onDone.\n\nclose() consumes all input so pills cannot intercept the confirm. The phase stays 'talk' while the dialog is open, preventing pill confirms. After go() runs, the phase becomes 'auto' for the next scene to block leftover confirms.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-620768f2-d9de-456d-bea8-00219c1060f5-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"settings:\\s*\\[|Settings\\.define|key: 'music'","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine","glob":"*.md","head_limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-620768f2-d9de-456d-bea8-00219c1060f5-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":3055,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3454,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":120448,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"0df48ac0-8c07-47d4-a96b-567c4736833c"}
