{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_171","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The music clock works headless via the game.\n\nThe 256-step chart matches the song length exactly. At 100 BPM the piece lasts about 38 seconds, so the activity will end when the rhythm finishes or after 60 seconds.\n\nThe session limit will be derived from the chart length so the activity ends cleanly. A helper function calculates duration from part count, step size, and tempo.\n\nThe second tier lasts 28 seconds. The test will assert play time stays within one second of the chart limit. The class step may run longer than the song but scores on accuracy. I will write play.js, world.js, and boot.js as complete files.\n\nThe remaining files are index.html, build.mjs, and tests. The script load order is lines, content, balance, audio, rigs, ui, play, world, boot. This avoids a G.busy timing issue because boot.js loads after ui.js. Dialog styling will use white, light blue, and teal accents.\n\nDialog speed is set to 1e6 and voice uses babble. Shell theme and CSS go in index.html and build.mjs. A hover focus listener goes in boot if document exists. Every scene camera has zoom disabled. The title scene may be non-pausable so the pause key does not trap it.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-56b87ed2-69f0-4520-b214-07d0546e2024-38","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Enter|views|filled|error","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/tools/check.mjs","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10427,"output_tokens":1079,"cache_read_input_tokens":137088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"6ea9368a-b017-4bba-b1ac-9af4744a9318"}
