{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9cac41fa-8f8f-4e8a-8072-4ff62723e726-54","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"12827→class PBody {\\n  /** made by world.add (and its shorthands): see the manual */\\n  constructor(world, d) {\\n12830→    Object.assign(this, { type: 'dynamic', shape: 'circle', x: 0, y: 0, angle: 0, vx: 0, vy: 0, spin: 0, r: 0, bounce: .3, friction: .4, damping: 0, layer: 1, mask: 0xffff, sensor: false, bullet: false, off: false, kick: 0, gravity: 1, maxSpeed: 0, data: null }, d);\\n    /** world: its world; id: its number (the order added); sleeping: at rest, skipped until something wakes it; held: the\\n     *  kicker holding it ({ k, t }), or null; to: a kinematic body's goal ({ x, y, angle, speed, turn }), or null */\\n    this.world = world; this.id = world._id++; this.sleeping = false; this.held = null; this.to = this.to || null;\\n    const s = this.shape;\\n    /** local: the core's points round x, y (a box's corners, a polygon's, a segment's two ends), or null (a circle) */\\n    this.local = s === 'box' ? [[-d.w / 2, -d.h / 2], [d.w / 2, -d.h / 2], [d.w / 2, d.h / 2], [-d.w / 2, d.h / 2]] : s === 'poly' ? wind(d.points) : s === 'segment' ? [d.a.slice(), d.b.slice()] : null;\\n    if (s === 'segment' && !d.x && !d.y) { this.x = (d.a[0] + d.b[0]) / 2; this.y = (d.a[1] + d.b[1]) / 2; this.local = [[d.a[0] - this.x, d.a[1] - this.y], [d.b[0] - this.x, d.b[1] - this.y]]; }\\n    // mass and the turning inertia (dynamic bodies only; the others never yield)\\n    if (this.type === 'dynamic') {\\n12840→      const den = d.density || .01; let m, I;\\n      if (!this.local) { m = d.mass || den * Math.PI * this.r * this.r; I = m * this.r * this.r / 2; }\\n      else {\\n        const pm = polyMass(this.local);\\n        if (pm) { for (const p of this.local) { p[0] -= pm.cx; p[1] -= pm.cy; } this.x += pm.cx; this.y += pm.cy; m = d.mass || den * pm.A; I = pm.I * m / pm.A; }\\n        else { const L = hyp(this.local[1][0] - this.local[0][0], this.local[1][1] - this.local[0][1]); m = d.mass || den * (L * 2 * this.r + Math.PI * this.r * this.r); I = m * (L * L / 12 + this.r * this.r / 2); }\\n      }\\n      /** mass, im (its inverse: 0 for what never yields), iI (the inverse of its turning inertia) */\\n      this.mass = m; this.im = 1 / m; this.iI = d.fixedRotation || !(I > 0) ? 0 : 1 / I;\\n    } else { this.mass = Infinity; this.im = 0; this.iI = 0; }\\n12850→    /** wv, wn: the core's points and its edges' outward normals in the world, now; box: [x0, y0, x1, y1] round it all */\\n    this.wv = this.local ? this.local.map(() => [0, 0]) : null; this.wn = this.local ? this.local.map(() => [0, 0]) : null; this.box = [0, 0, 0, 0]; this._still = 0;\\n    this._pose();\\n  }\\n  // the world points, normals and bounds of where it is now\\n  _pose() {\\n    const r = this.r, B = this.box;\\n    if (this.shape === 'field') { B[0] = B[1] = -Infinity; B[2] = B[3] = Infinity; return; }\\n    if (!this.local) { B[0] = this.x - r; B[1] = this.y - r; B[2] = this.x + r; B[3] = this.y + r; return; }\\n    const c = Math.cos(this.angle), s = Math.sin(this.angle), L = this.local, V = this.wv, N = this.wn, n = L.length;\\n12860→    B[0] = B[1] = Infinity; B[2] = B[3] = -Infinity;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const v = V[i]; v[0] = this.x + c * L[i][0] - s * L[i][1]; v[1] = this.y + s * L[i][0] + c * L[i][1]; if (v[0] - r < B[0]) B[0] = v[0] - r; if (v[1] - r < B[1]) B[1] = v[1] - r; if (v[0] + r > B[2]) B[2] = v[0] + r; if (v[1] + r > B[3]) B[3] = v[1] + r; }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const a = V[i], b = V[(i + 1) % n], ex = b[0] - a[0], ey = b[1] - a[1], l = hyp(ex, ey) || 1; N[i][0] = ey / l; N[i][1] = -ex / l; }\\n  }\\n  /** push it: an impulse (mass x speed) at a world point (its middle by default) */\\n  impulse(ix, iy, px = this.x, py = this.y) { if (this.type !== 'dynamic') return; this.wake(); this.vx += ix * this.im; this.vy += iy * this.im; this.spin += this.iI * ((px - this.x) * iy - (py - this.y) * ix); }\\n  /** wake it from sleep */\",\"content_concise\":\"12827→class PBody {\\n  /** made by world.add (and its shorthands): see the manual */\\n  constructor(world, d) {\\n12830→    Object.assign(this, { type: 'dynamic', shape: 'circle', x: 0, y: 0, angle: 0, vx: 0, vy: 0, spin: 0, r: 0, bounce: .3, friction: .4, damping: 0, layer: 1, mask: 0xffff, sensor: false, bullet: false, off: false, kick: 0, gravity: 1, maxSpeed: 0, data: null }, d);\\n    /** world: its world; id: its number (the order added); sleeping: at rest, skipped until something wakes it; held: the\\n     *  kicker holding it ({ k, t }), or null; to: a kinematic body's goal ({ x, y, angle, speed, turn }), or null */\\n    this.world = world; this.id = world._id++; this.sleeping = false; this.held = null; this.to = this.to || null;\\n    const s = this.shape;\\n    /** local: the core's points round x, y (a box's corners, a polygon's, a segment's two ends), or null (a circle) */\\n    this.local = s === 'box' ? [[-d.w / 2, -d.h / 2], [d.w / 2, -d.h / 2], [d.w / 2, d.h / 2], [-d.w / 2, d.h / 2]] : s === 'poly' ? wind(d.points) : s === 'segment' ? [d.a.slice(), d.b.slice()] : null;\\n    if (s === 'segment' && !d.x && !d.y) { this.x = (d.a[0] + d.b[0]) / 2; this.y = (d.a[1] + d.b[1]) / 2; this.local = [[d.a[0] - this.x, d.a[1] - this.y], [d.b[0] - this.x, d.b[1] - this.y]]; }\\n    // mass and the turning inertia (dynamic bodies only; the others never yield)\\n    if (this.type === 'dynamic') {\\n12840→      const den = d.density || .01; let m, I;\\n      if (!this.local) { m = d.mass || den * Math.PI * this.r * this.r; I = m * this.r * this.r / 2; }\\n      else {\\n        const pm = polyMass(this.local);\\n        if (pm) { for (const p of this.local) { p[0] -= pm.cx; p[1] -= pm.cy; } this.x += pm.cx; this.y += pm.cy; m = d.mass || den * pm.A; I = pm.I * m / pm.A; }\\n        else { const L = hyp(this.local[1][0] - this.local[0][0], this.local[1][1] - this.local[0][1]); m = d.mass || den * (L * 2 * this.r + Math.PI * this.r * this.r); I = m * (L * L / 12 + this.r * this.r / 2); }\\n      }\\n      /** mass, im (its inverse: 0 for what never yields), iI (the inverse of its turning inertia) */\\n      this.mass = m; this.im = 1 / m; this.iI = d.fixedRotation || !(I > 0) ? 0 : 1 / I;\\n    } else { this.mass = Infinity; this.im = 0; this.iI = 0; }\\n12850→    /** wv, wn: the core's points and its edges' outward normals in the world, now; box: [x0, y0, x1, y1] round it all */\\n    this.wv = this.local ? this.local.map(() => [0, 0]) : null; this.wn = this.local ? this.local.map(() => [0, 0]) : null; this.box = [0, 0, 0, 0]; this._still = 0;\\n    this._pose();\\n  }\\n  // the world points, normals and bounds of where it is now\\n  _pose() {\\n    const r = this.r, B = this.box;\\n    if (this.shape === 'field') { B[0] = B[1] = -Infinity; B[2] = B[3] = Infinity; return; }\\n    if (!this.local) { B[0] = this.x - r; B[1] = this.y - r; B[2] = this.x + r; B[3] = this.y + r; return; }\\n    const c = Math.cos(this.angle), s = Math.sin(this.angle), L = this.local, V = this.wv, N = this.wn, n = L.length;\\n12860→    B[0] = B[1] = Infinity; B[2] = B[3] = -Infinity;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const v = V[i]; v[0] = this.x + c * L[i][0] - s * L[i][1]; v[1] = this.y + s * L[i][0] + c * L[i][1]; if (v[0] - r < B[0]) B[0] = v[0] - r; if (v[1] - r < B[1]) B[1] = v[1] - r; if (v[0] + r > B[2]) B[2] = v[0] + r; if (v[1] + r > B[3]) B[3] = v[1] + r; }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const a = V[i], b = V[(i + 1) % n], ex = b[0] - a[0], ey = b[1] - a[1], l = hyp(ex, ey) || 1; N[i][0] = ey / l; N[i][1] = -ex / l; }\\n  }\\n  /** push it: an impulse (mass x speed) at a world point (its middle by default) */\\n  impulse(ix, iy, px = this.x, py = this.y) { if (this.type !== 'dynamic') return; this.wake(); this.vx += ix * this.im; this.vy += iy * this.im; this.spin += this.iI * ((px - this.x) * iy - (py - this.y) * ix); }\\n  /** wake it from sleep */\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js\",\"offset\":12827,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"class PBody {\\n  /** made by world.add (and its shorthands): see the manual */\\n  constructor(world, d) {\\n    Object.assign(this, { type: 'dynamic', shape: 'circle', x: 0, y: 0, angle: 0, vx: 0, vy: 0, spin: 0, r: 0, bounce: .3, friction: .4, damping: 0, layer: 1, mask: 0xffff, sensor: false, bullet: false, off: false, kick: 0, gravity: 1, maxSpeed: 0, data: null }, d);\\n    /** world: its world; id: its number (the order added); sleeping: at rest, skipped until something wakes it; held: the\\n     *  kicker holding it ({ k, t }), or null; to: a kinematic body's goal ({ x, y, angle, speed, turn }), or null */\\n    this.world = world; this.id = world._id++; this.sleeping = false; this.held = null; this.to = this.to || null;\\n    const s = this.shape;\\n    /** local: the core's points round x, y (a box's corners, a polygon's, a segment's two ends), or null (a circle) */\\n    this.local = s === 'box' ? [[-d.w / 2, -d.h / 2], [d.w / 2, -d.h / 2], [d.w / 2, d.h / 2], [-d.w / 2, d.h / 2]] : s === 'poly' ? wind(d.points) : s === 'segment' ? [d.a.slice(), d.b.slice()] : null;\\n    if (s === 'segment' && !d.x && !d.y) { this.x = (d.a[0] + d.b[0]) / 2; this.y = (d.a[1] + d.b[1]) / 2; this.local = [[d.a[0] - this.x, d.a[1] - this.y], [d.b[0] - this.x, d.b[1] - this.y]]; }\\n    // mass and the turning inertia (dynamic bodies only; the others never yield)\\n    if (this.type === 'dynamic') {\\n      const den = d.density || .01; let m, I;\\n      if (!this.local) { m = d.mass || den * Math.PI * this.r * this.r; I = m * this.r * this.r / 2; }\\n      else {\\n        const pm = polyMass(this.local);\\n        if (pm) { for (const p of this.local) { p[0] -= pm.cx; p[1] -= pm.cy; } this.x += pm.cx; this.y += pm.cy; m = d.mass || den * pm.A; I = pm.I * m / pm.A; }\\n        else { const L = hyp(this.local[1][0] - this.local[0][0], this.local[1][1] - this.local[0][1]); m = d.mass || den * (L * 2 * this.r + Math.PI * this.r * this.r); I = m * (L * L / 12 + this.r * this.r / 2); }\\n      }\\n      /** mass, im (its inverse: 0 for what never yields), iI (the inverse of its turning inertia) */\\n      this.mass = m; this.im = 1 / m; this.iI = d.fixedRotation || !(I > 0) ? 0 : 1 / I;\\n    } else { this.mass = Infinity; this.im = 0; this.iI = 0; }\\n    /** wv, wn: the core's points and its edges' outward normals in the world, now; box: [x0, y0, x1, y1] round it all */\\n    this.wv = this.local ? this.local.map(() => [0, 0]) : null; this.wn = this.local ? this.local.map(() => [0, 0]) : null; this.box = [0, 0, 0, 0]; this._still = 0;\\n    this._pose();\\n  }\\n  // the world points, normals and bounds of where it is now\\n  _pose() {\\n    const r = this.r, B = this.box;\\n    if (this.shape === 'field') { B[0] = B[1] = -Infinity; B[2] = B[3] = Infinity; return; }\\n    if (!this.local) { B[0] = this.x - r; B[1] = this.y - r; B[2] = this.x + r; B[3] = this.y + r; return; }\\n    const c = Math.cos(this.angle), s = Math.sin(this.angle), L = this.local, V = this.wv, N = this.wn, n = L.length;\\n    B[0] = B[1] = Infinity; B[2] = B[3] = -Infinity;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const v = V[i]; v[0] = this.x + c * L[i][0] - s * L[i][1]; v[1] = this.y + s * L[i][0] + c * L[i][1]; if (v[0] - r < B[0]) B[0] = v[0] - r; if (v[1] - r < B[1]) B[1] = v[1] - r; if (v[0] + r > B[2]) B[2] = v[0] + r; if (v[1] + r > B[3]) B[3] = v[1] + r; }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const a = V[i], b = V[(i + 1) % n], ex = b[0] - a[0], ey = b[1] - a[1], l = hyp(ex, ey) || 1; N[i][0] = ey / l; N[i][1] = -ex / l; }\\n  }\\n  /** push it: an impulse (mass x speed) at a world point (its middle by default) */\\n  impulse(ix, iy, px = this.x, py = this.y) { if (this.type !== 'dynamic') return; this.wake(); this.vx += ix * this.im; this.vy += iy * this.im; this.spin += this.iI * ((px - this.x) * iy - (py - this.y) * ix); }\\n  /** wake it from sleep */\\n\",\"total_lines\":14974}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"aae644d4-f26f-4292-9b6d-3c77558e7ced"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_188","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Calculated mass as roughly 1 using density 0.01, radius 6, and area π × 36.\n\nGravity is set to 378 px/s². Sensors will detect collisions with olives. Olives will have damping 1, friction 0.2, and bounce 0.05. A static lip segment with a gap will be placed in front of the olives.\n\nThe lip design is being simplified. Olives will start inside a box with an opening on the right side. Passive noise will juggle them inside. Gravity will push them through the gap to reach the glass.\n\nPassive olives would drift into the gap by chance and escape too easily. The bot must actively push them through a narrow opening at y=90–110. Some olives start aligned with that gap, so they could slide out on their own.\n\nA funnel-shaped gap would be too difficult for passive olives to thread, since their noise lacks a sustained vertical component. The bot could instead hold steady upward and rightward thrust to push them through. However, olives at different heights might still be missed by a single constant angle. A simpler alternative is being considered: remove the maze entirely, place large glasses on the right, and keep olives on the left.\n\nA static bumper lip was rejected as too complex. The simplest scoring model uses tilt acceleration: an olive is delivered once its x position clears the glass and its y position stays within the glass radius. Passive olives will random-walk because their horizontal velocity mean is near zero. Damping may prevent them from reaching the glass within sixty seconds.\n\nPassive olives will drift only about 50–100 pixels in sixty seconds, so they will not reach the glass. The bot can travel the same distance in roughly one second, confirming it can deliver olives while passive mode cannot.\n\nOlives will use damping 1.5. The bot can clear three trays in about nine seconds total, so passive mode scores zero. Both average and good tiers should reach three stars, and expert tier should reach two or three. A time bonus scales with remaining time; finishing early yields a full bonus, while finishing late yields only eighty percent.\n\nThe final scoring model is confirmed: no maze, wide glasses, and damping to keep passive olives from drifting away. Walls will be added around the tray to contain olives. The stork2 test comment needs fixing, and gentle games will use a 20-second activity limit.\n\nShort versions keep the real activity limit. A 20-second stork should still score well for a good driver, while passive stays low; gentle games are not star-gated separately. The duel will use a 90-second candle family where Gertrude’s flame starts at 1 and drops after 75 seconds if the player beats her by more than half. The player wins by having a higher flame at the end.\n\nGertrude’s flame will decay to 0.3 after 75 seconds if the player beats her by more than half. A passive player flame near zero lets Gertrude stay at one and lose, so the story continues.\n\nThe games scene will auto-chain: banners last 1.5 seconds, then the duel starts automatically, followed by the ending menu. The pump handles both play and auto phases.\n\nGames logic will live in world.js using a new G.Session API with an update(dt) method.\n\nThe session API will expose phase, progress, stars, timing, and completion state. Results phase renders pills. Auto mode skips the card and advances immediately from results to onDone. Gentle games use a 20-second limit with the driver preset and auto-advance. Normal story paths still walk through card, demo, countdown, and play.\n\nThe star gate test will confirm through the card phase unless skipToPlay is set. A helper will advance one frame after go() before pumping. The session resets on play entry. Ready to write the code.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The Lean model stays as it is. Next I’ll build the activities, the day loop, and the boot around it."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-76f1ba80-1ad7-47d5-8b91-16bc8596bb7a-55","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/ui.js","old_string":"  G.text = text;\n  G.prompt = function (g, r, action, verb) {\n    if (!r) return;\n    const I = G.game.input;\n    let chip;\n    if (action === 'lean') {\n      const src = G.lean.source;","new_string":"  G.text = text;\n  G.lean = G.lean || { ux: 0, uy: 0, breath: 0, effort: 0, source: 'keys' };\n  G.busy = G.busy || function () { return !!(G.talk && G.talk.open) || G.phase === 'talk'; };\n  G.prompt = function (g, r, action, verb) {\n    if (!r || !G.game) return;\n    const I = G.game.input;\n    let chip;\n    if (action === 'lean') {\n      const src = (G.lean && G.lean.source) || 'keys';"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1715,"output_tokens":2405,"cache_read_input_tokens":181248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"c55021cf-bdf6-4201-a055-04e08828fbcb"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-76f1ba80-1ad7-47d5-8b91-16bc8596bb7a-55","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"  G.text = text;\\n  G.prompt = function (g, r, action, verb) {\\n    if (!r) return;\\n    const I = G.game.input;\\n    let chip;\\n    if (action === 'lean') {\\n      const src = G.lean.source;\",\"new_string\":\"  G.text = text;\\n  G.lean = G.lean || { ux: 0, uy: 0, breath: 0, effort: 0, source: 'keys' };\\n  G.busy = G.busy || function () { return !!(G.talk && G.talk.open) || G.phase === 'talk'; };\\n  G.prompt = function (g, r, action, verb) {\\n    if (!r || !G.game) return;\\n    const I = G.game.input;\\n    let chip;\\n    if (action === 'lean') {\\n      const src = (G.lean && G.lean.source) || 'keys';\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/ui.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/ui.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/ui.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"  G.text = text;\\n  G.prompt = function (g, r, action, verb) {\\n    if (!r) return;\\n    const I = G.game.input;\\n    let chip;\\n    if (action === 'lean') {\\n      const src = G.lean.source;\",\"old_line\":9,\"new_string\":\"  G.text = text;\\n  G.lean = G.lean || { ux: 0, uy: 0, breath: 0, effort: 0, source: 'keys' };\\n  G.busy = G.busy || function () { return !!(G.talk && G.talk.open) || G.phase === 'talk'; };\\n  G.prompt = function (g, r, action, verb) {\\n    if (!r || !G.game) return;\\n    const I = G.game.input;\\n    let chip;\\n    if (action === 'lean') {\\n      const src = (G.lean && G.lean.source) || 'keys';\",\"new_line\":9,\"context_before\":\"  function text(g, s, x, y, col, scale, align) {\\n    E.font.text(g, String(s), x, y, col || '#20404c', { scale: scale || 1, align: align || 'left', outline: false, shadow: false });\\n  }\\n\",\"context_after\":\"      chip = src === 'pad' ? 'Left stick' : src === 'mouse' ? 'Move the mouse' : 'WASD';\\n      if (verb) chip += '  ' + verb;\\n    } else if (I.lastDevice === 'gamepad') chip = I.label(action) + (verb ? '  ' + verb : '');\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"bdd9b835-ba1e-41d6-9019-9ab81cadb733"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_189","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Starting work on play.js, the largest file.","signature":"aEQGa1BsScxQQ10zJZd4ZrrbZyisGVQ0JShBAh/PjEmMtkCmgXaKHjjrSwt8XKnq2og/zhPmmwFPIzHsHcA9isbIyAogv0709qPr5Ohs84jZ9pi8WEDGumVjWVeWdssZoRMSiSgSOAbTAP4"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-187cf936-2d7a-472e-8114-eec019070617-56","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","new_string":"/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\nvar G = G || {};\n(function () {\n  'use strict';\n  const E = My3D2dge;\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\n  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\n\n  function skillName(seat) {\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\n  }\n\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\n    if (!bal) return;\n    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\n    bal.skill = skill;\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\n    void br;\n    bal.bot = b;\n  }\n\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\n      return;\n    }\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\n    if (!skill) return;\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel;\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\n      const target = clamp(bead + lead * sign, -0.05, 1.15);\n      if (fam.axis === 'x') { seat.ux = fam.side * target; seat.uy = 0; }\n      else { seat.uy = -target; seat.ux = 0; }\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\n      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\n        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\n      }\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\n      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\n    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 28, -1, 1) * steer;\n      seat.uy = skill === 'poor' ? -0.2 : 0.35;\n    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\n      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 1.3 && pin.dist > 0.15);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\n    return s;\n  }\n\n  function repSet(axis) {\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\n    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\n    return o;\n  }\n\n  function holdCenter(t) {\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\n    const a = i * 2.4;\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\n  }\n\n  function beadOf(t, tier) {\n    if (tier >= 2) {\n      const u = t % 5;\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\n    }\n    const u = t % 4;\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\n  }\n\n  function guideOf(t) {\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\n  }\n\n  /* ---- families ---- */\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\n        const sk = skillName(q);\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\n      });\n    }\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\n      fam.scores = [];\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\n      });\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\n    }\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\n    }\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\n    sess.fam = fam;\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\n  }\n\n  function startStep(sess) {\n    const tier = sess.tier;\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\n    });\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\s+/).length;\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\n  }\n\n  function loadTray(sess) {\n    const fam = sess.fam;\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\n    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\n    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\n    const sensor = world.circle(glass.x, glass.y, Math.max(glass.r, 22), { type: 'static', sensor: true });\n    sensor._glass = true;\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.15, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02 });\n      b._olive = true;\n    });\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\n      other._caught = true;\n      fam.got++;\n      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\n    };\n    fam.world = world;\n    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\n  }\n\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\n    if (!fam) return;\n    fam.t += dt;\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\n    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\n    if (act.family === 'hold') stepHold(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'sun') stepSun(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'candle') stepCandle(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'rep') stepRep(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'step') stepStep(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'hoop') stepHoop(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'jog') stepJog(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'slalom') stepSlalom(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'tray') stepTray(sess, dt);\n    else if (act.family === 'laundry') stepLaundry(sess, dt);\n    const bal = seat.bal;\n    if (bal) {\n      sess.leanX = bal.px; sess.leanY = bal.py;\n      if (seat.local) { G.lean.ux = seat.ux; G.lean.uy = seat.uy; }\n    }\n  }\n\n  function stepHold(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\n    const c = holdCenter(fam.t);\n    fam.c = c;\n    let fx = 0;\n    const gull = Math.floor(fam.t / 12);\n    const gph = fam.t % 12;\n    if (gull > 0 && gph < 0.28) fx = (gull % 2 ? 1 : -1) * 0.7;\n    fam.fx = fx;\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, c);\n    if (sess.tier >= 2 && bal.px) {\n      /* eyes closed: the tone is the plate. Drawing hides the disc. */\n      fam.eyes = true;\n    }\n    const pct = clamp(bal.steadiness - 0.05 * bal.falls, 0, 1);\n    sess.pct = pct;\n  }\n\n  function stepSun(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\n    fam.guide = guideOf(fam.t);\n    if (skillName(seat)) seat.breath = fam.guide;\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\n    const breath = seat.local && !skillName(seat) ? G.lean.breath : seat.breath;\n    fam.matchN++;\n    if (Math.abs(breath - fam.guide) <= 0.25) fam.match++;\n    fam.poseI = Math.min(G.SUN_POSES.length - 1, Math.floor(fam.t / 16));\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * (fam.match / fam.matchN), 0, 1);\n    if (fam.t >= 80) sess.ended = true;\n  }\n\n  function stepCandle(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\n    let fx = 0, fy = 0;\n    fam.thought -= dt;\n    if (fam.thought <= 0) {\n      fam.thought = 4.5 + (sess.rng() * 2);\n      const ang = sess.rng() * Math.PI * 2;\n      fam.tx = Math.cos(ang) * 0.85;\n      fam.ty = Math.sin(ang) * 0.85;\n      fam.tleft = 1.1;\n      if (sess.tier >= 2 && sess.rng() > 0.5) { fam.tx *= 1.3; fam.ty *= 1.3; }\n    }\n    if (fam.tleft > 0) { fam.tleft -= dt; fx = fam.tx; fy = fam.ty; }\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, fy, { x: 0, y: 0 });\n    const sp = Math.hypot(bal.vx, bal.vy);\n    const inside = bal.stumble <= 0 && Math.hypot(bal.px, bal.py) < (bal.set.R || 0.2);\n    if (sp > 0.55) fam.flame -= 0.4 * dt;\n    else if (inside) fam.flame += 0.12 * dt;\n    else fam.flame -= 0.055 * dt;\n    fam.flame = clamp(fam.flame, 0, 1);\n    if (fam.flame <= 0 && !fam.relit) { fam.relit = true; fam.flame = 0.15; }\n    else if (fam.flame <= 0 && fam.relit) fam.dead = true;\n    fam.flameSum += fam.flame;\n    const moved = Math.hypot(seat.ux, seat.uy) > 0.05 || seat.breath > 0.05;\n    if (!moved) fam.untouched += dt; else fam.untouched = 0;\n    if (fam.untouched > 20 && !fam.said) { fam.said = true; G.subtitle = G.LINES.tare.filter(function (s) { return s.indexOf('controller') >= 0; })[0] || ''; }\n    const mean = fam.flameSum / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * mean, 0, 1);\n    if (fam.dead) sess.ended = true;\n  }\n\n  function stepRep(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\n    const prev = fam.bead;\n    fam.bead = beadOf(fam.t, sess.tier);\n    fam.beadVel = (fam.bead - prev) / dt;\n    fam.side = (Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle) % 2 === 0) ? 1 : -1;\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\n    if (fam.doneReps === Math.floor(fam.planned * 0.6) && !fam.fatigued) {\n      fam.fatigued = true;\n      const mul = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.fatigue / 1.5 : 1;\n      bal.set = Object.assign({}, bal.set, { A: bal.set.A * 1.5 * mul, k: bal.set.k * 0.8, kx: 16 * 0.8, ky: 16 * 0.8 });\n    }\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\n    const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? clamp(fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px, 0, 1) : clamp(-bal.py, 0, 1);\n    const tol = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.repTol : 0.08;\n    fam.err += Math.abs(depth - fam.bead);\n    fam.form += fam.axis === 'x' ? Math.abs(bal.py) : Math.abs(bal.px);\n    fam.samples++;\n    const cyc = Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle);\n    if (cyc > fam.doneReps) {\n      const meanErr = fam.err / Math.max(1, fam.samples);\n      let sc = meanErr <= tol ? 1 : meanErr >= 0.35 ? 0 : (0.35 - meanErr) / (0.35 - tol);\n      fam.scores.push(sc);\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0;\n      fam.doneReps = cyc;\n      if (fam.doneReps === fam.planned && !fam.extra) {\n        const mean = fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length;\n        if (mean > 0.8) { fam.extra = true; fam.planned += 2; sess.limit += fam.cycle * 2; }\n      }\n    }\n    const form = fam.form / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\n    const pen = clamp(form * 0.45, 0, 0.3);\n    const mean = fam.scores.length ? fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length : 0;\n    sess.pct = clamp(mean * (1 - pen), 0, 1);\n    if (fam.doneReps >= fam.planned && fam.scores.length >= fam.planned) sess.ended = true;\n  }\n\n  function stepStep(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, rh = fam.rh, seat = sess.seats[0];\n    if (!rh) return;\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\n    if (skill && !sess.classMode) {\n      const off = STEP_OFF[skill] || 0.02;\n      const pos = G.game.audio.pos;\n      const spb = 60 / (pos.bpm || 100) / 4;\n      for (let i = 0; i < rh.notes.length; i++) {\n        const n = rh.notes[i];\n        if (n.j || n.call || n._bot) continue;\n        const ahead = (n.step - pos.step) * spb;\n        if (ahead <= off) { n._bot = true; rh.hit(n.lane); }\n      }\n    }\n    rh.update();\n    const judged = rh.counts.perfect + rh.counts.great + rh.counts.good + rh.counts.miss;\n    sess.pct = judged ? rh.accuracy : 0;\n    if (rh.done) sess.ended = true;\n    void dt;\n  }\n\n  function stepHoop(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\n    const ux = seat.ux || 0, uy = seat.uy || 0;\n    const mag = Math.hypot(ux, uy);\n    let omega = 0;\n    if (mag > 0.55) {\n      const ang = Math.atan2(uy, ux);\n      let d = ang - (fam.ang || 0);\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\n      if (fam.haveAng) omega = d / dt;\n      fam.ang = ang; fam.haveAng = true;\n    } else fam.haveAng = false;\n    fam.omega = omega;\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopLo : 7;\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopHi : 11;\n    const dir = fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1;\n    const inBand = Math.abs(omega) >= lo && Math.abs(omega) <= hi && omega * dir > 0;\n    if (inBand) { fam.band += dt; fam.out = 0; fam.score += dt * (1 + fam.hoops * 0.15); }\n    else if (mag > 0.2) { fam.out += dt; if (fam.out > 1.5 && fam.hoops > 1) { fam.hoops--; fam.drops++; fam.out = 0; } }\n    if (!fam.otherWay && fam.t >= sess.limit * 0.5) fam.otherWay = true;\n    fam.tossT -= dt;\n    if (fam.tossT <= 0) {\n      fam.tossT = 8;\n      fam.toss = { side: sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, eta: 1.1 };\n    }\n    if (fam.toss) {\n      fam.toss.eta -= dt;\n      const hit = fam.toss.side < 0 ? seat.catchL : seat.catchR;\n      if (hit && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) <= 0.25) { fam.caught++; fam.hoops = Math.min(6, fam.hoops + 1); fam.toss = null; }\n      else if (fam.toss.eta < -0.25) fam.toss = null;\n    }\n    const best = sess.limit * 1.4;\n    sess.pct = clamp(fam.score / best, 0, 1);\n  }\n\n  function stepJog(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\n    const edgeL = seat.paceL && !fam.prevL;\n    const edgeR = seat.paceR && !fam.prevR;\n    fam.prevL = seat.paceL; fam.prevR = seat.paceR;\n    if (edgeL || edgeR) { fam.steps++; fam.hist.push(fam.t); }\n    while (fam.hist.length && fam.t - fam.hist[0] > 1) fam.hist.shift();\n    fam.cad = fam.hist.length;\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogLo : 2.6;\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogHi : 3.4;\n    const zoned = fam.cad >= lo && fam.cad <= hi && fam.stitch <= 0;\n    if (zoned) fam.zone += dt;\n    if (fam.cad > 4.2) fam.sprint += dt; else fam.sprint = 0;\n    if (fam.sprint > 2 && fam.stitch <= 0) fam.stitch = 3;\n    if (fam.stitch > 0) fam.stitch -= dt;\n    const speed = (G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogSpeed : 1) * (zoned ? 8 : 3);\n    fam.z += speed * dt;\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 1.6 * dt;\n    const cups = [12, 28, 44, 58];\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) {\n      if (fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) continue;\n      if (fam.z >= cups[i] && fam.z - speed * dt < cups[i]) {\n        const cx = (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8);\n        if (Math.abs(fam.x - cx) < 0.45) { fam.cups++; fam.gotCup = fam.gotCup || {}; fam.gotCup[i] = true; }\n      }\n    }\n    fam.nextCup = null;\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) if (!(fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) && fam.z < cups[i]) { fam.nextCup = { x: (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8), z: cups[i] }; break; }\n    const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\n  }\n\n  function stepSlalom(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\n    if (fam.done) return;\n    if (fam.tumble > 0) { fam.tumble -= dt; return; }\n    const base = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiSpeed : 220;\n    const turn = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiTurn : 1.6;\n    let spd = base;\n    if (seat.uy > 0.3) spd *= 1.35;\n    if (seat.uy < -0.3) spd *= 0.6;\n    fam.z += spd * dt;\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 78 * turn / 1.6 * dt;\n    const gates = G.GATES;\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) {\n      const g = gates[i];\n      if (fam.missed[i]) continue;\n      if (fam.z >= g.z && fam.z - spd * dt < g.z) {\n        fam.missed[i] = Math.abs(fam.x - g.x) > fam.half;\n        if (fam.missed[i]) fam.pen += 3;\n      }\n    }\n    for (let i = 0; i < G.OBSTACLES.length; i++) {\n      const o = G.OBSTACLES[i];\n      if (fam.hitO && fam.hitO[i]) continue;\n      if (Math.abs(fam.z - o.z) < 80 && Math.abs(fam.x - o.x) < 16) {\n        fam.hitO = fam.hitO || {}; fam.hitO[i] = true; fam.tumble = 1.2; fam.pen += 1.2;\n      }\n    }\n    let next = null;\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) if (gates[i].z > fam.z - 20) { next = gates[i]; break; }\n    fam.nextGate = next;\n    if (fam.z >= fam.finish) {\n      fam.done = true;\n      const par = 58, worst = 90;\n      const time = fam.t + fam.pen;\n      sess.pct = clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\n      sess.ended = true;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function stepTray(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\n    if (!seat.bal) {\n      seat.bal = new G.Balance({ k: 14, c: 8, s: 1, A: 0.5, nf: 0.8, R: 0.4, push: null }, sess.seed, {});\n    }\n    const sk = skillName(seat);\n    if (sk) {\n      const aim = sk === 'poor' ? 0.25 : sk === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\n    }\n    seat.bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\n    const Gv = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayG : 420;\n    if (fam.world) {\n      fam.world.gravity = [seat.bal.px * Gv, -seat.bal.py * Gv];\n      fam.world.wake();\n      fam.world.step(dt);\n      const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\n      const need = spec ? spec.olives.length : 0;\n      const gotHere = fam.got - fam.trayGot0;\n      if (gotHere >= need) {\n        fam.trayI++;\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\n        else loadTray(sess);\n      }\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\n  }\n\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\n    fam.air -= dt;\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0) fam.air = 0.38;\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\n    fam.gust -= dt;\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\n    let fx = 0;\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\n      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\n    }\n    const fallsBefore = bal.falls;\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\n    if (bal.falls > fallsBefore) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; }\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\n    let ahead = null;\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\n      if (d > 0) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\n    }\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.25 && fam.air <= 0 && !fam.pinHit) {\n      fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.pinHit = pins.indexOf(ahead.x);\n    }\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist > 1) fam.pinHit = -1;\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\n    const spd = effort * 2.2;\n    if (fam.air <= 0) fam.x += spd * dt;\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\n      fam.done = true;\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\n      const time = fam.t;\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\n      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\n      sess.pct = pct;\n      sess.ended = true;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\n    if (!fam) return;\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\n    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\n      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function Session(opts) {\n    opts = opts || {};\n    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\n    this.classMode = !!opts.classMode;\n    this.seed = (opts.seed || 1) >>> 0;\n    this.rng = E.rng(this.seed);\n    this.phase = opts.skipToPlay ? 'count' : 'card';\n    this.t = 0;\n    this.playTime = 0;\n    this.limit = opts.limit || this.act.dur[this.tier - 1] || 45;\n    if (this.phase === 'count') this.t = 0;\n    this.countT = opts.skipToPlay ? 0.4 : 3;\n    this.demoT = 3;\n    this.pct = 0;\n    this.stars = 0;\n    this.ended = false;\n    this.awarded = false;\n    this.seats = opts.seats || [{ name: (G.profile && G.profile.name) || 'You', color: '#ff7a59', local: true, human: true, skill: opts.driver || null }];\n    if (opts.driver) this.seats[0].skill = opts.driver;\n    this.driver = opts.driver || null;\n    this.fam = null;\n    this.line = (G.LINES.tare[this.seed % G.LINES.tare.length]) || '';\n  }\n\n  Session.prototype.update = function (dt) {\n    if (G.driver && G.driver !== 'human') {\n      this.driver = G.driver;\n      if (this.seats[0] && this.seats[0].local) this.seats[0].skill = G.driver;\n    }\n    if (this.phase === 'card') {\n      G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.phase === 'demo') {\n      this.demoT -= dt;\n      G.phase = 'auto'; G.left = Math.max(0, this.demoT);\n      if (this.demoT <= 0) { this.phase = 'count'; this.countT = 3; }\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.phase === 'count') {\n      this.countT -= dt;\n      G.phase = 'auto'; G.left = Math.max(0, this.countT);\n      if (this.countT <= 0) { this.phase = 'play'; this.playTime = 0; this.ended = false; beginFamily(this); }\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.phase === 'play') {\n      G.phase = 'play';\n      this.playTime += dt;\n      stepFamily(this, dt);\n      G.left = Math.max(0, this.limit - this.playTime);\n      const timed = this.act.family !== 'rep' && this.act.family !== 'slalom' && this.act.family !== 'laundry' && this.act.family !== 'tray' && this.act.family !== 'step';\n      if (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit || (timed && this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\n      if (this.act.family === 'step' && this.fam && this.fam.rh && this.fam.rh.done) this.finish();\n      if (this.act.family === 'rep' && this.ended) this.finish();\n      if (this.act.family === 'slalom' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\n      if (this.act.family === 'laundry' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\n      if (this.act.family === 'tray' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\n      if (this.act.family === 'candle' && this.fam && this.fam.dead) this.finish();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.phase === 'results') { G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0; }\n  };\n\n  Session.prototype.finish = function () {\n    if (this.phase === 'results') return;\n    scoreNow(this);\n    if (this.act.family === 'slalom' && this.fam && !this.fam.done) this.pct = 0;\n    if (this.act.family === 'laundry' && this.fam && !this.fam.done) this.pct = 0;\n    this.pct = clamp(this.pct || 0, 0, 1);\n    this.stars = G.starsOf(this.pct, this.act.stars);\n    this.phase = 'results';\n    G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\n    this.seats.forEach(function (q) { q.pct = this.pct; q.score = clamp(Math.round(this.pct * 1000), 0, 1000); }, this);\n    if (this.classMode) {\n      this.seats.forEach(function (q) {\n        const sk = skillName(q);\n        let p = this.pct;\n        if (!q.local && q.botFill) p = this.pct;\n        if (q.human && !q.local) p = q.moved ? this.pct : 0;\n        q.pct = p; q.score = q.scoring === false ? 0 : clamp(Math.round(p * 1000), 0, 1000);\n      }, this);\n    }\n    if (!this.trial && !G.attracting && !G.inSession) G.award(this.act.id, this.tier, this.stars, this.pct);\n    try {\n      const n = this.stars;\n      G.sting(n >= 3 ? 'star3' : n === 2 ? 'star2' : n === 1 ? 'star1' : null);\n    } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\n  };\n\n  Session.prototype.begin = function () { if (this.phase === 'card') { this.phase = 'demo'; this.demoT = 3; } };\n  Session.prototype.again = function () {\n    const id = this.act.id, tier = this.tier, trial = this.trial, driver = this.driver, limit = this.limit, seats = this.seats, classMode = this.classMode, seed = (this.seed + 1) >>> 0;\n    const next = new Session({ id: id, tier: tier, trial: trial, driver: driver, limit: limit, seats: seats, classMode: classMode, seed: seed, skipToPlay: false, cheat: this.cheat });\n    G.session = next;\n  };\n\n  G.Session = Session;\n  G.skillName = skillName;\n\n  G.drawActivity = function (r, sess) {\n    if (!r || !sess) return;\n    const fam = sess.fam;\n    G.paintRoom(r, sess.act && sess.act.id === 'slalom' ? 'dusk' : 'day');\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' || sess.phase === 'results' || sess.phase === 'demo' || sess.phase === 'count') {\n      try {\n        if (!sess._rig && G.makeRig) {\n          const look = G.lookColors ? G.lookColors(G.profile) : null;\n          sess._rig = G.makeRig(G.playerOpts(look, 2.1));\n        }\n        if (sess._rig && (sess.phase === 'play' || sess.phase === 'demo')) {\n          const pose = sess.act.family === 'sun' ? G.SUN_POSES[(fam && fam.poseI) || 0] : sess.act.pose;\n          if (sess.phase === 'demo') G.poseRig(sess._rig, pose || 'idle', sess.demoT, [0, 0]);\n          else if (fam && sess.seats[0].bal) {\n            const b = sess.seats[0].bal;\n            sess._rig.wob = [b.py, b.px];\n            if (sess.act.family === 'lunge' || sess.act.id === 'lunge') sess._rig.body = G.sideLunge(b.px);\n            else if (sess.act.id === 'hoop') sess._rig.body = G.hula(fam.ang || 0);\n            else G.poseRig(sess._rig, pose || 'idle', fam.t, [b.py, b.px]);\n          }\n          G.stepRig(sess._rig, DT, 0, 0);\n          r.actor(0, 8, 0, function (g, ox, oy) { sess._rig.draw(g, ox, oy, r.view); G.drawJoints(g, sess._rig, ox, oy); });\n        }\n      } catch (e) { /* a painted room still reads */ }\n    }\n    r.overlay(function (g) {\n      const W = r.W, H = r.H;\n      if (sess.phase === 'card') {\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, W / 2, 28, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\n        G.text(g, sess.act.blurb, 16, 52, '#20404c', 1, 'left');\n        const gates = sess.act.stars;\n        G.text(g, 'Stars  ' + gates[0] + '   ' + gates[1] + '   ' + gates[2], 16, 78, '#5f7f8a', 1);\n        const best = G.bestText ? G.bestText(sess.act.id, sess.tier) : '';\n        if (best) G.text(g, best, 16, 94, '#14a8c8', 1);\n        G.text(g, 'Tier ' + sess.tier, W - 70, 28, '#14a8c8', 1);\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'demo') {\n        G.text(g, sess.line, 16, 36, '#20404c', 1);\n        G.text(g, 'Watch', W / 2, H / 2 - 20, '#14a8c8', 2, 'center');\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'count') {\n        const n = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(sess.countT));\n        E.font.title(g, String(n), W / 2, H / 2 - 20, { scale: 4, align: 'center', colors: ['#ffffff', '#8fd3f4', '#14a8c8'] });\n        G.text(g, 'Breathe in', W / 2, H / 2 + 18, '#20404c', 1, 'center');\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'results') {\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, W / 2, 24, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\n        G.drawStars(g, W / 2 - 18, 48, sess.stars);\n        G.text(g, Math.round(sess.pct * 100) + '%', W / 2, 70, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\n        const remark = (G.LINES.stars[sess.stars] || G.LINES.stars[0])[0];\n        G.text(g, remark, 12, 96, '#20404c', 1);\n      } else if (fam) {\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, 8, 6, '#20404c', 1);\n        G.text(g, Math.ceil(Math.max(0, sess.limit - sess.playTime)) + 's', W - 36, 6, '#5f7f8a', 1);\n        if (sess.act.family === 'hoop') {\n          const label = Math.abs(fam.omega) < 7 ? 'Too slow' : Math.abs(fam.omega) > 11 ? 'Too eager' : 'Just right';\n          G.text(g, label, W / 2, 24, '#14a8c8', 1, 'center');\n          if (fam.otherWay) G.text(g, 'Other way!', W / 2, 40, '#e0553a', 1, 'center');\n        }\n        if (sess.act.family === 'jog') G.text(g, 'Cadence ' + fam.cad.toFixed(1), 8, 20, '#20404c', 1);\n        if (sess.act.family === 'candle') G.text(g, 'Flame ' + Math.round(fam.flame * 100), 8, 20, '#e0553a', 1);\n        if (sess.act.family === 'slalom') G.text(g, 'Time ' + (fam.t + fam.pen).toFixed(1), 8, 20, '#20404c', 1);\n        if (G.subtitle) G.text(g, G.subtitle, 8, H - 52, '#20404c', 1);\n      }\n    });\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' && sess.seats[0].bal) {\n      const hide = sess.act.id === 'stork' && sess.tier >= 2;\n      G.drawPlate(r, sess.seats[0].bal, { hide: hide, c: fam && fam.c, trace: G.dev && G.dev.trace });\n    }\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' && fam && fam.rh && fam.rh.draw) {\n      try { fam.rh.draw(r, { arrows: true, y: r.H - 78, len: 90 }); } catch (e) { /* highway can sit this one out */ }\n    }\n    if (sess.phase === 'play') G.prompt(null, r, 'lean', '');\n  };\n})();\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2542,"output_tokens":12721,"cache_read_input_tokens":182912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"7bcb73de-124c-4210-833f-f79dc461e788"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-187cf936-2d7a-472e-8114-eec019070617-56","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\\n  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\\n\\n  function skillName(seat) {\\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\\n    if (!bal) return;\\n    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\\n    bal.skill = skill;\\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\\n    void br;\\n    bal.bot = b;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\\n    if (!skill) return;\\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel;\\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\\n      const target = clamp(bead + lead * sign, -0.05, 1.15);\\n      if (fam.axis === 'x') { seat.ux = fam.side * target; seat.uy = 0; }\\n      else { seat.uy = -target; seat.ux = 0; }\\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\\n      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\\n        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\\n      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\\n    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 28, -1, 1) * steer;\\n      seat.uy = skill === 'poor' ? -0.2 : 0.35;\\n    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\\n      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 1.3 && pin.dist > 0.15);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\\n    return s;\\n  }\\n\\n  function repSet(axis) {\\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\\n    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\\n    return o;\\n  }\\n\\n  function holdCenter(t) {\\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\\n    const a = i * 2.4;\\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\\n  }\\n\\n  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\\n    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\\n    const sensor = world.circle(glass.x, glass.y, Math.max(glass.r, 22), { type: 'static', sensor: true });\\n    sensor._glass = true;\\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.15, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02 });\\n      b._olive = true;\\n    });\\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\\n      other._caught = true;\\n      fam.got++;\\n      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    };\\n    fam.world = world;\\n    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    fam.t += dt;\\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\\n    if (act.family === 'hold') stepHold(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'sun') stepSun(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'candle') stepCandle(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'rep') stepRep(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'step') stepStep(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'hoop') stepHoop(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'jog') stepJog(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'slalom') stepSlalom(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'tray') stepTray(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'laundry') stepLaundry(sess, dt);\\n    const bal = seat.bal;\\n    if (bal) {\\n      sess.leanX = bal.px; sess.leanY = bal.py;\\n      if (seat.local) { G.lean.ux = seat.ux; G.lean.uy = seat.uy; }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHold(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const c = holdCenter(fam.t);\\n    fam.c = c;\\n    let fx = 0;\\n    const gull = Math.floor(fam.t / 12);\\n    const gph = fam.t % 12;\\n    if (gull > 0 && gph < 0.28) fx = (gull % 2 ? 1 : -1) * 0.7;\\n    fam.fx = fx;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, c);\\n    if (sess.tier >= 2 && bal.px) {\\n      /* eyes closed: the tone is the plate. Drawing hides the disc. */\\n      fam.eyes = true;\\n    }\\n    const pct = clamp(bal.steadiness - 0.05 * bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n    sess.pct = pct;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSun(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    fam.guide = guideOf(fam.t);\\n    if (skillName(seat)) seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const breath = seat.local && !skillName(seat) ? G.lean.breath : seat.breath;\\n    fam.matchN++;\\n    if (Math.abs(breath - fam.guide) <= 0.25) fam.match++;\\n    fam.poseI = Math.min(G.SUN_POSES.length - 1, Math.floor(fam.t / 16));\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * (fam.match / fam.matchN), 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.t >= 80) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepCandle(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    let fx = 0, fy = 0;\\n    fam.thought -= dt;\\n    if (fam.thought <= 0) {\\n      fam.thought = 4.5 + (sess.rng() * 2);\\n      const ang = sess.rng() * Math.PI * 2;\\n      fam.tx = Math.cos(ang) * 0.85;\\n      fam.ty = Math.sin(ang) * 0.85;\\n      fam.tleft = 1.1;\\n      if (sess.tier >= 2 && sess.rng() > 0.5) { fam.tx *= 1.3; fam.ty *= 1.3; }\\n    }\\n    if (fam.tleft > 0) { fam.tleft -= dt; fx = fam.tx; fy = fam.ty; }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, fy, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const sp = Math.hypot(bal.vx, bal.vy);\\n    const inside = bal.stumble <= 0 && Math.hypot(bal.px, bal.py) < (bal.set.R || 0.2);\\n    if (sp > 0.55) fam.flame -= 0.4 * dt;\\n    else if (inside) fam.flame += 0.12 * dt;\\n    else fam.flame -= 0.055 * dt;\\n    fam.flame = clamp(fam.flame, 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.flame <= 0 && !fam.relit) { fam.relit = true; fam.flame = 0.15; }\\n    else if (fam.flame <= 0 && fam.relit) fam.dead = true;\\n    fam.flameSum += fam.flame;\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(seat.ux, seat.uy) > 0.05 || seat.breath > 0.05;\\n    if (!moved) fam.untouched += dt; else fam.untouched = 0;\\n    if (fam.untouched > 20 && !fam.said) { fam.said = true; G.subtitle = G.LINES.tare.filter(function (s) { return s.indexOf('controller') >= 0; })[0] || ''; }\\n    const mean = fam.flameSum / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * mean, 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.dead) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepRep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const prev = fam.bead;\\n    fam.bead = beadOf(fam.t, sess.tier);\\n    fam.beadVel = (fam.bead - prev) / dt;\\n    fam.side = (Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle) % 2 === 0) ? 1 : -1;\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    if (fam.doneReps === Math.floor(fam.planned * 0.6) && !fam.fatigued) {\\n      fam.fatigued = true;\\n      const mul = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.fatigue / 1.5 : 1;\\n      bal.set = Object.assign({}, bal.set, { A: bal.set.A * 1.5 * mul, k: bal.set.k * 0.8, kx: 16 * 0.8, ky: 16 * 0.8 });\\n    }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? clamp(fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px, 0, 1) : clamp(-bal.py, 0, 1);\\n    const tol = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.repTol : 0.08;\\n    fam.err += Math.abs(depth - fam.bead);\\n    fam.form += fam.axis === 'x' ? Math.abs(bal.py) : Math.abs(bal.px);\\n    fam.samples++;\\n    const cyc = Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle);\\n    if (cyc > fam.doneReps) {\\n      const meanErr = fam.err / Math.max(1, fam.samples);\\n      let sc = meanErr <= tol ? 1 : meanErr >= 0.35 ? 0 : (0.35 - meanErr) / (0.35 - tol);\\n      fam.scores.push(sc);\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0;\\n      fam.doneReps = cyc;\\n      if (fam.doneReps === fam.planned && !fam.extra) {\\n        const mean = fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length;\\n        if (mean > 0.8) { fam.extra = true; fam.planned += 2; sess.limit += fam.cycle * 2; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const form = fam.form / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    const pen = clamp(form * 0.45, 0, 0.3);\\n    const mean = fam.scores.length ? fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(mean * (1 - pen), 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.doneReps >= fam.planned && fam.scores.length >= fam.planned) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepStep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, rh = fam.rh, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!rh) return;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill && !sess.classMode) {\\n      const off = STEP_OFF[skill] || 0.02;\\n      const pos = G.game.audio.pos;\\n      const spb = 60 / (pos.bpm || 100) / 4;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < rh.notes.length; i++) {\\n        const n = rh.notes[i];\\n        if (n.j || n.call || n._bot) continue;\\n        const ahead = (n.step - pos.step) * spb;\\n        if (ahead <= off) { n._bot = true; rh.hit(n.lane); }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    rh.update();\\n    const judged = rh.counts.perfect + rh.counts.great + rh.counts.good + rh.counts.miss;\\n    sess.pct = judged ? rh.accuracy : 0;\\n    if (rh.done) sess.ended = true;\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHoop(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const ux = seat.ux || 0, uy = seat.uy || 0;\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(ux, uy);\\n    let omega = 0;\\n    if (mag > 0.55) {\\n      const ang = Math.atan2(uy, ux);\\n      let d = ang - (fam.ang || 0);\\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n      if (fam.haveAng) omega = d / dt;\\n      fam.ang = ang; fam.haveAng = true;\\n    } else fam.haveAng = false;\\n    fam.omega = omega;\\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopLo : 7;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopHi : 11;\\n    const dir = fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1;\\n    const inBand = Math.abs(omega) >= lo && Math.abs(omega) <= hi && omega * dir > 0;\\n    if (inBand) { fam.band += dt; fam.out = 0; fam.score += dt * (1 + fam.hoops * 0.15); }\\n    else if (mag > 0.2) { fam.out += dt; if (fam.out > 1.5 && fam.hoops > 1) { fam.hoops--; fam.drops++; fam.out = 0; } }\\n    if (!fam.otherWay && fam.t >= sess.limit * 0.5) fam.otherWay = true;\\n    fam.tossT -= dt;\\n    if (fam.tossT <= 0) {\\n      fam.tossT = 8;\\n      fam.toss = { side: sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, eta: 1.1 };\\n    }\\n    if (fam.toss) {\\n      fam.toss.eta -= dt;\\n      const hit = fam.toss.side < 0 ? seat.catchL : seat.catchR;\\n      if (hit && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) <= 0.25) { fam.caught++; fam.hoops = Math.min(6, fam.hoops + 1); fam.toss = null; }\\n      else if (fam.toss.eta < -0.25) fam.toss = null;\\n    }\\n    const best = sess.limit * 1.4;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(fam.score / best, 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepJog(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const edgeL = seat.paceL && !fam.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = seat.paceR && !fam.prevR;\\n    fam.prevL = seat.paceL; fam.prevR = seat.paceR;\\n    if (edgeL || edgeR) { fam.steps++; fam.hist.push(fam.t); }\\n    while (fam.hist.length && fam.t - fam.hist[0] > 1) fam.hist.shift();\\n    fam.cad = fam.hist.length;\\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogLo : 2.6;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogHi : 3.4;\\n    const zoned = fam.cad >= lo && fam.cad <= hi && fam.stitch <= 0;\\n    if (zoned) fam.zone += dt;\\n    if (fam.cad > 4.2) fam.sprint += dt; else fam.sprint = 0;\\n    if (fam.sprint > 2 && fam.stitch <= 0) fam.stitch = 3;\\n    if (fam.stitch > 0) fam.stitch -= dt;\\n    const speed = (G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogSpeed : 1) * (zoned ? 8 : 3);\\n    fam.z += speed * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 1.6 * dt;\\n    const cups = [12, 28, 44, 58];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) {\\n      if (fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= cups[i] && fam.z - speed * dt < cups[i]) {\\n        const cx = (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8);\\n        if (Math.abs(fam.x - cx) < 0.45) { fam.cups++; fam.gotCup = fam.gotCup || {}; fam.gotCup[i] = true; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    fam.nextCup = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) if (!(fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) && fam.z < cups[i]) { fam.nextCup = { x: (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8), z: cups[i] }; break; }\\n    const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSlalom(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (fam.done) return;\\n    if (fam.tumble > 0) { fam.tumble -= dt; return; }\\n    const base = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiSpeed : 220;\\n    const turn = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiTurn : 1.6;\\n    let spd = base;\\n    if (seat.uy > 0.3) spd *= 1.35;\\n    if (seat.uy < -0.3) spd *= 0.6;\\n    fam.z += spd * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 78 * turn / 1.6 * dt;\\n    const gates = G.GATES;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) {\\n      const g = gates[i];\\n      if (fam.missed[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= g.z && fam.z - spd * dt < g.z) {\\n        fam.missed[i] = Math.abs(fam.x - g.x) > fam.half;\\n        if (fam.missed[i]) fam.pen += 3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < G.OBSTACLES.length; i++) {\\n      const o = G.OBSTACLES[i];\\n      if (fam.hitO && fam.hitO[i]) continue;\\n      if (Math.abs(fam.z - o.z) < 80 && Math.abs(fam.x - o.x) < 16) {\\n        fam.hitO = fam.hitO || {}; fam.hitO[i] = true; fam.tumble = 1.2; fam.pen += 1.2;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    let next = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) if (gates[i].z > fam.z - 20) { next = gates[i]; break; }\\n    fam.nextGate = next;\\n    if (fam.z >= fam.finish) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 90;\\n      const time = fam.t + fam.pen;\\n      sess.pct = clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepTray(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!seat.bal) {\\n      seat.bal = new G.Balance({ k: 14, c: 8, s: 1, A: 0.5, nf: 0.8, R: 0.4, push: null }, sess.seed, {});\\n    }\\n    const sk = skillName(seat);\\n    if (sk) {\\n      const aim = sk === 'poor' ? 0.25 : sk === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    }\\n    seat.bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const Gv = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayG : 420;\\n    if (fam.world) {\\n      fam.world.gravity = [seat.bal.px * Gv, -seat.bal.py * Gv];\\n      fam.world.wake();\\n      fam.world.step(dt);\\n      const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n      const need = spec ? spec.olives.length : 0;\\n      const gotHere = fam.got - fam.trayGot0;\\n      if (gotHere >= need) {\\n        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n    fam.air -= dt;\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0) fam.air = 0.38;\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\\n    fam.gust -= dt;\\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\\n    let fx = 0;\\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\\n      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\\n    }\\n    const fallsBefore = bal.falls;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    if (bal.falls > fallsBefore) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; }\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.25 && fam.air <= 0 && !fam.pinHit) {\\n      fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.pinHit = pins.indexOf(ahead.x);\\n    }\\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist > 1) fam.pinHit = -1;\\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\\n    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (fam.air <= 0) fam.x += spd * dt;\\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\\n      const time = fam.t;\\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function Session(opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\\n    this.classMode = !!opts.classMode;\\n    this.seed = (opts.seed || 1) >>> 0;\\n    this.rng = E.rng(this.seed);\\n    this.phase = opts.skipToPlay ? 'count' : 'card';\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.playTime = 0;\\n    this.limit = opts.limit || this.act.dur[this.tier - 1] || 45;\\n    if (this.phase === 'count') this.t = 0;\\n    this.countT = opts.skipToPlay ? 0.4 : 3;\\n    this.demoT = 3;\\n    this.pct = 0;\\n    this.stars = 0;\\n    this.ended = false;\\n    this.awarded = false;\\n    this.seats = opts.seats || [{ name: (G.profile && G.profile.name) || 'You', color: '#ff7a59', local: true, human: true, skill: opts.driver || null }];\\n    if (opts.driver) this.seats[0].skill = opts.driver;\\n    this.driver = opts.driver || null;\\n    this.fam = null;\\n    this.line = (G.LINES.tare[this.seed % G.LINES.tare.length]) || '';\\n  }\\n\\n  Session.prototype.update = function (dt) {\\n    if (G.driver && G.driver !== 'human') {\\n      this.driver = G.driver;\\n      if (this.seats[0] && this.seats[0].local) this.seats[0].skill = G.driver;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'card') {\\n      G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'demo') {\\n      this.demoT -= dt;\\n      G.phase = 'auto'; G.left = Math.max(0, this.demoT);\\n      if (this.demoT <= 0) { this.phase = 'count'; this.countT = 3; }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'count') {\\n      this.countT -= dt;\\n      G.phase = 'auto'; G.left = Math.max(0, this.countT);\\n      if (this.countT <= 0) { this.phase = 'play'; this.playTime = 0; this.ended = false; beginFamily(this); }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'play') {\\n      G.phase = 'play';\\n      this.playTime += dt;\\n      stepFamily(this, dt);\\n      G.left = Math.max(0, this.limit - this.playTime);\\n      const timed = this.act.family !== 'rep' && this.act.family !== 'slalom' && this.act.family !== 'laundry' && this.act.family !== 'tray' && this.act.family !== 'step';\\n      if (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit || (timed && this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'step' && this.fam && this.fam.rh && this.fam.rh.done) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'rep' && this.ended) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'slalom' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'laundry' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'tray' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'candle' && this.fam && this.fam.dead) this.finish();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'results') { G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0; }\\n  };\\n\\n  Session.prototype.finish = function () {\\n    if (this.phase === 'results') return;\\n    scoreNow(this);\\n    if (this.act.family === 'slalom' && this.fam && !this.fam.done) this.pct = 0;\\n    if (this.act.family === 'laundry' && this.fam && !this.fam.done) this.pct = 0;\\n    this.pct = clamp(this.pct || 0, 0, 1);\\n    this.stars = G.starsOf(this.pct, this.act.stars);\\n    this.phase = 'results';\\n    G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\\n    this.seats.forEach(function (q) { q.pct = this.pct; q.score = clamp(Math.round(this.pct * 1000), 0, 1000); }, this);\\n    if (this.classMode) {\\n      this.seats.forEach(function (q) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        let p = this.pct;\\n        if (!q.local && q.botFill) p = this.pct;\\n        if (q.human && !q.local) p = q.moved ? this.pct : 0;\\n        q.pct = p; q.score = q.scoring === false ? 0 : clamp(Math.round(p * 1000), 0, 1000);\\n      }, this);\\n    }\\n    if (!this.trial && !G.attracting && !G.inSession) G.award(this.act.id, this.tier, this.stars, this.pct);\\n    try {\\n      const n = this.stars;\\n      G.sting(n >= 3 ? 'star3' : n === 2 ? 'star2' : n === 1 ? 'star1' : null);\\n    } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n  };\\n\\n  Session.prototype.begin = function () { if (this.phase === 'card') { this.phase = 'demo'; this.demoT = 3; } };\\n  Session.prototype.again = function () {\\n    const id = this.act.id, tier = this.tier, trial = this.trial, driver = this.driver, limit = this.limit, seats = this.seats, classMode = this.classMode, seed = (this.seed + 1) >>> 0;\\n    const next = new Session({ id: id, tier: tier, trial: trial, driver: driver, limit: limit, seats: seats, classMode: classMode, seed: seed, skipToPlay: false, cheat: this.cheat });\\n    G.session = next;\\n  };\\n\\n  G.Session = Session;\\n  G.skillName = skillName;\\n\\n  G.drawActivity = function (r, sess) {\\n    if (!r || !sess) return;\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    G.paintRoom(r, sess.act && sess.act.id === 'slalom' ? 'dusk' : 'day');\\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' || sess.phase === 'results' || sess.phase === 'demo' || sess.phase === 'count') {\\n      try {\\n        if (!sess._rig && G.makeRig) {\\n          const look = G.lookColors ? G.lookColors(G.profile) : null;\\n          sess._rig = G.makeRig(G.playerOpts(look, 2.1));\\n        }\\n        if (sess._rig && (sess.phase === 'play' || sess.phase === 'demo')) {\\n          const pose = sess.act.family === 'sun' ? G.SUN_POSES[(fam && fam.poseI) || 0] : sess.act.pose;\\n          if (sess.phase === 'demo') G.poseRig(sess._rig, pose || 'idle', sess.demoT, [0, 0]);\\n          else if (fam && sess.seats[0].bal) {\\n            const b = sess.seats[0].bal;\\n            sess._rig.wob = [b.py, b.px];\\n            if (sess.act.family === 'lunge' || sess.act.id === 'lunge') sess._rig.body = G.sideLunge(b.px);\\n            else if (sess.act.id === 'hoop') sess._rig.body = G.hula(fam.ang || 0);\\n            else G.poseRig(sess._rig, pose || 'idle', fam.t, [b.py, b.px]);\\n          }\\n          G.stepRig(sess._rig, DT, 0, 0);\\n          r.actor(0, 8, 0, function (g, ox, oy) { sess._rig.draw(g, ox, oy, r.view); G.drawJoints(g, sess._rig, ox, oy); });\\n        }\\n      } catch (e) { /* a painted room still reads */ }\\n    }\\n    r.overlay(function (g) {\\n      const W = r.W, H = r.H;\\n      if (sess.phase === 'card') {\\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, W / 2, 28, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\\n        G.text(g, sess.act.blurb, 16, 52, '#20404c', 1, 'left');\\n        const gates = sess.act.stars;\\n        G.text(g, 'Stars  ' + gates[0] + '   ' + gates[1] + '   ' + gates[2], 16, 78, '#5f7f8a', 1);\\n        const best = G.bestText ? G.bestText(sess.act.id, sess.tier) : '';\\n        if (best) G.text(g, best, 16, 94, '#14a8c8', 1);\\n        G.text(g, 'Tier ' + sess.tier, W - 70, 28, '#14a8c8', 1);\\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'demo') {\\n        G.text(g, sess.line, 16, 36, '#20404c', 1);\\n        G.text(g, 'Watch', W / 2, H / 2 - 20, '#14a8c8', 2, 'center');\\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'count') {\\n        const n = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(sess.countT));\\n        E.font.title(g, String(n), W / 2, H / 2 - 20, { scale: 4, align: 'center', colors: ['#ffffff', '#8fd3f4', '#14a8c8'] });\\n        G.text(g, 'Breathe in', W / 2, H / 2 + 18, '#20404c', 1, 'center');\\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'results') {\\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, W / 2, 24, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\\n        G.drawStars(g, W / 2 - 18, 48, sess.stars);\\n        G.text(g, Math.round(sess.pct * 100) + '%', W / 2, 70, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\\n        const remark = (G.LINES.stars[sess.stars] || G.LINES.stars[0])[0];\\n        G.text(g, remark, 12, 96, '#20404c', 1);\\n      } else if (fam) {\\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, 8, 6, '#20404c', 1);\\n        G.text(g, Math.ceil(Math.max(0, sess.limit - sess.playTime)) + 's', W - 36, 6, '#5f7f8a', 1);\\n        if (sess.act.family === 'hoop') {\\n          const label = Math.abs(fam.omega) < 7 ? 'Too slow' : Math.abs(fam.omega) > 11 ? 'Too eager' : 'Just right';\\n          G.text(g, label, W / 2, 24, '#14a8c8', 1, 'center');\\n          if (fam.otherWay) G.text(g, 'Other way!', W / 2, 40, '#e0553a', 1, 'center');\\n        }\\n        if (sess.act.family === 'jog') G.text(g, 'Cadence ' + fam.cad.toFixed(1), 8, 20, '#20404c', 1);\\n        if (sess.act.family === 'candle') G.text(g, 'Flame ' + Math.round(fam.flame * 100), 8, 20, '#e0553a', 1);\\n        if (sess.act.family === 'slalom') G.text(g, 'Time ' + (fam.t + fam.pen).toFixed(1), 8, 20, '#20404c', 1);\\n        if (G.subtitle) G.text(g, G.subtitle, 8, H - 52, '#20404c', 1);\\n      }\\n    });\\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' && sess.seats[0].bal) {\\n      const hide = sess.act.id === 'stork' && sess.tier >= 2;\\n      G.drawPlate(r, sess.seats[0].bal, { hide: hide, c: fam && fam.c, trace: G.dev && G.dev.trace });\\n    }\\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' && fam && fam.rh && fam.rh.draw) {\\n      try { fam.rh.draw(r, { arrows: true, y: r.H - 78, len: 90 }); } catch (e) { /* highway can sit this one out */ }\\n    }\\n    if (sess.phase === 'play') G.prompt(null, r, 'lean', '');\\n  };\\n})();\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\\n  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\\n\\n  function skillName(seat) {\\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\\n    if (!bal) return;\\n    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\\n    bal.skill = skill;\\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\\n    void br;\\n    bal.bot = b;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\\n    if (!skill) return;\\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel;\\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\\n      const target = clamp(bead + lead * sign, -0.05, 1.15);\\n      if (fam.axis === 'x') { seat.ux = fam.side * target; seat.uy = 0; }\\n      else { seat.uy = -target; seat.ux = 0; }\\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\\n      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\\n        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\\n      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\\n    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 28, -1, 1) * steer;\\n      seat.uy = skill === 'poor' ? -0.2 : 0.35;\\n    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\\n      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 1.3 && pin.dist > 0.15);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\\n    return s;\\n  }\\n\\n  function repSet(axis) {\\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\\n    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\\n    return o;\\n  }\\n\\n  function holdCenter(t) {\\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\\n    const a = i * 2.4;\\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\\n  }\\n\\n  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\\n    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\\n    const sensor = world.circle(glass.x, glass.y, Math.max(glass.r, 22), { type: 'static', sensor: true });\\n    sensor._glass = true;\\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.15, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02 });\\n      b._olive = true;\\n    });\\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\\n      other._caught = true;\\n      fam.got++;\\n      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    };\\n    fam.world = world;\\n    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    fam.t += dt;\\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\\n    if (act.family === 'hold') stepHold(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'sun') stepSun(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'candle') stepCandle(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'rep') stepRep(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'step') stepStep(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'hoop') stepHoop(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'jog') stepJog(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'slalom') stepSlalom(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'tray') stepTray(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'laundry') stepLaundry(sess, dt);\\n    const bal = seat.bal;\\n    if (bal) {\\n      sess.leanX = bal.px; sess.leanY = bal.py;\\n      if (seat.local) { G.lean.ux = seat.ux; G.lean.uy = seat.uy; }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHold(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const c = holdCenter(fam.t);\\n    fam.c = c;\\n    let fx = 0;\\n    const gull = Math.floor(fam.t / 12);\\n    const gph = fam.t % 12;\\n    if (gull > 0 && gph < 0.28) fx = (gull % 2 ? 1 : -1) * 0.7;\\n    fam.fx = fx;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, c);\\n    if (sess.tier >= 2 && bal.px) {\\n      /* eyes closed: the tone is the plate. Drawing hides the disc. */\\n      fam.eyes = true;\\n    }\\n    const pct = clamp(bal.steadiness - 0.05 * bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n    sess.pct = pct;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSun(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    fam.guide = guideOf(fam.t);\\n    if (skillName(seat)) seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const breath = seat.local && !skillName(seat) ? G.lean.breath : seat.breath;\\n    fam.matchN++;\\n    if (Math.abs(breath - fam.guide) <= 0.25) fam.match++;\\n    fam.poseI = Math.min(G.SUN_POSES.length - 1, Math.floor(fam.t / 16));\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * (fam.match / fam.matchN), 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.t >= 80) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepCandle(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    let fx = 0, fy = 0;\\n    fam.thought -= dt;\\n    if (fam.thought <= 0) {\\n      fam.thought = 4.5 + (sess.rng() * 2);\\n      const ang = sess.rng() * Math.PI * 2;\\n      fam.tx = Math.cos(ang) * 0.85;\\n      fam.ty = Math.sin(ang) * 0.85;\\n      fam.tleft = 1.1;\\n      if (sess.tier >= 2 && sess.rng() > 0.5) { fam.tx *= 1.3; fam.ty *= 1.3; }\\n    }\\n    if (fam.tleft > 0) { fam.tleft -= dt; fx = fam.tx; fy = fam.ty; }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, fy, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const sp = Math.hypot(bal.vx, bal.vy);\\n    const inside = bal.stumble <= 0 && Math.hypot(bal.px, bal.py) < (bal.set.R || 0.2);\\n    if (sp > 0.55) fam.flame -= 0.4 * dt;\\n    else if (inside) fam.flame += 0.12 * dt;\\n    else fam.flame -= 0.055 * dt;\\n    fam.flame = clamp(fam.flame, 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.flame <= 0 && !fam.relit) { fam.relit = true; fam.flame = 0.15; }\\n    else if (fam.flame <= 0 && fam.relit) fam.dead = true;\\n    fam.flameSum += fam.flame;\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(seat.ux, seat.uy) > 0.05 || seat.breath > 0.05;\\n    if (!moved) fam.untouched += dt; else fam.untouched = 0;\\n    if (fam.untouched > 20 && !fam.said) { fam.said = true; G.subtitle = G.LINES.tare.filter(function (s) { return s.indexOf('controller') >= 0; })[0] || ''; }\\n    const mean = fam.flameSum / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * mean, 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.dead) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepRep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const prev = fam.bead;\\n    fam.bead = beadOf(fam.t, sess.tier);\\n    fam.beadVel = (fam.bead - prev) / dt;\\n    fam.side = (Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle) % 2 === 0) ? 1 : -1;\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    if (fam.doneReps === Math.floor(fam.planned * 0.6) && !fam.fatigued) {\\n      fam.fatigued = true;\\n      const mul = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.fatigue / 1.5 : 1;\\n      bal.set = Object.assign({}, bal.set, { A: bal.set.A * 1.5 * mul, k: bal.set.k * 0.8, kx: 16 * 0.8, ky: 16 * 0.8 });\\n    }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? clamp(fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px, 0, 1) : clamp(-bal.py, 0, 1);\\n    const tol = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.repTol : 0.08;\\n    fam.err += Math.abs(depth - fam.bead);\\n    fam.form += fam.axis === 'x' ? Math.abs(bal.py) : Math.abs(bal.px);\\n    fam.samples++;\\n    const cyc = Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle);\\n    if (cyc > fam.doneReps) {\\n      const meanErr = fam.err / Math.max(1, fam.samples);\\n      let sc = meanErr <= tol ? 1 : meanErr >= 0.35 ? 0 : (0.35 - meanErr) / (0.35 - tol);\\n      fam.scores.push(sc);\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0;\\n      fam.doneReps = cyc;\\n      if (fam.doneReps === fam.planned && !fam.extra) {\\n        const mean = fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length;\\n        if (mean > 0.8) { fam.extra = true; fam.planned += 2; sess.limit += fam.cycle * 2; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const form = fam.form / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    const pen = clamp(form * 0.45, 0, 0.3);\\n    const mean = fam.scores.length ? fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(mean * (1 - pen), 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.doneReps >= fam.planned && fam.scores.length >= fam.planned) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepStep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, rh = fam.rh, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!rh) return;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill && !sess.classMode) {\\n      const off = STEP_OFF[skill] || 0.02;\\n      const pos = G.game.audio.pos;\\n      const spb = 60 / (pos.bpm || 100) / 4;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < rh.notes.length; i++) {\\n        const n = rh.notes[i];\\n        if (n.j || n.call || n._bot) continue;\\n        const ahead = (n.step - pos.step) * spb;\\n        if (ahead <= off) { n._bot = true; rh.hit(n.lane); }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    rh.update();\\n    const judged = rh.counts.perfect + rh.counts.great + rh.counts.good + rh.counts.miss;\\n    sess.pct = judged ? rh.accuracy : 0;\\n    if (rh.done) sess.ended = true;\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHoop(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const ux = seat.ux || 0, uy = seat.uy || 0;\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(ux, uy);\\n    let omega = 0;\\n    if (mag > 0.55) {\\n      const ang = Math.atan2(uy, ux);\\n      let d = ang - (fam.ang || 0);\\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n      if (fam.haveAng) omega = d / dt;\\n      fam.ang = ang; fam.haveAng = true;\\n    } else fam.haveAng = false;\\n    fam.omega = omega;\\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopLo : 7;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopHi : 11;\\n    const dir = fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1;\\n    const inBand = Math.abs(omega) >= lo && Math.abs(omega) <= hi && omega * dir > 0;\\n    if (inBand) { fam.band += dt; fam.out = 0; fam.score += dt * (1 + fam.hoops * 0.15); }\\n    else if (mag > 0.2) { fam.out += dt; if (fam.out > 1.5 && fam.hoops > 1) { fam.hoops--; fam.drops++; fam.out = 0; } }\\n    if (!fam.otherWay && fam.t >= sess.limit * 0.5) fam.otherWay = true;\\n    fam.tossT -= dt;\\n    if (fam.tossT <= 0) {\\n      fam.tossT = 8;\\n      fam.toss = { side: sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, eta: 1.1 };\\n    }\\n    if (fam.toss) {\\n      fam.toss.eta -= dt;\\n      const hit = fam.toss.side < 0 ? seat.catchL : seat.catchR;\\n      if (hit && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) <= 0.25) { fam.caught++; fam.hoops = Math.min(6, fam.hoops + 1); fam.toss = null; }\\n      else if (fam.toss.eta < -0.25) fam.toss = null;\\n    }\\n    const best = sess.limit * 1.4;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(fam.score / best, 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepJog(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const edgeL = seat.paceL && !fam.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = seat.paceR && !fam.prevR;\\n    fam.prevL = seat.paceL; fam.prevR = seat.paceR;\\n    if (edgeL || edgeR) { fam.steps++; fam.hist.push(fam.t); }\\n    while (fam.hist.length && fam.t - fam.hist[0] > 1) fam.hist.shift();\\n    fam.cad = fam.hist.length;\\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogLo : 2.6;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogHi : 3.4;\\n    const zoned = fam.cad >= lo && fam.cad <= hi && fam.stitch <= 0;\\n    if (zoned) fam.zone += dt;\\n    if (fam.cad > 4.2) fam.sprint += dt; else fam.sprint = 0;\\n    if (fam.sprint > 2 && fam.stitch <= 0) fam.stitch = 3;\\n    if (fam.stitch > 0) fam.stitch -= dt;\\n    const speed = (G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogSpeed : 1) * (zoned ? 8 : 3);\\n    fam.z += speed * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 1.6 * dt;\\n    const cups = [12, 28, 44, 58];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) {\\n      if (fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= cups[i] && fam.z - speed * dt < cups[i]) {\\n        const cx = (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8);\\n        if (Math.abs(fam.x - cx) < 0.45) { fam.cups++; fam.gotCup = fam.gotCup || {}; fam.gotCup[i] = true; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    fam.nextCup = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) if (!(fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) && fam.z < cups[i]) { fam.nextCup = { x: (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8), z: cups[i] }; break; }\\n    const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSlalom(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (fam.done) return;\\n    if (fam.tumble > 0) { fam.tumble -= dt; return; }\\n    const base = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiSpeed : 220;\\n    const turn = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiTurn : 1.6;\\n    let spd = base;\\n    if (seat.uy > 0.3) spd *= 1.35;\\n    if (seat.uy < -0.3) spd *= 0.6;\\n    fam.z += spd * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 78 * turn / 1.6 * dt;\\n    const gates = G.GATES;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) {\\n      const g = gates[i];\\n      if (fam.missed[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= g.z && fam.z - spd * dt < g.z) {\\n        fam.missed[i] = Math.abs(fam.x - g.x) > fam.half;\\n        if (fam.missed[i]) fam.pen += 3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < G.OBSTACLES.length; i++) {\\n      const o = G.OBSTACLES[i];\\n      if (fam.hitO && fam.hitO[i]) continue;\\n      if (Math.abs(fam.z - o.z) < 80 && Math.abs(fam.x - o.x) < 16) {\\n        fam.hitO = fam.hitO || {}; fam.hitO[i] = true; fam.tumble = 1.2; fam.pen += 1.2;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    let next = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) if (gates[i].z > fam.z - 20) { next = gates[i]; break; }\\n    fam.nextGate = next;\\n    if (fam.z >= fam.finish) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 90;\\n      const time = fam.t + fam.pen;\\n      sess.pct = clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepTray(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!seat.bal) {\\n      seat.bal = new G.Balance({ k: 14, c: 8, s: 1, A: 0.5, nf: 0.8, R: 0.4, push: null }, sess.seed, {});\\n    }\\n    const sk = skillName(seat);\\n    if (sk) {\\n      const aim = sk === 'poor' ? 0.25 : sk === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    }\\n    seat.bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const Gv = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayG : 420;\\n    if (fam.world) {\\n      fam.world.gravity = [seat.bal.px * Gv, -seat.bal.py * Gv];\\n      fam.world.wake();\\n      fam.world.step(dt);\\n      const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n      const need = spec ? spec.olives.length : 0;\\n      const gotHere = fam.got - fam.trayGot0;\\n      if (gotHere >= need) {\\n        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n    fam.air -= dt;\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0) fam.air = 0.38;\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\\n    fam.gust -= dt;\\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\\n    let fx = 0;\\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\\n      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\\n    }\\n    const fallsBefore = bal.falls;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    if (bal.falls > fallsBefore) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; }\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.25 && fam.air <= 0 && !fam.pinHit) {\\n      fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.pinHit = pins.indexOf(ahead.x);\\n    }\\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist > 1) fam.pinHit = -1;\\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\\n    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (fam.air <= 0) fam.x += spd * dt;\\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\\n      const time = fam.t;\\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function Session(opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\\n    this.classMode = !!opts.classMode;\\n    this.seed = (opts.seed || 1) >>> 0;\\n    this.rng = E.rng(this.seed);\\n    this.phase = opts.skipToPlay ? 'count' : 'card';\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.playTime = 0;\\n    this.limit = opts.limit || this.act.dur[this.tier - 1] || 45;\\n    if (this.phase === 'count') this.t = 0;\\n    this.countT = opts.skipToPlay ? 0.4 : 3;\\n    this.demoT = 3;\\n    this.pct = 0;\\n    this.stars = 0;\\n    this.ended = false;\\n    this.awarded = false;\\n    this.seats = opts.seats || [{ name: (G.profile && G.profile.name) || 'You', color: '#ff7a59', local: true, human: true, skill: opts.driver || null }];\\n    if (opts.driver) this.seats[0].skill = opts.driver;\\n    this.driver = opts.driver || null;\\n    this.fam = null;\\n    this.line = (G.LINES.tare[this.seed % G.LINES.tare.length]) || '';\\n  }\\n\\n  Session.prototype.update = function (dt) {\\n    if (G.driver && G.driver !== 'human') {\\n      this.driver = G.driver;\\n      if (this.seats[0] && this.seats[0].local) this.seats[0].skill = G.driver;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'card') {\\n      G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'demo') {\\n      this.demoT -= dt;\\n      G.phase = 'auto'; G.left = Math.max(0, this.demoT);\\n      if (this.demoT <= 0) { this.phase = 'count'; this.countT = 3; }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'count') {\\n      this.countT -= dt;\\n      G.phase = 'auto'; G.left = Math.max(0, this.countT);\\n      if (this.countT <= 0) { this.phase = 'play'; this.playTime = 0; this.ended = false; beginFamily(this); }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'play') {\\n      G.phase = 'play';\\n      this.playTime += dt;\\n      stepFamily(this, dt);\\n      G.left = Math.max(0, this.limit - this.playTime);\\n      const timed = this.act.family !== 'rep' && this.act.family !== 'slalom' && this.act.family !== 'laundry' && this.act.family !== 'tray' && this.act.family !== 'step';\\n      if (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit || (timed && this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'step' && this.fam && this.fam.rh && this.fam.rh.done) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'rep' && this.ended) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'slalom' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'laundry' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'tray' && (this.ended || this.playTime >= this.limit)) this.finish();\\n      if (this.act.family === 'candle' && this.fam && this.fam.dead) this.finish();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.phase === 'results') { G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0; }\\n  };\\n\\n  Session.prototype.finish = function () {\\n    if (this.phase === 'results') return;\\n    scoreNow(this);\\n    if (this.act.family === 'slalom' && this.fam && !this.fam.done) this.pct = 0;\\n    if (this.act.family === 'laundry' && this.fam && !this.fam.done) this.pct = 0;\\n    this.pct = clamp(this.pct || 0, 0, 1);\\n    this.stars = G.starsOf(this.pct, this.act.stars);\\n    this.phase = 'results';\\n    G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\\n    this.seats.forEach(function (q) { q.pct = this.pct; q.score = clamp(Math.round(this.pct * 1000), 0, 1000); }, this);\\n    if (this.classMode) {\\n      this.seats.forEach(function (q) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        let p = this.pct;\\n        if (!q.local && q.botFill) p = this.pct;\\n        if (q.human && !q.local) p = q.moved ? this.pct : 0;\\n        q.pct = p; q.score = q.scoring === false ? 0 : clamp(Math.round(p * 1000), 0, 1000);\\n      }, this);\\n    }\\n    if (!this.trial && !G.attracting && !G.inSession) G.award(this.act.id, this.tier, this.stars, this.pct);\\n    try {\\n      const n = this.stars;\\n      G.sting(n >= 3 ? 'star3' : n === 2 ? 'star2' : n === 1 ? 'star1' : null);\\n    } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n  };\\n\\n  Session.prototype.begin = function () { if (this.phase === 'card') { this.phase = 'demo'; this.demoT = 3; } };\\n  Session.prototype.again = function () {\\n    const id = this.act.id, tier = this.tier, trial = this.trial, driver = this.driver, limit = this.limit, seats = this.seats, classMode = this.classMode, seed = (this.seed + 1) >>> 0;\\n    const next = new Session({ id: id, tier: tier, trial: trial, driver: driver, limit: limit, seats: seats, classMode: classMode, seed: seed, skipToPlay: false, cheat: this.cheat });\\n    G.session = next;\\n  };\\n\\n  G.Session = Session;\\n  G.skillName = skillName;\\n\\n  G.drawActivity = function (r, sess) {\\n    if (!r || !sess) return;\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    G.paintRoom(r, sess.act && sess.act.id === 'slalom' ? 'dusk' : 'day');\\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' || sess.phase === 'results' || sess.phase === 'demo' || sess.phase === 'count') {\\n      try {\\n        if (!sess._rig && G.makeRig) {\\n          const look = G.lookColors ? G.lookColors(G.profile) : null;\\n          sess._rig = G.makeRig(G.playerOpts(look, 2.1));\\n        }\\n        if (sess._rig && (sess.phase === 'play' || sess.phase === 'demo')) {\\n          const pose = sess.act.family === 'sun' ? G.SUN_POSES[(fam && fam.poseI) || 0] : sess.act.pose;\\n          if (sess.phase === 'demo') G.poseRig(sess._rig, pose || 'idle', sess.demoT, [0, 0]);\\n          else if (fam && sess.seats[0].bal) {\\n            const b = sess.seats[0].bal;\\n            sess._rig.wob = [b.py, b.px];\\n            if (sess.act.family === 'lunge' || sess.act.id === 'lunge') sess._rig.body = G.sideLunge(b.px);\\n            else if (sess.act.id === 'hoop') sess._rig.body = G.hula(fam.ang || 0);\\n            else G.poseRig(sess._rig, pose || 'idle', fam.t, [b.py, b.px]);\\n          }\\n          G.stepRig(sess._rig, DT, 0, 0);\\n          r.actor(0, 8, 0, function (g, ox, oy) { sess._rig.draw(g, ox, oy, r.view); G.drawJoints(g, sess._rig, ox, oy); });\\n        }\\n      } catch (e) { /* a painted room still reads */ }\\n    }\\n    r.overlay(function (g) {\\n      const W = r.W, H = r.H;\\n      if (sess.phase === 'card') {\\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, W / 2, 28, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\\n        G.text(g, sess.act.blurb, 16, 52, '#20404c', 1, 'left');\\n        const gates = sess.act.stars;\\n        G.text(g, 'Stars  ' + gates[0] + '   ' + gates[1] + '   ' + gates[2], 16, 78, '#5f7f8a', 1);\\n        const best = G.bestText ? G.bestText(sess.act.id, sess.tier) : '';\\n        if (best) G.text(g, best, 16, 94, '#14a8c8', 1);\\n        G.text(g, 'Tier ' + sess.tier, W - 70, 28, '#14a8c8', 1);\\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'demo') {\\n        G.text(g, sess.line, 16, 36, '#20404c', 1);\\n        G.text(g, 'Watch', W / 2, H / 2 - 20, '#14a8c8', 2, 'center');\\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'count') {\\n        const n = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(sess.countT));\\n        E.font.title(g, String(n), W / 2, H / 2 - 20, { scale: 4, align: 'center', colors: ['#ffffff', '#8fd3f4', '#14a8c8'] });\\n        G.text(g, 'Breathe in', W / 2, H / 2 + 18, '#20404c', 1, 'center');\\n      } else if (sess.phase === 'results') {\\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, W / 2, 24, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\\n        G.drawStars(g, W / 2 - 18, 48, sess.stars);\\n        G.text(g, Math.round(sess.pct * 100) + '%', W / 2, 70, '#20404c', 2, 'center');\\n        const remark = (G.LINES.stars[sess.stars] || G.LINES.stars[0])[0];\\n        G.text(g, remark, 12, 96, '#20404c', 1);\\n      } else if (fam) {\\n        G.text(g, sess.act.name, 8, 6, '#20404c', 1);\\n        G.text(g, Math.ceil(Math.max(0, sess.limit - sess.playTime)) + 's', W - 36, 6, '#5f7f8a', 1);\\n        if (sess.act.family === 'hoop') {\\n          const label = Math.abs(fam.omega) < 7 ? 'Too slow' : Math.abs(fam.omega) > 11 ? 'Too eager' : 'Just right';\\n          G.text(g, label, W / 2, 24, '#14a8c8', 1, 'center');\\n          if (fam.otherWay) G.text(g, 'Other way!', W / 2, 40, '#e0553a', 1, 'center');\\n        }\\n        if (sess.act.family === 'jog') G.text(g, 'Cadence ' + fam.cad.toFixed(1), 8, 20, '#20404c', 1);\\n        if (sess.act.family === 'candle') G.text(g, 'Flame ' + Math.round(fam.flame * 100), 8, 20, '#e0553a', 1);\\n        if (sess.act.family === 'slalom') G.text(g, 'Time ' + (fam.t + fam.pen).toFixed(1), 8, 20, '#20404c', 1);\\n        if (G.subtitle) G.text(g, G.subtitle, 8, H - 52, '#20404c', 1);\\n      }\\n    });\\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' && sess.seats[0].bal) {\\n      const hide = sess.act.id === 'stork' && sess.tier >= 2;\\n      G.drawPlate(r, sess.seats[0].bal, { hide: hide, c: fam && fam.c, trace: G.dev && G.dev.trace });\\n    }\\n    if (sess.phase === 'play' && fam && fam.rh && fam.rh.draw) {\\n      try { fam.rh.draw(r, { arrows: true, y: r.H - 78, len: 90 }); } catch (e) { /* highway can sit this one out */ }\\n    }\\n    if (sess.phase === 'play') G.prompt(null, r, 'lean', '');\\n  };\\n})();\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"99fb0867-67b2-4151-bb46-77610714586d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_190","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found a bug in stepRep. drive() is called twice: once inside stepFamily and again inside stepRep after updating the bead.\n\nThe duplicate drive calls are harmless. The first call uses the previous bead, and the second call in stepRep uses the updated bead before balance.\n\nI found another bug in drive(). When a hold skill is active, the function falls through without setting seat.ux, so the value remains stale.\n\nI should re-arm the balance skill each frame inside stepFamily. The balance ignores stale ux values, but the skill reference can become outdated if the driver is set after construction.\n\nLaundry balance logic is correct. stepLaundry sets effort and jump using seat.jump, which is safe because it reads the previous frame's pinAhead.\n\nSun bot breathing has a one-frame lag. drive sets the guide before stepSun updates it, but stepSun copies the updated guide into seat.breath before matching. Passive sun correctly leaves breath at zero.\n\nstepSun can end at exactly 80 frames even when the limit is 80. The finish() guard prevents duplicate calls because it returns immediately once the phase is already results. stepFamily sets ended first, so the update loop catches it before playTime checks.\n\nRep limit is set correctly after the Session constructor initializes it from duration. Step limit is reduced to song length at play start. Slalom percentage persists through finish because scoreNow only zeros it when the course is incomplete.\n\nPassive tray, jog, hoop, and candle scores all correctly default to zero. Tray percentage persists through finish even when not all olives are collected. The duplicate drive in stepRep risks using a bead velocity of zero on the first frames.\n\narm() overwrites the seeded noise with an unseeded sine wave, but this is harmless because the constructor already set the correct noise when the skill was passed. beginFamily assigns a balance to each class seat.\n\nstepFamily currently only steps the shared family logic for seat 0. For class mode, each seat needs its own balance updated for holds, candles, and squats. I will add a class-specific path to step each seat's balance separately.\n\nAll class seats will share the same average bot skill. They will all score the same percentage, so each seat receives the same score multiplied by 1000. Podium titles still assign correctly.\n\nEmpty seats are non-scoring. Human players in class mode score zero when idle, but headless bots with assigned skills fill and score normally. The finish function correctly assigns the session percentage to every seat. Calling G.sting(null) is safe because the lookup returns undefined.\n\nG.award must be defined in boot before play starts, since finish calls it at runtime. G.bestText, G.lookColors, and G.subtitle are optional. G.drawStars accepts a canvas context and is invoked correctly from the overlay.\n\nCandle and hold stork activities finish via the time limit rather than an internal ended flag. The first sun frame uses a zero guide because stepFamily drives before stepSun updates it, but this is harmless. Passive sun creates a balance with no skill, so the bot remains idle.\n\nPassive rep scores zero because the bead averages 0.5 and the error is roughly 0.5. The good rep lead of 0.14 still needs a test to confirm it tracks properly. The duplicate drive calls in stepRep are safe because drive is captured in closure. Fatigue scaling replaces bal.set but preserves anisotropic stiffness through kx and k.\n\nThe `this` binding in the `forEach` callback inside `finish` is correct.\n\nHoop scoring logic was verified. A single hoop at default speed yields a percentage of roughly 0.82, which clears the two-star threshold of 0.65 and falls short of the three-star threshold at 0.90. Average skill also reaches about 0.82, satisfying the 0.65 requirement. Passive performance scores zero.\n\nHoop scores can rise above 0.82 when the bot catches additional hoops, but they still clear the two-star threshold.\n\nThe halfway-reversal logic is sound. When the bot flips direction, the sign of omega changes, yet the in-band check remains satisfied because the product of omega and direction stays positive.\n\nHuman circling is genuine; bots set seat velocity directly rather than through the balance.\n\nIn jog mode, the zone share starts near zero because the history length equals the cadence, then quickly approaches full share as the limit nears.\n\nJog edge detection fires only once per step because the flag persists until the next step. Passive jog scores zero since pace never activates and the bot stays outside the zone. The slalom bot can clear gates at closing speed; the distance between gates is about 140 units, but the bot travels roughly 187 units in the time between them, so it should make it. Poor skill sets the slalom steer to zero.\n\nAverage slalom steer should clear the gates, but overshoot oscillation might cause misses that still leave the percentage above 0.81. The tray activity needs testing. For laundry, a good bot with effort 0.62 and length 55 finishes in about 40 seconds, yielding full percentage if it avoids falls; gusts may knock off roughly 0.06 points per fall.\n\nAverage laundry should clear the threshold. A good run finishes in about 40 seconds, and an average run in roughly 50 seconds still passes even with a few falls. Passive laundry scores zero.\n\nThe pin-fall jump may be too short. At speed 1.36 units per second, the bot only has 0.38 seconds of air time, which might not let it clear the pin before landing. The jump trigger distance or air duration likely needs adjustment.\n\nThe pin-fall jump distance and air duration are being tightened so the bot clears the pin before landing. The laundry jump logic is confirmed correct because it uses the previous frame's pin-ahead state. During a jump, holdP skips integration to prevent gusts from moving the bot.\n\nThe finish guard prevents duplicate calls even when multiple conditions trigger it. Rep limits are set to planned cycles plus 1.5 seconds so reps complete before the time limit expires. Two more activities extend the limit. The sun family also receives a balance from the hold-like branch.\n\nSun is confirmed to be a non-rep activity. Laundry has no duplicate creation bug. Sun uses stepSun instead of stepHold. The arm balance must update when the skill changes. G.subtitle persists across sessions and needs clearing at the start.\n\nThe Session constructor will clear G.subtitle to an empty string. Headless mode skips draw entirely, so r.actor never runs. check.mjs wraps makeRig and poseRig in try/catch blocks to handle Mocap failures gracefully. In class mode, stepFamily drives every seat but stepX only steps seat 0; since star gates use a single seat, the shared botPh is not overwritten.\n\nRemote class seats are not local, so they skip the human lean branch and fall back to bot driving. A local human with a driver set correctly uses the driver skill. The skillName helper prioritizes G.driver over individual seat skills, which is acceptable for solo mode; in class mode it falls back to seat.skill when G.driver is null.\n\nClass tests will clear G.driver so each seat uses its own skill. If G.driver is set to 'passive', skillName returns null because BOTS lacks that key, and drive falls back to a zero-ux bot.\n\nThe first few hoop frames report zero angular velocity because the bot angle is not yet initialized, so the in-band check stays false until the rotation rate builds up.\n\nThe first two hoop frames produce a clean angular velocity of 9, so the out accumulator only increases by one frame and does not drop the hoop prematurely. The slalom tuck and speed boost may make the gates too close together for the steer to keep up.\n\nSlalom bot uy is being set to 0 so base speed stays at 220 and steering has more time. Average steer of 0.85 might oscillate, so that needs testing. The rep drive-before-bead ordering is already correct. Slalom finish handles both early completion and time-limit expiry safely. Tray percentage computes correctly when all trays clear. world.js and boot.js still need to be written.\n\nThe jump threshold still needs fixing. The Balance constructor receives the skill from skillName at play start, so it is correctly attached. The attract cheat disables stumbles. Sun activity ends at frame 80.\n\nCandle flame mean and untouched subtitle are confirmed safe. The 0.85 thought force is smaller than the 1.1 table push, so passive candle should not fall. Next I will fix the laundry jump and slalom uy, then write world.js and boot.js.\n\nRep family kind is confirmed as 'rep'. Squat, tier 2 squat, and push limits are correctly overwritten to 33.5, 61.5, and 25.5 seconds. The two-more-reps guard uses an extra flag so it triggers only once, preventing infinite loops.\n\nThe rep scoring logic is confirmed correct. The cycle counter starts at zero, so the first cycle is scored only after it completes. The score array includes the rep that triggers the extra two reps, and the bead error is sampled exactly when the cycle increments.\n\nG.award must update played stars, minutes, unlocks, and spine. The suggestion multiplier applies when profile.suggestion matches the activity id. Tier bests store the maximum of the two tier scores. Play scene pills show Begin at start and Done or Again after results. Confirm input is ignored during play, demo, and count phases.\n\nThe play scene update checks for an open talk window first. It then rebuilds the pill bar only when the session phase changes, and handles Begin, Done, or Again clicks by calling the matching session method.\n\nThe session object is replaced by `s.again()` but the local reference updates on the next frame, so this is safe. `onDoneSession` will route to the island, class podium, or games callback via a session option. Star gate reads its percentage directly from the results phase without requiring a Done click. Pump clicks Done and returns to the island. Trial shows results and returns without awarding; its `onDone` callback simply sends the user back.\n\nG.afterPlay() routes to the next queued game or the island. The body check scene is a standalone auto-timer scene, not a session. Island pills are rebuilt from unlocked activities on every enter. A visited set will be added in the boot enter hook. world.js is being written now with a structured dialog helper.\n\nThe dialog helper is being implemented with a bottom-aligned, two-line panel in muted blues and teals. It disables shadows and sets speech speed to 1e6. A `say` wrapper function is also being added to queue text for that panel.\n\nThe `say` wrapper queues text to the dialog panel and sets the phase to `talk`. It only passes one callback at a time because both `onChoice` and `onDone` cannot fire together. The arrival scene uses this to greet the player, ask for an instructor choice between Birch and Alder, then save the selection and enter the bungalow.\n\nThe arrival scene chains two dialogs with confirm. The first say may wrap into multiple pages. Its onDone opens the second dialog. The same confirm that closes the last page of the first also triggers onDone. That callback calls say() to open the choice dialog. The new dialog opens this frame after the confirm is processed. The next confirm hits the choice. This flow works correctly.\n\nThe arrival scene will use two short pages followed by a choice. The member scene uses pills instead of dialogs. The title scene shows New Member, Continue, Class, and About pills; Continue is disabled when no saves exist and the pill system skips disabled items.\n\nA Settings pill will be added to the title scene, though it is not focused by default. The title pill bar will use New Member at focus 0, with Continue, Class, and About as the remaining options. Entering class mode from the title will route through a setup scene or picker, since the pump activity does not include it.\n\nA free-play island scene will be added for unrestricted access. The island logic will be extracted into a shared function used by both the title and free-play paths. After the body check on day five, the game routes to the games scene if the player has not yet unlocked it; otherwise it returns to the island. A sleep function for the bed scene is also being drafted.\n\nThe bed scene now advances the day counter and resets sessions. On day two it captures the spine age into `holdSpine` and sets a plateau flag. The plateau lasts through day three, freezing the displayed age to that captured value. Day four then clears the plateau and increments normally. The next activity suggestion is drawn from the guide for the current day.\n\nDay five is strictly the games day. The bed scene will not run again after day four; the player proceeds directly from body check to games, then duel, then ending. Days one through four cover all twelve activities exactly once. Day four unlocks tier two. A tierFor helper is being drafted.\n\nThe tier helper returns tier 2 for day four or free play, and tier 1 otherwise. The unlock helper clamps the current day to three and falls back to the day-three activity list, so days four and five keep all activities available.\n\nThe activity suggestion for each day is the first entry in the guide array. Day four specifically suggests lunge. The ×1.5 multiplier applies to that session. A quick estimate shows the minimum playtime across days one through four plus day five games exceeds thirty minutes, so the time budget is safe. Even a one-star stork on day one would still yield enough minutes.\n\nA concrete test case shows that twelve high-star activities drop the spine age to about 59. The formula averages the four activity scores, then subtracts roughly 19 from 78. This confirms the age stays below 71 and the holdSpine value is stable.\n\nPassive playthroughs will finish activities with zero stars and continue to the ending. The spine age may remain at 71 during passive runs, which is acceptable because the scripted fall test covers that separately. The test pump will assign the passive driver during auto and play scenes so activities receive passive skill. Body check does not require skill.\n\nPassive activity runs finish within their limits with zero stars. Slalom completes in about fifty-eight seconds. Tray and laundry end at sixty and seventy seconds. Reps finish in roughly thirty-two seconds. Step ends early when life fails. All runs complete so the story continues. A full playthrough is estimated at one to two minutes.\n\nDay five duel is kept at ninety seconds. The festival games are capped at twenty seconds each, so slalom may not finish its course and still ends with zero percent; the story continues regardless. Stars do not gate the ending. Next I will fix the laundry jump and write world.js and boot.js, plus add a guard for G.sting and G.award.\n\nBalance data and noise functions are kept separate, so the `set` assignment in stepRep is safe. Live() reads `set.k` and step() reads `set.kx`. The hoop score percentage clamp is correct. A subtitle field will be added to Session. Family drive is guarded against null during card play. Count phase begins at the end of count. The laundry jump fix will use search_replace.\n\nThe rep activity sequence is being checked. stepFamily calls drive before stepRep updates the bead velocity, but that is correct because drive uses the previous frame's value. A potential bug is noted: beginFamily creates a new family object, yet the same update cycle returns early without stepping it. The developer is now inspecting the main update loop to verify whether that early return actually prevents the new family from being stepped.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e6f7941a-fdea-4ef5-8e82-896e41e3dacc-57","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","old_string":"      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 1.3 && pin.dist > 0.15);","new_string":"      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 0.7 && pin.dist > 0.05);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e6f7941a-fdea-4ef5-8e82-896e41e3dacc-58","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","old_string":"      seat.ux = clamp(err / 28, -1, 1) * steer;\n      seat.uy = skill === 'poor' ? -0.2 : 0.35;","new_string":"      seat.ux = clamp(err / 36, -1, 1) * steer;\n      seat.uy = 0;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e6f7941a-fdea-4ef5-8e82-896e41e3dacc-59","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","old_string":"    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0) fam.air = 0.38;","new_string":"    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0) fam.air = 0.55;"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12914,"output_tokens":9240,"cache_read_input_tokens":185344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"8c275164-ba90-4acc-9b4f-13abf05e48a9"}
