- G.t >= .45) { G.long = true; this._gLong = [G.x, G.y]; }   // a press held still\\n    this._longAt = this._gLong; this._tap2At = this._gTap2; this._panAt = this._gPan; this._gLong = this._gTap2 = this._gPan = null;\\n    this._boxAt = this._gBox && Object.assign({}, this._gBox); if (this._gBox && this._gBox.done) this._gBox = null;\\n    const da = this._dragAcc || (this._dragAcc = [0, 0]), k = this.screen.dpr / this.screen.S; this._drag = this.stickOn ? [da[0] * k, da[1] * k] : null; da[0] = da[1] = 0;\\n  }\\n  /** wire every element with data-act=\\\"<action>\\\" inside root to the action */\\n  bindButtons(root) {\\n    this._boundButtons = (this._boundButtons || []).filter(b => b.isConnected);\\n\",\"total_lines\":14974}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"5087c375-f9d3-4a68-83c0-5b0bfed6a013"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_201","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tap() function calls press(), which adds the key to both _fresh and held.\n\nThe next tick releases the previous tap and moves current taps to _tapsDue. The key stays pressed during that advance's update. If go() is called with fade 0, the scene transitions before the next tick.\n\nThe released tap becomes pressed again on the new scene's entry frame. A confirm after a transition therefore triggers an extra confirm on the new scene. Menu scenes immediately consume that extra confirm and transition again. This is the bug.\n\nThe snapshot lags behind scene transitions. The pump still sees the old screen after a transition, so it issues a tap that lands on the new scene's entry frame. That tap is the only input the new scene receives, and it fires immediately as its forward action. This creates a chain where each menu screen gets exactly one confirm on entry.\n\nThe title screen confirms New Member and enters slots. The slots screen confirms the first slot and enters member. The member screen confirms This is me and enters arrival. If the arrival screen opens a dialog in its enter() before the next tick, that confirm advances the dialog.\n\nThe title screen is the only one that should not auto-advance on a stale confirm. Every other menu screen should perform its single action on the entry confirm alone, since that extra tap is its intended forward action.\n\nTitle is the only screen that needs a confirm to leave. The first tap lands on title itself, not as a stale entry tap. After that, each menu screen consumes exactly one confirm on its entry frame. Arrival confirms advance any dialog opened in enter(). The pump then sees arrival with phase talk.\n\nArrival's entry confirm advances the gift typing page. The next confirm closes it and opens the choice dialog. A third confirm selects Birch and goes to bungalow. I should use onDone only for the first dialog that opens the choice, and onChoice exclusively for the choice dialog itself.\n\nPhase must be set at the end of update, after dialog.update. If phase is still 'talk' when the choice dialog closes, the snapshot lags behind the scene transition and the pump may tap again.\n\nBungalow entry confirms the day start. Body check is automatic and should ignore entry confirms. The phase must be set to auto in enter() before update runs, so the confirm is discarded and the pump advances time instead.\n\nBody auto lasts roughly nine seconds. The pump advances time by only one second per iteration while phase is auto, so G.left must be set to the remaining duration. If left is zero during auto, the pump falls back to 1/120 seconds. After the body check finishes, the question pill appears and phase switches to menu.\n\nThe body sequence ends with question pills. One confirm picks the first answer and opens a multi-page reading talk. The pump advances through those pages while phase is talk. After the final page, onDone either goes to island or shows a suggestion before island. Island uses guided mat focus.\n\nThe island entry confirm starts the guided session. Island then confirms the mat to enter play. The play scene's entry confirm begins the card session and advances to the demo.\n\nThe demo runs for three seconds in auto phase. After it, the play scene begins with its driver set. The pump advances time in one-second chunks while the activity runs. When the activity finishes, phase switches to results and menu. The snapshot then shows results, so the next pump tap confirms the Done button.\n\nThe confirm that finishes the activity lands on the Done button. The one-second advance during the session does not generate extra confirms; it simply runs the activity. If the session ends mid-advance, the remaining steps on the results scene see no confirm.\n\nThe Done button transitions to island while the snapshot still shows play/menu. The next tap enters island and confirms the focused mat. If fewer than three sessions have run, that confirms starts the next activity; otherwise focus is Bed and confirms go to evening. The session counter should increment on Done rather than on Again.\n\nEvening entry confirms continue to bed. Bed auto-runs for about two seconds before the next dawn bungalow. On day four, the bungalow entry confirm goes to tare.\n\nTare is entered and immediately left in the same step, so its seen flag must be set inside enter(). Day five body onDone goes to games instead of island. Games auto-advance three activities with skipToPlay and a twenty-step limit, then run the duel for about ninety seconds, followed by ending talk and free play. The games sequence needs no confirms between its activities.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-374734c3-4b0d-4b3d-b594-5f99f0533726-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","offset":1,"limit":220}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-374734c3-4b0d-4b3d-b594-5f99f0533726-37","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/audio.js","offset":90,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-374734c3-4b0d-4b3d-b594-5f99f0533726-38","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"game\\.hook|prototype\\.hook|start\\(\\{","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-374734c3-4b0d-4b3d-b594-5f99f0533726-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/tools/check.mjs","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3020,"output_tokens":2610,"cache_read_input_tokens":107008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"3899336d-c092-4bcb-9906-c1aaf91518f5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-374734c3-4b0d-4b3d-b594-5f99f0533726-36","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\\n10→  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\\n\\n  function skillName(seat) {\\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\\n    if (!bal) return;\\n20→    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\\n    bal.skill = skill;\\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\\n    void br;\\n    bal.bot = b;\\n  }\\n30→\\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\\n40→      return;\\n    }\\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\\n    if (!skill) return;\\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel;\\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\\n50→      const target = clamp(bead + lead * sign, -0.05, 1.15);\\n      if (fam.axis === 'x') { seat.ux = fam.side * target; seat.uy = 0; }\\n      else { seat.uy = -target; seat.ux = 0; }\\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\\n      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\\n60→        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\\n      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\\n70→    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 36, -1, 1) * steer;\\n      seat.uy = 0;\\n    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\\n80→      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 0.7 && pin.dist > 0.05);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\\n90→    return s;\\n  }\\n\\n  function repSet(axis) {\\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\\n    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\\n    return o;\\n  }\\n\\n100→  function holdCenter(t) {\\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\\n    const a = i * 2.4;\\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\\n  }\\n\\n  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n110→      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n120→  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n130→      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n140→      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n150→    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n160→    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n170→    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n180→    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\\n190→    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\\n    const sensor = world.circle(glass.x, glass.y, Math.max(glass.r, 22), { type: 'static', sensor: true });\\n    sensor._glass = true;\\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.15, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02 });\\n      b._olive = true;\\n200→    });\\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\\n      other._caught = true;\\n      fam.got++;\\n      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    };\\n    fam.world = world;\\n210→    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    fam.t += dt;\\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n220→    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\\n10→  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\\n\\n  function skillName(seat) {\\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\\n    if (!bal) return;\\n20→    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\\n    bal.skill = skill;\\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\\n    void br;\\n    bal.bot = b;\\n  }\\n30→\\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\\n40→      return;\\n    }\\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\\n    if (!skill) return;\\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel;\\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\\n50→      const target = clamp(bead + lead * sign, -0.05, 1.15);\\n      if (fam.axis === 'x') { seat.ux = fam.side * target; seat.uy = 0; }\\n      else { seat.uy = -target; seat.ux = 0; }\\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\\n      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\\n60→        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\\n      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\\n70→    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 36, -1, 1) * steer;\\n      seat.uy = 0;\\n    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\\n80→      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 0.7 && pin.dist > 0.05);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\\n90→    return s;\\n  }\\n\\n  function repSet(axis) {\\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\\n    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\\n    return o;\\n  }\\n\\n100→  function holdCenter(t) {\\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\\n    const a = i * 2.4;\\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\\n  }\\n\\n  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n110→      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n120→  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n130→      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n140→      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n150→    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n160→    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n170→    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n180→    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\\n190→    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\\n    const sensor = world.circle(glass.x, glass.y, Math.max(glass.r, 22), { type: 'static', sensor: true });\\n    sensor._glass = true;\\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.15, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02 });\\n      b._olive = true;\\n200→    });\\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\\n      other._caught = true;\\n      fam.got++;\\n      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    };\\n    fam.world = world;\\n210→    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    fam.t += dt;\\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n220→    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":220,\"raw_output\":\"/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\\n  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\\n\\n  function skillName(seat) {\\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\\n    if (!bal) return;\\n    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\\n    bal.skill = skill;\\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\\n    void br;\\n    bal.bot = b;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\\n    if (!skill) return;\\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel;\\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\\n      const target = clamp(bead + lead * sign, -0.05, 1.15);\\n      if (fam.axis === 'x') { seat.ux = fam.side * target; seat.uy = 0; }\\n      else { seat.uy = -target; seat.ux = 0; }\\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\\n      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\\n        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\\n      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\\n    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 36, -1, 1) * steer;\\n      seat.uy = 0;\\n    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\\n      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 0.7 && pin.dist > 0.05);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\\n    return s;\\n  }\\n\\n  function repSet(axis) {\\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\\n    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\\n    return o;\\n  }\\n\\n  function holdCenter(t) {\\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\\n    const a = i * 2.4;\\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\\n  }\\n\\n  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\\n    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\\n    const sensor = world.circle(glass.x, glass.y, Math.max(glass.r, 22), { type: 'static', sensor: true });\\n    sensor._glass = true;\\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.15, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02 });\\n      b._olive = true;\\n    });\\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\\n      other._caught = true;\\n      fam.got++;\\n      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    };\\n    fam.world = world;\\n    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    fam.t += dt;\\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\\n\",\"total_lines\":727}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-374734c3-4b0d-4b3d-b594-5f99f0533726-37","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileCont