cter, then one digit for each row of its pixels, top to bottom, the\"},{\"line_number\":1345,\"content\":\"// under its accent); any other character draws as ?. It is the agent edition's table. To see glyphs as rows of # and .:\"},{\"line_number\":1359,\"content\":\"  normal: { glyphs: parseFont(G57), h: 7, desc: 2, gap: 1, space: 3, upper: false },\"},{\"line_number\":1360,\"content\":\"  tiny: { glyphs: parseFont(GLYPHS, 3), h: 5, desc: 0, gap: 2, space: 3, upper: true, mono: 3 }\"},{\"line_number\":1374,\"content\":\"  _glyph(f, ch) { return f.glyphs[f.upper ? ch.toUpperCase() : ch] || f.glyphs[ch.toUpperCase()] || f.glyphs['?']; },\"},{\"line_number\":1431,\"content\":\"   * Big logo text for title screens: scaled glyphs with a vertical color gradient, an outline and an extruded 3D edge.\"},{\"line_number\":3024,\"content\":\" *      one with a standard key and no label changes that setting, its other fields kept: { key: 'glyphs', value:\"},{\"line_number\":3026,\"content\":\" *      player picks Xbox (game.settings.set('glyphs', 'xbox') switches); one with a label of its own is the game's, in the\"},{\"line_number\":3054,\"content\":\"  music: { group: 'Sound', label: 'Music', type: 'slider', value: .5, apply: (g, v) => { g.audio.musicVolume = v; g.audio.applyVolume(); } },\"},{\"line_number\":3066,\"content\":\"  glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'auto', options: [['auto', 'Auto'], ['xbox', 'Xbox'], ['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['nintendo', 'Nintendo'], ['generic', 'Positions']], apply: (g, v) => { for (const q of g._players || [g.input]) q.glyphs = v; } },\"},{\"line_number\":3768,\"content\":\"  for (const k of ['glyphs', 'deadzone', 'invertAimY', 'invertMoveX', 'invertMoveY', 'rumbleScale']) q[k] = this.input[k];   // (the player's settings: button symbols, dead zone, aim, the move stick, vibration)\"},{\"line_number\":7833,\"content\":\"   * sounds on that step of the music clock, scheduled with the music: a rhythm game's calls and claps), pan: -1 (left)\"},{\"line_number\":7881,\"content\":\"    if (!C) { warn('music:empty', 'music(song) needs song.tracks with notes'); return; }\"},{\"line_number\":8026,\"content\":\"      const kit = DRUMS[tok[0].toLowerCase()]; if (!kit) { warn('drum:' + tok, 'music: drum token \\\"' + tok + '\\\" is unknown (k s h o c t or .)'); return; }\"},{\"line_number\":8031,\"content\":\"    const f = noteFreq(tok); if (!f) { warn('note:' + tok, 'music: \\\"' + tok + '\\\" is not a note (use C4, F#3, Bb2, \\\".\\\" for rest, \\\"-\\\" to hold)'); return; }\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ad2bc4d0-73ac-4cbc-8b20-790776a65b5e-43","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle: **Spine Wee**\\n\\nChosen with Node `crypto.randomBytes` (4 bytes `92846675`, uint32 `2458150517`, index `17` of 50 silent riffs). The list of 50 is not recorded. The product name \\\"Wii Fit\\\" was not a candidate.\\n\\nDev folder: `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108`\\n\\n## Milestones\\n10→\\n- [ ] M0 fetch, build, tests, boot\\n- [ ] M1 Lean + Stork Stand\\n- [ ] M2 day loop\\n- [ ] M3 stillness + strength\\n- [ ] M4 cardio\\n- [ ] M5 balance games\\n- [ ] M6 story, ending, audio\\n- [ ] M7 class + hub\\n- [ ] M8 attract, dev, about\\n20→- [ ] M9 bundle + exit interview\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle: **Spine Wee**\\n\\nChosen with Node `crypto.randomBytes` (4 bytes `92846675`, uint32 `2458150517`, index `17` of 50 silent riffs). The list of 50 is not recorded. The product name \\\"Wii Fit\\\" was not a candidate.\\n\\nDev folder: `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108`\\n\\n## Milestones\\n10→\\n- [ ] M0 fetch, build, tests, boot\\n- [ ] M1 Lean + Stork Stand\\n- [ ] M2 day loop\\n- [ ] M3 stillness + strength\\n- [ ] M4 cardio\\n- [ ] M5 balance games\\n- [ ] M6 story, ending, audio\\n- [ ] M7 class + hub\\n- [ ] M8 attract, dev, about\\n20→- [ 