{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_208","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"paintRoom loops over every pixel row. It may be slow but acceptable.\n\nConfirmed `hasUnlock` is defined in world.js before any draw. Now writing world.js. Also need to fix play.js Session to clear subtitle and copy G.driver at beginFamily.\n\nThe pump sets G.driver before advancing during countdown. During the card menu phase, the pump only taps confirm and does not set the driver. The demo and countdown phases then set it. beginFamily at the end of countdown reads the correct G.driver.\n\nAdding `G.setDriver` to let tests control the active driver. If the test omits it, activities remain passive; the test will set it. Human play keeps `G.driver` null so lean works. In headless class scenes with no stick movement, seats are treated as bots via `seat.skill`.\n\nEmpty headless class seats will be bots with `seat.skill = 'good'` and `botFill` enabled. All scoring seats receive the same percentage during finish, which is acceptable for podium sorting. Determinism is ensured by calling `G.hashRun` twice.\n\nChecking the attract test timing. Advancing 9.9 seconds from a fresh title should not trigger attract. Advancing another 0.1 second should. Need to verify whether headless start() steps the scene or only enters it. The accumulator starts at half the step count.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ef9e5d7f-28f9-43d7-9963-cdc2f447f536-53","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"this\\._acc","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4559,"output_tokens":940,"cache_read_input_tokens":133248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"6700d78b-06b6-41cb-99df-e714ffa2554c"}
