{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_217","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"cardSent is set when the hub sends a card to the game.\n\nEnter must call answer('ready') once the game connects with card:true. The scene already listens for confirm after welcome. Keyboard events should reach the engine through the window listener. Ghost updates will send every 0.1s of game time and progress every second.\n\nThe deal will be generated once per round using a seeded RNG. The hub round must stay robust because throwing sessions would fail the harness.\n\nThe hub round will use real sessions with trial mode and short slices, wrapped in try/catch so a single throw does not break the round. A headless fake hub test can skip full activities if it only checks deal and result logic.\n\nAt boot, the scene reads AIHub.active to set inSession. While in session, the start scene is 'round', autoPause is disabled, and live mode is enabled. The menu hides dev, quit, and save options. If the hash indicates a hub but no session is active, the scene starts in practice mode using a local clock.\n\nHash parsing at boot now routes to specific scenes. A 'hub' hash loads the round scene, 'act/' loads play with parsed data, 'day/' sets the day and loads the bungalow, 'ending' loads the ending scene, and everything else defaults to title.\n\nPlay scene data includes id, tier, trial, driver, skipToPlay, limit, classMode, seats, autoDone, and games.\n\nThe class input map binds directional keys to default engine controls.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fc99e2bc-b334-49b0-94e0-03e2c7978395-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"halfKeys","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":568,"output_tokens":892,"cache_read_input_tokens":151296,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"2b8b2a9d-2a76-498c-8952-79f4634b5f4f"}
