{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_224","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The headless shell returned early with a null root.\n\nThe Game constructor will always instantiate the Shell system during boot, so headless mode exits immediately. The standard menu shell is created and then disposed by our custom Shell. The game will use three view modes: brawler, threequarter, and side. A light blue background prevents the canvas from appearing dark before painting.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b3e2ff16-b3c9-4131-83ff-ba18026f6495-72","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function poke","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/tests/hub/harness.html","-A":18}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2417,"output_tokens":373,"cache_read_input_tokens":169600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"2234842b-de8a-4863-a7d3-b001cd0dc20f"}
