{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_241","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pause toggle runs before step hooks and scene updates, using pressed('pause').\n\nAttract mode consumes all input during its hook to prevent pause from firing. Scene transitions set _next for the next step, so the current step still updates the old scene. Idle counting increments each step when on title, slots, about, or class menus with no input, requiring game.time >= 9.999 and idleSteps >= 1200.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-43698304-91b6-480e-b51e-b6da26d2d656-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"advance\\(|_acc =|fadeTime","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-43698304-91b6-480e-b51e-b6da26d2d656-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":2388,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-43698304-91b6-480e-b51e-b6da26d2d656-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/balance.js","offset":120,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-43698304-91b6-480e-b51e-b6da26d2d656-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":930,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7420,"output_tokens":658,"cache_read_input_tokens":88064,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"6a4de7e