11,103,96,46,10,52,48,58,45,32,91,32,93,32,70,105,110,105,115,104,32,97,116,116,114,97,99,116,44,32,102,117,108,108,32,100,101,118,32,109,111,100,101,44,32,65,98,111,117,116,44,32,116,104,101,32,115,105,110,103,108,101,32,72,84,77,76,44,32,97,110,100,32,96,101,120,105,116,45,105,110,116,101,114,118,105,101,119,46,106,115,111,110,96,59,32,114,117,110,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,116,101,115,116,115,47,114,117,110,46,109,106,115,32,97,108,108,96,32,97,110,100,32,107,101,101,112,32,116,104,101,32,116,119,111,32,108,97,117,110,99,104,32,108,111,103,115,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":7,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e%2Fwork/01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"3. The same screens are built for a TV pad first and also feel native on keyboard and mouse: lean is stick, key-nudge, or pointer; prompts follow the last used device; glyphs default to PlayStation and a setting switches to Xbox; hover moves focus and click activates in both the game pills and the HTML menus. Touch-only devices get no touch controls, the text “Controller or keyboard required”, and a Settings button, and attract still runs. After 10 seconds without input on the title or top-level menus, a looping AI/replay demo plays the activities and does not write saves or unlocks; any input returns to the title and swallows that press; it does not start at 9.9 seconds. Dev mode opens from the pause menu in every scene, keeps the game running, exposes the important Lean, scoring, cardio, game, and time variables as live sliders with a reset to defaults, and can jump scene, activity, tier, and day. All music, effects, and voices are synthesized in code (no audio files); voices are Ani [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\"4. On its own, local Class joins 2–4 players on one screen (pads or split keyboard) for Stork Stand, Quiet Candle, Squat Rail, Step Class, and Hoop Hips, scores them, and shows a podium; empty mats are non-scoring bots. In an AI Hub session the game skips title, attract, dev, quit, restart, and saves, connects ghost mode for 1–4 seats, shows the ready card, and plays Morning Class: three shared events dealt from the plan’s pools, timed from hub time, with translucent ghosts, progress, and a single result. The unmodified hub session script is the first script in the built page, and the hub meta tags identify a Game, source Wii Fit, 1–4 players, ghost session, about 3 minutes. The five harness cases pass (1, 2, 3 and 4 with bad network, 4 with host-leave). Outside a session, connect does not take over, and the page reaches its own title.\"},{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\"5. `node tests/run.mjs` with `rules`, `browser`, `hub`, and `all` is the only test command, prints failures plus one count line, and `all` finishes with 0 failed. Those tests drive the shipped game from its real start (not a reimplementation or a mocked Lean): section 3’s bot bands land within ±10 on 12 seeds; every activity and tier meets the star gates (tier 1 passive under 1★, average at least 1★, good at least 2★; tier 2 passive under 1★, good at least 1★, expert at least 2★); a scripted playthrough and a passive run reach the ending with the day-3 plateau and unlocks; saves round-trip and a damaged save does not crash; the same seed and input hash the same twice; attract, dev sliders/reset/jumps, class, and a fake hub (one report on time-up, end stops input) behave as above; data references resolve and game sources contain no TODO, placeholder, or stub. The browser group loads the built file from `file://` with no page errors, a gamepad stub, keyboard and mouse, the touch notice,  [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"1. gating: From the dev subfolder, run `node tests/run.mjs all` once after browsers are free. Capture stdout and stderr to `{SCRATCH}/tests-all.log`. Pass only if the log’s final line is a count with 0 failed and no failure block. Read the test sources and confirm they load the shipped scripts, advance the real game, and assert every outcome named in criterion 5 (bands, both playthroughs, saves, determinism, attract at 10s not 9.9s, dev, class, fake hub, data lint, file:// browser checks, engine check, and the five hub harness URLs including `__hubCheck.pass`). A runner that only prints a count, or tests that never call the shipped game, does not pass.\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\"3. gating: Static hand-in, no browser. Confirm the HTML, matching dev subfolder, `PROGRESS.md`, and `exit-interview.json` names and JSON shape in criterion 1; confirm the built page inlines its scripts, injects the same About text as the JSON, lists the hub meta tags, keeps session.js first and unmodified, and contains no TODO/placeholder/stub and no audio-file loads. Capture `{SCRATCH}/handoff-static.log`.\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"- [ ] Finish attract, full dev mode, About, the single HTML, and `exit-interview.json`; run `node tests/run.mjs all` and keep the two launch logs.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2410a318-b71b-4c0e-90ce-f76acda015d9-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→      onDone: o.onDone || null,\\n      auto: o.auto || 0\\n    });\\n    G.phase = 'talk';\\n  }\\n\\n  function songFor(scene) {\\n    if (scene === 'island' || scene === 'free') return 'island';\\n    if (scene === 'evening' || scene === 'duel' || scene === 'ending') return 'dusk';\\n    if (scene === 'games') return 'festival';\\n210→    if (scene === 'bed') return 'yoga';\\n    return 'studio';\\n  }\\n\\n  function base(extra) {\\n    return Object.assign({\\n      pausable: true,\\n      camera: { zoom: false },\\n      input: G.INPUT,\\n      view: 'brawler'\\n220→    }, extra);\\n  }\\n\\n  function hudName(r, title, sub) {\\n    r.overlay(function (g) {\\n      E.font.title(g, title, r.W / 2, 18, { scale: 2, align: 'center', colors: ['#ffffff', '#8fd3f4', '#14a8c8'] });\\n      if (sub) G.text(g, sub, r.W / 2, 48, '#20404c', 1, 'center');\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n230→  /* ---------- screens ---------- */\\n  const scenes = {};\\n\\n  scenes.title = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      G.idleSteps = 0;\\n      try { G.playSong('studio'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      const cont = !!(G.game && G.game.saves && G.game.saves.any);\\n      scenes.title._pills = new G.Pills([\\n240→        { label: 'New Member', id: 'new' },\\n        { label: 'Continue', id: 'cont', disabled: !cont },\\n        { label: 'Local Class', id: 'class' },\\n        { label: 'About', id: 'about' }\\n      ], { i: 0 });\\n    },\\n    update(dt) {\\n      G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\\n      const it = scenes.title._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n250→      if (it.id === 'new') go('slots');\\n      else if (it.id === 'cont') {\\n        const latest = G.game.saves.latest();\\n        if (latest) { G.game.saves.load(latest.slot); go(G.profile.freePlay ? 'free' : 'bungalow'); }\\n      } else if (it.id === 'class') go('class');\\n      else if (it.id === 'about') go('about');\\n      void dt;\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n260→      hudName(r, 'Spine Wee', 'A five-day stay');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) {\\n        try { G.drawTare(g, r.W / 2, r.H / 2 - 10, 1.4, 'happy', G.game.time * 3); } catch (e) { /* scale still */ }\\n        G.text(g, 'Institute for Gentle Improvement', r.W / 2, r.H / 2 + 28, '#5f7f8a', 1, 'center');\\n      });\\n      scenes.title._pills.draw(r);\\n      G.prompt(null, r, 'confirm', 'Choose');\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n270→  scenes.slots = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const list = G.game.saves.list().filter(function (s) { return s.slot !== 'auto'; });\\n      scenes.slots._rows = list;\\n      scenes.slots._pills = new G.Pills(list.map(function (s) {\\n        const label = s.empty ? ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  Empty') : ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  ' + (s.place || 'Saved'));\\n        return { label: label, id: s.slot, damaged: !!s.damaged, empty: !!s.empty };\\n      }), { i: 0 });\\n    },\",\"content_concise\":\"200→      onDone: o.onDone || null,\\n      auto: o.auto || 0\\n    });\\n    G.phase = 'talk';\\n  }\\n\\n  function songFor(scene) {\\n    if (scene === 'island' || scene === 'free') return 'island';\\n    if (scene === 'evening' || scene === 'duel' || scene === 'ending') return 'dusk';\\n    if (scene === 'games') return 'festival';\\n210→    if (scene === 'bed') return 'yoga';\\n    return 'studio';\\n  }\\n\\n  function base(extra) {\\n    return Object.assign({\\n      pausable: true,\\n      camera: { zoom: false },\\n      input: G.INPUT,\\n      view: 'brawler'\\n220→    }, extra);\\n  }\\n\\n  function hudName(r, title, sub) {\\n    r.overlay(function (g) {\\n      E.font.title(g, title, r.W / 2, 18, { scale: 2, align: 'center', colors: ['#ffffff', '#8fd3f4', '#14a8c8'] });\\n      if (sub) G.text(g, sub, r.W / 2, 48, '#20404c', 1, 'center');\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n230→  /* ---------- screens ---------- */\\n  const scenes = {};\\n\\n  scenes.title = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      G.idleSteps = 0;\\n      try { G.playSong('studio'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      const cont = !!(G.game && G.game.saves && G.game.saves.any);\\n      scenes.title._pills = new G.Pills([\\n240→        { label: 'New Member', id: 'new' },\\n        { label: 'Continue', id: 'cont', disabled: !cont },\\n        { label: 'Local Class', id: 'class' },\\n        { label: 'About', id: 'about' }\\n      ], { i: 0 });\\n    },\\n    update(dt) {\\n      G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\\n      const it = scenes.title._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n250→      if (it.id === 'new') go('slots');\\n      else if (it.id === 'cont') {\\n        const latest = G.game.saves.latest();\\n        if (latest) { G.game.saves.load(latest.slot); go(G.profile.freePlay ? 'free' : 'bungalow'); }\\n      } else if (it.id === 'class') go('class');\\n      else if (it.id === 'about') go('about');\\n      void dt;\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n260→      hudName(r, 'Spine Wee', 'A five-day stay');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) {\\n        try { G.drawTare(g, r.W / 2, r.H / 2 - 10, 1.4, 'happy', G.game.time * 3); } catch (e) { /* scale still */ }\\n        G.text(g, 'Institute for Gentle Improvement', r.W / 2, r.H / 2 + 28, '#5f7f8a', 1, 'center');\\n      });\\n      scenes.title._pills.draw(r);\\n      G.prompt(null, r, 'confirm', 'Choose');\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n270→  scenes.slots = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const list = G.game.saves.list().filter(function (s) { return s.slot !== 'auto'; });\\n      scenes.slots._rows = list;\\n      scenes.slots._pills = new G.Pills(list.map(function (s) {\\n        const label = s.empty ? ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  Empty') : ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  ' + (s.place || 'Saved'));\\n        return { label: label, id: s.slot, damaged: !!s.damaged, empty: !!s.empty };\\n      }), { i: 0 });\\n    },\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"      onDone: o.onDone || null,\\n      auto: o.auto || 0\\n    });\\n    G.phase = 'talk';\\n  }\\n\\n  function songFor(scene) {\\n    if (scene === 'island' || scene === 'free') return 'island';\\n    if (scene === 'evening' || scene === 'duel' || scene === 'ending') return 'dusk';\\n    if (scene === 'games') return 'festival';\\n    if (scene === 'bed') return 'yoga';\\