');\\n\\n/* =============================================================================\\n * ARCADE  scores, tables, initials, lives, credits, turns, cards and the attract mode\\n * ========================================================================== */\\nconst LETTERS = 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789.-! ', COLS = ['#ff4a4a', '#ffffff', '#ffe070'];\\nconst clicked = I => I.clicked ? I.clicked() : null;   // (a tap: the full engine's; the agent edition has none)\\nconst KEPT = {};   // the tables this visit, beside E.store (they still show where storage is blocked)\\n\",\"total_lines\":14974}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"d82859b5-5108-452d-8d60-81620903a98a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_250","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Examples are in comments.\n\nThe engine assigns root.My3D2dge to window or globalThis. A headless VM context is being prepared with console, event listeners, location, navigator, performance, animation frame, and timers.\n\nThe VM context is finalized with globalThis and self pointing to itself. Boot.js skips auto-booting when document is absent, so tests will call G.boot() directly. The engine should tolerate missing document, localStorage, and matchMedia in headless mode. AIHub.active defaults to false in the VM because the parent equals root; it becomes true only when tests set the aihub query parameter.\n\nAIHub.active is computed at load time, not dynamically. Tests will overwrite the entire AIHub object before calling G.boot() to simulate a fake hub and set active to true. This makes G.inSession true. For normal tests, booting normally and then calling AIHub.connect() should resolve null without taking over.\n\nThe harness browser tests load session.js first and frame the page with an aihub query parameter. The build.mjs script is being drafted to concatenate engine, vendor, and game files into a single output.\n\nThe build script now includes play.js, world.js, and boot.js. It escapes script tags to prevent XSS, reads an optional exit-interview.json for the about field, and assembles the HTML with session.js and the concatenated game body.\n\nThe HTML structure is now fixed: session.js sits first in the head, followed by meta tags and styles. The body contains an e3-boot div and a canvas with id \"screen\", into which the game script is injected. Relative paths from game/index.html point to vendor/session.js, engine/my-3d2dge.js, readable.js, and boot.js. The canvas CSS uses 100% width and height.\n\nBoot.js auto-calls G.boot only when document exists. Tests will call G.boot({headless:true}) directly in the VM. Headless mode sets game.fadeTime to zero. The save write method returns undefined during attract mode or active sessions.\n\nThe save read method restores the profile from the stored data, falling back to default flags, unlocks, and played entries. When write returns undefined during attract mode or active sessions, the save layer only warns in the console rather than throwing an error. The attract scene does not trigger bungalow visits or island walks that would normally autosave.\n\nThe restart session menu item will load a fresh profile into the same slot and return to the bungalow. Dev mode will call shell.hide() before opening G.dev(). The menu items array will be formatted as [['Restart Session', fn], ['Dev Mode', fn]]. For controls, only useful actions will be named while overlapping or confusing ones are hidden from rebinding to avoid breaking the mapping.\n\nControls will be named with plain labels such as \"Breathe\", \"Catch left\", and \"Jump\", while \"interact\" is hidden from rebinding. Settings are being configured with a music slider, a glyphs selector, and a voice volume slider that updates audio volume.\n\nNew settings include a Gentle Mode toggle, a Breath selector with Hold and Toggle options, and a Tare's Tips toggle. The startScene function now parses URL hash deep links to route directly to the round, ending, or play scenes.\n\nDeep links now route #day/ to the bungalow scene and default to title. The #ending hash sets the profile ending before starting. The #act/stork/1 hash passes trial data with id, tier, and trial: true. The #day/3 hash sets the day and arrival flag.\n\ngame.start receives scenes, scene, and optional data. Hub message handlers are registered before AIHub.connect when inSession is active. Messages are filtered by type 'g', then matched against ghosts by sender.\n\nGhost messages are stored as objects with sender name, color, and action data. The ghost list is capped at eight entries. Leave events remove the matching ghost by sender ID. Time-up, end, and card events trigger hub callbacks. AIHub connects in ghost mode with seats 1 and 4 and card enabled.\n\nAIHub.connect resolves to a hubInfo object. If the round scene is active, the game returns to title. The ready callback waits for boot completion before calling AIHub.ready(). The #hub hash routes to the round scene for practice even when not in session, and hub connection is skipped outside sessions. Offline rounds use the local clock.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4bd85a76-7554-4f41-a31d-fe46382d208d-58","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":270,"limit":220}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2091,"output_tokens":2673,"cache_read_input_tokens":123776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"6aafce68-ce22-4670-bf20-8130fe5edb90"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4bd85a76-7554-4f41-a31d-fe46382d208d-58","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"270→  scenes.slots = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const list = G.game.saves.list().filter(function (s) { return s.slot !== 'auto'; });\\n      scenes.slots._rows = list;\\n      scenes.slots._pills = new G.Pills(list.map(function (s) {\\n        const label = s.empty ? ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  Empty') : ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  ' + (s.place || 'Saved'));\\n        return { label: label, id: s.slot, damaged: !!s.damaged, empty: !!s.empty };\\n      }), { i: 0 });\\n    },\\n280→    update() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n      const it = scenes.slots._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      if (it.damaged) {\\n        say('Tare', 'This save looks tired. I will not open it. We can start clean.', { onDone: function () { G.game.saves.erase(it.id); go('slots'); } });\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (it.empty) { G.profile = G.freshProfile(it.id); go('member'); }\\n290→      else { G.game.saves.load(it.id); go(G.profile.freePlay ? 'free' : 'bungalow'); }\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      hudName(r, 'Member card', 'Three cards. I do not mix them.');\\n      scenes.slots._pills.draw(r);\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n300→  scenes.member = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const L = G.LOOKS;\\n      scenes.member._pills = new G.Pills([\\n        { label: 'Hair', id: 'hair', n: L.hair.length },\\n        { label: 'Skin', id: 'skin', n: L.skin.length },\\n        { label: 'Top', id: 'top', n: L.top.length },\\n        { label: 'Bottom', id: 'bottom', n: L.bottom.length },\\n        { label: 'Name', id: 'name', n: G.NICKS.length },\\n310→        { label: 'This is me', id: 'ok' }\\n      ], { i: 5 });\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const pills = scenes.member._pills;\\n      const I = G.game.input;\\n      const it0 = pills.items[pills.i];\\n      if (it0 && it0.id !== 'ok' && (I.pressed('left') || I.pressed('right'))) {\\n320→        const dir = I.pressed('right') ? 1 : -1;\\n        const p = G.profile;\\n        if (it0.id === 'name') {\\n          p.nickIndex = (p.nickIndex + dir + G.NICKS.length) % G.NICKS.length;\\n          p.name = G.NICKS[p.nickIndex];\\n        } else {\\n          p.look[it0.id] = (p.look[it0.id] + dir + it0.n) % it0.n;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      const it = pills.update(I);\\n330→      if (it && it.id === 'ok') {\\n        G.profile.flags.arrival = false;\\n        go('arrival');\\n      }\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const p = G.profile;\\n      hudName(r, p.name, 'The card is you.');\\n      const pills = scenes.member._pills;\\n340→      pills.items[0].label = 'Hair  ' + G.LOOKS.hair[p.look.hair];\\n      pills.items[4].label = 'Name  ' + p.name;\\n      pills.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.arrival = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.profile.flags.arrival = true;\\n      say('Tare', [\\n350→        'You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement.',\\n        \\\"The card isn't signed. It only says: 'You know why.'\\\"\\n      ], {\\n        onDone: function () {\\n          say('Tare', 'Birch is very tall. Alder was a tree more recently. Both are nice.', {\\n            choices: ['Birch', 'Alder'],\\n            onChoice: function (i) {\\n              G.profile.instructor = i === 1 ? 'Alder' : 'Birch';\\n              go('bungalow');\\n            }\\n360→          });\\n        }\\n      });\\n    },\\n    update(dt) {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(dt); return; }\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n370→      hudName(r, 'Arrival', '');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) { try { G.drawTare(g, 70, r.H / 2, 1.6, 'shocked', G.game.time * 2); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ } });\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.bungalow = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      G.profile.sessions = G.profile.sessions || 0;\\n380→      const day = G.profile.day;\\n      if (G.GUIDE[day]) G.profile.suggestion = G.GUIDE[day][0];\\n      scenes.bungalow._pills = new G.Pills([{ label: 'Begin the day', id: 'go' }], { i: 0 });\\n      try { G.playSong('studio'); G.sting('day'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      if (!G.attracting && !G.inSession && G.game) {\\n        try { G.game.saves.autosave(); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      }\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n390→      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const it = scenes.bungalow._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      if (G.profile.day === 4 && !G.profile.flags.tareDay) go('tare');\\n      else go('body');\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const day = G.profile.day;\\n      hudName(r, 'Day ' + day, (G.LINES.days[day - 1] || '').slice(0, 42));\\n400→      r.overlay(function (g) {\\n        G.text(g, 'Spine Age ' + G.spineAge(), 12, 70, '#14a8c8', 1);\\n        G.text(g, G.profile.instructor + ' is outside.', 12, 84, '#20404c', 1);\\n        try { G.drawGerald(g, r.W - 40, r.H / 2, 1.2, G.hasUnlock('friend')); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      });\\n      scenes.bungalow._pills.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.tare = base({\\n410→    enter() {\\n      G.profile.flags.tareDay = true;\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      scenes.tare._pills = new G.Pills([{ label: 'Read the scale', id: 'read' }], { i: 0 });\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const it = scenes.tare._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      say('Tare', \\\"Three grams. It's the feelings. They're dense.\\\", { onDone: function () { go('body'); } });\\n420→    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      hudName(r, \\\"Tare's Day\\\", 'Press to read me.');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) { try { G.drawTare(g, r.W / 2, r.H / 2, 2, 'judging', 0); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ } });\\n      if (!(G.talk && G.talk.open)) scenes.tare._pills.draw(r);\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n430→  scenes.body = base({\\n    enter(d) {\\n      scenes.body.t = 0;\\n      scenes.body.step = 'still';\\n      scenes.body.q = (d && d.q) || (G.profile.day - 1) % G.LINES.questions.length;\\n      scenes.body._pills = null;\\n      G.phase = 'auto';\\n      G.left = 9;\\n      try { G.playSong('yoga'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    },\\n440→    update(dt) {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(dt); return; }\\n      const b = scenes.body;\\n      if (b.step === 'ask') {\\n        G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\\n        const it = b._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n        if (!it) return;\\n        const q = G.LINES.questions[b.q];\\n        const ducks = 'Today you weigh 11.4 ducks. That is a normal number of ducks.';\\n        const remark = G.LINES.remarks[b.q % G.LINES.remarks.length];\\n450→        const sug = G.profile.suggestion && G.ACTS[G.profile.suggestion];\\n        say('Tare', [q.q, ducks, remark, sug ? (\\\"Today's suggestion: \\\" + sug.name) : 'The reading is ready.'], {\\n          onDone: function () {\\n            if (G.profile.day >= 5 && !G.profile.flags.games) go('games');\\n            else go('island');\\n          }\\n        });\\n        b.step = 'talk';\\n        return;\\n      }\\n460→      b.t += dt;\\n      G.phase = 'auto';\\n      const need = b.step === 'still' ? 5 : 4;\\n      G.left = Math.max(0, need - b.t);\\n      if (b.step === 'talk') return;\\n      if (b.step === 'still' && b.t >= 5) { b.step = 'lean'; b.t = 0; }\\n      else if (b.step === 'lean' && b.t >= 4) {\\n        b.step = 'ask';\\n        const q = G.LINES.questions[b.q];\\n        b._pills = new G.Pills(q.a.map(function (label, i) { return { label: label, id: i }; }), { i: 0 });\\n470→        G.phase = 'menu';\\n      }\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const b = scenes.body;\\n      hudName(r, 'Body check', b.step === 'ask' ? G.LINES.questions[b.q].q : 'Please stand still.');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) {\\n        try { G.drawTare(g, r.W / 2, 70, 1.3, 'neutral', 0); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n        G.text(g, 'Ducks, not pounds.', r.W / 2, 100, '#5f7f8a', 1, 'center');\\n480→      });\\n      if (b._pills && b.step === 'ask') b._pills.draw(r);\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  function islandPills() {\\n    const items = [];\\n    G.ACT_IDS.forEach(function (id) {\\n      if (!G.unlocked(id)) return;\",\"content_concise\":\"270→  scenes.slots = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const list = G.game.saves.list().filter(function (s) { return s.slot !== 'auto'; });\\n      scenes.slots._rows = list;\\n      scenes.slots._pills = new G.Pills(list.map(function (s) {\\n        const label = s.empty ? ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  Empty') : ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  ' + (s.place || 'Saved'));\\n        return { label: label, id: s.slot, damaged: !!s.damaged, empty: !!s.empty };\\n      }), { i: 0 });\\n    },\\n280→    update() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n      const it = scenes.slots._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      if (it.damaged) {\\n        say('Tare', 'This save looks tired. I will not open it. We can start clean.', { onDone: function () { G.game.saves.erase(it.id); go('slots'); } });\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (it.empty) { G.profile = G.freshProfile(it.id); go('member'); }\\n290→      else { G.game.saves.load(it.id); go(G.profile.freePlay ? 'free' : 'bungalow'); }\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      hudName(r, 'Member card', 'Three cards. I do not mix them.');\\n      scenes.slots._pills.draw(r);\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n300→  scenes.member = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const L = G.LOOKS;\\n      scenes.member._pills = new G.Pills([\\n        { label: 'Hair', id: 'hair', n: L.hair.length },\\n        { label: 'Skin', id: 'skin', n: L.skin.length },\\n        { label: 'Top', id: 'top', n: L.top.length },\\n        { label: 'Bottom', id: 'bottom', n: L.bottom.length },\\n        { label: 'Name', id: 'name', n: G.NICKS.length },\\n310→        { label: 'This is me', id: 'ok' }\\n      ], { i: 5 });\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const pills = scenes.member._pills;\\n      const I = G.game.input;\\n      const it0 = pills.items[pills.i];\\n      if (it0 && it0.id !== 'ok' && (I.pressed('left') || I.pressed('right'))) {\\n320→        const dir = I.pressed('right') ? 1 : -1;\\n        const p = G.profile;\\n        if (it0.id === 'name') {\\n          p.nickIndex = (p.nickIndex + dir + G.NICKS.length) % G.NICKS.length;\\n          p.name = G.NICKS[p.nickIndex];\\n        } else {\\n          p.look[it0.id] = (p.look[it0.id] + dir + it0.n) % it0.n;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      const it = pills.update(I);\\n330→      if (it && it.id === 'ok') {\\n        G.profile.flags.arrival = false;\\n        go('arrival');\\n      }\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const p = G.profile;\\n      hudName(r, p.name, 'The card is you.');\\n      const pills = scenes.member._pills;\\n340→      pills.items[0].label = 'Hair  ' + G.LOOKS.hair[p.look.hair];\\n      pills.items[4].label = 'Name  ' + p.name;\\n      pills.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.arrival = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.profile.flags.arrival = true;\\n      say('Tare', [\\n350→        'You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement.',\\n        \\\"The card isn't signed. It only says: 'You know why.'\\\"\\n      ], {\\n        onDone: function () {\\n          say('Tare', 'Birch is very tall. Alder was a tree more recently. Both are nice.', {\\n            choices: ['Birch', 'Alder'],\\n            onChoice: function (i) {\\n              G.profile.instructor = i === 1 ? 'Alder' : 'Birch';\\n              go('bungalow');\\n            }\\n360→          });\\n        }\\n      });\\n    },\\n    update(dt) {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(dt); return; }\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n370→      hudName(r, 'Arrival', '');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) { try { G.drawTare(g, 70, r.H / 2, 1.6, 'shocked', G.game.time * 2); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ } });\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.bungalow = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      G.profile.sessions = G.profile.sessions || 0;\\n380→      const day = G.profile.day;\\n      if (G.GUIDE[day]) G.profile.suggestion = G.GUIDE[day][0];\\n      scenes.bungalow._pills = new G.Pills([{ label: 'Begin the day', id: 'go' }], { i: 0 });\\n      try { G.playSong('studio'); G.sting('day'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      if (!G.attracting && !G.inSession && G.game) {\\n        try { G.game.saves.autosave(); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      }\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n390→      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const it = scenes.bungalow._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      if (G.profile.day === 4 && !G.profile.flags.tareDay) go('tare');\\n      else go('body');\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const day = G.profile.day;\\n      hudName(r, 'Day ' + day, (G.LINES.days[day - 1] || '').slice(0, 42));\\n400→      r.overlay(function (g) {\\n        G.text(g, 'Spine Age ' + G.spineAge(), 12, 70, '#14a8c8', 1);\\n        G.text(g, G.profile.instructor + ' is outside.', 12, 84, '#20404c', 1);\\n        try { G.drawGerald(g, r.W - 40, r.H / 2, 1.2, G.hasUnlock('friend')); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      });\\n      scenes.bungalow._pills.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.tare = base({\\n410→    enter() {\\n      G.profile.flags.tareDay = true;\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      scenes.tare._pills = new G.Pills([{ label: 'Read the scale', id: 'read' }], { i: 0 });\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const it = scenes.tare._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      say('Tare', \\\"Three grams. It's the feelings. They're dense.\\\", { onDone: function () { go('body'); } });\\n420→    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      hudName(r, \\\"Tare's Day\\\", 'Press to read me.');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) { try { G.drawTare(g, r.W / 2, r.H / 2, 2, 'judging', 0); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ } });\\n      if (!(G.talk && G.talk.open)) scenes.tare._pills.draw(r);\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n430→  scenes.body = base({\\n    enter(d) {\\n      scenes.body.t = 0;\\n      scenes.body.step = 'still';\\n      scenes.body.q = (d && d.q) || (G.profile.day - 1) % G.LINES.questions.length;\\n      scenes.body._pills = null;\\n      G.phase = 'auto';\\n      G.left = 9;\\n      try { G.playSong('yoga'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    },\\n440→    update(dt) {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(dt); return; }\\n      const b = scenes.body;\\n      if (b.step === 'ask') {\\n        G.phase = 'menu'; G.left = 0;\\n        const it = b._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n        if (!it) return;\\n        const q = G.LINES.questions[b.q];\\n        const ducks = 'Today you weigh 11.4 ducks. That is a normal number of ducks.';\\n        const remark = G.LINES.remarks[b.q % G.LINES.remarks.length];\\n450→        const sug = G.profile.suggestion && G.ACTS[G.profile.suggestion];\\n        say('Tare', [q.q, ducks, remark, sug ? (\\\"Today's suggestion: \\\" + sug.name) : 'The reading is ready.'], {\\n          onDone: function () {\\n            if (G.profile.day >= 5 && !G.profile.flags.games) go('games');\\n            else go('island');\\n          }\\n        });\\n        b.step = 'talk';\\n        return;\\n      }\\n460→      b.t += dt;\\n      G.phase = 'auto';\\n      const need = b.step === 'still' ? 5 : 4;\\n      G.left = Math.max(0, need - b.t);\\n      if (b.step === 'talk') return;\\n      if (b.step === 'still' && b.t >= 5) { b.step = 'lean'; b.t = 0; }\\n      else if (b.step === 'lean' && b.t >= 4) {\\n        b.step = 'ask';\\n        const q = G.LINES.questions[b.q];\\n        b._pills = new G.Pills(q.a.map(function (label, i) { return { label: label, id: i }; }), { i: 0 });\\n470→        G.phase = 'menu';\\n      }\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const b = scenes.body;\\n      hudName(r, 'Body check', b.step === 'ask' ? G.LINES.questions[b.q].q : 'Please stand still.');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) {\\n        try { G.drawTare(g, r.W / 2, 70, 1.3, 'neutral', 0); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n        G.text(g, 'Ducks, not pounds.', r.W / 2, 100, '#5f7f8a', 1, 'center');\\n480→      });\\n      if (b._pills && b.step === 'ask') b._pills.draw(r);\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  function islandPills() {\\n    const items = [];\\n    G.ACT_IDS.forEach(function (id) {\\n      if (!G.unlocked(id)) return;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js\",\"offset\":270,\"limit\":220,\"raw_output\":\"  scenes.slots = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const list = G.game.saves.list().filter(function (s) { return s.slot !== 'auto'; });\\n      scenes.slots._rows = list;\\n      scenes.slots._pills = new G.Pills(list.map(function (s) {\\n        const label = s.empty ? ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  Empty') : ('Slot ' + (s.slot + 1) + '  ' + (s.place || 'Saved'));\\n        return { label: label, id: s.slot, damaged: !!s.damaged, empty: !!s.empty };\\n      }), { i: 0 });\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n      const it = scenes.slots._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      if (it.damaged) {\\n        say('Tare', 'This save looks tired. I will not open it. We can start clean.', { onDone: function () { G.game.saves.erase(it.id); go('slots'); } });\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (it.empty) { G.profile = G.freshProfile(it.id); go('member'); }\\n      else { G.game.saves.load(it.id); go(G.profile.freePlay ? 'free' : 'bungalow'); }\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      hudName(r, 'Member card', 'Three cards. I do not mix them.');\\n      scenes.slots._pills.draw(r);\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.member = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const L = G.LOOKS;\\n      scenes.member._pills = new G.Pills([\\n        { label: 'Hair', id: 'hair', n: L.hair.length },\\n        { label: 'Skin', id: 'skin', n: L.skin.length },\\n        { label: 'Top', id: 'top', n: L.top.length },\\n        { label: 'Bottom', id: 'bottom', n: L.bottom.length },\\n        { label: 'Name', id: 'name', n: G.NICKS.length },\\n        { label: 'This is me', id: 'ok' }\\n      ], { i: 5 });\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const pills = scenes.member._pills;\\n      const I = G.game.input;\\n      const it0 = pills.items[pills.i];\\n      if (it0 && it0.id !== 'ok' && (I.pressed('left') || I.pressed('right'))) {\\n        const dir = I.pressed('right') ? 1 : -1;\\n        const p = G.profile;\\n        if (it0.id === 'name') {\\n          p.nickIndex = (p.nickIndex + dir + G.NICKS.length) % G.NICKS.length;\\n          p.name = G.NICKS[p.nickIndex];\\n        } else {\\n          p.look[it0.id] = (p.look[it0.id] + dir + it0.n) % it0.n;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      const it = pills.update(I);\\n      if (it && it.id === 'ok') {\\n        G.profile.flags.arrival = false;\\n        go('arrival');\\n      }\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const p = G.profile;\\n      hudName(r, p.name, 'The card is you.');\\n      const pills = scenes.member._pills;\\n      pills.items[0].label = 'Hair  ' + G.LOOKS.hair[p.look.hair];\\n      pills.items[4].label = 'Name  ' + p.name;\\n      pills.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.arrival = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.profile.flags.arrival = true;\\n      say('Tare', [\\n        'You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement.',\\n        \\\"The card isn't signed. It only says: 'You know why.'\\\"\\n      ], {\\n        onDone: function () {\\n          say('Tare', 'Birch is very tall. Alder was a tree more recently. Both are nice.', {\\n            choices: ['Birch', 'Alder'],\\n            onChoice: function (i) {\\n              G.profile.instructor = i === 1 ? 'Alder' : 'Birch';\\n              go('bungalow');\\n            }\\n          });\\n        }\\n      });\\n    },\\n    update(dt) {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(dt); return; }\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      hudName(r, 'Arrival', '');\\n      r.overlay(function (g) { try { G.drawTare(g, 70, r.H / 2, 1.6, 'shocked', G.game.time * 2); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ } });\\n      if (G.talk) G.talk.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.bungalow = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      G.profile.sessions = G.profile.sessions || 0;\\n      const day = G.profile.day;\\n      if (G.GUIDE[day]) G.profile.suggestion = G.GUIDE[day][0];\\n      scenes.bungalow._pills = new G.Pills([{ label: 'Begin the day', id: 'go' }], { i: 0 });\\n      try { G.playSong('studio'); G.sting('day'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      if (!G.attracting && !G.inSession && G.game) {\\n        try { G.game.saves.autosave(); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      }\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      if (G.talk && G.talk.open) { G.phase = 'talk'; G.talk.update(1 / 120); return; }\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const it = scenes.bungalow._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      if (G.profile.day === 4 && !G.profile.flags.tareDay) go('tare');\\n      else go('body');\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const day = G.profile.day;\\n      hudName(r, 'Day ' + day, (G.LINES.days[day - 1] || '').slice(0, 42));\\n      r.overlay(function (g) {\\n        G.text(g, 'Spine Age ' + G.spineAge(), 12, 70, '#14a8c8', 1);\\n        G.text(g, G.profile.instructor + ' is outside.', 12, 84, '#20404c', 1);\\n        try { G.drawGerald(g, r.W - 40, r.H / 2, 1.2, G.hasUnlock('friend')); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n      });\\n      scenes.bungalow._pills.draw(r);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  scenes.tare = base({\\n    enter() {\\n      G.profile.flags.tareDay = true;\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      scenes.tare._pills = new G.Pills([{ label: 'Read the scale', id: 'read' }], { i: 0 });\\n    },\\n    update() {\\n      G.phase = 'menu';\\n      const it = scenes.tare._pills.update(G.game.input);\\n      if (!it) return;\\n      say('Tare', \\\"Three grams. It's the feelings. They're dense.\\\", { onDone: function () { go('body'); } });\\n    },\\n    draw(r) {\\n      G.pai