{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_253","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in `doneSession`.\n\nThe early return in `doneSession` when `autoNext` is active prevents gentle games from advancing. The hold timer calls `doneSession` to advance the queue, but the function exits before reaching the queue logic. This return was likely meant to prevent double-processing.\n\nThe fix removes the `autoNext` early return from `doneSession`. The hold timer will then advance the queue. The confirm path only runs when `autoNext` is off.\n\nThe `games.enter` wrapper correctly chains to `play` after the current step finishes. Duel limits are too long for testing. Pump advances only one second per update cycle. Star gate durations vary by activity: stork is 45 seconds, sun is 80 seconds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b185f17-05fe-4726-bc96-f8d6d1d276ae-61","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"G\\.award|function finish|this\\.pct|starsOf","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b185f17-05fe-4726-bc96-f8d6d1d276ae-62","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":120,"limit":60}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3559,"output_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":132992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"020cd6ef-0af3-4a68-8792-251ac1a69055"}
