:5,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/data/content.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"  add({ id: 'tray', name: 'Tray Service', family: 'tray', discipline: 'Balance', view: 'brawler', dur: [60, 60], pose: 'idle', blurb: 'Olives in glasses. Dennis will not explain.' });\"},{\"line_number\":104,\"content\":\"  G.TRAYS = [\"},{\"line_number\":105,\"content\":\"    { name: 'Three olives', olives: [olive(40, 70), olive(40, 100), olive(40, 130)], glasses: [glass(200, 100)], bumps: [] },\"},{\"line_number\":106,\"content\":\"    { name: 'Five, with a gap', olives: [olive(36, 50), olive(36, 80), olive(36, 120), olive(36, 150), olive(70, 100)], glasses: [glass(210, 100)], bumps: [{ x: 120, y: 60, r: 10 }, { x: 120, y: 150, r: 10 }] },\"},{\"line_number\":107,\"content\":\"    { name: 'Seven and a gecko', olives: [olive(30, 40), olive(30, 70), olive(30, 100), olive(30, 130), olive(30, 160), olive(60, 80), olive(60, 120)], glasses: [glass(214, 100)], bumps: [{ x: 130, y: 46, r: 8 }, { x: 130, y: 160, r: 8 }], gecko: true }\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"242a7d2a-88f3-4704-822e-3c43da5ebb13"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_283","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The balance skill bot overrides ux and uy inside bal.\n\nThe jump logic reads seat.jump before bal.step. Falling every few seconds resets x to post 0 and prevents progress. Pin collision triggers a fall when distance is under 0.25 while not jumping. The jump window spans 0.05 to 0.7 units. Speed is roughly 1.6 units per second. Movement continues during the 0.55 second air period.\n\nForward movement stops during the 0.55 second air period. The bot lands still near the pin, so distance remains below 0.25 and the jump condition fires again immediately. This creates an endless in-place hop loop.\n\nThe fix is to keep moving forward during the jump. Only the balance angle should freeze in the air, not the walker's position. This lets the bot travel over the pin and clear the collision.\n\nMoving during the jump covers roughly 0.87 units. That distance clears the pin even if triggered late at 0.2 units away. The jump condition fires before movement, so the bot lands safely past the obstacle.\n\nGust falls reset the walker to post, which is harsh but manageable if they do not fall every second. The unstable board uses s=16 and k=10 with an expert centering bot. A 2.4 force gust lasts 0.35 seconds and can cause stumbles. Removing the skill bot would let the board run away and stumble constantly. The expert skill is needed to stay up. If small gusts still knock the bot down, jumping during the gust or adding a counter-force could help.\n\nThe skill bot does not know about gust forces, so it corrects after lag and stumbles. I will fix the air movement first and retest the laundry run. If progress remains zero, I will reduce fall resets or make the expert survive better.\n\nThe tray gravity is roughly 400 units right because px tracks ux at about 0.95. Olives at x=40 and glass at x=200 should slide right quickly. The got/total ratio is only 0.107.\n\nThe 0.107 ratio equals exactly two olives out of fifteen, multiplied by an 80 percent time-share factor. Only two olives land before the run ends. The cause is still unknown.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-af7c668f-3c03-46ce-84a5-fb243bd1549b-101","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"gravity|on\\.enter|this\\.step|sensor","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1295,"output_tokens":1402,"cache_read_input_tokens":198400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"801f8a5e-3054-40f3-b899-87b6d91f039c"}
