{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_299","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found: the drive() function for laundry incorrectly sets the seat.\n\nThe laundry jump logic is actually correct. drive() uses the previous frame's pinAhead, and stepLaundry updates it before checking the resulting jump.\n\nFell and jump mechanics are correct. Drive triggers at 1.2 distance while stepLaundry only jumps below 0.95.\n\nA stability bug was found: effort multiplied by four on the laundry state value makes it unstable.\n\nThe balance set object is replaced each frame, but its push array remains shared.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8998bec8-6cd5-49dc-afe2-270a31d87585-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","offset":500,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10267,"output_tokens":538,"cache_read_input_tokens":92672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"b036c87c-384b-4f2e-944c-21abac49cc2b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8998bec8-6cd5-49dc-afe2-270a31d87585-29","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"500→        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n510→\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (!fam.rope) fam.rope = Object.assign({}, bal.set);\\n    /* Faster walking sways the rope. The set on the balance is a copy, so the band table stays put. */\\n    bal.set = Object.assign({}, fam.rope, { s: fam.rope.s + effort * 4 });\\n520→    fam.air -= dt;\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0.04) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    /* One jump per pin, long enough to land past it. Air freezes the plate, not the walker. */\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0 && ahead && fam.cleared !== ahead.x && ahead.dist < 0.95) {\\n530→      fam.air = Math.min(0.85, ahead.dist / Math.max(0.45, spd) + 0.12);\\n      fam.cleared = ahead.x;\\n    }\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\\n    fam.gust -= dt;\\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\\n    let fx = 0;\\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\\n540→      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\\n    }\\n    const fallsBefore = bal.falls;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    let fell = false;\\n    if (bal.falls > fallsBefore && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.18 && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (fell) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.cleared = -1; }\\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\\n550→    if (!fell) fam.x += spd * dt;\\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\\n      const time = fam.t;\\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n560→  }\\n\\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n570→      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function Session(opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\",\"content_concise\":\"500→        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n510→\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (!fam.rope) fam.rope = Object.assign({}, bal.set);\\n    /* Faster walking sways the rope. The set on the balance is a copy, so the band table stays put. */\\n    bal.set = Object.assign({}, fam.rope, { s: fam.rope.s + effort * 4 });\\n520→    fam.air -= dt;\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0.04) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    /* One jump per pin, long enough to land past it. Air freezes the plate, not the walker. */\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0 && ahead && fam.cleared !== ahead.x && ahead.dist < 0.95) {\\n530→      fam.air = Math.min(0.85, ahead.dist / Math.max(0.45, spd) + 0.12);\\n      fam.cleared = ahead.x;\\n    }\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\\n    fam.gust -= dt;\\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\\n    let fx = 0;\\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\\n540→      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\\n    }\\n    const fallsBefore = bal.falls;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    let fell = false;\\n    if (bal.falls > fallsBefore && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.18 && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (fell) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.cleared = -1; }\\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\\n550→    if (!fell) fam.x += spd * dt;\\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\\n      const time = fam.t;\\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n560→  }\\n\\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n570→      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function Session(opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js\",\"offset\":500,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (!fam.rope) fam.rope = Object.assign({}, bal.set);\\n    /* Faster walking sways the rope. The set on the balance is a copy, so the band table stays put. */\\n    bal.set = Object.assign({}, fam.rope, { s: fam.rope.s + effort * 4 });\\n    fam.air -= dt;\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0.04) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    /* One jump per pin, long enough to land past it. Air freezes the plate, not the walker. */\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0 && ahead && fam.cleared !== ahead.x && ahead.dist < 0.95) {\\n      fam.air = Math.min(0.85, ahead.dist / Math.max(0.45, spd) + 0.12);\\n      fam.cleared = ahead.x;\\n    }\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\\n    fam.gust -= dt;\\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\\n    let fx = 0;\\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\\n      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\\n    }\\n    const fallsBefore = bal.falls;\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    let fell = false;\\n    if (bal.falls > fallsBefore && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.18 && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (fell) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.cleared = -1; }\\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\\n    if (!fell) fam.x += spd * dt;\\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\\n      const time = fam.t;\\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function Session(opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\\n\",\"total_lines\":749}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"1302b769-d5d1-4f69-bda2-bb65c27490f8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_300","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A logic bug was found: `fam` is being set incorrectly.\n\nThe jump logic is being verified. Air starts at zero, drops below zero on the first frame, then jumps back to positive. Pin collision checks use the old ahead distance before movement, so they won't trigger during the initial jump. Once air reaches zero or below, another jump may occur if the cleared distance differs from ahead.x.\n\nIf the jump lands short of the pin, the character will walk into it and fall. The extra travel distance from the jump frame plus air time is roughly 0.13 units at average speed, which should clear the pin.\n\nThe landing position is confirmed to be safely past the pin. Even at the slowest speed, the character clears the pin by about 0.074 units, well above the 0.18 hit threshold.\n\nThe jump trigger distance is valid. A one-frame delay in pin detection is negligible. The real issue is that drive() runs before stepLaundry updates pinAhead, so the jump decision uses the previous frame's pin position.\n\nThe jump trigger and stepLaundry distance checks are confirmed to work correctly together. After clearing a pin, the character will walk until close enough to trigger another jump.\n\nThe laundry simulation is expected to be fast. Six skill tiers across seventy seconds of simulation should finish well under a minute even at fifty times realtime.\n\nThe remaining gate runs are laundry, tray, squat, push, and lunge.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-babc3600-47ff-44ab-a254-f9391940796f-30","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"D=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/gates.mjs\"; for a in laundry tray squat push lunge; do node \"$D\" \"$a\"; done","description":"Re-run star gates for fixed activities"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1882,"output_tokens":1079,"cache_read_input_tokens":102912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"e2795463-d345-4747-a21c-7d1396520087"}
