ood stars 1 pct 0.373 phase menu ms 276 \\ntray t2 passive stars 0 pct 0 phase menu ms 255 \\ntray t2 good stars 1 pct 0.373 phase menu ms 233 \\ntray t2 expert stars 1 pct 0.373 phase menu ms 238 \\n(node:4153183) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\nsquat t1 passive stars 0 pct 0 phase menu ms 143 \\nsquat t1 average stars 2 pct 0.67 phase menu ms 123 \\nsquat t1 good stars 2 pct 0.883 phase menu ms 99 \\nsquat t2 passive stars 0 pct 0 phase menu ms 186 \\nsquat t2 good stars 2 pct 0.651 phase menu ms 142 \\nsquat t2 expert stars 1 pct 0.533 phase menu ms 118 \\n(node:4153243) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\npush t1 passive stars 0 pct 0 phase menu ms 75 \\npush t1 average stars 2 pct 0.681 phase menu ms 87 \\npush t1 good stars 2 pct 0.873 phase menu ms 78 \\npush t2 passive stars 0 pct 0 phase menu ms 121 \\npush t2 good stars 1 pct 0.642 phase menu ms 131 \\npush t2 expert stars 1 pct 0.497 phase menu ms 154 \\n(node:4153267) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\nlunge t1 passive stars 0 pct 0 phase menu ms 129 \\nlunge t1 average stars 1 pct 0.599 phase menu ms 110 \\nlunge t1 good stars 2 pct 0.822 phase menu ms 121 \\nlunge t2 passive stars 0 pct 0 phase menu ms 183 \\nlunge t2 good stars 2 pct 0.691 phase menu ms 138 \\nlunge t2 expert stars 2 pct 0.663 phase menu ms 139 \\n(node:4153275) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"D=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/gates.mjs\\\"; for a in laundry tray squat push lunge; do node \\\"$D\\\" \\\"$a\\\"; done\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Re-run star gates for fixed activities\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e%2Fwork/01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c/terminal/call-babc3600-47ff-44ab-a254-f9391940796f-30.log\",\"total_bytes\":3261}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"e05691e3-7882-4ea9-b1a4-5d3681a9fb53"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_301","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Progress is incomplete. Laundry remains unfinished.\n\nLaundry average and good failed. Expert passed. t2 good passed the section 4 rule.\n\nTray average barely passed. Good and expert failed. t2 good passed. t2 expert failed.\n\nRep lunge expert cleared 0.663★2. Squat and push expert remain under 0.65★1. The lunge improvement did not break other cells. Tray share of 0.373 equals exactly seven of fifteen olives, so time expired before all trays cleared.\n\nTray 7 olives means tray 1 is complete and tray 2 is partially done. The system likely stalled before tray 3.\n\nOne olive is stuck on tray 2. Bumps and funnel jam are blocking it from reaching tray 3.\n\nLaundry good at 0.467 does not fit the time formula. A zero-fall finish under 70 seconds should score higher, so the result is inconsistent.\n\nLaundry good at 0.467 implies roughly three to four falls, or about nine falls if finished early. Expert cleared the limit with zero falls in about thirty-five seconds. Good effort is slower and needs either faster execution or fewer falls.\n\nThe +4×effort sway bonus is causing falls that reset the bot before it can finish. Average and good attempts stall because the extra seconds trigger too many resets. Expert already passes without this bonus, so removing or reducing it should let the lower levels clear the gate.\n\nOne fix is to stop resetting the bot’s horizontal position on balance falls and only reset on pin hits. Falls would then cost only 0.06 points each. Even with nine falls, a forty-second finish scores about 0.46, still below the 0.65 threshold. The plan also specifies a three-second penalty per fall, but the code currently applies only a 0.06 point deduction.\n\nThe original code without the +4 bonus scored zero falls in six seconds while walking. That proves the bot can walk safely on an unstable rope. The +4 bonus is what triggers falls. I will try cutting the bonus to 1.2 or removing it entirely so good can finish without falling.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-52c20833-75d1-4665-af3e-e432eb8a1e77-31","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/diag.mjs","old_string":"const mode = process.argv[2] || 'laundry';\nif (mode === 'laundry') {\n  const game = bootPlay('laundry', 1, 'good');\n  for (let t = 0; t < 20; t++) {\n    game.advance(1);\n    const fam = G.session.fam;\n    const bal = G.session.seats[0].bal;\n    console.log('t', t + 1, 'x', +fam.x.toFixed(2), 'air', +fam.air.toFixed(2), 'falls', fam.falls, 'post', fam.post, 'px', +bal.px.toFixed(2), 'py', +bal.py.toFixed(2), 'st', +bal.stumble.toFixed(2), 'bfalls', bal.falls, 'pin', fam.pinAhead && +fam.pinAhead.dist.toFixed(2), 'jump', G.session.seats[0].jump, 'pct', +G.session.pct.toFixed(3), 'done', fam.done);\n  }\n  game.dispose();\n}\nif (mode === 'tray') {\n  const game = bootPlay('tray', 1, 'good');\n  for (let t = 0; t < 12; t++) {\n    game.advance(1);\n    const fam = G.session.fam;\n    const bal = G.session.seats[0].bal;\n    const bodies = fam.world ? fam.world.bodies.filter(b => b._olive).map(b => Math.round(b.x) + ',' + Math.round(b.y) + (b._caught ? '!' : '') + (b.off ? 'x' : '')) : [];\n    console.log('t', t + 1, 'got', fam.got, 'tray', fam.trayI, 'px', bal && +bal.px.toFixed(2), 'py', bal && +bal.py.toFixed(2), 'ux', +G.session.seats[0].ux.toFixed(2), 'g', fam.world && fam.world.gravity.map(n => Math.round(n)), 'olives', bodies.join(' '));\n  }\n  game.dispose();\n}\nif (mode === 'rep') {\n  const game = bootPlay('push', 2, 'expert');\n  const fam = G.session.fam;\n  let last = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < 8000; i++) {\n    game.advance(1 / 120);\n    if (fam.doneReps !== last) {\n      const sc = fam.scores[fam.scores.length - 1];\n      console.log('rep', fam.doneReps, 'sc', sc && +sc.toFixed(3), 'pct', +G.session.pct.toFixed(3), 'form', +(fam.form / Math.max(1, G.session.seats[0].bal.frames)).toFixed(3));\n      last = fam.doneReps;\n    }\n    if (G.session.phase !== 'play') break;\n  }\n  console.log('end', +G.session.pct.toFixed(3), G.session.stars, fam.scores.map(s => +s.toFixed(2)).join(','));\n  game.dispose();\n}","new_string":"const mode = process.argv[2] || 'laundry';\nconst skill = process.argv[3] || 'good';\nif (mode === 'laundry') {\n  const game = bootPlay('laundry', 1, skill);\n  for (let t = 0; t < 70; t++) {\n    game.advance(1);\n    const fam = G.session.fam;\n    if (!fam || G.session.phase !== 'play') { console.log('end', t, G.session.phase, G.session.pct, fam && fam.falls, fam && +fam.t.toFixed(2), fam && +fam.x.toFixed(2)); break; }\n    if (t % 5 === 4) {\n      const bal = G.session.seats[0].bal;\n      console.log('t', t + 1, 'x', +fam.x.toFixed(2), 'falls', fam.falls, 'post', fam.post, 'px', +bal.px.toFixed(2), 's', +bal.set.s.toFixed(2), 'pin', fam.pinAhead && fam.pinAhead.x, 'd', fam.pinAhead && +fam.pinAhead.dist.toFixed(2), 'air', +fam.air.toFixed(2));\n    }\n  }\n  game.dispose();\n}\nif (mode === 'tray') {\n  const game = bootPlay('tray', 1, skill);\n  for (let t = 0; t < 60; t++) {\n    game.advance(1);\n    const fam = G.session.fam;\n    if (!fam || G.session.phase !== 'play') { console.log('end', t, G.session.pct, fam && fam.got, fam && fam.trayI); break; }\n    if (t % 5 === 4) {\n      const bodies = fam.world ? fam.world.bodies.filter(b => b._olive && !b._caught).map(b => Math.round(b.x) + ',' + Math.round(b.y)) : [];\n      console.log('t', t + 1, 'got', fam.got, 'tray', fam.trayI, 'px', +G.session.seats[0].bal.px.toFixed(2), 'left', bodies.join(' '));\n    }\n  }\n  game.dispose();\n}\nif (mode === 'rep') {\n  const id = process.argv[4] || 'push';\n  const game = bootPlay(id, 2, skill);\n  let last = -1;\n  for (let i = 0; i < 20000; i++) {\n    game.advance(1 / 120);\n    const fam = G.session.fam;\n    if (fam && fam.doneReps !== last && fam.scores.length) {\n      const sc = fam.scores[fam.scores.length - 1];\n      const bal = G.session.seats[0].bal;\n      console.log('rep', fam.doneReps, 'sc', +sc.toFixed(3), 'pct', +G.session.pct.toFixed(3), 'form', +(fam.form / Math.max(1, bal.frames)).toFixed(3), 'px', +bal.px.toFixed(2), 'py', +bal.py.toFixed(2));\n      last = fam.doneReps;\n    }\n    if (G.session.phase !== 'play' && G.session.fam) break;\n  }\n  const fam = G.session.fam;\n  console.log('end', +G.session.pct.toFixed(3), G.session.stars, fam && fam.scores.map(s => +s.toFixed(2)).join(','));\n  game.dispose();\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1950,"output_tokens":3428,"cache_read_input_tokens":104704,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"a6149396-e759-43da-8d2a-f95f1c941438"}
