er\":207,\"content\":\"## 6. The island (hub)\"},{\"line_number\":234,\"content\":\"## 7. Cast and voice\"},{\"line_number\":283,\"content\":\"## 8. Art direction\"},{\"line_number\":303,\"content\":\"## 9. Animation recipes (all ✔)\"},{\"line_number\":382,\"content\":\"## 10. Audio (all from code, no files)\"},{\"line_number\":394,\"content\":\"## 11. UI and UX: 10 feet, controller first\"},{\"line_number\":423,\"content\":\"**About / Credits screen** (from Title): paged, big text, no scrolling wall. Pages: Source Information (every field your brief lists, in its order), Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback, Credits (engine; Mesh2Motion and Quaternius, CC0; CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database; asset store sources). `build.mjs` injects your exit-interview JSON into the page as `G.ABOUT`, so screen, file and chat reply cannot disagree. Usage shows \\\"added on import\\\" as your brief says.\"},{\"line_number\":427,\"content\":\"## 12. Attract Mode\"},{\"line_number\":437,\"content\":\"## 13. Dev Mode\"},{\"line_number\":452,\"content\":\"## 14. Multiplayer\"},{\"line_number\":504,\"content\":\"## 15. Tech and setup\"},{\"line_number\":568,\"content\":\"**`build.mjs`:** concatenates engine, `vendor/readable.js`, `vendor/mocap.js`, `vendor/fitclips.js`, game files; replaces every `</script` with `<\\\\/script` in everything it inlines ✔; writes head tags, CSS, the boot markup at the start of `<body>` (copy the `e3-boot` div from `engine/game/index.html`); injects the exit-interview JSON as `G.ABOUT`; writes the single file to the place your brief names (pass it as an argument) and copies it to `tests/hub/game.html`. External CDN is allowed but not needed: inline everything. About 1.5 MB.\"},{\"line_number\":588,\"content\":\"## 16. Testing\"},{\"line_number\":617,\"content\":\"## 17. Build order\"},{\"line_number\":638,\"content\":\"## 18. Finish line: your brief, line by line\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"3338cb12-e128-4659-acfc-75d1b4536254"}
