brave on a larger scale.\\\",\\n    'The Gentle Games. Bunting is not a score. It is a mood.'\\n280→  ];\\n  L.attract = [\\n    \\\"Nobody's here. I'll just show the room what we do.\\\",\\n    'This is the deck. People stand here until they become impressive.',\\n    'This is a body check. It is mostly ducks and honesty.',\\n    'I will put the dot back. I always put the dot back.',\\n    'The class is imaginary. The effort is a demonstration.',\\n    'Gerald is showing off. He only knows one trick. It is swallowing.',\\n    'The raft at dusk is my favourite minute. You may borrow it.'\\n  ];\\n290→  L.tips = L.tare.filter(s => s.indexOf('Tip:') === 0);\\n  function count() {\\n    let n = L.boot.length + L.questions.length + L.remarks.length + L.ending.length + L.days.length + L.attract.length + L.podium.length;\\n    for (const k of ['tare', 'birch', 'alder', 'gertrude', 'dennis', 'marisol', 'kevin', 'okafor', 'lou', 'twins', 'thoughts']) n += L[k].length;\\n    for (const k in L.stars) n += L.stars[k].length;\\n    for (const k in L.endingAge) n += 1;\\n    return n;\\n  }\\n  L.count = count;\\n  G.LINES = L;\\n300→})();\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/data/lines.js\",\"offset\":270,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"    mid: 'Your spine has stopped asking questions.',\\n    late: 'Come back. Please. I mean that in a wellness way.'\\n  };\\n  L.podium = ['Most Still', 'Best Wobble', 'Participated'];\\n  L.days = [\\n    'Orientation. Everything is new. I am not. I am very not.',\\n    'Improvement. A nod from Gertrude is the prize. She is thrifty with nods.',\\n    'The Plateau. It is on the map. You cannot go around it.',\\n    \\\"Tare's Day. I will be brave on a larger scale.\\\",\\n    'The Gentle Games. Bunting is not a score. It is a mood.'\\n  ];\\n  L.attract = [\\n    \\\"Nobody's here. I'll just show the room what we do.\\\",\\n    'This is the deck. People stand here until they become impressive.',\\n    'This is a body check. It is mostly ducks and honesty.',\\n    'I will put the dot back. I always put the dot back.',\\n    'The class is imaginary. The effort is a demonstration.',\\n    'Gerald is showing off. He only knows one trick. It is swallowing.',\\n    'The raft at dusk is my favourite minute. You may borrow it.'\\n  ];\\n  L.tips = L.tare.filter(s => s.indexOf('Tip:') === 0);\\n  function count() {\\n    let n = L.boot.length + L.questions.length + L.remarks.length + L.ending.length + L.days.length + L.attract.length + L.podium.length;\\n    for (const k of ['tare', 'birch', 'alder', 'gertrude', 'dennis', 'marisol', 'kevin', 'okafor', 'lou', 'twins', 'thoughts']) n += L[k].length;\\n    for (const k in L.stars) n += L.stars[k].length;\\n    for (const k in L.endingAge) n += 1;\\n    return n;\\n  }\\n  L.count = count;\\n  G.LINES = L;\\n})();\\n\",\"total_lines\":300}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"51b98c8e-a543-49db-b5f1-648606fbe2e9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_335","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Session.update sets the skill from G.\n\nPassive is a driver name, so skillName must treat it as no skill. When the driver is passive, seats[0].skill becomes 'passive' and balance skill is null. Star gates use go('play', {trial:true, driver, skipToPlay:true}). Rep sessions end early when ended. Sun is an 80s session. The full matrix has 72 sessions: 12 IDs across t1 passive, average, good; t2 passive, good, expert.\n\nSession durations are mapped out. Stork is 45 seconds. Sun is 80. Candle is 60. Squat is 32 or 60. Push is 24 or 50. Lunge is 32 or 60. Step is 60. Hoop is 60. Jog is 70. Slalom is 70. Tray is 60. Laundry is 70.\n\nThe full matrix totals roughly 3960 seconds of simulation. That is about 518k steps at 120 steps per second. The story playthrough adds another 100k steps. Two playthroughs bring the total to roughly 200k steps. The run should finish in 30 to 120 seconds.\n\nClass adds 35 seconds. Total runtime is about one to three minutes.\n\nEyes closed uses stork tier two.\n\nStar gates use the activity's own thresholds. Sun and step are .5, .75, and .92. Others are .35, .65, and .90. Passive must stay below the star one threshold. Prior measurements showed passive near zero.\n\nFor device lean tests, the stick registers an input hook after boot. The tick zeros padMove when no gamepad exists before hooks run.\n\nSetting padMove in an input hook registered after boot runs after the tick clears the pad but before the step hook reads it. That single frame is enough to set the source pad and UX/UY values directly, so no hold is needed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0ffd757-4bfd-4c2c-a0f8-aab61bc07ddc-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hold\\(action|hold\\(a\\)|feed\\(type","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0ffd757-4bfd-4c2c-a0f8-aab61bc07ddc-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":1080,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0ffd757-4bfd-4c2c-a0f8-aab61bc07ddc-25","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function skillName|passive","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0ffd757-4bfd-4c2c-a0f8-aab61bc07ddc-26","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/TASK.md","offset":1,"limit":180}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8985,"output_tokens":1140,"cache_read_input_tokens":72960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"92b4f6ce-0578-41fc-a7d5-1301816c66de"}
