d-in\"},{\"line_number\":643,\"content\":\"   *  headless game's, sized as a 1280 x 720 window would size it, with nothing to draw on */\"},{\"line_number\":645,\"content\":\"    /** canvas: the page's canvas (null in a headless game); o: the sizing options (the game's o) */\"},{\"line_number\":647,\"content\":\"    /** buf: the low-resolution buffer the game draws into (W + 2 by H + 2 pixels; null when headless, a stand-in when a\"},{\"line_number\":648,\"content\":\"     *  headless game draws: o.draw); ctx: its 2D context (r.ctx is the same) */\"},{\"line_number\":755,\"content\":\"  /** signal: an AbortSignal that removes every listener this adds (game.dispose()). A screen without a canvas (headless)\"},{\"line_number\":1479,\"content\":\"    if (!game.headless || game.o.draw) { this._cv = mkCanvas(8, 8); this._g = this._cv.getContext('2d'); this.refresh(); }   // (a headless game never draws, unless it was made with draw: true)\"},{\"line_number\":2235,\"content\":\"        if (!g.canvas.standIn) game.lights.render(this);   // (a stand-in screen, headless: no pixels to light)\"},{\"line_number\":2310,\"content\":\"   * new E.Game({ canvas, view, views, res, expand, input, bg, step: 1 / 120, loop: true, headless: false, menu,\"},{\"line_number\":2318,\"content\":\"   * - headless: no screen, renderer, sound or DOM input (tests, tools, a simulation in Node, where it is the default):\"},{\"line_number\":2320,\"content\":\"   * - draw: true (headless): draw runs each advance on a stand-in renderer, its errors in game.errors\"},{\"line_number\":2337,\"content\":\"    /** true for a game with no display (o.headless, or no DOM: Node) */\"},{\"line_number\":2338,\"content\":\"    this.headless = !!o.headless || typeof document === 'undefined';\"},{\"line_number\":2339,\"content\":\"    if (this.headless) o.canvas = null;\"},{\"line_number\":2346,\"content\":\"     *  step, input, loop, headless) */\"},{\"line_number\":2347,\"content\":\"    this.o = Object.assign({ view: 'iso', minH: 190, minW: 300, maxW: 560, maxH: 330, bg: '#07060d', step: 1 / 120, input: Input.DEFAULT, loop: !this.headless }, o);\"},{\"line_number\":2368,\"content\":\"    this.time = 0; this.real = 0; this.hitstop = 0; this.timeScale = 1; this._shakeAmt = 0; this.reduceMotion = !this.headless && !!(window.matchMedia && matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches);\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ce1dd91a-fe44-4bf5-9753-0ffa5d8ac63b-50","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle: **Spine Wee**\\n\\nChosen with Node `crypto.randomBytes` (4 bytes `92846675`, uint32 `2458150517`, index `17` of 50 silent riffs). The list of 50 is not recorded. The product name \\\"Wii Fit\\\" was not a candidate.\\n\\nDev folder: `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108`\\n\\n## Milestones\\n10→\\n- [ ] M0 fetch, build, tests, boot\\n- [ ] M1 Lean + Stork Stand\\n- [ ] M2 day loop\\n- [ ] M3 stillness + strength\\n- [ ] M4 cardio\\n- [ ] M5 balance games\\n- [ ] M6 story, ending, audio\\n- [ ] M7 class + hub\\n- [ ] M8 attract, dev, about\\n20→- [ ] M9 bundle + exit interview\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle: **Spine Wee**\\n\\nChosen with Node `crypto.randomBytes` (4 bytes `92846675`, uint32 `2458150517`, index `17` of 50 silent riffs). The list of 50 is not recorded. The product name \\\"Wii Fit\\\" was not a candidate.\\n\\nDev folder: `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108`\\n\\n## Milestones\\n10→\\n- [ ] M0 fetch, build, tests, boot\\n- [ ] M1 Lean + Stork Stand\\n- [ ] M2 day loop\\n- [ ] M3 stillness + strength\\n- [ ] M4 cardio\\n- [ ] M5 balance games\\n- [ ] M6 story, ending, audio\\n- [ ] M7 class + hub\\n- [ ] M8 attract, dev, about\\n20→- [ ] M9 bundle + exit interview\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"# Prog