about the z axis\\n};\\n/** two-bone IK in 3D: returns [joint, end]. hint points the way the joint should bend. */\\nfunction ik3(a, b, L1, L2, hint) {\\n  let d = V3.sub(b, a), dist = V3.len(d);\\n  const max = L1 + L2 - .01;\\n  if (dist > max) { d = V3.mul(d, max / dist); b = V3.add(a, d); dist = max; }\\n  dist = Math.max(dist, .01);\\n  const n = V3.mul(d, 1 / dist);\\n\",\"total_lines\":14974}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"0013f6da-afac-45d7-9f8c-b7d2e92e5992"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_357","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The draw:true setting uses a null canvas. It should work.\n\nDraw paths are safely wrapped in try/catch. I will write the test file and read game sources for linting. Talk index and open flag logic is being added. Plateau sampling inside pump is being implemented.\n\nA `note` function will track plateau age on day 3 to prevent movement. The good run must reach the plateau, keep spineAge below 71, unlock the friend, and play all 12 songs. All 12 plays are verified via `G.profile.played` keys. Passive mode requires reaching freePlay but not the friend or age drop; it still needs the day 3 plateau. It may run long since poor scores do not end early, though time limits will stop it.\n\nBoth playthroughs should take roughly the same duration. A full run needs about 240k steps plus 400k gates. Tray physics is expensive but JavaScript can handle it. The rules test will use a 10-minute timeout. Star gates finish early once olives are done. Repetition ends when reps are complete. Step ends when rhythm is done. Sun, jog, slalom, laundry, candle, stork, and hoop each run for about 6 minutes. Squat, push-up, and lunge are shorter.\n\nThe simulation should finish in about 42 seconds at 10,000 steps per second, or roughly 3.5 minutes at 2,000 steps per second. The rules test will wait up to eight minutes.\n\nA scratch/rules-progress.txt file will record each completed test name for background monitoring.\n\nrun.mjs will be written in one pass.\n\nDuring pumping, G.setDriver must run before play and auto so the countdown sees the driver. The story pump sets the driver every auto and play frame. At the card phase, the menu phase delays driver assignment.\n\nopenPlay passes G.driver when starting the play session. If that value is null at confirmation, the session begins without a driver. During demo frames, the pump sets G.driver, and session.update copies it onto the local seat before beginFamily runs at the end of the countdown.\n\nThe first demo auto frame correctly sets the driver before advancing, so the session updates properly. G.setDriver should run both before the main loop and inside each auto or play frame.\n\nPassive mode is handled as a non-human driver. It assigns skill 'passive', which makes skillName return null and keeps the human flag false, so drive sets ux to zero and lean is not used.\n\nThe star gate test uses a `runAct` helper that boots the game, sets the driver via both `G.setDriver` and the `go` options, and enters play with `skipToPlay: true`. It then loops until the snapshot reaches the play menu for the target activity, reapplying the driver on every frame to keep it active during the brief skip.\n\nThe `runAct` loop advances the game by a time step computed from remaining time, capped at 0.5 seconds. It exits when the scene is play, the phase is menu, and the activity matches the target. The guard clause prevents stopping on the title screen before the first advance enters play. Because `skipToPlay` starts at the countdown rather than the card menu, the first frames are in auto phase.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5c5baab3-36d6-4588-a4f9-2a60cfcec8f9-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"eyes|hide","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3271,"output_tokens":1551,"cache_read_input_tokens":128896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"7de86850-fa90-470f-aadd-d90664cdd3e6"}
