{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-47aaa03a-7b40-44dd-b5b8-2611c27459fd-69","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,48,49,48,56,95,95,120,54,49,98,100,55,101,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"a0e6ca47-8326-491e-9083-5aa04efc2f53"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_363","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Game sources are clean. Engine TODOs are acceptable since lint only covers game sources.\n\nWriting the main test file. Planning to mutate `input.padMove` via a hook and test key inputs like holding left.\n\nMouse and pad tests need fresh boots to avoid stale timestamps. Pad input overrides mouse. Key source is always keys even when idle, so the test must verify actual movement rather than just source identity.\n\nKey hold should yield ux < -0.4. Mouse and pad tests will assert source and ux thresholds of 0.3 and 0.5. Screen dimensions will use the actual headless resolution. A quick check is needed to confirm tick does not clear mouse.active.\n\nFeed mouse input inside the input hook so it runs after tick and avoids stale timestamps. The stuck pump message will include the key and errors. Day 3 must fail if no plateau is reached, since day 2 sets the plateau and day 3 advances on the same frame.\n\nThe bed update sets plateau to true when day is 2, then clears it to false when day becomes 3. The snapshot is captured after the day increment, so the transition frame itself records plateau as true for day 3. This confirms the test will sample a valid plateau state.\n\nThe snapshot uses spineAge(), which returns holdSpine and stays stable even if raw age changes. The friend unlock test will not fake minutes; it will rely on the actual game behavior.\n\nA JSON dump to scratch/play-good.json will record minutes, stars per activity, and unlocks for debugging without stdout spam. The friend unlock may require a scoring or suggestion bonus fix after the run. Both story and passive playthroughs are necessary; timeScale was considered but rejected because it would alter physics.\n\nPlaythrough simulation will use 0.5 or 1-second chunks without increasing delta time. Rep sessions may finish early as left decreases, and passive play can end from candle death or laundry effort zero. The pump loop will break immediately when freePlay is true and the scene is ending or free.\n\nThe ending scene can remain active for one frame after freePlay triggers, so the pump advances once and breaks to read the next snapshot. The freePlay check must run before any tap logic to avoid misfiring. Five confirmations are required on the ending talk pages.\n\nThe pump loop will throw immediately if game.errors.length is nonzero, halting that test without running the full 200k-step simulation. An assert helper will throw on failure so the runner can catch and record the error.\n\nStar gate tests will collect all failures in one run and throw at the end so every missed gate is visible together. Playthrough errors will include a wall-clock timestamp. The hub fake queues handlers via AIHub.on, and boot wireHub registers them; connect returns a promise, so a microtask flush is needed before assertions.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-25dd554f-e4de-43c7-90d6-daabb59e188f-70","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"this\\.booted","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":310,"output_tokens":1840,"cache_read_input_tokens":145920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"9c1d99c9-589f-43cd-9d77-99faaaa2fd39"}
