{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_388","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"chainAfter is only in doneSession, which is the play scene.\n\nThe else branch built a podium with Regular score 0. The confirm tap may be swallowed by an active shell or the title scene's fade.\n\nThe shell is not open. The confirm key may be swallowed because the step returns early while `_podium` is true. I will log `_podium` and `_next`, and try pressing Enter or KeyZ to force an exit.\n\nThe title scene's enter function might throw an error and prevent the switch. Since the scene remains class, the transition likely never started or the second advance did not run enter. I will add a debug assertion to inspect the game state after tapping confirm.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4a0eddea-c77d-4fe7-818b-7af0553b9ce7-96","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  game.input.tap('confirm');\n  game.advance(1 / 120);\n  game.advance(1 / 120);\n  assert(snap(game).scene === 'title', 'left class to ' + snap(game).scene);","new_string":"  game.input.tap('confirm');\n  const n1 = game.advance(1 / 120);\n  const mid = { scene: game.sceneName, pod: !!G.scenes.class._podium, sess: !!G.session, next: game._next && game._next.name, n1: n1, phase: G.phase };\n  const n2 = game.advance(1 / 120);\n  assert(snap(game).scene === 'title', 'left class to ' + snap(game).scene + ' ' + JSON.stringify(mid) + ' n2=' + n2 + ' err=' + JSON.stringify(game.errors));"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":757,"output_tokens":800,"cache_read_input_tokens":188288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"7dea3a11-45be-4485-81e5-65672fbf4173"}
