{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_392","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Line 1196 releases the previous tap's `_tapsDue` at the start of `tick`.\n\nThe new tap moves from `_taps` into `_tapsDue`. The previous tap's release may clear the fresh press if the confirm code is identical. The prior iteration tapped confirm to build the podium. That tap's confirm was pressed that step and ended in `_tapsDue`.\n\nThe new press adds confirm to held. The tick's release then deletes it. The new press's _fresh may be cleared.\n\nRelease does not clear `_fresh`. The new press's confirm remains in `_now` after the swap. `pressed()` checks `_now`, so it should return true. The scene update should have seen it, but nothing happened.\n\nThe exit tap may have been the same tap that built the podium. The loop advances while `!podium`, so the first tap in that block creates the podium. The second tap is the actual exit. If `_podium` was set during that same step, the update consumed confirm to build it and never reached the exit branch.\n\nThe exit tap is actually the first confirm that builds the podium. It does not reach the title screen because the session was still present at the start of the update. This matches the debug output: the scene remains unchanged and `pod` is true.\n\nThe session was cleared during this step. The next scene is null because the title branch was never reached; the code stayed in the results branch.\n\nThis means the loop exited because `G.podium` became true during a play or auto advance, not from a menu tap. The class update does not call `doneSession`, and there is no `chainAfter` call in the class activity, so it is unclear how the podium flag was set without a confirm press.\n\nThe debug output follows the loop, so the podium flag must have been set during a tap inside the loop. The second tap's advance still sees no next scene, meaning the flag was already true before that step.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-921b0c17-a6b1-401a-bfda-41b20b5d4e7e-100","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"G\\.podium","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1919,"output_tokens":1158,"cache_read_input_tokens":191872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"57a9d007-55d2-45a5-8d7d-b86677dc2016"}
