ges, a drag, a zoom toward its point; the focus kept to bounds\\n  _freeCam(dt) {\\n    const c = this.cam, F = c.free === true ? {} : c.free, I = this.input, S = this.screen, z = this._zoomTo || this.zoom;\\n    let dx = 0, dy = 0, moved = false;\\n    if (F.keys !== false && !(this.shell && this.shell.screen) && !I.stickOn) { const m = I.move(), sp = (F.speed || 300) * dt; dx += m[0] * sp; dy += m[1] * sp; }   // (a finger pans by its drag, not as a stick)\\n\",\"total_lines\":14974}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"bb6a6842-3a55-436e-bb5b-badccc7fc04e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_394","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The shell step might consume confirmation when a shell screen is open.\n\nThe game is paused. The pause check runs before scene updates, so the title screen never loads. The pause state persists because autoPause triggers when not in session. The class is pausable, but only confirm and arrow keys were pressed.\n\nThe game may have paused from removing a player or allowing joins. The dev panel was not opened. The shell menu was not triggered. I will check the debug state for paused and shell.screen. The fix is to resume the game or prevent pause.\n\nThe pause might be caused by player add or remove logic, or by the player count dropping to one. The wireScenes update function could also block class updates if a talk screen is open.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fad549c3-161b-4097-89c4-8ef37d564680-102","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"this\\.paused = true|paused = true","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1949,"output_tokens":670,"cache_read_input_tokens":195200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"847248f4-a034-4d23-96f7-9a8e211b4a21"}
