{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_397","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Lines 884-887 contain an important `input` reference.\n\n`input.use()` clears `_now` and `_fresh`, but it only runs on session enter. `begin()` creates a new session without changing input, so the next activity's enter won't re-use the old input. The podium check uses direct pressed checks rather than pills, which may be related to the issue.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-53bb5967-53bf-43b9-8875-bab1344a9591-105","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"_step\\(\\)|pressed\\('confirm'\\)|pressed\\('start'\\)","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3972,"output_tokens":409,"cache_read_input_tokens":198400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"fc7b470b-285f-4602-a317-4ddc10977714"}
