{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_402","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Trying to understand why confirm doesn't leave the podium.\n\nThe loop exits before the confirm tap, so G.podium is already set when confirm is pressed. The next step should see a null session and an active podium.\n\nThe confirm tap may be suppressed by shell stack or pause logic. If pressed() returns false, go('title') never runs and the scene stays on the podium.\n\nChecking if a pause or shell menu blocks the confirm tap. The input lifecycle looks correct: a tap made before advance is visible during that step's update. The cause must be elsewhere.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The podium is already showing, so the next confirm should leave. I'll check whether that press is swallowed by a fade, a pause, or the shell."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a6bd4d9-5a12-448f-b19b-e692aff16f14-5","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"go\\(name|_fade|_next|fade","glob":"**/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a6bd4d9-5a12-448f-b19b-e692aff16f14-6","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pressed\\(|_suppressed|_tapsDue|function tap\\(","glob":"**/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4181,"output_tokens":755,"cache_read_input_tokens":33408,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"81ba7b9f-1feb-4c04-bbd0-9939bd40c1df"}
