{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_404","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The world's `go()` function is missing the `fade: 0` parameter.\n\nThe 0.22-second fade is the likely culprit. The test only advances two frames, which is shorter than the fade duration, so the scene update is skipped and the scene remains unchanged. The debug output also did not check `_fade`, so it cannot confirm whether `go()` was actually invoked.\n\nThe fade-out lasts 0.22 seconds, followed by a 0.22-second fade-in, so the scene should reach title after roughly 0.44 seconds total. The confirm input is processed during the same step that starts the fade.\n\nThe fade is started during the scene update, so it begins in the next step. After two frames the timer reads only 0.0167 seconds, which is well below the 0.22-second threshold. This confirms the bug is in the test itself, not the game. The test should advance past the fade duration.\n\nThe test should advance 0.5 seconds and assert the scene is title. Other tests using `go()` need review to see if they expect instant transitions or rely on the engine's default fade. The internal `go()` always fades, while explicit `fade: 0` calls work because they bypass that default. A human would naturally see a fade from podium to title. The confirm input firing also needs verification.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5a78b6d8-626c-472f-aac5-fae043a0c7b2-10","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":9780,"limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5a78b6d8-626c-472f-aac5-fae043a0c7b2-11","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function go\\(|game\\.go\\(","glob":"**/game/*.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8180,"output_tokens":930,"cache_read_input_tokens":41728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"f29e9932-e198-4c9f-b0a7-ff893f36b4e0"}
