ay original (this is a new game, not a recreation):** no Wii, Mii or Balance Board names, no copied characters, music, menus, minigame presentations or look. Say \\\"Wii Fit\\\" only in the Source Information your brief requires, and let the title riff on it as the brief says. Our cast, island, activities and jokes are below.\"},{\"line_number\":423,\"content\":\"**About / Credits screen** (from Title): paged, big text, no scrolling wall. Pages: Source Information (every field your brief lists, in its order), Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback, Credits (engine; Mesh2Motion and Quaternius, CC0; CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database; asset store sources). `build.mjs` injects your exit-interview JSON into the page as `G.ABOUT`, so screen, file and chat reply cannot disagree. Usage shows \\\"added on import\\\" as your brief says.\"},{\"line_number\":568,\"content\":\"**`build.mjs`:** concatenates engine, `vendor/readable.js`, `vendor/mocap.js`, `vendor/fitclips.js`, game files; replaces every `</script` with `<\\\\/script` in everything it inlines ✔; writes head tags, CSS, the boot markup at the start of `<body>` (copy the `e3-boot` div from `engine/game/index.html`); injects the exit-interview JSON as `G.ABOUT`; writes the single file to the place your brief names (pass it as an argument) and copies it to `tests/hub/game.html`. External CDN is allowed but not needed: inline everything. About 1.5 MB.\"},{\"line_number\":654,\"content\":\"- [ ] Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback in the chat reply **and** the About screen, \\\"unknown\\\" for what you can't confirm, Usage as \\\"added on import\\\". Plan field: this plan's file name. Research field: what you actually did (further research is optional; this plan's recipes are already tested)\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/build.mjs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\"  const raw = readFileSync(join(work, 'exit-interview.json'), 'utf8');\"},{\"line_number\":37,\"content\":\"bundled = bundled.replace('/*ABOUT*/null', about);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"  G.ABOUT = /*ABOUT*/null;\"},{\"line_number\":1047,\"content\":\"    const A = G.ABOUT;\"},{\"line_number\":1054,\"content\":\"      ['Testing Feedback', A && A.testingFeedback],\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/TASK.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":92,\"content\":\"## Source Information\"},{\"line_number\":93,\"content\":\"CRITICAL: Put Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback in your chat reply and an in-game About/Credits screen. Write \\\"unknown\\\" for anything you can't confirm.\"},{\"line_number\":109,\"content\":\"Exit interview: before you finish, also save these answers as exit-interview.json in this folder's root, beside the game's .html: one JSON object in exactly the shape below, every value filled in (\\\"unknown\\\" for anything you can't confirm). Tools read it (the game's run record and the AI Hub catalogue), so write plain text, and check that the file parses as JSON.\"},{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\\"your answer to each Testing Feedback question, in order\\\"],\"},{\"line_number\":130,\"content\":\"Testing Feedback\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"44dd0963-9338-4fef-9ee4-1b660d1a1e27"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_423","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All star gates passed, including stork t2 good eyes.\n\nI need to run the full rules suite first to get real failure counts. Then I will write exit-interview.json with those actual numbers. I also need to check build.mjs and TASK.md for the exact JSON shape and About screen requirements.\n\nThree game-breaking bugs were fixed: tray scoring, laundry balance resets, and tier-2 expert servo. I will read TASK.md, build.mjs, the About scene, and PROGRESS.md next. The exit interview will be written after the full suite runs.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6283713d-9bec-409e-b567-d290effa8588-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/build.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6283713d-9bec-409e-b567-d290effa8588-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/TASK.md","offset":80,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6283713d-9bec-409e-b567-d290effa8588-41","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":1000,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6283713d-9bec-409e-b567-d290effa8588-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/PROGRESS.md","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4814,"output_tokens":665,"cache_read_input_tokens":90880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"9c150f77-974b-42dc-a072-28156348f2c4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6283713d-9bec-409e-b567-d290effa8588-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/* One file for the hand-in, and a copy the hub harness can frame. */\\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync, mkdirSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { dirname, join } from 'node:path';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\n\\nconst here = dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url));\\nconst work = dirname(here);\\nconst name = 'Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108';\\nconst out = process.argv[2] || join(work, name + '.html');\\n10→\\nconst order = [\\n  'engine/my-3d2dge.js',\\n  'vendor/readable.js',\\n  'vendor/mocap.js',\\n  'vendor/fitclips.js',\\n  'game/data/lines.js',\\n  'game/data/content.js',\\n  'game/balance.js',\\n  'game/audio.js',\\n20→  'game/rigs.js',\\n  'game/ui.js',\\n  'game/play.js',\\n  'game/world.js',\\n  'game/boot.js'\\n];\\n\\nfunction esc(s) { return s.replace(/<\\\\/script/gi, '<\\\\\\\\/script'); }\\n\\nlet about = 'null';\\n30→try {\\n  const raw = readFileSync(join(work, 'exit-interview.json'), 'utf8');\\n  JSON.parse(raw);\\n  about = raw.trim();\\n} catch (e) { about = 'null'; }\\n\\nlet bundled = order.map(function (f) { return esc(readFileSync(join(here, f), 'utf8')); }).join('\\\\n;\\\\n');\\nbundled = bundled.replace('/*ABOUT*/null', about);\\nconst session = esc(readFileSync(join(here, 'vendor/session.js'), 'utf8'));\\n\\n40→const html = `<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<script>\\n${session}\\n</script>\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\\\">\\n<title>Spine Wee — a five-day stay for your spine</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"A sports retreat where a talking scale coaches one lean: stillness, strength, cardio, and balance, alone or in a class of four.\\\">\\n50→<meta name=\\\"theme-color\\\" content=\\\"#2cc6e6\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:type\\\" content=\\\"Game\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:players\\\" content=\\\"1–4\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:source\\\" content=\\\"Wii Fit\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session\\\" content=\\\"1\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:session-players\\\" content=\\\"1-4\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:session-mode\\\" content=\\\"ghost\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"3\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-goal\\\" content=\\\"Stay steadiest over 3 exercises; most points wins\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Lean: left stick, WASD or mouse. Breathe: R2, Space or click\\\">\\n<style>\\nhtml, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; background: #e7f6f8; overflow: hidden }\\n#screen { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; image-rendering: pixelated; touch-action: none; background: #e7f6f8 }\\n@media (min-height:700px){.esh-mod{zoom:1.5}} @media (min-height:1000px){.esh-mod{zoom:2}}\\n60→.esh button:focus,.esh input:focus{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\\n[data-sys=need]{background:rgba(5,3,12,.35)!important;align-items:flex-end!important}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div id=\\\"e3-boot\\\" role=\\\"status\\\" style=\\\"position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:40;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:6px;padding:20px;background:#e7f6f8;color:#5f7f8a;font:12px/1.5 ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace\\\"><style>@keyframes e3-run{from{transform:translateX(-100%)}to{transform:translateX(340%)}}@keyframes e3-late{to{opacity:1}}</style><b style=\\\"color:#20404c;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.08em\\\">SPINE WEE</b><span>Starting · my-3D2dge v0.89.0</span><span style=\\\"display:block;height:4px;max-width:440px;overflow:hidden;background:#c8dde2\\\"><span style=\\\"display:block;width:30%;height:100%;background:#14a8c8;animation:e3-run 1.2s ease-in-out infinite\\\"></span></span><span style=\\\"opacity:0;animation:e3-late .3s 12s forwards\\\">Still starting. If this stays, the ga