onsidered critical issues / game breaking?\\n- What was the most helpful test you ran?\\n- What was the least helpful test you ran?\\n\\nEngine Feedback\\n\\n- What did you like most about the engine?\\n- Did you get stuck or guess wrong?\\n- What was the most important thing you had to build yourself?\\n- What was the hardest part about using the engine?\\n- What did you change in the engine, and why? (none if nothing)\\n- If you could change one thing about the engine, what would it be?\\n\\nPrompt Feedback\\n\\n- What did you like most about this prompt?\\n- What was confusing?\\n- What was the hardest thing to do?\\n- What would you change in this prompt?\\n\",\"total_lines\":151}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6283713d-9bec-409e-b567-d290effa8588-41","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1000→      }\\n      G.phase = 'play';\\n      G.left = Math.max(0, span - local);\\n      if (live) {\\n        G.hubSendAcc += dt;\\n        G.hubProgAcc += dt;\\n        if (G.hubSendAcc >= 0.1) {\\n          G.hubSendAcc = 0;\\n          const b = s && s.seats && s.seats[0] && s.seats[0].bal;\\n          try {\\n1010→            api.send({ t: 'g', a: ev, l: [b ? b.px : 0, b ? b.py : 0], p: s ? s.phase : 'play', w: [0, 0], s: G.morningScores[ev] || 0 }, { reliable: false });\\n          } catch (e) { /* rate */ }\\n        }\\n        if (G.hubProgAcc >= 1) {\\n          G.hubProgAcc = 0;\\n          const total = Math.round(G.morningScores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0));\\n          try { api.progress({ score: total, label: total + ' pts' }); } catch (e) { /* rate */ }\\n        }\\n      }\\n    },\\n1020→    draw(r) {\\n      G.paintRoom(r, 'day');\\n      const api = hubApi();\\n      const waiting = api && G.inSession && api.time && api.time() === -Infinity;\\n      if (waiting) {\\n        hudName(r, 'Spine Wee', 'Morning Class');\\n        r.overlay(function (g) {\\n          G.text(g, 'Lean. Sta