{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_424","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand the engine changes that were made.\n\nI am reviewing the engine changes and PLAN.md for honest feedback. Testing caught game-breaking issues: tray glass sizing, laundry balance resets, and tier-2 expert lead scoring. Test harness issues are separate from game bugs.\n\nThree test harness bugs were found: a strict per-seed assertion, a headless flag breaking autoFull, and a swallowed consecutive tap in podium exit. These are not game bugs. I will verify only known issues from the conversation and code comments.\n\nI will answer the questions with short, ordered array values. I will distinguish between game bugs and test harness bugs in my counts.\n\nI will inspect the engine diffs to identify exact modifications. I also need to verify that hub harness files exist. The exit-interview.json will be written only after I have confirmed the engine changes.\n\nBrowser tests will run first, launching Chromium sequentially. The hub test follows, since it spawns both a browser and a Python server. Finally, the official log runs via `node tests/run.mjs all`.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c2853ecb-c635-4378-9848-2de9c5a1ecfb-43","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"shadow|Dialog","glob":"**/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c2853ecb-c635-4378-9848-2de9c5a1ecfb-44","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function startServer|harness.html|__hubCheck","glob":"**/tests/**/*.{mjs,js,html}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c2853ecb-c635-4378-9848-2de9c5a1ecfb-45","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/PLAN.md","offset":560,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5057,"output_tokens":996,"cache_read_input_tokens":95616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"par