{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_448","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Reviewing the boot sequence conditionals in the code.\n\nThe splash screen hides after two drawn frames. The screenshot is taken immediately after waitForFunction resolves for the title scene, so it may occur before both frames are rendered or while the fade is still active.\n\nLater screenshots capture the real game after the splash fades. The title screenshot is too early and shows the boot splash instead of the game title. This is a test timing issue, not a game bug.\n\nThe test should wait for the boot overlay to fully hide before taking the title screenshot. This ensures the evidence image shows the real game title rather than the splash screen.\n\nThe test should wait for the boot overlay to have `display: none` rather than just the `out` class. This ensures the splash is fully hidden before the title screenshot is taken.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fcd8a80f-5a5a-4275-8bc4-594445043094-82","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/plate-1920x1080.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fcd8a80f-5a5a-4275-8bc4-594445043094-83","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/island-1920x1080.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fcd8a80f-5a5a-4275-8bc4-594445043094-84","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/card-1920x1080.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":578,"output_tokens":840,"cache_read_input_tokens":157184,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"5db57278-b7bc-4cfc-acaa-b1643248fd27"}
