{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_464","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Overlays are drawn onto `g`, which is `this`.\n\nText should appear on both the buffer and screen canvas. The diagnostic found no text ink or white pixels. The beach is not white, and pills are white but were not detected. This suggests font.text may be a no-op or drawing off-buffer. The title PNG was actually the darkened sea during boot, not text.\n\nThe entire HUD is missing from the presented canvas. The buffer should be sampled for text and ink instead of the display canvas, since present may fail to blit or the engine may use a bitmap renderer.\n\nI will monkeypatch `E.font.text` to count calls and catch errors, then rerun the diagnostic on the buffer.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4bc229cf-5457-4efd-863a-2a7393a8d2a5-105","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/shot-diag.mjs","old_string":"  const out = [Object.assign(sample('title'), { boot: bootState })];\n  g.go('play', { id: 'stork', tier: 1, trial: true }, { fade: 0 });\n  await new Promise(r => requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(r)));\n  out.push(sample('play'));\n  const s = window.G && G.session;\n  out.push({ sess: s ? { phase: s.phase, act: s.act && s.act.id } : null, derr: window.__derr || null });\n  return out;","new_string":"  function sampleBuf(label) {\n    const buf = g.screen.buf;\n    const ctx = buf.getContext('2d');\n    const d = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, buf.width, buf.height).data;\n    let ink = 0, white = 0, nz = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < d.length; i += 16) {\n      const r = d[i], gg = d[i + 1], b = d[i + 2], a = d[i + 3];\n      if (a > 10) nz++;\n      if (r < 50 && gg > 40 && gg < 110 && b > 50 && b < 130) ink++;\n      if (r > 240 && gg > 240 && b > 240) white++;\n    }\n    const mid = (buf.width >> 1) * 4 + 20 * buf.width * 4;\n    return { label, scene: g.sceneName, W: g.screen.W, H: g.screen.H, bw: buf.width, bh: buf.height, ink, white, nz, mid: [d[mid], d[mid + 1], d[mid + 2], d[mid + 3]], errors: (g.errors || []).map(e => e.where + ' ' + e.message) };\n  }\n  const E = window.My3D2dge;\n  let fontCalls = 0, fontErr = null;\n  const orig = E.font.text;\n  E.font.text = function () {\n    fontCalls++;\n    try { return orig.apply(this, arguments); }\n    catch (e) { fontErr = String(e && e.stack || e); throw e; }\n  };\n  const out = [Object.assign(sample('canvas-title'), { boot: bootState }), sampleBuf('buf-title')];\n  g.go('play', { id: 'stork', tier: 1, trial: true }, { fade: 0 });\n  await new Promise(r => requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(r)));\n  await new Promise(r => requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(r)));\n  out.push(sample('canvas-play'));\n  out.push(sampleBuf('buf-play'));\n  const s = window.G && G.session;\n  out.push({ sess: s ? { phase: s.phase, act: s.act && s.act.id } : null, fontCalls, fontErr });\n  return out;"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2000,"output_tokens":1326,"cache_read_input_tokens":186240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"06453d46-d082-4b2c-8055-079aaed3fe48"}
