   \\\"white\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"nz\\\": 25955,\\n      \\\"mid\\\": [\\n        209,\\n        240,\\n        250,\\n        255\\n      ],\\n      \\\"errors\\\": []\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"sess\\\": {\\n        \\\"phase\\\": \\\"card\\\",\\n        \\\"act\\\": \\\"stork\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"fontCalls\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"fontErr\\\": null\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"logs\\\": []\\n}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"node \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/shot-diag.mjs\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Compare screen canvas and game buffer pixels\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e%2Fwork/01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c/terminal/call-6f9b087b-563c-4cc6-879d-44594fbca6a1-106.log\",\"total_bytes\":1332}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"545b43a1-4156-4c57-bd84-2014d6dc79ae"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_466","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"fontCalls is zero. E.font.text was never called after the patch.\n\nThe buffer shows only the beach sky. The title was already drawn before the patch. The play scene draw is not calling font.text. Either scene.draw is not running, it throws before text, or drawActivity returns early because _finish was never called.\n\nThe beach is drawn directly to the canvas, so paintRoom runs. Overlays are deferred until _finish executes them. If _finish never runs, the overlay callbacks are never invoked and font.text stays zero. Another possibility is that draw throws before overlay() is ever called.\n\nThe engine's _frame method is being examined to see if it actually calls r._finish after sc.draw. If the draw path skips that step, overlays would never run.\n\nThe engine does call _finish after sc.draw. If drawActivity queues an overlay, it should run before _finish even if draw throws later. Since fontCalls is still zero, the overlay was never registered or the throw happens before that point.\n\nThe patch on E.font.text should work because G.text resolves the property at call time. The frames may have been skipped if the game was paused or the tab did not render. A cached font function is also being considered.\n\nThe font replacement is confirmed correct. Two rAFs may have been skipped if the page was backgrounded. The next step is to add manual draw and _finish calls inside evaluate, plus logging to catch any draw throws.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8cab8058-05f4-4df2-a535-583d2c52fe95-107","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/shot-diag.mjs","old_string":"  const s = window.G && G.session;\n  out.push({ sess: s ? { phase: s.phase, act: s.act && s.act.id } : null, fontCalls, fontErr });\n  re