{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_472","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Engine v0.89 removed or renamed px.round.\n\nThe plan targets engine 0.88, so I'll add a small compatibility shim in the game code to restore `E.px.round` at boot. This avoids editing engine files and fixes all call sites at once.\n\nThe shim will draw a filled rectangle and skip its corner pixels to create rounded corners. It clamps the radius to half the smaller dimension.\n\nThe shim will be placed in ui.js so it loads after rigs.js, where paintRoom is defined. It draws the body and sides as filled rectangles, then fills the four corners as small squares.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5a220955-1ab7-42b5-9123-db5eca21b180-114","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"E\\.px\\.\\w+","glob":"**/game/**/*.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1344,"output_tokens":635,"cache_read_input_tokens":194816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"ddfed6a6-93f3-4667-83c1-7a63fd067900"}
