{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_475","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Text and white pills have been placed on the canvas.\n\nFont calls are at 30 with no draw errors. The draw wrapper now calls game.fail. A full rules run will verify the playthrough is clean. Exit interview counts are updated to 6 issues and 4 critical. Testing feedback strings will include the px.round HUD bug. Engine feedback notes that v0.89 lacks E.px.round from v0.88.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-295a0733-5896-42f1-8094-4445c7967670-119","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108\" && node tests/run.mjs rules","description":"Re-run all rules after HUD draw fix","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1185,"output_tokens":366,"cache_read_input_tokens":201472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"f59e9670-5eb2-4724-8e42-b49e0afeed37"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-295a0733-5896-42f1-8094-4445c7967670-119","content":"{\"type\":\"BackgroundTaskStarted\",\"task_id\":\"8f0c6fb5-1dde-4eb0-a1ea-8e8634ddb109\",\"task_type\":\"bash\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e%2Fwork/01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c/terminal/call-295a0733-5896-42f1-8094-4445c7967670-119.log\",\"status\":\"running\",\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108\\\" && node tests/run.mjs rules\",\"summary\":\"Background task 8f0c6fb5-1dde-4eb0-a1ea-8e8634ddb109 started\",\"retrieval_hint\":\"Use get_command_or_subagent_output with task_ids=[\\\"8f0c6fb5-1dde-4eb0-a1ea-8e8634ddb109\\\"] when you need the output.\",\"pid\":94147}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"4632c098-4247-4766-aa8a-9652ddd5b84c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_476","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Updating the exit interview text while rules run.\n\nConfirmed the fourth critical bug. Updating testing feedback to six issues total, with four game-breaking bugs and two test harness mistakes.\n\nThe missing rounded-rect call caused pills, the scale, and the activity card to vanish. The star-gate matrix revealed Tray Service, Laundry Line, and tier-2 expert reps scoring too low. The two harness failures were not game bugs. I will combine these findings into one honest answer.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7c3a1de9-5e29-49e9-b297-1437df07f440-120","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"5. Testing caught five issues. Three were game bugs in activity scoring. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\",\n    \"3. Three were game-breaking. Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps finished under their star gates until fixed. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\",\n    \"The star-gate matrix across all 12 activities and both tiers, driven from the real start. It showed Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps scoring too low.\",","new_string":"    \"6. Testing caught six issues. Four were game bugs: Tray Service scoring, Laundry Line scoring, tier-2 expert reps, and every screen draw throwing because engine 0.89 has no E.px.round. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\",\n    \"4. Four were game-breaking. The three scoring bugs finished under their star gates, and the missing rounded rect meant the pills, the scale, and the activity card never appeared. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\",\n    \"Reading the built page's pixels. The rules suite stayed green while every draw threw on E.px.round and the picture was only the room. The star-gate matrix was the other check that mattered: it showed Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps scoring too low.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7c3a1de9-5e29-49e9-b297-1437df07f440-121","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"Yes. input.tap ignores a press while the last tap of that action is still held, so two confirms on back-to-back frames drop the second. game.go fades for 0.22 seconds unless fadeTime is 0. Setting headless to false in a vm with no document throws inside fullscreen and skips scene enter. A custom input map replaces the whole preset. Mouse movement does not change lastDevice.\",","new_string":"    \"Yes. Engine 0.89 has no E.px.round, which the 0.88 recipes use, so every draw threw and the HUD never appeared. input.tap ignores a press while the last tap of that action is still held. game.go fades for 0.22 seconds unless fadeTime is 0. Setting headless to false in a vm with no document throws inside fullscreen and skips scene enter. A custom input map replaces the whole preset. Mouse movement does not change lastDevice.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7c3a1de9-5e29-49e9-b297-1437df07f440-122","name":"get_command_or_subagent_output","input":{"task_ids":["8f0c6fb5-1dde-4eb0-a1ea-8e8634ddb109"],"timeout_ms":180000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":669,"output_tokens":1003,"cache_read_input_tokens":202624,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"6c686296-6324-4eab-80c5-ba6c96712b42"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7c3a1de9-5e29-49e9-b297-1437df07f440-120","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"5. Testing caught five issues. Three were game bugs in activity scoring. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\\\",\\n    \\\"3. Three were game-breaking. Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps finished under their star gates until fixed. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\\\",\\n    \\\"The star-gate matrix across all 12 activities and both tiers, driven from the real start. It showed Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps scoring too low.\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"6. Testing caught six issues. Four were game bugs: Tray Service scoring, Laundry Line scoring, tier-2 expert reps, and every screen draw throwing because engine 0.89 has no E.px.round. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\\\",\\n    \\\"4. Four were game-breaking. The three scoring bugs finished under their star gates, and the missing rounded rect meant the pills, the scale, and the activity card never appeared. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\\\",\\n    \\\"Reading the built page's pixels. The rules suite stayed green while every draw threw on E.px.round and the picture was only the room. The star-gate matrix was the other check that mattered: it showed Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps scoring too low.\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"5. Testing caught five issues. Three were game bugs in activity scoring. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\\\",\\n    \\\"3. Three were game-breaking. Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps finished under their star gates until fixed. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\\\",\\n    \\\"The star-gate matrix across all 12 activities and both tiers, driven from the real start. It showed Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps scoring too low.\\\",\",\"old_line\":20,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"6. Testing caught six issues. Four were game bugs: Tray Service scoring, Laundry Line scoring, tier-2 expert reps, and every screen draw throwing because engine 0.89 has no E.px.round. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\\\",\\n    \\\"4. Four were game-breaking. The three scoring bugs finished under their star gates, and the missing rounded rect meant the pills, the scale, and the activity card never appeared. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\\\",\\n    \\\"Reading the built page's pixels. The rules suite stayed green while every draw threw on E.px.round and the picture was only the room. The star-gate matrix was the other check that mattered: it showed Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps scoring too low.\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"Asserting each of the 12 section 3 seeds on its own. Single seeds swing past the band while the mean of those seeds stays inside it, and the Lean was left as shipped.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"engineFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7c3a1de9-5e29-49e9-b297-1437df07f440-121","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Yes. input.tap ignores a press while the last tap of that action is still held, so two confirms on back-to-back frames drop the second. game.go fades for 0.22 seconds unless fadeTime is 0. Setting headless to false in a vm with no document throws inside fullscreen and skips scene enter. A custom input map replaces the whole preset. Mouse movement does not change lastDevice.\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Yes. Engine 0.89 has no E.px.round, which the 0.88 recipes use, so every draw threw and the HUD never appeared. input.tap ignores a press while the last tap of that action is still held. game.go fades for 0.22 seconds unless fadeTime is 0. Setting headless to false in a vm with no document throws inside fullscreen and skips scene enter. A custom input map replaces the whole preset. Mouse movement does not change lastDevice.\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Yes. input.tap ignores a press while the last tap of that action is still held, so two confirms on back-to-back frames drop the second. game.go fades for 0.22 seconds unless fadeTime is 0. Setting headless to false in a vm with no document throws inside fullscreen and skips scene enter. A custom input map replaces the whole preset. Mouse movement does not change lastDevice.\\\",\",\"old_line\":27,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Yes. Engine 0.89 has no E.px.round, which the 0.88 recipes use, so every draw threw and the HUD never appeared. input.tap ignores a press while the last tap of that action is still held. game.go fades for 0.22 seconds unless fadeTime is 0. Setting headless to false in a vm with no document throws inside fullscreen and skips scene enter. A custom input map replaces the whole preset. Mouse movement does not change lastDevice.\\\",\",\"new_line\":27,\"context_before\":\"  ],\\n  \\\"engineFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"Headless play. game.advance, input.tap, scenes, and game.debug.snapshot let the rules suite drive the shipped game without a browser.\\\",\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"The Lean: one centre of balance, with noise, pushes, stumble, and steadiness, plus the bots that play every activity through that same input.\\\",\\n    \\\"Input timing in tests, and keeping one skill model honest across twelve activities whose scoring all read that Lean.\\\",\\n    \\\"Dialog text shadow can now be null. It was hard-coded to a dark colour, which hid text on the light retreat panels. Nothing else in the engine was changed.\\\",\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7c3a1de9-5e29-49e9-b297-1437df07f440-122","content":"{\"type\":\"TaskOutput\",\"Result\":{\"task_id\":\"8f0c6fb5-1dde-4eb0-a1ea-8e8634ddb109\",\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108\\\" && node tests/run.mjs rules\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"exit_code\":0,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T08:03:58Z\",\"ended\":\"2026-11-05T08:04:18Z\",\"duration_secs\":19.996930275,\"output\":\"14 passed, 0 failed\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmi