{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_484","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"12Gi of memory is available. Three sibling Chrome headless instances are running.\n\nRunning the full test suite now. It should take two to three minutes. I'll wait up to seven minutes for it to finish.\n\nChecking the draw scenes test. It should pass now that draws throw on failure. The title screenshot may be taken before the boot splash hides, which would leave the screen darkened.\n\nThe title test checks the game snapshot, not the screenshot pixels. The HUD should add enough painted pixels to pass the 30-pixel diff threshold.\n\nThe test waits for the title scene in game state, but the screenshot may still be darkened by the boot splash. I need to check whether the splash hides before the image is captured.\n\nThe boot splash likely hides after 400 milliseconds. The test should wait for the splash to disappear in game state before capturing the title screenshot. This avoids darkened images and uses DOM state instead of wall-clock time.\n\nI will inspect the boot splash timing in the engine and review the draw scenes test. The title screenshot fix is a test change, not a game change.\n\nI'll launch the full suite in the background and prepare a static handoff script to run after it finishes. I'm also reading TASK.md and PROGRESS.md to verify all requirements are covered.\n\nLaunched the full test suite in the background. I'll monitor the log with a lightweight watcher that only alerts when actionable progress appears, since the output is sparse.\n\nThe test log places the warning at the start and the final count at the end. I will tail suite-progress to track completion.\n\nLaunching Chromium alongside three existing headless instances should be safe with 12Gi of memory available. If earlyoom kills the process, I will retry once.\n\nI need to check whether the title screenshot waits for the boot splash to hide before capturing. If the test needs a fix, I will apply it now rather than rerunning the full suite.\n\nThe title screenshot is captured immediately after the title scene loads. The boot splash overlay is DOM-based and not painted to the canvas, so it will not darken the image. No test change is needed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3c9bca80-8399-4c8b-b246-b943c42b952d-15","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"e3-boot|_finish|BOOT","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108","glob":"*.{js,mjs,html}","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3c9bca80-8399-4c8b-b246-b943c42b952d-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/PROGRESS.md","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3c9bca80-8399-4c8b-b246-b943c42b952d-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hand-in|exit-interview|PROGRESS|About|feedback","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/TASK.md","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":48305,"output_tokens":1862,"cache_read_input_tokens":6656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"f8431dee-490a-4b10-828e-ea8ca5031d80"}
