{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_491","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"session.js matches the upstream version exactly.\n\nI will delete the temporary session-upstream.js file after recording the comparison result in the static log. I also spotted a bug in the About pages: feedback lines already start with \"6. \" and \"4. \", but the renderer prefixes \"(i+1). \", causing duplicate numbering like \"1. 6. Testing caught...\" that does not match the JSON.\n\nI will fix the About page renderer to display the JSON strings exactly, removing the extra index prefix.\n\nSource fields already include their names, so that wording is acceptable. The feedback lines still need the extra index prefix removed.\n\nI cannot edit world.js now. The rules tests already loaded the old scripts via vm, and the browser rebuild will use the current files. I must wait until the suite finishes before applying any fixes.\n\nI will read the suite-progress file to check the suite's current state. This avoids polling and ensures I do not race a test that is actively reading files.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-710d5748-b0d2-4a61-ba7c-840efd756a56-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":1084,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-710d5748-b0d2-4a61-ba7c-840efd756a56-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/suite-progress.txt","offset":1,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2253,"output_tokens":1211,"cache_read_input_tokens":73600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"4608457c-4f5c-4bca-ac6a-37477526f