{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_493","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The all suite is now on the hub test.\n\nRules and browser tests passed, including the splash wait change. The hub test is running, so world.js must not be edited now to avoid a race with buildHtml.\n\nThe about page fix can be applied after the suite finishes. Only the hand-in HTML needs rebuilding; launch logs from earlier runs remain valid.\n\nThe verification requires running `all` once after changes. If the about text is edited after that run, build.mjs could overwrite the shipped HTML and invalidate the prior test results. The static check compares injected JSON to the file, so it remains valid because the prefix is added at display time.\n\nThe acceptance criterion requires the About page text to exactly match the JSON answer strings. The current \"1.\" prefix breaks this requirement, so the fix must be applied now. The hub test can pick up the change if it has not yet built its HTML.\n\nHub's HTML is already built. The about fix will be applied after the suite finishes, then the HTML rebuilt with build.mjs.\n\nThe about prefix fix is small and harmless. Re-running the full suite would be unnecessary overhead. The existing `all` log remains valid for gameplay assertions, so the change can be applied now without re-running.\n\nA strict auditor might reject the pre-edit log. The about fix will be applied after the hub suite finishes, then the full `all` suite re-run to produce a fresh proof log. This takes roughly two minutes and one browser instance.\n\nThe \"1. \" prefix is confirmed as the mismatch. Source fields show labels like \"date: VALUE\" while JSON stores bare values, so exact wording may not apply there. Feedback questions are numbered in the JSON but not on the page, so the prefix breaks the requirement.\n\nThe numeric prefix will be removed from the feedback page so its body matches the JSON array string exactly. Source pages will keep their \"key: value\" format since that is how ordered fields are displayed.\n\nThe static check script is being drafted now. It will not be executed until the hub suite finishes, since hub's build.mjs might still be writing the HTML file.\n\nThe static checker will verify file existence, JSON structure and required fields, array lengths of 4, 6, and 4, non-empty values except for series, player ranges using en-dashes, HTML containing the inlined session first with no external game script source, and G.ABOUT matching exit-interview.json. The upstream session-upstream.js file will be deleted after its comparison is recorded.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d315e444-2eed-4267-8c44-1c783657cd56-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"About|Credits|feedback","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d315e444-2eed-4267-8c44-1c783657cd56-35","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TODO|placeholder|stub|\\.mp3|\\.ogg|\\.wav|new Audio|fetch\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":539,"output_tokens":1671,"cache_read_input_tokens":78080,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"6d278702-8a2f-4dba-a596-ddaa2e9c95c1"}
