{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_494","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The build script injects exit-interview JSON into the page as G.\n\nThe rendered screen shows a line prefix that does not match the file. The test answers also include extra numbering. I will wait for the suite to finish before editing to avoid racing the hub build. The static check script verifies built HTML rather than rendered text.\n\nI will write the static check script now so it is ready for the fix. The source page uses `k + ': ' + value`, which means field labels like \"date:\" are required by the ordering rule and do not count as a prefix mismatch. I may also add a node test that loads the game to verify about pages directly.\n\nThe feedback prefix \"1.\" will be removed from the answers. I will read the launch log and title screenshot to verify the HUD is visible.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ba635357-2606-49d2-b468-ea18456861aa-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/launch-1.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ba635357-2606-49d2-b468-ea18456861aa-37","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/title-1920x1080.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2882,"output_tokens":593,"cache_read_input_tokens":78592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"e2a1a415-5c49-430d-aa33-46a7887e6730"}
