ntent\":\"  /** press a key or button code ('KeyJ', 'Mouse0', 'Pad0', 'Act:attack') as if the person did: scripted input,\"},{\"line_number\":1304,\"content\":\"  Mouse0: 'Left click', Mouse1: 'Middle click', Mouse2: 'Right click', Mouse3: 'Mouse 4', Mouse4: 'Mouse 5', Backquote: '`', Minus: '-', Equal: '=', BracketLeft: '[',\"},{\"line_number\":1311,\"content\":\"  attack: ['KeyJ', 'KeyX', 'Mouse0', 'Pad0', 'Pad7'], dash: ['Space', 'ShiftLeft', 'ShiftRight', 'KeyK', 'Pad1', 'Pad6'],\"},{\"line_number\":1317,\"content\":\"  jump: ['Space', 'KeyZ', 'KeyK', 'Pad0'], attack: ['KeyX', 'KeyJ', 'Mouse0', 'Pad2'], dash: ['ShiftLeft', 'ShiftRight', 'KeyC', 'KeyL', 'Pad1', 'Pad5'],\"},{\"line_number\":1326,\"content\":\"  attack: ['KeyJ', 'Mouse0', 'Pad2'], block: ['KeyK', 'Mouse2', 'Pad4'], dodge: ['KeyL', 'Pad5'], use: ['KeyQ', 'Pad6'], map: ['KeyM', 'Tab', 'Pad8'], ...MENU_KEYS\"},{\"line_number\":1331,\"content\":\"  fire: ['Space', 'KeyZ', 'KeyJ', 'Mouse0', 'Pad0', 'Pad7'], bomb: ['KeyX', 'KeyK', 'Mouse2', 'Pad1', 'Pad6'], ...MENU_KEYS\"},{\"line_number\":11107,\"content\":\"  _view(k) { const q = Math.round(k * 16) / 16; let v = this._views.get(q); if (!v) { v = new E.View('click', 'Click', 0, 20, q * 1.5, 1); this._views.set(q, v); } return v; }\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"bb8e3f69-1de3-4000-900b-091407f8cd1d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_504","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"MENU_KEYS likely maps Enter and possibly Mouse0 to confirm.\n\nThe \"Enter / Enter\" label likely misread \"Enter / Left click\" from the image. The vision model probably mistook the longer \"Left click\" text for a duplicate \"Enter\".\n\nThe prompt wording will remain unchanged. The next step is removing the \"1. \" prefix from exact wording to match the JSON.\n\nInstitute text will be moved to y=64 in the sky with #20404c. A rebuild and `all` run will overwrite tests-all.log to match verification requirements. The pale rectangle in the title screenshot may come from E.font.title drawing a huge background, a leftover boot splash, or an oversized dialog panel.\n\nThe pale box likely comes from E.font.title drawing a banner at y=18. It covers the upper-middle behind the subtitle. The institute line sits below it on the water. Moving the institute to y=64 should place it inside or just below that box for contrast. I need to search paintRoom and font.title to find the source of this semi-transparent wash.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ae42f231-4404-482e-9a00-e62109e074c1-53","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fillStyle|rgba\\(255|panel|banner|#ffffff88|globalAlpha","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/rigs.js","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ae42f231-4404-482e-9a00-e62109e074c1-54","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function title|title\\(g","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1138,"output_tokens":780,"cache_read_input_tokens":96512,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"sessio