{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_509","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The monitor's MARK is set after a 2-second sleep, so it may miss the run's start. That is acceptable because it only reads content that appears after the mark.\n\nA failure during the 2-second sleep before the mark would be missed. A later failure would appear after the mark and be caught. The log is overwritten by each run, so stale \"passed\" lines from prior runs could make the monitor falsely report completion.\n\nThe shell truncates the log file when opening it for output, so stale \"passed\" lines are removed before the monitor begins. The two-second sleep occurs after that truncation, ensuring the monitor only sees content from the current run.\n\nThe monitor has a bug. It exits with code 0 when it finds \"passed,\" even if the line also contains \"failed\". It should exit 1 if the test count is wrong.\n\nThe runner writes FAIL lines to progress immediately, so failures appear before the final count line. The monitor checks the log first; if the suite finished, it exits 0 and echoes the last line, which will show the failure count. The \"DONE\" label is slightly misleading but acceptable.\n\nWhile waiting for the monitor, I will prepare PROGRESS.md content and review the goal plan to be ready to flip checkboxes. I also want to verify the G.ABOUT regex against the current HTML, since that HTML was generated before my about string change.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2a749917-3feb-4f47-acad-4cfb7e178e2c-65","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"node --input-type=module -e '\nimport { readFileSync } from \"node:fs\";\nconst html = readFileSync(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108.html\",\"utf8\");\nconst m = html.match(/G\\.ABOUT = (\\{[\\s\\S]*?\\n  \\}\\n);/);\nconsole.log(\"match\", !!m, \"len\", m && m[1].length);\nif (m) {\n  const about = JSON.parse(m[1]);\n  const interview = JSON.parse(readFileSync(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json\",\"utf8\"));\n  console.log(\"equal\", JSON.stringify(about)===JSON.stringify(interview));\n  console.log(\"tail\", JSON.stringify(m[1].slice(-40)));\n} else {\n  const i = html.indexOf(\"G.ABOUT\");\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(html.slice(i, i+80)));\n  console.log(\"---end---\");\n  const j = html.indexOf(\"\\\"tags\\\"\");\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(html.slice(j, j+180)));\n}\n'","description":"Check that the About JSON regex matches the built page"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1235,"output_tokens":1183,"cache_read_input_tokens":105856,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"d5594180-e990-45fd-a9e6-ad9e0f751447"}
