es; winning gives -1 Spine Age and her line: \\\"Well done, dear. I've been waiting since Thursday.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":295,\"content\":\"**Performance is not a goal.** Your brief treats the budget as unlimited, with frame rates and optimization out of scope: add the detail, crowd, particles and lights a scene wants, and don't spend time optimizing.\"},{\"line_number\":421,\"content\":\"**Comfort:** use `game.shake` / `game.flash`, which follow the settings. Pausing is standard; every activity scene is `pausable: true`.\"},{\"line_number\":448,\"content\":\"**Tools:** jump to any scene/activity/tier/day; finish now with N stars; unlock all; +10 minutes; set Spine Age; reset this member; no stumbles; bot plays (poor/average/good/expert); show Plate trace and numbers; frame step; force attract; **Pose Viewer** (pick any clip, scrub, print a pose row for `game/data/poses.js`); log `game.debug.snapshot()` to the console. Hidden in a hub session.\"},{\"line_number\":481,\"content\":\"- **Randomness:** every activity takes its disturbances from `AIHub.rng('e' + eventIndex)` (and a seeded `E.rng` offline). `Math.random` is only for cosmetics like particles and blinks, because copies draw it at different rates.\"},{\"line_number\":631,\"content\":\"| M8 | Full attract, full Dev Mode with Pose Viewer, About screen, tier 2s, Comfort, polish pass (particles, stamps, rumble, transitions: `game.go` with `fade: 'iris'`) | All groups green |\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"78bae6b3-b387-40ea-b8dd-0ac0f646e1af"}
