{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_520","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"poseMode is toggled but never read.\n\npose and poseT are initialized but never used. The Pose Viewer is missing its required clip scrubbing and pose row printing. The current test suite will pass without it, so implementation can wait.\n\nEditing ui.js now could break a running rules test if it reads the file mid-write. The browser and hub builds will snapshot the new code, but the missing pose viewer is dev-only and untested.\n\nWaiting for the suite to finish is the safer path. A mid-write corruption during build.mjs is possible, so a full re-run would be required after adding the pose viewer.\n\nI will wait for the suite to finish before implementing the pose viewer. I need to study how clips and poses are structured so I can build it quickly afterward. I also noticed that toolAct reads this.tool but never increments it.\n\nThe tool selection bug is confirmed. `this.tool` never increments, so only the first tool can be activated. Left and right controls adjust the slider instead of switching tools.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-36a747f6-6596-4a69-92dc-5c4986f58109-77","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"dev\\.tool|this\\.tool","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":488,"output_tokens":770,"cache_read_input_tokens":115840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"602d53c9-fffc-4fbd-bbb4-ba846971788c"}
