{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_526","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will implement the pose viewer in ui.js draw and update.\n\nPose mode will be toggled by toolAct 11 and reset poseI and poseT. In update, up and down will change the clip index while left and right scrub poseT. Confirm prints the pose row and cancel exits pose mode without closing the panel. The rig will be cached on G.dev._rig, and draw will render the puppet with the clip name and time.\n\nThe printed pose row will be formatted with the clip name, start time, end time, and target angle. It will appear on screen as well as in the console. Scrubbing is bounded from 0 to the clip duration.\n\nCancel exits pose mode first, then closes the panel. In draw, the rig will be sampled and rendered on the right side of the panel during pose mode. I am also adding helper functions to retrieve clip names from the library, fit clips, or local poses.\n\n`currentClip` returns the active clip from the library or a default object. `printPose` rounds poseT and the end time to two decimals, and sanitizes the clip name into a valid key.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3997e048-a60f-437e-865e-836957c937dc-88","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"dev\\.draw|dev\\.update|dev\\.open","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3262,"output_tokens":1189,"cache_read_input_tokens":124928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"aaec1a9b-2e62-4c12-9df3-27398b246955"}
