{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_531","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Headless games might not call draw.\n\nThe dev test passes without drawing. Headless draw errors are caught. I'll run the \"dev sliders\" filter first for speed, then all tests. I confirmed input.repeat exists. poseMode early-returns prevent retry reset.\n\nArrow key presses map correctly to the down action. Confirm taps register as expected. The dev update runs after the scene update, so returning early from it does not skip the scene.\n\nDown presses in pose mode may move title pills, but the test only checks pose state so this is harmless. The planned test sequence opens the panel, releases the slider, enters pose mode, presses down and right and confirm, asserts the result, then exits pose mode.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3707b954-e3d5-4605-a269-aa996982264a-93","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/tests/run.mjs","offset":1,"limit":60}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":716,"output_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":134272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"8b579f89-8a58-4d1b-a865-d69c8a5db43a"}
