{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_541","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed the MENU confirm key bindings exclude mouse buttons.\n\nFixed the prompt label in G.prompt. If the keyboard and mouse labels are identical, it now shows only one label. If no mouse binding exists, it displays \"Click\" instead of duplicating \"Enter\".\n\nRe-running the full test suite is necessary to refresh stale HTML and screenshots. The prompt will show \"Enter / Click Choose\".\n\nThe prompt should display only the last active device's label. Before any input, the keyboard is last used, so the chip reads \"Enter Choose\". This avoids the duplicate label and matches the launch test behavior.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The menu prompt prints Enter twice, because confirm has no mouse binding and the mouse label falls back to the same key. I'll show Click for that case."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-70b0b6da-a8f9-46c3-8515-834cc72b29dd-113","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/ui.js","old_string":"    else if (I.lastDevice === 'gamepad') chip = I.label(action) + (verb ? '  ' + verb : '');\n    else chip = I.label(action, 'keyboard') + ' / ' + I.label(action, 'mouse') + (verb ? '  ' + verb : '');","new_string":"    else if (I.lastDevice === 'gamepad') chip = I.label(action) + (verb ? '  ' + verb : '');\n    else if (I.lastDevice === 'mouse') {\n      const mouse = I.label(action, 'mouse');\n      const key = I.label(action, 'keyboard');\n      chip = (mouse && mouse !== key ? mouse : 'Click') + (verb ? '  ' + verb : '');\n    } else {\n      const key = I.label(action, 'keyboard');\n      const mouse = I.label(action, 'mouse');\n      const click = mouse && mouse !== key ? mouse : 'Click';\n      chip = key + ' / ' + click + (verb ? '  ' + verb : '');\n    }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1831,"output_tokens":973,"cache_read_input_tokens":147712,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"a44ad0ee-11fb-4157-b409-6d8d48fac031"}
