{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_552","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The node process has only the Python HTTP server as a child.\n\nThe node process is hung. It has no live browser child, so it is stuck waiting on a promise that never settles. I will kill the server processes and rerun the tests to get a fresh log with zero failures.\n\nI will kill the node process first, then the server if it survives. I will check memory and Chrome count before deciding whether to run hub only or all tests. The earlier hub pass likely succeeded because the machine was less loaded.\n\nThe browser was likely OOM-killed, which caused the node client to hang instead of timing out. I will check memory and Chrome count after killing the hung processes. If contention remains high, I will wait for fewer sibling Chrome instances before retrying.\n\nThe prompt fix is already in the source, so the HTML on disk should contain the Click prompt. The launch logs and screenshots from this run are valid because they completed before the hang. I will check the title PNG after killing the process to confirm it shows Click. The tests-all.log still lacks a failure count because the hung process has not exited; a completed run is required to capture that.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8c283829-2f93-4011-a419-9b88713f5e51-126","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"kill 142768\nsleep 1\nif kill -0 142768 2>/dev/null; then echo STILL_NODE; kill -9 142768; else echo NODE_STOPPED; fi\nsleep 0.5\nif kill -0 145020 2>/dev/null; then echo STILL_SERVER; kill 145020; else echo SERVER_STOPPED; fi\nsleep 0.3\nps -p 142768,145020 -o pid,stat,cmd || echo gone\nfree -h | head -2\necho \"chrome heads $(ps -eo args | awk '/chrome-headless-shell|chrome-linux64\\/chrome / && !/--type=/ && !/awk/ {c++} END{print c+0}')\"","description":"Stop the hung suite and its server by PID"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":852,"output_tokens":820,"cache_read_input_tokens":161024,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"ccb24904-cbdc-4f9b-874a-b7ccb9cd1e9c"}
