{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_557","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All checks passed. Static analysis succeeded and launch results are consistent.\n\nMilestones M0 through M9 are now checked off in PROGRESS.md. Temporary diagnostic and tuning scripts are being deleted, along with session-upstream.js. Logs, images, JSON files, gates.txt, check-output, and suite-progress will be kept.\n\nScratch files created during the conversation will be deleted, but captured logs and check-output screenshots remain as evidence. The final reply must include the four feedback blocks verbatim from the JSON.\n\nHTML, dev folder, and exit-interview are confirmed present in the work root. The milestone section of PROGRESS.md will be replaced with all boxes checked. Only the seven task checklist items in the goal plan will be marked complete. The monitor task has already exited.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6394814d-a001-425c-a66e-7dfe5bdec0e8-133","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/PROGRESS.md","old_string":"- [ ] M0 fetch, build, tests, boot\n- [ ] M1 Lean + Stork Stand\n- [ ] M2 day loop\n- [ ] M3 stillness + strength\n- [ ] M4 cardio\n- [ ] M5 balance games\n- [ ] M6 story, ending, audio\n- [ ] M7 class + hub\n- [ ] M8 attract, dev, about\n- [ ] M9 bundle + exit interview","new_string":"- [x] M0 fetch, build, tests, boot\n- [x] M1 Lean + Stork Stand\n- [x] M2 day loop\n- [x] M3 stillness + strength\n- [x] M4 cardio\n- [x] M5 balance games\n- [x] M6 story, ending, audio\n- [x] M7 class + hub\n- [x] M8 attract, dev, about\n- [x] M9 bundle + exit interview"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6394814d-a001-425c-a66e-7dfe5bdec0e8-134","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e%2Fwork/01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c/goal/plan.md","old_string":"- [ ] Fetch the handoff, hub client, and clip set; add the build and `tests/run.mjs`; boot a file:// page with the session wrapper, themed shell, and music at 0.1.\n- [ ] Implement Lean, device intent, bots, the plate, rigs, the scale, and Stork Stand until the section 3 bands hold on stick, keys, and mouse.\n- [ ] Add title, member, arrival, island day loop, body check, saves, Spine Age, Gerald, and a dev panel with live Lean sliders.\n- [ ] Add the other eleven activities and tier 2, including Eyes Closed, until every tier’s star gates pass.\n- [ ] Write the five-day script, Gentle Games, duel, ending, free play, line bank, and all synthesized music, effects, and voices; pass the scripted playthrough.\n- [ ] Add local Class and the hub Morning Class round; pass the five harness cases and a standalone title launch.\n- [ ] Finish attract, full dev mode, About, the single HTML, and `exit-interview.json`; run `node tests/run.mjs all` and keep the two launch logs.","new_string":"- [x] Fetch the handoff, hub client, and clip set; add the build and `tests/run.mjs`; boot a file:// page with the session wrapper, themed shell, and music at 0.1.\n- [x] Implement Lean, device intent, bots, the plate, rigs, the scale, and Stork Stand until the section 3 bands hold on stick, keys, and mouse.\n- [x] Add title, member, arrival, island day loop, body check, saves, Spine Age, Gerald, and a dev panel with live Lean sliders.\n- [x] Add the other eleven activities and tier 2, including Eyes Closed, until every tier’s star gates pass.\n- [x] Write the five-day script, Gentle Games, duel, ending, free play, line bank, and all synthesized music, effects, and voices; pass the scripted playthrough.\n- [x] Add local Class and the hub Morning Class round; pass the five harness cases and a standalone title launch.\n- [x] Finish attract, full dev mode, About, the single HTML, and `exit-interview.json`; run `node tests/run.mjs all` and k