{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_565","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking whether bandTrial simulates lean physics or hardcodes expected band values.\n\nActivity scoring produces identical scores across different skill levels. The paint check threshold of 30 is too weak; the screenshot shows substantial paint, but the diff logic samples every 16 bytes.\n\nThe paint check samples every 4th pixel. A diff of 32160 out of 32400 means nearly all sampled pixels differ from the background, confirming substantial paint. The launch evidence looks solid. I will check suite-progress.txt and check-mjs.log to verify the full test run, including hub tests.\n\nInvestigating whether activities auto-complete with high scores regardless of input, or if bots play identically across skill levels. Also checking if large time steps in game.advance skip physics simulation, and whether hashRun and bandTrial contain bugs. Reviewing playthrough traces to confirm the story is genuine. The browser tests may be missing WASD controls, mouse hover, and Xbox glyphs despite covering touch and pad stubs.\n\nCriterion 5 explicitly requires keyboard and mouse support in the browser group. The current browser tests only cover engine checks, file launch with pad stubs, and touch notice. Keyboard and mouse lean is tested separately in rules via input.hold and mouse feed, but Criterion 5 expects it to be verified within the browser suite itself.\n\nThe verification plan lists \"file:// browser checks\" but does not explicitly require keyboard and mouse tests within the browser group. Criterion 5 is a single paragraph, so the plan's enumerated outcomes may not fully capture its intent.\n\nSearching for existing tests covering hover focus and xbox glyphs. Criterion 5 requires driving the real shipped game from its actual start, not a mocked or reimplemented Lean. I need to verify whether bandTrial uses the same physics as the live game.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9e858f3-241e-4057-a9b4-2d12677e2044-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"bandTrial|hashRun|function stepLean|stumble|advance\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9e858f3-241e-4057-a9b4-2d12677e2044-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/suite-progress.txt","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9e858f3-241e-4057-a9b4-2d12677e2044-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/check-mjs.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9e858f3-241e-4057-a9b4-2d12677e2044-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/play-good.json","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6663,"output_tokens":1273,"cache_read_input_tokens":62464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"ebc96610-fd48-49bb-a3c0-0dedfba184c8"}
