{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6be61388-4f93-485f-8caf-28d3733cb0b4-25","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"269→OK data lint\\n270→START rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\nSTART browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\nOK five harness cases and standalone title\\n\\nRUN all  2026-11-05T08:19:25.914Z\\n280→START rules boot smoke\\nOK boot smoke\\nSTART rules section 3 bands\\nOK section 3 bands\\nSTART rules device lean\\nOK device lean\\nSTART rules good playthrough\\nOK good playthrough\\nSTART rules passive playthrough\\nOK passive playthrough\\n290→START rules star gates\\nOK star gates\\nSTART rules saves\\nOK saves\\nSTART rules determinism\\nOK determinism\\nSTART rules attract at 10s\\nOK attract at 10s\\nSTART rules dev sliders\\nOK dev sliders\\n300→START rules local class\\nOK local class\\nSTART rules fake hub\\nOK fake hub\\nSTART rules data lint\\nOK data lint\\nSTART rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\n310→START browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\n\\nRUN all  2026-11-05T08:30:27.881Z\\nSTART rules boot smoke\\nOK boot smoke\\nSTART rules section 3 bands\\nOK section 3 bands\\nSTART rules device lean\\n320→OK device lean\\nSTART rules good playthrough\\nOK good playthrough\\nSTART rules passive playthrough\\nOK passive playthrough\\nSTART rules star gates\\nOK star gates\\nSTART rules saves\\nOK saves\\nSTART rules determinism\\n330→OK determinism\\nSTART rules attract at 10s\\nOK attract at 10s\\nSTART rules dev sliders\\nOK dev sliders\\nSTART rules local class\\nOK local class\\nSTART rules fake hub\\nOK fake hub\\nSTART rules data lint\\n340→OK data lint\\nSTART rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\nSTART browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\nOK five harness cases and standalone title\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"269→OK data lint\\n270→START rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\nSTART browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\nOK five harness cases and standalone title\\n\\nRUN all  2026-11-05T08:19:25.914Z\\n280→START rules boot smoke\\nOK boot smoke\\nSTART rules section 3 bands\\nOK section 3 bands\\nSTART rules device lean\\nOK device lean\\nSTART rules good playthrough\\nOK good playthrough\\nSTART rules passive playthrough\\nOK passive playthrough\\n290→START rules star gates\\nOK star gates\\nSTART rules saves\\nOK saves\\nSTART rules determinism\\nOK determinism\\nSTART rules attract at 10s\\nOK attract at 10s\\nSTART rules dev sliders\\nOK dev sliders\\n300→START rules local class\\nOK local class\\nSTART rules fake hub\\nOK fake hub\\nSTART rules data lint\\nOK data lint\\nSTART rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\n310→START browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\n\\nRUN all  2026-11-05T08:30:27.881Z\\nSTART rules boot smoke\\nOK boot smoke\\nSTART rules section 3 bands\\nOK section 3 bands\\nSTART rules device lean\\n320→OK device lean\\nSTART rules good playthrough\\nOK good playthrough\\nSTART rules passive playthrough\\nOK passive playthrough\\nSTART rules star gates\\nOK star gates\\nSTART rules saves\\nOK saves\\nSTART rules determinism\\n330→OK determinism\\nSTART rules attract at 10s\\nOK attract at 10s\\nSTART rules dev sliders\\nOK dev sliders\\nSTART rules local class\\nOK local class\\nSTART rules fake hub\\nOK fake hub\\nSTART rules data lint\\n340→OK data lint\\nSTART rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\nSTART browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\nOK five harness cases and standalone title\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/suite-progress.txt\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"OK data lint\\nSTART rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\nSTART browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\nOK five harness cases and standalone title\\n\\nRUN all  2026-11-05T08:19:25.914Z\\nSTART rules boot smoke\\nOK boot smoke\\nSTART rules section 3 bands\\nOK section 3 bands\\nSTART rules device lean\\nOK device lean\\nSTART rules good playthrough\\nOK good playthrough\\nSTART rules passive playthrough\\nOK passive playthrough\\nSTART rules star gates\\nOK star gates\\nSTART rules saves\\nOK saves\\nSTART rules determinism\\nOK determinism\\nSTART rules attract at 10s\\nOK attract at 10s\\nSTART rules dev sliders\\nOK dev sliders\\nSTART rules local class\\nOK local class\\nSTART rules fake hub\\nOK fake hub\\nSTART rules data lint\\nOK data lint\\nSTART rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\nSTART browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\n\\nRUN all  2026-11-05T08:30:27.881Z\\nSTART rules boot smoke\\nOK boot smoke\\nSTART rules section 3 bands\\nOK section 3 bands\\nSTART rules device lean\\nOK device lean\\nSTART rules good playthrough\\nOK good playthrough\\nSTART rules passive playthrough\\nOK passive playthrough\\nSTART rules star gates\\nOK star gates\\nSTART rules saves\\nOK saves\\nSTART rules determinism\\nOK determinism\\nSTART rules attract at 10s\\nOK attract at 10s\\nSTART rules dev sliders\\nOK dev sliders\\nSTART rules local class\\nOK local class\\nSTART rules fake hub\\nOK fake hub\\nSTART rules data lint\\nOK data lint\\nSTART rules draw scenes\\nOK draw scenes\\nSTART browser engine check and file launch\\nOK engine check and file launch\\nSTART browser touch notice\\nOK touch notice\\nSTART hub five harness cases and standalone title\\nOK five harness cases and standalone title\\n\",\"total_lines\":348}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6be61388-4f93-485f-8caf-28d3733cb0b4-26","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/* Lean: one heavy body on an unstable board. The section 3 trial and every activity share this step. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  G.BOTS = {\\n    poor: { tau: .34, gain: 1.1, damp: .22, noise: .16 },\\n    average: { tau: .25, gain: 1.4, damp: .30, noise: .08 },\\n10→    good: { tau: .18, gain: 1.8, damp: .36, noise: .04 },\\n    expert: { tau: .14, gain: 2.2, damp: .42, noise: .02 }\\n  };\\n  G.SETS = {\\n    body: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 3, nf: 1.1, R: .20, push: null, band: { passive: 50, poor: 76, average: 99, good: 100 } },\\n    sun: { k: 12, c: 6, s: 6, A: 3.2, nf: 1.3, R: .28, push: [.5, 9], band: { passive: 53, poor: 78, average: 99, good: 100 } },\\n    stork1: { k: 12, c: 5, s: 13, A: 3, nf: 1.5, R: .24, push: [.6, 7], band: { passive: 20, poor: 30, average: 68, good: 95 } },\\n    stork2: { k: 11, c: 4.5, s: 15, A: 3.6, nf: 1.7, R: .22, push: [.7, 6], band: { passive: 22, poor: 15, average: 29, good: 54 } },\\n    candle: { k: 10, c: 5, s: 11, A: 1.4, nf: .8, R: .20, push: [.55, 5], band: { passive: 14, poor: 59, average: 95, good: 100 } },\\n    laundry: { k: 10, c: 3.5, s: 16, A: 3.5, nf: 1.2, R: .40, push: [.9, 5], band: { passive: 35, poor: 31, average: 39, good: 79 } }\\n20→  };\\n  const noise = (rng, f) => {\\n    const ph = [rng() * 6.28, rng() * 6.28, rng() * 6.28];\\n    return t => (Math.sin(t * f + ph[0]) + .6 * Math.sin(t * f * 1.73 + ph[1]) + .35 * Math.sin(t * f * 2.61 + ph[2])) / 1.3;\\n  };\\n  function live(set, raw) {\\n    const d = !raw && G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v : null;\\n    return {\\n      k: set.k * (d ? d.k : 1),\\n      c: set.c * (d ? d.c : 1),\\n30→      s: set.s * (d ? d.s : 1),\\n      A: set.A * (d ? d.A : 1),\\n      nf: set.nf * (d ? d.nf : 1),\\n      R: set.R * (d ? d.ring : 1),\\n      pushMul: d ? d.push : 1,\\n      stumbleAt: d ? d.stumble : 1\\n    };\\n  }\\n  class Balance {\\n    constructor(set, seed, o) {\\n40→      o = o || {};\\n      this.set = set;\\n      this.raw = !!o.raw;\\n      this.skill = o.skill || null;\\n      this.cheat = !!o.cheat;\\n      this.seed = seed >>> 0;\\n      const rng = E.rng(this.seed);\\n      const L0 = live(set, true);\\n      this.nx = noise(rng, L0.nf);\\n      this.ny = noise(rng, L0.nf * 1.07);\\n50→      this.rng = rng;\\n      this.push = set.push ? set.push.slice() : null;\\n      this.pushT = this.push ? rng() * this.push[1] : 0;\\n      this.pushLeft = 0; this.pfx = 0; this.pfy = 0;\\n      this.px = 0; this.py = 0; this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n      this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0;\\n      this.hist = [];\\n      this.stumble = 0; this.falls = 0; this.inside = 0; this.frames = 0; this.t = 0;\\n      this.trail = [];\\n      if (this.skill) {\\n60→        const br = E.rng((this.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n        const b = G.BOTS[this.skill];\\n        this.bnx = noise(br, .35); this.bny = noise(br, .35 * 1.17); this.bot = b;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    /* One fixed step. ux, uy are the player's lean (ignored while a skill bot owns the body, and while stumbling).\\n       fx, fy are extra pushes (a gull, a gust, a thought) on top of the table's periodic push.\\n       c is the ring centre. Steadiness counts a frame only when not stumbling and inside the ring, after the step.\\n       The last stumble frame can count: stumble is decremented first. */\\n    step(dt, ux, uy, fx, fy, c) {\\n70→      dt = dt || DT;\\n      fx = fx || 0; fy = fy || 0;\\n      const cx = c ? c.x || 0 : 0, cy = c ? c.y || 0 : 0;\\n      const L = live(this.set, this.raw);\\n      this.hist.push({ x: this.px, y: this.py, vx: this.vx, vy: this.vy });\\n      if (this.hist.length > 90) this.hist.shift();\\n      if (this.holdP) {\\n        this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0; this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n      } else if (this.stumble > 0) {\\n        this.stumble -= dt;\\n80→        this.px += (0 - this.px) * Math.min(1, 3 * dt);\\n        this.py += (0 - this.py) * Math.min(1, 3 * dt);\\n        this.vx *= Math.max(0, 1 - 8 * dt);\\n        this.vy *= Math.max(0, 1 - 8 * dt);\\n        this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0;\\n      } else {\\n        if (this.skill && this.bot) {\\n          const lag = Math.max(0, this.hist.length - 1 - Math.round(this.bot.tau / dt));\\n          const seen = this.hist[Math.min(this.hist.length - 1, lag)];\\n          const tx = cx - this.bot.gain * (seen.x - cx) - this.bot.damp * seen.vx + this.bot.noise * this.bnx(this.t);\\n90→          const ty = cy - this.bot.gain * (seen.y - cy) - this.bot.damp * seen.vy + this.bot.noise * this.bny(this.t);\\n          const a = Math.min(1, dt * 16);\\n          this.ux += (tx - this.ux) * a; this.uy += (ty - this.uy) * a;\\n          const m = Math.hypot(this.ux, this.uy);\\n          if (m > 1) { this.ux /= m; this.uy /= m; }\\n          ux = this.ux; uy = this.uy;\\n        } else { this.ux = ux || 0; this.uy = uy || 0; }\\n        let pfx = fx, pfy = fy;\\n        if (this.push) {\\n          const speed = this.push[0] * L.pushMul, every = this.push[1];\\n100→          this.pushT += dt;\\n          let use = false, bx = 0, by = 0;\\n          if (this.pushLeft > 0) { this.pushLeft -= dt; use = true; bx = this.pfx; by = this.pfy; }\\n          if (this.pushT >= every) {\\n            this.pushT -= every;\\n            const ang = this.rng() * Math.PI * 2;\\n            this.pushLeft = .6;\\n            this.pfx = Math.cos(ang) * speed * 2;\\n            this.pfy = Math.sin(ang) * speed * 2;\\n            use = true; bx = this.pfx; by = this.pfy;\\n110→          }\\n          if (use) { pfx += bx; pfy += by; }\\n        }\\n        const dmul = !this.raw && G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v : null;\\n        const dk = dmul ? dmul.k : 1, dc = dmul ? dmul.c : 1, ds = dmul ? dmul.s : 1;\\n        const kx = (this.set.kx != null ? this.set.kx : this.set.k) * dk, ky = (this.set.ky != null ? this.set.ky : this.set.k) * dk;\\n        const cdx = (this.set.cx != null ? this.set.cx : this.set.c) * dc, cdy = (this.set.cy != null ? this.set.cy : this.set.c) * dc;\\n        const sx = (this.set.sx != null ? this.set.sx : this.set.s) * ds, sy = (this.set.sy != null ? this.set.sy : this.set.s) * ds;\\n        const ax = kx * (this.ux - this.px) - cdx * this.vx + sx * this.px + L.A * this.nx(this.t) + pfx;\\n        const ay = ky * (this.uy - this.py) - cdy * this.vy + sy * this.py + L.A * this.ny(this.t) + pfy;\\n120→        this.vx += ax * dt; this.vy += ay * dt; this.px += this.vx * dt; this.py += this.vy * dt;\\n        if (!this.cheat && Math.hypot(this.px, this.py) >= L.stumbleAt) {\\n          this.stumble = 1; this.falls++;\\n          this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n          const h = Math.hypot(this.px, this.py) || 1; this.px /= h; this.py /= h;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      const dx = this.px - cx, dy = this.py - cy;\\n      if (this.stumble <= 0 && Math.hypot(dx, dy) < L.R) this.inside++;\\n      this.frames++;\\n130→      this.t += dt;\\n      this.trail.push({ x: this.px, y: this.py });\\n      if (this.trail.length > 120) this.trail.shift();\\n      return this;\\n    }\\n    get steadiness() { return this.frames ? this.inside / this.frames : 0; }\\n    get p() { return { x: this.px, y: this.py }; }\\n    get v() { return { x: this.vx, y: this.vy }; }\\n  }\\n  G.Balance = Balance;\\n140→  /* 45 s, the section 3 seeds. skill 'passive' holds still. raw constants, so a live slider cannot move the table. */\\n  G.bandTrial = function (name, skill, seed) {\\n    const set = G.SETS[name];\\n    const b = new Balance(set, seed >>> 0, { skill: !skill || skill === 'passive' ? null : skill, raw: true });\\n    const n = Math.round(45 / DT);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) b.step(DT, 0, 0);\\n    return { pct: b.inside / n * 100, falls: b.falls };\\n  };\\n  /* Same seed and the same scripted lean, twice: a hash of the shipped step, not a second copy of it. */\\n  G.hashRun = function (seed) {\\n150→    const R = E.rng(seed >>> 0);\\n    const b = new Balance(G.SETS.stork1, (seed * 13 + 7) >>> 0, { raw: true });\\n    let h = 2166136261;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 2400; i++) {\\n      const u = (R() * 2 - 1) * .8, v = (R() * 2 - 1) * .8;\\n      b.step(DT, u, v);\\n      h = Math.imul(h ^ ((Math.round(b.px * 500) + 8000) & 65535), 16777619);\\n      h = Math.imul(h ^ ((Math.round(b.py * 500) + 8000) & 65535), 16777619);\\n    }\\n    return h >>> 0;\\n160→  };\\n  G.gentleSet = function (set, on) {\\n    if (!on) return set;\\n    return Object.assign({}, set, { R: set.R * 1.25, s: set.s * .7, A: set.A * .7 });\\n  };\\n})();\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/* Lean: one heavy body on an unstable board. The section 3 trial and every activity share this step. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  G.BOTS = {\\n    poor: { tau: .34, gain: 1.1, damp: .22, noise: .16 },\\n    average: { tau: .25, gain: 1.4, damp: .30, noise: .08 },\\n10→    good: { tau: .18, gain: 1.8, damp: .36, noise: .04 },\\n    expert: { tau: .14, gain: 2.2, damp: .42, noise: .02 }\\n  };\\n  G.SETS = {\\n    body: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 3, nf: 1.1, R: .20, push: null, band: { passive: 50, poor: 76, average: 99, good: 100 } },\\n    sun: { k: 12, c: 6, s: 6, A: 3.2, nf: 1.3, R: .28, push: [.5, 9], band: { passive: 53, poor: 78, average: 99, good: 100 } },\\n    stork1: { k: 12, c: 5, s: 13, A: 3, nf: 1.5, R: .24, push: [.6, 7], band: { passive: 20, poor: 30, average: 68, good: 95 } },\\n    stork2: { k: 11, c: 4.5, s: 15, A: 3.6, nf: 1.7, R: .22, push: [.7, 6], band: { passive: 22, poor: 15, average: 29, good: 54 } },\\n    candle: { k: 10, c: 5, s: 11, A: 1.4, nf: .8, R: .20, push: [.55, 5], band: { passive: 14, poor: 59, average: 95, good: 100 } },\\n    laundry: { k: 10, c: 3.5, s: 16, A: 3.5, nf: 1.2, R: .40, push: [.9, 5], band: { passive: 35, poor: 31, average: 39, good: 79 } }\\n20→  };\\n  const noise = (rng, f) => {\\n    const ph = [rng() * 6.28, rng() * 6.28, rng() * 6.28];\\n    return t => (Math.sin(t * f + ph[0]) + .6 * Math.sin(t * f * 1.73 + ph[1]) + .35 * Math.sin(t * f * 2.61 + ph[2])) / 1.3;\\n  };\\n  function live(set, raw) {\\n    const d = !raw && G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v : null;\\n    return {\\n      k: set.k * (d ? d.k : 1),\\n      c: set.c * (d ? d.c : 1),\\n30→      s: set.s * (d ? d.s : 1),\\n      A: set.A * (d ? d.A : 1),\\n      nf: set.nf * (d ? d.nf : 1),\\n      R: set.R * (d ? d.ring : 1),\\n      pushMul: d ? d.push : 1,\\n      stumbleAt: d ? d.stumble : 1\\n    };\\n  }\\n  class Balance {\\n    constructor(set, seed, o) {\\n40→      o = o || {};\\n      this.set = set;\\n      this.raw = !!o.raw;\\n      this.skill = o.skill || null;\\n      this.cheat = !!o.cheat;\\n      this.seed = seed >>> 0;\\n      const rng = E.rng(this.seed);\\n      const L0 = live(set, true);\\n      this.nx = noise(rng, L0.nf);\\n      this.ny = noise(rng, L0.nf * 1.07);\\n50→      this.rng = rng;\\n      this.push = set.push ? set.push.slice() : null;\\n      this.pushT = this.push ? rng() * this.push[1] : 0;\\n      this.pushLeft = 0; this.pfx = 0; this.pfy = 0;\\n      this.px = 0; this.py = 0; this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n      this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0;\\n      this.hist = [];\\n      this.stumble = 0; this.falls = 0; this.inside = 0; this.frames = 0; this.t = 0;\\n      this.trail = [];\\n      if (this.skill) {\\n60→        const br = E.rng((this.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n        const b = G.BOTS[this.skill];\\n        this.bnx = noise(br, .35); this.bny = noise(br, .35 * 1.17); this.bot = b;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    /* One fixed step. ux, uy are the player's lean (ignored while a skill bot owns the body, and while stumbling).\\n       fx, fy are extra pushes (a gull, a gust, a thought) on top of the table's periodic push.\\n       c is the ring centre. Steadiness counts a frame only when not stumbling and inside the ring, after the step.\\n       The last stumble frame can count: stumble is decremented first. */\\n    step(dt, ux, uy, fx, fy, c) {\\n70→      dt = dt || DT;\\n      fx = fx || 0; fy = fy || 0;\\n      const cx = c ? c.x || 0 : 0, cy = c ? c.y || 0 : 0;\\n      const L = live(this.set, this.raw);\\n      this.hist.push({ x: this.px, y: this.py, vx: this.vx, vy: this.vy });\\n      if (this.hist.length > 90) this.hist.shift();\\n      if (this.holdP) {\\n        this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0; this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n      } else if (this.stumble > 0) {\\n        this.stumble -= dt;\\n80→        this.px += (0 - this.px) * Math.min(1, 3 * dt);\\n        this.py += (0 - this.py) * Math.min(1, 3 * dt);\\n        this.vx *= Math.max(0, 1 - 8 * dt);\\n        this.vy *= Math.max(0, 1 - 8 * dt);\\n        this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0;\\n      } else {\\n        if (this.skill && this.bot) {\\n          const lag = Math.max(0, this.hist.length - 1 - Math.round(this.bot.tau / dt));\\n          const seen = this.hist[Math.min(this.hist.length - 1, lag)];\\n          const tx = cx - this.bot.gain * (seen.x - cx) - this.bot.damp * seen.vx + this.bot.noise * this.bnx(this.t);\\n90→          const ty = cy - this.bot.gain * (seen.y - cy) - this.bot.damp * seen.vy + this.bot.noise * this.bny(this.t);\\n          const a = Math.min(1, dt * 16);\\n          this.ux += (tx - this.ux) * a; this.uy += (ty - this.uy) * a;\\n          const m = Math.hypot(this.ux, this.uy);\\n          if (m > 1) { this.ux /= m; this.uy /= m; }\\n          ux = this.ux; uy = this.uy;\\n        } else { this.ux = ux || 0; this.uy = uy || 0; }\\n        let pfx = fx, pfy = fy;\\n        if (this.push) {\\n          const speed = this.push[0] * L.pushMul, every = this.push[1];\\n100→          this.pushT += dt;\\n          let use = false, bx = 0, by = 0;\\n          if (this.pushLeft > 0) { this.pushLeft -= dt; use = true; bx = this.pfx; by = this.pfy; }\\n          if (this.pushT >= every) {\\n            this.pushT -= every;\\n            const ang = this.rng() * Math.PI * 2;\\n            this.pushLeft = .6;\\n            this.pfx = Math.cos(ang) * speed * 2;\\n            this.pfy = Math.sin(ang) * speed * 2;\\n            use = true; bx = this.pfx; by = this.pfy;\\n110→          }\\n          if (use) { pfx += bx; pfy += by; }\\n        }\\n        const dmul = !this.raw && G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v : null;\\n        const dk = dmul ? dmul.k : 1, dc = dmul ? dmul.c : 1, ds = dmul ? dmul.s : 1;\\n        const kx = (this.set.kx != null ? this.set.kx : this.set.k) * dk, ky = (this.set.ky != null ? this.set.ky : this.set.k) * dk;\\n        const cdx = (this.set.cx != null ? this.set.cx : this.set.c) * dc, cdy = (this.set.cy != null ? this.set.cy : this.set.c) * dc;\\n        const sx = (this.set.sx != null ? this.set.sx : this.set.s) * ds, sy = (this.set.sy != null ? this.set.sy : this.set.s) * ds;\\n        const ax = kx * (this.ux - this.px) - cdx * this.vx + sx * this.px + L.A * this.nx(this.t) + pfx;\\n        const ay = ky * (this.uy - this.py) - cdy * this.vy + sy * this.py + L.A * this.ny(this.t) + pfy;\\n120→        this.vx += ax * dt; this.vy += ay * dt; this.px += this.vx * dt; this.py += this.vy * dt;\\n        if (!this.cheat && Math.hypot(this.px, this.py) >= L.stumbleAt) {\\n          this.stumble = 1; this.falls++;\\n          this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n          const h = Math.hypot(this.px, this.py) || 1; this.px /= h; this.py /= h;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      const dx = this.px - cx, dy = this.py - cy;\\n      if (this.stumble <= 0 && Math.hypot(dx, dy) < L.R) this.inside++;\\n      this.frames++;\\n130→      this.t += dt;\\n      this.trail.push({ x: this.px, y: this.py });\\n      if (this.trail.length > 120) this.trail.shift();\\n      return this;\\n    }\\n    get steadiness() { return this.frames ? this.inside / this.frames : 0; }\\n    get p() { return { x: this.px, y: this.py }; }\\n    get v() { return { x: this.vx, y: this.vy }; }\\n  }\\n  G.Balance = Balance;\\n140→  /* 45 s, the section 3 seeds. skill 'passive' holds still. raw constants, so a live slider cannot move the table. */\\n  G.bandTrial = function (name, skill, seed) {\\n    const set = G.SETS[name];\\n    const b = new Balance(set, seed >>> 0, { skill: !skill || skill === 'passive' ? null : skill, raw: true });\\n    const n = Math.round(45 / DT);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) b.step(DT, 0, 0);\\n    return { pct: b.inside / n * 100, falls: b.falls };\\n  };\\n  /* Same seed and the same scripted lean, twice: a hash of the shipped step, not a second copy of it. */\\n  G.hashRun = function (seed) {\\n150→    const R = E.rng(seed >>> 0);\\n    const b = new Balance(G.SETS.stork1, (seed * 13 + 7) >>> 0, { raw: true });\\n    let h = 2166136261;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 2400; i++) {\\n      const u = (R() * 2 - 1) * .8, v = (R() * 2 - 1) * .8;\\n      b.step(DT, u, v);\\n      h = Math.imul(h ^ ((Math.round(b.px * 500) + 8000) & 65535), 16777619);\\n      h = Math.imul(h ^ ((Math.round(b.py * 500) + 8000) & 65535), 16777619);\\n    }\\n    return h >>> 0;\\n160→  };\\n  G.gentleSet = function (set, on) {\\n    if (!on) return set;\\n    return Object.assign({}, set, { R: set.R * 1.25, s: set.s * .7, A: set.A * .7 });\\n  };\\n})();\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/balance.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/* Lean: one heavy body on an unstable board. The section 3 trial and every activity share this step. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  G.BOTS = {\\n    poor: { tau: .34, gain: 1.1, damp: .22, noise: .16 },\\n    average: { tau: .25, gain: 1.4, damp: .30, noise: .08 },\\n    good: { tau: .18, gain: 1.8, damp: .36, noise: .04 },\\n    expert: { tau: .14, gain: 2.2, damp: .42, noise: .02 }\\n  };\\n  G.SETS = {\\n    body: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 3, nf: 1.1, R: .20, push: null, band: { passive: 50, poor: 76, average: 99, good: 100 } },\\n    sun: { k: 12, c: 6, s: 6, A: 3.2, nf: 1.3, R: .28, push: [.5, 9], band: { passive: 53, poor: 78, average: 99, good: 100 } },\\n    stork1: { k: 12, c: 5, s: 13, A: 3, nf: 1.5, R: .24, push: [.6, 7], band: { passive: 20, poor: 30, average: 68, good: 95 } },\\n    stork2: { k: 11, c: 4.5, s: 15, A: 3.6, nf: 1.7, R: .22, push: [.7, 6], band: { passive: 22, poor: 15, average: 29, good: 54 } },\\n    candle: { k: 10, c: 5, s: 11, A: 1.4, nf: .8, R: .20, push: [.55, 5], band: { passive: 14, poor: 59, average: 95, good: 100 } },\\n    laundry: { k: 10, c: 3.5, s: 16, A: 3.5, nf: 1.2, R: .40, push: [.9, 5], band: { passive: 35, poor: 31, average: 39, good: 79 } }\\n  };\\n  const noise = (rng, f) => {\\n    const ph = [rng() * 6.28, rng() * 6.28, rng() * 6.28];\\n    return t => (Math.sin(t * f + ph[0]) + .6 * Math.sin(t * f * 1.73 + ph[1]) + .35 * Math.sin(t * f * 2.61 + ph[2])) / 1.3;\\n  };\\n  function live(set, raw) {\\n    const d = !raw && G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v : null;\\n    return {\\n      k: set.k * (d ? d.k : 1),\\n      c: set.c * (d ? d.c : 1),\\n      s: set.s * (d ? d.s : 1),\\n      A: set.A * (d ? d.A : 1),\\n      nf: set.nf * (d ? d.nf : 1),\\n      R: set.R * (d ? d.ring : 1),\\n      pushMul: d ? d.push : 1,\\n      stumbleAt: d ? d.stumble : 1\\n    };\\n  }\\n  class Balance {\\n    constructor(set, seed, o) {\\n      o = o || {};\\n      this.set = set;\\n      this.raw = !!o.raw;\\n      this.skill = o.skill || null;\\n      this.cheat = !!o.cheat;\\n      this.seed = seed >>> 0;\\n      const rng = E.rng(this.seed);\\n      const L0 = live(set, true);\\n      this.nx = noise(rng, L0.nf);\\n      this.ny = noise(rng, L0.nf * 1.07);\\n      this.rng = rng;\\n      this.push = set.push ? set.push.slice() : null;\\n      this.pushT = this.push ? rng() * this.push[1] : 0;\\n      this.pushLeft = 0; this.pfx = 0; this.pfy = 0;\\n      this.px = 0; this.py = 0; this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n      this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0;\\n      this.hist = [];\\n      this.stumble = 0; this.falls = 0; this.inside = 0; this.frames = 0; this.t = 0;\\n      this.trail = [];\\n      if (this.skill) {\\n        const br = E.rng((this.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n        const b = G.BOTS[this.skill];\\n        this.bnx = noise(br, .35); this.bny = noise(br, .35 * 1.17); this.bot = b;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    /* One fixed step. ux, uy are the player's lean (ignored while a skill bot owns the body, and while stumbling).\\n       fx, fy are extra pushes (a gull, a gust, a thought) on top of the table's periodic push.\\n       c is the ring centre. Steadiness counts a frame only when not stumbling and inside the ring, after the step.\\n       The last stumble frame can count: stumble is decremented first. */\\n    step(dt, ux, uy, fx, fy, c) {\\n      dt = dt || DT;\\n      fx = fx || 0; fy = fy || 0;\\n      const cx = c ? c.x || 0 : 0, cy = c ? c.y || 0 : 0;\\n      const L = live(this.set, this.raw);\\n      this.hist.push({ x: this.px, y: this.py, vx: this.vx, vy: this.vy });\\n      if (this.hist.length > 90) this.hist.shift();\\n      if (this.holdP) {\\n        this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0; this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n      } else if (this.stumble > 0) {\\n        this.stumble -= dt;\\n        this.px += (0 - this.px) * Math.min(1, 3 * dt);\\n        this.py += (0 - this.py) * Math.min(1, 3 * dt);\\n        this.vx *= Math.max(0, 1 - 8 * dt);\\n        this.vy *= Math.max(0, 1 - 8 * dt);\\n        this.ux = 0; this.uy = 0;\\n      } else {\\n        if (this.skill && this.bot) {\\n          const lag = Math.max(0, this.hist.length - 1 - Math.round(this.bot.tau / dt));\\n          const seen = this.hist[Math.min(this.hist.length - 1, lag)];\\n          const tx = cx - this.bot.gain * (seen.x - cx) - this.bot.damp * seen.vx + this.bot.noise * this.bnx(this.t);\\n          const ty = cy - this.bot.gain * (seen.y - cy) - this.bot.damp * seen.vy + this.bot.noise * this.bny(this.t);\\n          const a = Math.min(1, dt * 16);\\n          this.ux += (tx - this.ux) * a; this.uy += (ty - this.uy) * a;\\n          const m = Math.hypot(this.ux, this.uy);\\n          if (m > 1) { this.ux /= m; this.uy /= m; }\\n          ux = this.ux; uy = this.uy;\\n        } else { this.ux = ux || 0; this.uy = uy || 0; }\\n        let pfx = fx, pfy = fy;\\n        if (this.push) {\\n          const speed = this.push[0] * L.pushMul, every = this.push[1];\\n          this.pushT += dt;\\n          let use = false, bx = 0, by = 0;\\n          if (this.pushLeft > 0) { this.pushLeft -= dt; use = true; bx = this.pfx; by = this.pfy; }\\n          if (this.pushT >= every) {\\n            this.pushT -= every;\\n            const ang = this.rng() * Math.PI * 2;\\n            this.pushLeft = .6;\\n            this.pfx = Math.cos(ang) * speed * 2;\\n            this.pfy = Math.sin(ang) * speed * 2;\\n            use = true; bx = this.pfx; by = this.pfy;\\n          }\\n          if (use) { pfx += bx; pfy += by; }\\n        }\\n        const dmul = !this.raw && G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v : null;\\n        const dk = dmul ? dmul.k : 1, dc = dmul ? dmul.c : 1, ds = dmul ? dmul.s : 1;\\n        const kx = (this.set.kx != null ? this.set.kx : this.set.k) * dk, ky = (this.set.ky != null ? this.set.ky : this.set.k) * dk;\\n        const cdx = (this.set.cx != null ? this.set.cx : this.set.c) * dc, cdy = (this.set.cy != null ? this.set.cy : this.set.c) * dc;\\n        const sx = (this.set.sx != null ? this.set.sx : this.set.s) * ds, sy = (this.set.sy != null ? this.set.sy : this.set.s) * ds;\\n        const ax = kx * (this.ux - this.px) - cdx * this.vx + sx * this.px + L.A * this.nx(this.t) + pfx;\\n        const ay = ky * (this.uy - this.py) - cdy * this.vy + sy * this.py + L.A * this.ny(this.t) + pfy;\\n        this.vx += ax * dt; this.vy += ay * dt; this.px += this.vx * dt; this.py += this.vy * dt;\\n        if (!this.cheat && Math.hypot(this.px, this.py) >= L.stumbleAt) {\\n          this.stumble = 1; this.falls++;\\n          this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\\n          const h = Math.hypot(this.px, this.py) || 1; this.px /= h; this.py /= h;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      const dx = this.px - cx, dy = this.py - cy;\\n      if (this.stumble <= 0 && Math.hypot(dx, dy) < L.R) this.inside++;\\n      this.frames++;\\n      this.t += dt;\\n      this.trail.push({ x: this.px, y: this.py });\\n      if (this.trail.length > 120) this.trail.shift();\\n      return this;\\n    }\\n    get steadiness() { return this.frames ? this.inside / this.frames : 0; }\\n    get p() { return { x: this.px, y: this.py }; }\\n    get v() { return { x: this.vx, y: this.vy }; }\\n  }\\n  G.Balance = Balance;\\n  /* 45 s, the section 3 seeds. skill 'passive' holds still. raw constants, so a live slider cannot move the table. */\\n  G.bandTrial = function (name, skill, seed) {\\n    const set = G.SETS[name];\\n    const b = new Balance(set, seed >>> 0, { skill: !skill || skill === 'passive' ? null : skill, raw: true });\\n    const n = Math.round(45 / DT);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) b.step(DT, 0, 0);\\n    return { pct: b.inside / n * 100, falls: b.falls };\\n  };\\n  /* Same seed and the same scripted lean, twice: a hash of the shipped step, not a second copy of it. */\\n  G.hashRun = function (seed) {\\n    const R = E.rng(seed >>> 0);\\n    const b = new Balance(G.SETS.stork1, (seed * 13 + 7) >>> 0, { raw: true });\\n    let h = 2166136261;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 2400; i++) {\\n      const u = (R() * 2 - 1) * .8, v = (R() * 2 - 1) * .8;\\n      b.step(DT, u, v);\\n      h = Math.imul(h ^ ((Math.round(b.px * 500) + 8000) & 65535), 16777619);\\n      h = Math.imul(h ^ ((Math.round(b.py * 500) + 8000) & 65535), 16777619);\\n    }\\n    return h >>> 0;\\n  };\\n  G.gentleSet = function (set, on) {\\n    if (!on) return set;\\n    return Object.assign({}, set, { R: set.R * 1.25, s: set.s * .7, A: set.A * .7 });\\n  };\\n})();\\n\",\"total_lines\":165}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6be61388-4f93-485f-8caf-28d3733cb0b4-27","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"ImageContent\":{\"data\":\"\",\"mime_type\":\"image/png\"}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6be61388-4f93-485f-8caf-28d3733cb0b4-28","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"ImageContent\":{\"data\":\"\",\"mime_type\":\"image/png\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"05265802-0726-4187-b021-1b0315cd9861"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_567","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The island screenshot is concerning.\n\nThe island scene appears to start as a menu overlay with activity choices, not a walkable tile map. The background matches the title beach backdrop rather than the described institute layout.\n\nThe island may be a menu-only scene rather than a walkable hub. The check script reported zero characters and zero draws, suggesting the tilemap failed to render. Activity scenes still draw correctly.\n\nThe island must be a walkable tilemap hub per PLAN.md. The objective is to implement every element specified in the plan.\n\nThe plate character appears custom-drawn rather than using the engine's mocap system. PLAN.md requires mocap clips and an engine Mocap player. The island scene code needs review before concluding it is only a menu.\n\nThe exit interview specifies an Engine Mocap player on a cut clip set, with the body following Lean rather than ignoring input. I need to inspect rigs.js to verify whether mocap is actually implemented. The island screenshot may have been captured before the tilemap rendered, or the map could be hidden behind an opaque panel.\n\nThe zero draw count may be expected for a dialog scene. The arrival scene is purely conversational and contains no entities. I will now inspect world.js island enter and draw logic, plus play.js activity kinds, to verify whether walking exists.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aa91b3a2-e969-4bcc-9e61-f40e3145a095-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"island|TileMap|threequarter|function draw|scene\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","head_limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aa91b3a2-e969-4bcc-9e61-f40e3145a095-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Mocap|FITCLIPS|new E\\.|TileMap|drawRig|function