{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_587","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Continuing work on the Spine Wee game.\n\nFound three scoring bugs to fix. Local Class only steps seat 0, so finish() copies that single score to every seat. readLean in boot.js only reads game.input, blocking second-pad input. Two humans must each receive the correct score.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The verifier found four real gaps: local Class scores only seat 0, Morning Class plays the good bot instead of the human, ghosts are names only, and several dev-panel controls never run. I'll wire those through the real input path and add tests that prove it."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c7a8e00-54d1-4842-8d3e-93ddc7f1f5b1-137","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"c1","content":"Per-seat Class lean and distinct scores","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"c2","content":"Morning Class human driver, not good bot","status":"pending"},{"id":"c3","content":"Draw translucent hub ghosts from lean","status":"pending"},{"id":"c4","content":"Dev panel jump, bot, trayFric, ropeS via input","status":"pending"},{"id":"c5","content":"Targeted tests then full suite and hand-in","status":"pending"}],"merge":false}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c7a8e00-54d1-4842-8d3e-93ddc7f1f5b1-138","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","offset":200,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c7a8e00-54d1-4842-8d3e-93ddc7f1f5b1-139","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/boot.js","offset":1,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c7a8e00-54d1-4842-8d3e-93ddc7f1f5b1-140","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-x