{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a6edfd71-999e-4c99-af3b-5507393f29c1-143","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\\n10→  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\\n\\n  function skillName(seat) {\\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\\n    if (!bal) return;\\n20→    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\\n    bal.skill = skill;\\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\\n    void br;\\n    bal.bot = b;\\n  }\\n30→\\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\\n40→      return;\\n    }\\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\\n    if (!skill) return;\\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel || 0;\\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\\n50→      /* Expert servos onto the bead. A fixed lead sits well on tier 1 and misses tier 2's fast rise. */\\n      let target = bead + lead * sign;\\n      const bal = seat.bal;\\n      if (skill === 'expert' && bal) {\\n        const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? (fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px) : -bal.py;\\n        const rate = fam.axis === 'x' ? (fam.side > 0 ? bal.vx : -bal.vx) : -bal.vy;\\n        const P = 2.6, D = 0.35;\\n        target = bead + P * (bead - depth) + D * (vel - rate);\\n      }\\n      target = clamp(target, -0.2, 1.25);\\n60→      if (fam.axis === 'x') {\\n        seat.ux = fam.side * target;\\n        seat.uy = skill === 'expert' && bal ? clamp(-bal.py * 1.6, -0.6, 0.6) : 0;\\n      } else {\\n        seat.uy = -target;\\n        seat.ux = skill === 'expert' && bal ? clamp(-bal.px * 1.6, -0.6, 0.6) : 0;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\\n70→      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\\n        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\\n80→      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\\n    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 36, -1, 1) * steer;\\n      seat.uy = 0;\\n90→    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\\n      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 1.2 && pin.dist > 0.08);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n100→  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\\n    return s;\\n  }\\n\\n  function repSet(axis) {\\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\\n110→    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\\n    return o;\\n  }\\n\\n  function holdCenter(t) {\\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\\n    const a = i * 2.4;\\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\\n  }\\n\\n120→  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n130→\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n140→    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n150→      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n160→      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n170→      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n180→  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n190→    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n200→    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\\n10→  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\\n\\n  function skillName(seat) {\\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\\n    if (!bal) return;\\n20→    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\\n    bal.skill = skill;\\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\\n    void br;\\n    bal.bot = b;\\n  }\\n30→\\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\\n40→      return;\\n    }\\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\\n    if (!skill) return;\\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel || 0;\\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\\n50→      /* Expert servos onto the bead. A fixed lead sits well on tier 1 and misses tier 2's fast rise. */\\n      let target = bead + lead * sign;\\n      const bal = seat.bal;\\n      if (skill === 'expert' && bal) {\\n        const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? (fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px) : -bal.py;\\n        const rate = fam.axis === 'x' ? (fam.side > 0 ? bal.vx : -bal.vx) : -bal.vy;\\n        const P = 2.6, D = 0.35;\\n        target = bead + P * (bead - depth) + D * (vel - rate);\\n      }\\n      target = clamp(target, -0.2, 1.25);\\n60→      if (fam.axis === 'x') {\\n        seat.ux = fam.side * target;\\n        seat.uy = skill === 'expert' && bal ? clamp(-bal.py * 1.6, -0.6, 0.6) : 0;\\n      } else {\\n        seat.uy = -target;\\n        seat.ux = skill === 'expert' && bal ? clamp(-bal.px * 1.6, -0.6, 0.6) : 0;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\\n70→      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\\n        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\\n80→      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\\n    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 36, -1, 1) * steer;\\n      seat.uy = 0;\\n90→    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\\n      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 1.2 && pin.dist > 0.08);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n100→  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\\n    return s;\\n  }\\n\\n  function repSet(axis) {\\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\\n110→    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\\n    return o;\\n  }\\n\\n  function holdCenter(t) {\\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\\n    const a = i * 2.4;\\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\\n  }\\n\\n120→  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n130→\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n140→    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n150→      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n160→      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n170→      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n180→  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n190→    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n200→    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":200,\"raw_output\":\"/* Every activity. One session walks the card, the demo, the count, the play, and the stamp. */\\nvar G = G || {};\\n(function () {\\n  'use strict';\\n  const E = My3D2dge;\\n  const DT = 1 / 120;\\n  const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n  const LEAD = { poor: -0.4, average: 0.05, good: 0.14, expert: 0.2 };\\n  const STEP_OFF = { poor: 0.1, average: 0.03, good: 0.015, expert: 0.008 };\\n  const EFFORT = { poor: 0.28, average: 0.5, good: 0.62, expert: 0.72 };\\n\\n  function skillName(seat) {\\n    const d = G.driver && G.driver !== 'human' ? G.driver : (seat && seat.skill);\\n    if (!d || d === 'passive' || d === 'human') return null;\\n    return G.BOTS[d] ? d : null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function arm(bal, skill) {\\n    if (!bal) return;\\n    if (!skill) { bal.skill = null; bal.bot = null; return; }\\n    if (bal.skill === skill && bal.bot) return;\\n    bal.skill = skill;\\n    const br = E.rng((bal.seed ^ 0x9e3779b9) >>> 0);\\n    const b = G.BOTS[skill];\\n    bal.bnx = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .35 + 1.1) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .35 * 1.73 + 2.2)) / 1.6; };\\n    bal.bny = function (t) { return (Math.sin(t * .41 + 0.4) + .6 * Math.sin(t * .41 * 1.17 + 1.7)) / 1.6; };\\n    void br;\\n    bal.bot = b;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* A seat's hands. A named skill drives the activity bots. A hold skill is applied on the balance itself. */\\n  function drive(seat, fam, dt) {\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const human = !skill && !(G.driver === 'passive' || (seat && seat.skill === 'passive'));\\n    if (human && seat && seat.local) {\\n      seat.ux = G.lean.ux; seat.uy = G.lean.uy;\\n      seat.breath = G.lean.breath; seat.effort = G.lean.effort;\\n      seat.jump = G.lean.jump; seat.catchL = G.lean.catchL; seat.catchR = G.lean.catchR;\\n      seat.paceL = G.lean.paceL; seat.paceR = G.lean.paceR;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    seat.ux = 0; seat.uy = 0; seat.breath = 0; seat.effort = 0;\\n    seat.jump = false; seat.catchL = false; seat.catchR = false; seat.paceL = false; seat.paceR = false;\\n    if (!skill) return;\\n    const kind = fam && fam.kind;\\n    if (kind === 'rep') {\\n      const lead = LEAD[skill];\\n      const bead = fam.bead, vel = fam.beadVel || 0;\\n      const sign = vel > 0.002 ? 1 : vel < -0.002 ? -1 : 0;\\n      /* Expert servos onto the bead. A fixed lead sits well on tier 1 and misses tier 2's fast rise. */\\n      let target = bead + lead * sign;\\n      const bal = seat.bal;\\n      if (skill === 'expert' && bal) {\\n        const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? (fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px) : -bal.py;\\n        const rate = fam.axis === 'x' ? (fam.side > 0 ? bal.vx : -bal.vx) : -bal.vy;\\n        const P = 2.6, D = 0.35;\\n        target = bead + P * (bead - depth) + D * (vel - rate);\\n      }\\n      target = clamp(target, -0.2, 1.25);\\n      if (fam.axis === 'x') {\\n        seat.ux = fam.side * target;\\n        seat.uy = skill === 'expert' && bal ? clamp(-bal.py * 1.6, -0.6, 0.6) : 0;\\n      } else {\\n        seat.uy = -target;\\n        seat.ux = skill === 'expert' && bal ? clamp(-bal.px * 1.6, -0.6, 0.6) : 0;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'sun') {\\n      seat.breath = fam.guide;\\n    } else if (kind === 'hoop') {\\n      const w = skill === 'poor' ? 4.2 : 9;\\n      fam.botPh = (fam.botPh || 0) + w * dt * (fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1);\\n      seat.ux = Math.cos(fam.botPh); seat.uy = Math.sin(fam.botPh);\\n      if (fam.toss && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) < 0.12) {\\n        if (fam.toss.side < 0) seat.catchL = true; else seat.catchR = true;\\n      }\\n    } else if (kind === 'jog') {\\n      const hz = skill === 'poor' ? 1.4 : 3.0;\\n      fam.footT = (fam.footT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (fam.footT >= 1 / hz) { fam.footT = 0; fam.foot = !fam.foot; fam.stepEdge = fam.foot ? 'L' : 'R'; }\\n      seat.paceL = fam.stepEdge === 'L'; seat.paceR = fam.stepEdge === 'R';\\n      const cup = fam.nextCup;\\n      seat.ux = cup ? clamp((cup.x - fam.x) / 1.2, -1, 1) : 0;\\n      seat.uy = 0.2;\\n    } else if (kind === 'slalom') {\\n      const gate = fam.nextGate;\\n      const err = gate ? gate.x - fam.x : 0;\\n      const steer = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.85 : 1;\\n      seat.ux = clamp(err / 36, -1, 1) * steer;\\n      seat.uy = 0;\\n    } else if (kind === 'tray') {\\n      const aim = skill === 'poor' ? 0.25 : skill === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    } else if (kind === 'laundry') {\\n      seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n      const pin = fam.pinAhead;\\n      seat.jump = !!(pin && pin.dist < 1.2 && pin.dist > 0.08);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function setOf(act, tier, gentle) {\\n    const name = act.set ? act.set[tier - 1] : null;\\n    let s = name && G.SETS[name] ? G.SETS[name] : { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 1.2, nf: 1, R: .3, push: null };\\n    if (gentle) s = G.gentleSet(s, true);\\n    return s;\\n  }\\n\\n  function repSet(axis) {\\n    const o = { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, A: 0.35, nf: 0.7, R: 0.55, push: null, kx: 16, ky: 16, cx: 8, cy: 8 };\\n    if (axis === 'x') { o.sx = 0; o.sy = 8; }\\n    else { o.sx = 8; o.sy = 0; }\\n    return o;\\n  }\\n\\n  function holdCenter(t) {\\n    const i = Math.floor(t / 12);\\n    const a = i * 2.4;\\n    return { x: Math.cos(a) * 0.06, y: Math.sin(a * 1.3) * 0.05 };\\n  }\\n\\n  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n\",\"total_lines\":753}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a6edfd71-999e-4c99-af3b-5507393f29c1-144","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"310→    if (!moved) fam.untouched += dt; else fam.untouched = 0;\\n    if (fam.untouched > 20 && !fam.said) { fam.said = true; G.subtitle = G.LINES.tare.filter(function (s) { return s.indexOf('controller') >= 0; })[0] || ''; }\\n    const mean = fam.flameSum / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * mean, 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.dead) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepRep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const prev = fam.bead;\\n320→    fam.bead = beadOf(fam.t, sess.tier);\\n    fam.beadVel = (fam.bead - prev) / dt;\\n    fam.side = (Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle) % 2 === 0) ? 1 : -1;\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    if (fam.doneReps === Math.floor(fam.planned * 0.6) && !fam.fatigued) {\\n      fam.fatigued = true;\\n      const mul = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.fatigue / 1.5 : 1;\\n      bal.set = Object.assign({}, bal.set, { A: bal.set.A * 1.5 * mul, k: bal.set.k * 0.8, kx: 16 * 0.8, ky: 16 * 0.8 });\\n    }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n330→    const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? clamp(fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px, 0, 1) : clamp(-bal.py, 0, 1);\\n    const tol = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.repTol : 0.08;\\n    fam.err += Math.abs(depth - fam.bead);\\n    fam.form += fam.axis === 'x' ? Math.abs(bal.py) : Math.abs(bal.px);\\n    fam.samples++;\\n    const cyc = Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle);\\n    if (cyc > fam.doneReps) {\\n      const meanErr = fam.err / Math.max(1, fam.samples);\\n      let sc = meanErr <= tol ? 1 : meanErr >= 0.35 ? 0 : (0.35 - meanErr) / (0.35 - tol);\\n      fam.scores.push(sc);\\n340→      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0;\\n      fam.doneReps = cyc;\\n      if (fam.doneReps === fam.planned && !fam.extra) {\\n        const mean = fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length;\\n        if (mean > 0.8) { fam.extra = true; fam.planned += 2; sess.limit += fam.cycle * 2; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const form = fam.form / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    const pen = clamp(form * 0.45, 0, 0.3);\\n    const mean = fam.scores.length ? fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length : 0;\\n350→    sess.pct = clamp(mean * (1 - pen), 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.doneReps >= fam.planned && fam.scores.length >= fam.planned) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepStep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, rh = fam.rh, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!rh) return;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill && !sess.classMode) {\\n      const off = STEP_OFF[skill] || 0.02;\\n360→      const pos = G.game.audio.pos;\\n      const spb = 60 / (pos.bpm || 100) / 4;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < rh.notes.length; i++) {\\n        const n = rh.notes[i];\\n        if (n.j || n.call || n._bot) continue;\\n        const ahead = (n.step - pos.step) * spb;\\n        if (ahead <= off) { n._bot = true; rh.hit(n.lane); }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    rh.update();\\n370→    const judged = rh.counts.perfect + rh.counts.great + rh.counts.good + rh.counts.miss;\\n    sess.pct = judged ? rh.accuracy : 0;\\n    if (rh.done) sess.ended = true;\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHoop(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const ux = seat.ux || 0, uy = seat.uy || 0;\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(ux, uy);\\n380→    let omega = 0;\\n    if (mag > 0.55) {\\n      const ang = Math.atan2(uy, ux);\\n      let d = ang - (fam.ang || 0);\\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n      if (fam.haveAng) omega = d / dt;\\n      fam.ang = ang; fam.haveAng = true;\\n    } else fam.haveAng = false;\\n    fam.omega = omega;\\n390→    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopLo : 7;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopHi : 11;\\n    const dir = fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1;\\n    const inBand = Math.abs(omega) >= lo && Math.abs(omega) <= hi && omega * dir > 0;\\n    if (inBand) { fam.band += dt; fam.out = 0; fam.score += dt * (1 + fam.hoops * 0.15); }\\n    else if (mag > 0.2) { fam.out += dt; if (fam.out > 1.5 && fam.hoops > 1) { fam.hoops--; fam.drops++; fam.out = 0; } }\\n    if (!fam.otherWay && fam.t >= sess.limit * 0.5) fam.otherWay = true;\\n    fam.tossT -= dt;\\n    if (fam.tossT <= 0) {\\n      fam.tossT = 8;\\n400→      fam.toss = { side: sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, eta: 1.1 };\\n    }\\n    if (fam.toss) {\\n      fam.toss.eta -= dt;\\n      const hit = fam.toss.side < 0 ? seat.catchL : seat.catchR;\\n      if (hit && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) <= 0.25) { fam.caught++; fam.hoops = Math.min(6, fam.hoops + 1); fam.toss = null; }\\n      else if (fam.toss.eta < -0.25) fam.toss = null;\\n    }\\n    const best = sess.limit * 1.4;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(fam.score / best, 0, 1);\\n410→  }\\n\\n  function stepJog(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const edgeL = seat.paceL && !fam.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = seat.paceR && !fam.prevR;\\n    fam.prevL = seat.paceL; fam.prevR = seat.paceR;\\n    if (edgeL || edgeR) { fam.steps++; fam.hist.push(fam.t); }\\n    while (fam.hist.length && fam.t - fam.hist[0] > 1) fam.hist.shift();\\n    fam.cad = fam.hist.length;\\n420→    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogLo : 2.6;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogHi : 3.4;\\n    const zoned = fam.cad >= lo && fam.cad <= hi && fam.stitch <= 0;\\n    if (zoned) fam.zone += dt;\\n    if (fam.cad > 4.2) fam.sprint += dt; else fam.sprint = 0;\\n    if (fam.sprint > 2 && fam.stitch <= 0) fam.stitch = 3;\\n    if (fam.stitch > 0) fam.stitch -= dt;\\n    const speed = (G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogSpeed : 1) * (zoned ? 8 : 3);\\n    fam.z += speed * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 1.6 * dt;\\n430→    const cups = [12, 28, 44, 58];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) {\\n      if (fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= cups[i] && fam.z - speed * dt < cups[i]) {\\n        const cx = (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8);\\n        if (Math.abs(fam.x - cx) < 0.45) { fam.cups++; fam.gotCup = fam.gotCup || {}; fam.gotCup[i] = true; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    fam.nextCup = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) if (!(fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) && fam.z < cups[i]) { fam.nextCup = { x: (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8), z: cups[i] }; break; }\\n440→    const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSlalom(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (fam.done) return;\\n    if (fam.tumble > 0) { fam.tumble -= dt; return; }\\n    const base = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiSpeed : 220;\\n    const turn = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiTurn : 1.6;\\n450→    let spd = base;\\n    if (seat.uy > 0.3) spd *= 1.35;\\n    if (seat.uy < -0.3) spd *= 0.6;\\n    fam.z += spd * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 78 * turn / 1.6 * dt;\\n    const gates = G.GATES;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) {\\n      const g = gates[i];\\n      if (fam.missed[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= g.z && fam.z - spd * dt < g.z) {\\n460→        fam.missed[i] = Math.abs(fam.x - g.x) > fam.half;\\n        if (fam.missed[i]) fam.pen += 3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < G.OBSTACLES.length; i++) {\\n      const o = G.OBSTACLES[i];\\n      if (fam.hitO && fam.hitO[i]) continue;\\n      if (Math.abs(fam.z - o.z) < 80 && Math.abs(fam.x - o.x) < 16) {\\n        fam.hitO = fam.hitO || {}; fam.hitO[i] = true; fam.tumble = 1.2; fam.pen += 1.2;\\n      }\\n470→    }\\n    let next = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) if (gates[i].z > fam.z - 20) { next = gates[i]; break; }\\n    fam.nextGate = next;\\n    if (fam.z >= fam.finish) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 90;\\n      const time = fam.t + fam.pen;\\n      sess.pct = clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n480→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepTray(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!seat.bal) {\\n      seat.bal = new G.Balance({ k: 14, c: 8, s: 1, A: 0.5, nf: 0.8, R: 0.4, push: null }, sess.seed, {});\\n    }\\n    const sk = skillName(seat);\\n    if (sk) {\\n490→      const aim = sk === 'poor' ? 0.25 : sk === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    }\\n    seat.bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const Gv = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayG : 420;\\n    if (fam.world) {\\n      if (fam.gecko) fam.gecko.moveTo(78, 100 + Math.sin(fam.t * 0.55) * 36, 0, 22, 0);\\n      fam.world.gravity = [seat.bal.px * Gv, -seat.bal.py * Gv];\\n      fam.world.wake();\\n      fam.world.step(dt);\\n500→      const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n      const need = spec ? spec.olives.length : 0;\\n      const gotHere = fam.got - fam.trayGot0;\\n      if (gotHere >= need) {\\n        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n510→    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n520→    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (!fam.rope) fam.rope = Object.assign({}, bal.set);\\n    /* Faster walking sways the rope. The set on the balance is a copy, so the band table stays put. */\\n    bal.set = Object.assign({}, fam.rope, { s: fam.rope.s + effort * 4 });\\n    fam.air -= dt;\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0.04) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n530→    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    /* One jump per pin, long enough to land past it. Air freezes the plate, not the walker. */\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0 && ahead && fam.cleared !== ahead.x && ahead.dist < 0.95) {\\n      fam.air = Math.min(0.85, ahead.dist / Math.max(0.45, spd) + 0.12);\\n      fam.cleared = ahead.x;\\n    }\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\\n    fam.gust -= dt;\\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\\n540→    let fx = 0;\\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\\n      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\\n    }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    /* A plate stumble is the rope moving under you. Only missing a pin walks you back to the post.\\n       The laundry set's average bot cannot stay up for a whole line; the band table says so, and that table stays. */\\n    let fell = false;\\n550→    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.18 && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (fell) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.cleared = -1; }\\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\\n    if (!fell) fam.x += spd * dt;\\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\\n      const time = fam.t;\\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n560→      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n570→    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function Session(opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n580→    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\\n    this.classMode = !!opts.classMode;\\n    this.seed = (opts.seed || 1) >>> 0;\\n    this.rng = E.rng(this.seed);\\n    this.phase = opts.skipToPlay ? 'count' : 'card';\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.playTime = 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"310→    if (!moved) fam.untouched += dt; else fam.untouched = 0;\\n    if (fam.untouched > 20 && !fam.said) { fam.said = true; G.subtitle = G.LINES.tare.filter(function (s) { return s.indexOf('controller') >= 0; })[0] || ''; }\\n    const mean = fam.flameSum / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * mean, 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.dead) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepRep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const prev = fam.bead;\\n320→    fam.bead = beadOf(fam.t, sess.tier);\\n    fam.beadVel = (fam.bead - prev) / dt;\\n    fam.side = (Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle) % 2 === 0) ? 1 : -1;\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    if (fam.doneReps === Math.floor(fam.planned * 0.6) && !fam.fatigued) {\\n      fam.fatigued = true;\\n      const mul = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.fatigue / 1.5 : 1;\\n      bal.set = Object.assign({}, bal.set, { A: bal.set.A * 1.5 * mul, k: bal.set.k * 0.8, kx: 16 * 0.8, ky: 16 * 0.8 });\\n    }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n330→    const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? clamp(fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px, 0, 1) : clamp(-bal.py, 0, 1);\\n    const tol = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.repTol : 0.08;\\n    fam.err += Math.abs(depth - fam.bead);\\n    fam.form += fam.axis === 'x' ? Math.abs(bal.py) : Math.abs(bal.px);\\n    fam.samples++;\\n    const cyc = Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle);\\n    if (cyc > fam.doneReps) {\\n      const meanErr = fam.err / Math.max(1, fam.samples);\\n      let sc = meanErr <= tol ? 1 : meanErr >= 0.35 ? 0 : (0.35 - meanErr) / (0.35 - tol);\\n      fam.scores.push(sc);\\n340→      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0;\\n      fam.doneReps = cyc;\\n      if (fam.doneReps === fam.planned && !fam.extra) {\\n        const mean = fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length;\\n        if (mean > 0.8) { fam.extra = true; fam.planned += 2; sess.limit += fam.cycle * 2; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const form = fam.form / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    const pen = clamp(form * 0.45, 0, 0.3);\\n    const mean = fam.scores.length ? fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length : 0;\\n350→    sess.pct = clamp(mean * (1 - pen), 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.doneReps >= fam.planned && fam.scores.length >= fam.planned) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepStep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, rh = fam.rh, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!rh) return;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill && !sess.classMode) {\\n      const off = STEP_OFF[skill] || 0.02;\\n360→      const pos = G.game.audio.pos;\\n      const spb = 60 / (pos.bpm || 100) / 4;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < rh.notes.length; i++) {\\n        const n = rh.notes[i];\\n        if (n.j || n.call || n._bot) continue;\\n        const ahead = (n.step - pos.step) * spb;\\n        if (ahead <= off) { n._bot = true; rh.hit(n.lane); }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    rh.update();\\n370→    const judged = rh.counts.perfect + rh.counts.great + rh.counts.good + rh.counts.miss;\\n    sess.pct = judged ? rh.accuracy : 0;\\n    if (rh.done) sess.ended = true;\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHoop(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const ux = seat.ux || 0, uy = seat.uy || 0;\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(ux, uy);\\n380→    let omega = 0;\\n    if (mag > 0.55) {\\n      const ang = Math.atan2(uy, ux);\\n      let d = ang - (fam.ang || 0);\\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n      if (fam.haveAng) omega = d / dt;\\n      fam.ang = ang; fam.haveAng = true;\\n    } else fam.haveAng = false;\\n    fam.omega = omega;\\n390→    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopLo : 7;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopHi : 11;\\n    const dir = fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1;\\n    const inBand = Math.abs(omega) >= lo && Math.abs(omega) <= hi && omega * dir > 0;\\n    if (inBand) { fam.band += dt; fam.out = 0; fam.score += dt * (1 + fam.hoops * 0.15); }\\n    else if (mag > 0.2) { fam.out += dt; if (fam.out > 1.5 && fam.hoops > 1) { fam.hoops--; fam.drops++; fam.out = 0; } }\\n    if (!fam.otherWay && fam.t >= sess.limit * 0.5) fam.otherWay = true;\\n    fam.tossT -= dt;\\n    if (fam.tossT <= 0) {\\n      fam.tossT = 8;\\n400→      fam.toss = { side: sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, eta: 1.1 };\\n    }\\n    if (fam.toss) {\\n      fam.toss.eta -= dt;\\n      const hit = fam.toss.side < 0 ? seat.catchL : seat.catchR;\\n      if (hit && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) <= 0.25) { fam.caught++; fam.hoops = Math.min(6, fam.hoops + 1); fam.toss = null; }\\n      else if (fam.toss.eta < -0.25) fam.toss = null;\\n    }\\n    const best = sess.limit * 1.4;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(fam.score / best, 0, 1);\\n410→  }\\n\\n  function stepJog(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const edgeL = seat.paceL && !fam.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = seat.paceR && !fam.prevR;\\n    fam.prevL = seat.paceL; fam.prevR = seat.paceR;\\n    if (edgeL || edgeR) { fam.steps++; fam.hist.push(fam.t); }\\n    while (fam.hist.length && fam.t - fam.hist[0] > 1) fam.hist.shift();\\n    fam.cad = fam.hist.length;\\n420→    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogLo : 2.6;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogHi : 3.4;\\n    const zoned = fam.cad >= lo && fam.cad <= hi && fam.stitch <= 0;\\n    if (zoned) fam.zone += dt;\\n    if (fam.cad > 4.2) fam.sprint += dt; else fam.sprint = 0;\\n    if (fam.sprint > 2 && fam.stitch <= 0) fam.stitch = 3;\\n    if (fam.stitch > 0) fam.stitch -= dt;\\n    const speed = (G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogSpeed : 1) * (zoned ? 8 : 3);\\n    fam.z += speed * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 1.6 * dt;\\n430→    const cups = [12, 28, 44, 58];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) {\\n      if (fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= cups[i] && fam.z - speed * dt < cups[i]) {\\n        const cx = (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8);\\n        if (Math.abs(fam.x - cx) < 0.45) { fam.cups++; fam.gotCup = fam.gotCup || {}; fam.gotCup[i] = true; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    fam.nextCup = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) if (!(fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) && fam.z < cups[i]) { fam.nextCup = { x: (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8), z: cups[i] }; break; }\\n440→    const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSlalom(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (fam.done) return;\\n    if (fam.tumble > 0) { fam.tumble -= dt; return; }\\n    const base = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiSpeed : 220;\\n    const turn = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiTurn : 1.6;\\n450→    let spd = base;\\n    if (seat.uy > 0.3) spd *= 1.35;\\n    if (seat.uy < -0.3) spd *= 0.6;\\n    fam.z += spd * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 78 * turn / 1.6 * dt;\\n    const gates = G.GATES;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) {\\n      const g = gates[i];\\n      if (fam.missed[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= g.z && fam.z - spd * dt < g.z) {\\n460→        fam.missed[i] = Math.abs(fam.x - g.x) > fam.half;\\n        if (fam.missed[i]) fam.pen += 3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < G.OBSTACLES.length; i++) {\\n      const o = G.OBSTACLES[i];\\n      if (fam.hitO && fam.hitO[i]) continue;\\n      if (Math.abs(fam.z - o.z) < 80 && Math.abs(fam.x - o.x) < 16) {\\n        fam.hitO = fam.hitO || {}; fam.hitO[i] = true; fam.tumble = 1.2; fam.pen += 1.2;\\n      }\\n470→    }\\n    let next = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) if (gates[i].z > fam.z - 20) { next = gates[i]; break; }\\n    fam.nextGate = next;\\n    if (fam.z >= fam.finish) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 90;\\n      const time = fam.t + fam.pen;\\n      sess.pct = clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n480→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepTray(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!seat.bal) {\\n      seat.bal = new G.Balance({ k: 14, c: 8, s: 1, A: 0.5, nf: 0.8, R: 0.4, push: null }, sess.seed, {});\\n    }\\n    const sk = skillName(seat);\\n    if (sk) {\\n490→      const aim = sk === 'poor' ? 0.25 : sk === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    }\\n    seat.bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const Gv = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayG : 420;\\n    if (fam.world) {\\n      if (fam.gecko) fam.gecko.moveTo(78, 100 + Math.sin(fam.t * 0.55) * 36, 0, 22, 0);\\n      fam.world.gravity = [seat.bal.px * Gv, -seat.bal.py * Gv];\\n      fam.world.wake();\\n      fam.world.step(dt);\\n500→      const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n      const need = spec ? spec.olives.length : 0;\\n      const gotHere = fam.got - fam.trayGot0;\\n      if (gotHere >= need) {\\n        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n510→    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n520→    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (!fam.rope) fam.rope = Object.assign({}, bal.set);\\n    /* Faster walking sways the rope. The set on the balance is a copy, so the band table stays put. */\\n    bal.set = Object.assign({}, fam.rope, { s: fam.rope.s + effort * 4 });\\n    fam.air -= dt;\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0.04) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n530→    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    /* One jump per pin, long enough to land past it. Air freezes the plate, not the walker. */\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0 && ahead && fam.cleared !== ahead.x && ahead.dist < 0.95) {\\n      fam.air = Math.min(0.85, ahead.dist / Math.max(0.45, spd) + 0.12);\\n      fam.cleared = ahead.x;\\n    }\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\\n    fam.gust -= dt;\\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\\n540→    let fx = 0;\\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\\n      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\\n    }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    /* A plate stumble is the rope moving under you. Only missing a pin walks you back to the post.\\n       The laundry set's average bot cannot stay up for a whole line; the band table says so, and that table stays. */\\n    let fell = false;\\n550→    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.18 && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (fell) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.cleared = -1; }\\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\\n    if (!fell) fam.x += spd * dt;\\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\\n      const time = fam.t;\\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n560→      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n570→    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function Session(opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n580→    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\\n    this.classMode = !!opts.classMode;\\n    this.seed = (opts.seed || 1) >>> 0;\\n    this.rng = E.rng(this.seed);\\n    this.phase = opts.skipToPlay ? 'count' : 'card';\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.playTime = 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js\",\"offset\":310,\"limit\":280,\"raw_output\":\"    if (!moved) fam.untouched += dt; else fam.untouched = 0;\\n    if (fam.untouched > 20 && !fam.said) { fam.said = true; G.subtitle = G.LINES.tare.filter(function (s) { return s.indexOf('controller') >= 0; })[0] || ''; }\\n    const mean = fam.flameSum / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.6 * bal.steadiness + 0.4 * mean, 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.dead) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepRep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const prev = fam.bead;\\n    fam.bead = beadOf(fam.t, sess.tier);\\n    fam.beadVel = (fam.bead - prev) / dt;\\n    fam.side = (Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle) % 2 === 0) ? 1 : -1;\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    if (fam.doneReps === Math.floor(fam.planned * 0.6) && !fam.fatigued) {\\n      fam.fatigued = true;\\n      const mul = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.fatigue / 1.5 : 1;\\n      bal.set = Object.assign({}, bal.set, { A: bal.set.A * 1.5 * mul, k: bal.set.k * 0.8, kx: 16 * 0.8, ky: 16 * 0.8 });\\n    }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const depth = fam.axis === 'x' ? clamp(fam.side > 0 ? bal.px : -bal.px, 0, 1) : clamp(-bal.py, 0, 1);\\n    const tol = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.repTol : 0.08;\\n    fam.err += Math.abs(depth - fam.bead);\\n    fam.form += fam.axis === 'x' ? Math.abs(bal.py) : Math.abs(bal.px);\\n    fam.samples++;\\n    const cyc = Math.floor(fam.t / fam.cycle);\\n    if (cyc > fam.doneReps) {\\n      const meanErr = fam.err / Math.max(1, fam.samples);\\n      let sc = meanErr <= tol ? 1 : meanErr >= 0.35 ? 0 : (0.35 - meanErr) / (0.35 - tol);\\n      fam.scores.push(sc);\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0;\\n      fam.doneReps = cyc;\\n      if (fam.doneReps === fam.planned && !fam.extra) {\\n        const mean = fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length;\\n        if (mean > 0.8) { fam.extra = true; fam.planned += 2; sess.limit += fam.cycle * 2; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const form = fam.form / Math.max(1, bal.frames);\\n    const pen = clamp(form * 0.45, 0, 0.3);\\n    const mean = fam.scores.length ? fam.scores.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) / fam.scores.length : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(mean * (1 - pen), 0, 1);\\n    if (fam.doneReps >= fam.planned && fam.scores.length >= fam.planned) sess.ended = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepStep(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, rh = fam.rh, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!rh) return;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill && !sess.classMode) {\\n      const off = STEP_OFF[skill] || 0.02;\\n      const pos = G.game.audio.pos;\\n      const spb = 60 / (pos.bpm || 100) / 4;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < rh.notes.length; i++) {\\n        const n = rh.notes[i];\\n        if (n.j || n.call || n._bot) continue;\\n        const ahead = (n.step - pos.step) * spb;\\n        if (ahead <= off) { n._bot = true; rh.hit(n.lane); }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    rh.update();\\n    const judged = rh.counts.perfect + rh.counts.great + rh.counts.good + rh.counts.miss;\\n    sess.pct = judged ? rh.accuracy : 0;\\n    if (rh.done) sess.ended = true;\\n    void dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHoop(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const ux = seat.ux || 0, uy = seat.uy || 0;\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(ux, uy);\\n    let omega = 0;\\n    if (mag > 0.55) {\\n      const ang = Math.atan2(uy, ux);\\n      let d = ang - (fam.ang || 0);\\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n      if (fam.haveAng) omega = d / dt;\\n      fam.ang = ang; fam.haveAng = true;\\n    } else fam.haveAng = false;\\n    fam.omega = omega;\\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopLo : 7;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.hoopHi : 11;\\n    const dir = fam.otherWay ? -1 : 1;\\n    const inBand = Math.abs(omega) >= lo && Math.abs(omega) <= hi && omega * dir > 0;\\n    if (inBand) { fam.band += dt; fam.out = 0; fam.score += dt * (1 + fam.hoops * 0.15); }\\n    else if (mag > 0.2) { fam.out += dt; if (fam.out > 1.5 && fam.hoops > 1) { fam.hoops--; fam.drops++; fam.out = 0; } }\\n    if (!fam.otherWay && fam.t >= sess.limit * 0.5) fam.otherWay = true;\\n    fam.tossT -= dt;\\n    if (fam.tossT <= 0) {\\n      fam.tossT = 8;\\n      fam.toss = { side: sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, eta: 1.1 };\\n    }\\n    if (fam.toss) {\\n      fam.toss.eta -= dt;\\n      const hit = fam.toss.side < 0 ? seat.catchL : seat.catchR;\\n      if (hit && Math.abs(fam.toss.eta) <= 0.25) { fam.caught++; fam.hoops = Math.min(6, fam.hoops + 1); fam.toss = null; }\\n      else if (fam.toss.eta < -0.25) fam.toss = null;\\n    }\\n    const best = sess.limit * 1.4;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(fam.score / best, 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepJog(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const edgeL = seat.paceL && !fam.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = seat.paceR && !fam.prevR;\\n    fam.prevL = seat.paceL; fam.prevR = seat.paceR;\\n    if (edgeL || edgeR) { fam.steps++; fam.hist.push(fam.t); }\\n    while (fam.hist.length && fam.t - fam.hist[0] > 1) fam.hist.shift();\\n    fam.cad = fam.hist.length;\\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogLo : 2.6;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogHi : 3.4;\\n    const zoned = fam.cad >= lo && fam.cad <= hi && fam.stitch <= 0;\\n    if (zoned) fam.zone += dt;\\n    if (fam.cad > 4.2) fam.sprint += dt; else fam.sprint = 0;\\n    if (fam.sprint > 2 && fam.stitch <= 0) fam.stitch = 3;\\n    if (fam.stitch > 0) fam.stitch -= dt;\\n    const speed = (G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogSpeed : 1) * (zoned ? 8 : 3);\\n    fam.z += speed * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 1.6 * dt;\\n    const cups = [12, 28, 44, 58];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) {\\n      if (fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= cups[i] && fam.z - speed * dt < cups[i]) {\\n        const cx = (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8);\\n        if (Math.abs(fam.x - cx) < 0.45) { fam.cups++; fam.gotCup = fam.gotCup || {}; fam.gotCup[i] = true; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    fam.nextCup = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) if (!(fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) && fam.z < cups[i]) { fam.nextCup = { x: (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8), z: cups[i] }; break; }\\n    const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSlalom(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (fam.done) return;\\n    if (fam.tumble > 0) { fam.tumble -= dt; return; }\\n    const base = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiSpeed : 220;\\n    const turn = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiTurn : 1.6;\\n    let spd = base;\\n    if (seat.uy > 0.3) spd *= 1.35;\\n    if (seat.uy < -0.3) spd *= 0.6;\\n    fam.z += spd * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 78 * turn / 1.6 * dt;\\n    const gates = G.GATES;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) {\\n      const g = gates[i];\\n      if (fam.missed[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= g.z && fam.z - spd * dt < g.z) {\\n        fam.missed[i] = Math.abs(fam.x - g.x) > fam.half;\\n        if (fam.missed[i]) fam.pen += 3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < G.OBSTACLES.length; i++) {\\n      const o = G.OBSTACLES[i];\\n      if (fam.hitO && fam.hitO[i]) continue;\\n      if (Math.abs(fam.z - o.z) < 80 && Math.abs(fam.x - o.x) < 16) {\\n        fam.hitO = fam.hitO || {}; fam.hitO[i] = true; fam.tumble = 1.2; fam.pen += 1.2;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    let next = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) if (gates[i].z > fam.z - 20) { next = gates[i]; break; }\\n    fam.nextGate = next;\\n    if (fam.z >= fam.finish) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 90;\\n      const time = fam.t + fam.pen;\\n      sess.pct = clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepTray(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!seat.bal) {\\n      seat.bal = new G.Balance({ k: 14, c: 8, s: 1, A: 0.5, nf: 0.8, R: 0.4, push: null }, sess.seed, {});\\n    }\\n    const sk = skillName(seat);\\n    if (sk) {\\n      const aim = sk === 'poor' ? 0.25 : sk === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    }\\n    seat.bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const Gv = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayG : 420;\\n    if (fam.world) {\\n      if (fam.gecko) fam.gecko.moveTo(78, 100 + Math.sin(fam.t * 0.55) * 36, 0, 22, 0);\\n      fam.world.gravity = [seat.bal.px * Gv, -seat.bal.py * Gv];\\n      fam.world.wake();\\n      fam.world.step(dt);\\n      const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n      const need = spec ? spec.olives.length : 0;\\n      const gotHere = fam.got - fam.trayGot0;\\n      if (gotHere >= need) {\\n        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? G.lean.effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (!fam.rope) fam.rope = Object.assign({}, bal.set);\\n    /* Faster walking sways the rope. The set on the balance is a copy, so the band table stays put. */\\n    bal.set = Object.assign({}, fam.rope, { s: fam.rope.s + effort * 4 });\\n    fam.air -= dt;\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0.04) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    /* One jump per pin, long enough to land past it. Air freezes the plate, not the walker. */\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0 && ahead && fam.cleared !== ahead.x && ahead.dist < 0.95) {\\n      fam.air = Math.min(0.85, ahead.dist / Math.max(0.45, spd) + 0.12);\\n      fam.cleared = ahead.x;\\n    }\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\\n    fam.gust -= dt;\\n    fam.gustT -= dt;\\n    let fx = 0;\\n    if (fam.gustT <= 0) { fam.gustT = 4.5; fam.gust = 0.35; fam.gustSign = sess.rng() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1; }\\n    if (fam.gust > 0 && fam.air <= 0) {\\n      const g = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.gust : 9;\\n      fx = fam.gustSign * Math.min(g, 2.4);\\n    }\\n    bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, fx, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    /* A plate stumble is the rope moving under you. Only missing a pin walks you back to the post.\\n       The laundry set's average bot cannot stay up for a whole line; the band table says so, and that table stays. */\\n    let fell = false;\\n    if (ahead && ahead.dist < 0.18 && fam.air <= 0) fell = true;\\n    if (fell) { fam.falls++; fam.x = fam.post; fam.cleared = -1; }\\n    const posts = [0, 18, 36, 55];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < posts.length; i++) if (fam.x >= posts[i]) fam.post = posts[i];\\n    if (!fell) fam.x += spd * dt;\\n    if (fam.x >= fam.len) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n      const par = 58, worst = 95;\\n      const time = fam.t;\\n      let pct = time <= par ? 1 : clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      pct = clamp(pct - 0.06 * fam.falls, 0, 1);\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function scoreNow(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, fam = sess.fam;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' && sess.seats[0].bal) sess.pct = clamp(sess.seats[0].bal.steadiness - 0.05 * sess.seats[0].bal.falls, 0, 1);\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry' && !fam.done) sess.pct = 0;\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') {\\n      const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n      sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function Session(opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    this.act = G.ACTS[opts.id] || G.ACTS.stork;\\n    this.tier = opts.tier || 1;\\n    this.trial = !!opts.trial;\\n    this.cheat = !!opts.cheat;\\n    this.classMode = !!opts.classMode;\\n    this.seed = (opts.seed || 1) >>> 0;\\n    this.rng = E.rng(this.seed);\\n    this.phase = opts.skipToPlay ? 'count' : 'card';\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.playTime = 0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":753}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"42cd9069-8508-44d4-bf6e-5089c9563965"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_590","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A large change requires caution. Existing single-player scoring is carefully tuned and must not be broken.\n\nClass mode needs per-seat scoring. Single-player activities must keep using seat 0 only. The skeptic notes that local class currently steps seat 0, copies one percentage to all seats, and ignores skillName. readLean also only reads game.input, so a second pad cannot change scores.\n\nFive class activities need per-player intent and independent seat balances: Stork Stand, Quiet Candle, Squat Rail, Step Class, and Hoop Hips. finish() must assign each seat its own percentage based on its own balance. A test will verify that two different inputs produce two different scores.\n\nHeadless class currently marks local players as bots with skill 'good'. Morning Class always sets the driver to 'good', so the hub score reflects the bot's performance and ignores the human's lean.\n\nHub sessions should keep the local seat as a human with driver null, and G.driver must not be 'good'. A still player should score low rather than copying the good bot's high percentage. A held lean should move px. Ghosts need to be drawn at alpha 0.5 from received l/w when a matches the event. I will search G.ghosts to see how they are received.\n\nDev jump and bot-play currently only work through direct test calls. Keyboard confirm is ignored, so tools cannot be activated from the UI. The tray friction and rope slider values are never applied.\n\nI will expose jump and bot-play on the dev panel for keyboard and pad input, apply those two sliders, and drive them through input instead of toolAct(). Keyboard confirm should also activate tools.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-22a804fc-cb74-4cb4-8e43-b2e6431e1fb1-145","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"addPlayer|padMove|halfKeys|_players","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.bui