{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_598","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand halfKeys to identify which keys P2 uses for lean.\n\nI need to read halfKeys and understand physics friction. The verifier requires observable slider changes. I will apply trayFric by setting olive friction to trayFric * 0.04 when the dev panel is active.\n\nI realized setting friction only at creation time would miss mid-run slider changes, so I will update olive friction each step while the dev panel is active. For the rope, I will use G.dev.v.ropeS as the base instability instead of fam.rope.s.\n\nThe rope instability formula will use `G.dev.v.ropeS` only when the dev panel is active, preserving star gate behavior when it is off. I am designing a test that opens the panel, selects a jump tool, jumps to laundry, and asserts the slider changes the instability value.\n\nThe panel stays open after a jump, so the ropeS slider can be adjusted and the instability value checked. Arrow keys are already blocked for P1 lean while the panel is open. For tray friction, the test will read olive body friction from fam.world after the count phase.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58425d82-12a5-4b15-ab3c-e629e889e001-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":3740,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58425d82-12a5-4b15-ab3c-e629e889e001-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"friction","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58425d82-12a5-4b15-ab3c-e629e889e001-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108_