{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_603","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The headless engine might still create a canvas via a stub.\n\nThe engine still draws in headless mode. G.boot ignores the draw option. The draw scenes test confirms this. Hooking the view's actor method is too hacky.\n\nA better test approach is to boot a fake hub, start the round, fire the ghost message, and call scene.draw with a fake renderer that records actor calls. The verifier requires tests to drive shipped code on the real path without re-implementing it. Using the engine's real renderer is preferable. I will examine game.draw or scene draw during advance.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-30204b5b-497d-4a5e-97b3-2fad8f9480b0-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"headless","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-30204b5b-497d-4a5e-97b3-2fad8f9480b0-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"scene\\.draw|_draw\\(|\\.draw\\(this\\.view","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2968,"output_tokens":671,"cache_read_input_tokens":97408,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"11017405-5678-49d2-9989-84af665d3ffb"}
