{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_608","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking world.js around lines 1130-1170 to determine the step order.\n\nThe `more` key cycles tools in the boot hook before scene update. `dev.update` ignores it. Adding jump mode risks double activation if confirm also triggers scene actions. Existing toolAct patterns may prevent this.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-78b65c17-b0e0-4082-a2d2-24c37acea469-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":1100,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":701,"output_tokens":327,"cache_read_input_tokens":111488,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"c3274748-5c90-4f1c-ac76-d88a1fc8044a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-78b65c17-b0e0-4082-a2d2-24c37acea469-42","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1100→    }\\n  });\\n\\n  G.scenes = scenes;\\n\\n  G.capture = function () {\\n    const g = G.game, s = G.session, p = G.profile;\\n    const snap = {\\n      scene: g ? g.sceneName : '',\\n      activity: s && s.act ? s.act.id : '',\\n1110→      tier: s ? s.tier : 0,\\n      day: p ? p.day : 1,\\n      session: p ? p.sessions : 0,\\n      pct: s ? s.pct : 0,\\n      stars: s ? s.stars : 0,\\n      minutes: p ? p.minutes : 0,\\n      spineAge: p ? G.spineAge() : 71,\\n      lean: { x: G.lean.ux, y: G.lean.uy },\\n      source: G.lean.source || 'keys',\\n      phase: G.phase,\\n1120→      freePlay: !!(p && p.freePlay),\\n      unlocks: p ? p.unlocks.slice() : [],\\n      saves: g && g.saves ? g.saves.list().length : 0,\\n      attract: !!G.attracting,\\n      dev: !!(G.dev && G.dev.panel),\\n      plateau: !!(p && p.plateau),\\n      title: 'Spine Wee',\\n      ending: !!(p && p.ending) || (g && g.sceneName === 'ending'),\\n      duelWon: !!(p && p.duelWon),\\n      left: G.left || 0\\n1130→    };\\n    if (g) g.debug = g.debug || {};\\n    if (g) g.debug.snapshot = function () { return snap; };\\n    G._snap = snap;\\n    return snap;\\n  };\\n\\n  G.wireScenes = function (game) {\\n    const out = {};\\n    Object.keys(scenes).forEach(function (name) {\\n1140→      const s = scenes[name];\\n      const update = s.update, draw = s.draw, enter = s.enter;\\n      out[name] = Object.assign({}, s, {\\n        enter: function (data) {\\n          G.seen[name] = true;\\n          try { if (enter) enter.call(s, data); } catch (e) { game.fail('enter ' + name, e); }\\n        },\\n        update: function (dt) {\\n          if (G.talk && G.talk.open) {\\n            G.phase = 'talk';\\n1150→            try { G.talk.update(dt); } catch (e) { game.fail('talk', e); }\\n            if (G.talk.open) { if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.update(game.input, dt); } catch (e2) { /* panel */ } } G.capture(); return; }\\n          }\\n          try { if (update) update.call(s, dt); } catch (e) { game.fail('update ' + name, e); }\\n          if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.update(game.input, dt); } catch (e2) { /* panel */ } }\\n          G.capture();\\n        },\\n        draw: function (r) {\\n          try { if (draw) draw.call(s, r); }\\n          catch (e) {\\n1160→            game.fail('draw ' + name, e);\\n            try { G.paintRoom(r, 'day'); } catch (e2) { /* blank is worse */ }\\n          }\\n          if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.draw(r); } catch (e3) { /* panel */ } }\\n        }\\n      });\\n    });\\n    return out;\\n  };\\n\\n1170→  void songFor;\\n})();\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1100→    }\\n  });\\n\\n  G.scenes = scenes;\\n\\n  G.capture = function () {\\n    const g = G.game, s = G.session, p = G.profile;\\n    const snap = {\\n      scene: g ? g.sceneName : '',\\n      activity: s && s.act ? s.act.id : '',\\n1110→      tier: s ? s.tier : 0,\\n      day: p ? p.day : 1,\\n      session: p ? p.sessions : 0,\\n      pct: s ? s.pct : 0,\\n      stars: s ? s.stars : 0,\\n      minutes: p ? p.minutes : 0,\\n      spineAge: p ? G.spineAge() : 71,\\n      lean: { x: G.lean.ux, y: G.lean.uy },\\n      source: G.lean.source || 'keys',\\n      phase: G.phase,\\n1120→      freePlay: !!(p && p.freePlay),\\n      unlocks: p ? p.unlocks.slice() : [],\\n      saves: g && g.saves ? g.saves.list().length : 0,\\n      attract: !!G.attracting,\\n      dev: !!(G.dev && G.dev.panel),\\n      plateau: !!(p && p.plateau),\\n      title: 'Spine Wee',\\n      ending: !!(p && p.ending) || (g && g.sceneName === 'ending'),\\n      duelWon: !!(p && p.duelWon),\\n      left: G.left || 0\\n1130→    };\\n    if (g) g.debug = g.debug || {};\\n    if (g) g.debug.snapshot = function () { return snap; };\\n    G._snap = snap;\\n    return snap;\\n  };\\n\\n  G.wireScenes = function (game) {\\n    const out = {};\\n    Object.keys(scenes).forEach(function (name) {\\n1140→      const s = scenes[name];\\n      const update = s.update, draw = s.draw, enter = s.enter;\\n      out[name] = Object.assign({}, s, {\\n        enter: function (data) {\\n          G.seen[name] = true;\\n          try { if (enter) enter.call(s, data); } catch (e) { game.fail('enter ' + name, e); }\\n        },\\n        update: function (dt) {\\n          if (G.talk && G.talk.open) {\\n            G.phase = 'talk';\\n1150→            try { G.talk.update(dt); } catch (e) { game.fail('talk', e); }\\n            if (G.talk.open) { if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.update(game.input, dt); } catch (e2) { /* panel */ } } G.capture(); return; }\\n          }\\n          try { if (update) update.call(s, dt); } catch (e) { game.fail('update ' + name, e); }\\n          if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.update(game.input, dt); } catch (e2) { /* panel */ } }\\n          G.capture();\\n        },\\n        draw: function (r) {\\n          try { if (draw) draw.call(s, r); }\\n          catch (e) {\\n1160→            game.fail('draw ' + name, e);\\n            try { G.paintRoom(r, 'day'); } catch (e2) { /* blank is worse */ }\\n          }\\n          if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.draw(r); } catch (e3) { /* panel */ } }\\n        }\\n      });\\n    });\\n    return out;\\n  };\\n\\n1170→  void songFor;\\n})();\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js\",\"offset\":1100,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"    }\\n  });\\n\\n  G.scenes = scenes;\\n\\n  G.capture = function () {\\n    const g = G.game, s = G.session, p = G.profile;\\n    const snap = {\\n      scene: g ? g.sceneName : '',\\n      activity: s && s.act ? s.act.id : '',\\n      tier: s ? s.tier : 0,\\n      day: p ? p.day : 1,\\n      session: p ? p.sessions : 0,\\n      pct: s ? s.pct : 0,\\n      stars: s ? s.stars : 0,\\n      minutes: p ? p.minutes : 0,\\n      spineAge: p ? G.spineAge() : 71,\\n      lean: { x: G.lean.ux, y: G.lean.uy },\\n      source: G.lean.source || 'keys',\\n      phase: G.phase,\\n      freePlay: !!(p && p.freePlay),\\n      unlocks: p ? p.unlocks.slice() : [],\\n      saves: g && g.saves ? g.saves.list().length : 0,\\n      attract: !!G.attracting,\\n      dev: !!(G.dev && G.dev.panel),\\n      plateau: !!(p && p.plateau),\\n      title: 'Spine Wee',\\n      ending: !!(p && p.ending) || (g && g.sceneName === 'ending'),\\n      duelWon: !!(p && p.duelWon),\\n      left: G.left || 0\\n    };\\n    if (g) g.debug = g.debug || {};\\n    if (g) g.debug.snapshot = function () { return snap; };\\n    G._snap = snap;\\n    return snap;\\n  };\\n\\n  G.wireScenes = function (game) {\\n    const out = {};\\n    Object.keys(scenes).forEach(function (name) {\\n      const s = scenes[name];\\n      const update = s.update, draw = s.draw, enter = s.enter;\\n      out[name] = Object.assign({}, s, {\\n        enter: function (data) {\\n          G.seen[name] = true;\\n          try { if (enter) enter.call(s, data); } catch (e) { game.fail('enter ' + name, e); }\\n        },\\n        update: function (dt) {\\n          if (G.talk && G.talk.open) {\\n            G.phase = 'talk';\\n            try { G.talk.update(dt); } catch (e) { game.fail('talk', e); }\\n            if (G.talk.open) { if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.update(game.input, dt); } catch (e2) { /* panel */ } } G.capture(); return; }\\n          }\\n          try { if (update) update.call(s, dt); } catch (e) { game.fail('update ' + name, e); }\\n          if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.update(game.input, dt); } catch (e2) { /* panel */ } }\\n          G.capture();\\n        },\\n        draw: function (r) {\\n          try { if (draw) draw.call(s, r); }\\n          catch (e) {\\n            game.fail('draw ' + name, e);\\n            try { G.paintRoom(r, 'day'); } catch (e2) { /* blank is worse */ }\\n          }\\n          if (G.dev && G.dev.panel) { try { G.dev.draw(r); } catch (e3) { /* panel */ } }\\n        }\\n      });\\n    });\\n    return out;\\n  };\\n\\n  void songFor;\\n})();\\n\",\"total_lines\":1171}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"2f9ac75b-1ed3-4fc0-be30-994ec56ee89f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_609","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Dev update runs after scene update.\n\nKeyboard confirm may activate both the tool and the scene simultaneously. Existing tests avoid this by calling toolAct directly. For the jump test, the plan is to open the title panel, cycle to the Jump tool, and press confirm. To prevent both events from firing, the press must be consumed before the scene sees it, or dev update must run first.\n\nThe fix is to run dev update before scene update while the panel is open, and consume confirm, more, and arrow keys so the scene does not also act. Arrow keys already move both sliders and menu focus when the panel is open, so this may already happen in tests.\n\nArrowRight on the title panel does not trigger confirm, so it is safe to use for testing. The real conflict is Enter: activating a tool from the title panel also fires the title's own confirm and navigates to New Member. Testing jump from the title scene would therefore fail. Moving dev.update before scene update and consuming the confirm press would prevent this.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-52fd944f-c8c3-4209-bb51-4bf69a43ab3f-43","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"consume\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-52fd944f-c8c3-4209-bb51-4bf69a43ab3f-44","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":990,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1242,"output_tokens":632,"cache_read_input_tokens":112128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"0b8a0c51-2218-435d-86c6-f0613d8c3ef9"}
