{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_625","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The skill was captured before the arm.\n\nThe laundry function confirms the skill is captured before arm. The effort line uses that same local variable.\n\nArming a human laundry balance nulls the bot. The band balance keeps its skill and still works. When dev mode is on, ropeS defaults to 16 from the set copy. Live() multipliers might change that value.\n\nThe copied set is raw, so ropeS and the default 16 match. Dev mode multiplies by 1, keeping the value unchanged. Next up are world.js seats, hub driver, ghosts, and the UI dev panel.\n\nCandle arm on a human does not interfere with Balance.step because the human has no skill. Hold arm is safe too: it no-ops when the balance already holds a skill, and the bot ignores seat.ux as before.\n\nA potential bug was spotted: if a dev bot turns on mid-session, arm() sets the bot but uses E.rng for bnx/bny instead of the balance's noise() function.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bcf2a158-787c-4d6e-8faf-82e0a42d057e-75","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","old_string":"    breath: ['KeyF', 'Pad6', 'Pad7'], catchL: ['KeyG', 'Pad4'], catchR: ['KeyH', 'Pad5']\n  };","new_string":"    breath: ['KeyF', 'Pad6', 'Pad7'], catchL: ['KeyG', 'Pad4'], catchR: ['KeyH', 'Pad5'],\n    more: ['Tab', 'KeyM', 'Pad3'], retry: ['KeyR', 'Pad2']\n  };"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bcf2a158-787c-4d6e-8faf-82e0a42d057e-76","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","old_string":"      for (let i = 0; i < n && i < 4; i++) {\n        const local = i < players.length;\n        const headlessBo