{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_634","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tray jump logic is being reviewed. After the first jump, jumpActI becomes 1, indicating a stork.\n\nThe second jump opens jump mode and resets the row. Ten rights from stork land on tray, confirming the loop logic. Laundry is next at index 12.\n\nThe second and third jumps both reset jumpRow to zero correctly. Pressing Enter disables the bot. The 0.6-second advance releases Pad0 during its steps. skillName remains dev.bot with dev.on set.\n\nThe tray jump creates a fresh session. Its balance starts without the centering skill, so dev.bot and skillName are null. The 0.6-second advance should let the session enter play and step tray friction. One concern: the slider change might occur after the jump's confirm frame already started the session.\n\nThe slider navigation takes 0.4 seconds, so the session may already be in play with default friction before the friction value is increased. The assertion occurs after the increase and the 0.6-second advance, so the new friction applies correctly. The laundry step follows the same pattern.\n\nThe rope slider change from tray friction to rope strength takes only two frames, so it finishes before the 0.6-second advance enters play and applies the new value.\n\nNext, I will insert a class seats test after the local class test, extend the fake hub, and add hub ghosts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3baf457-69ff-4277-9975-648c5cba55aa-93","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  assert(snap(game).scene === 'title', 'left class to ' + snap(game).scene + ' err=' + JSON.stringify(game.errors));\n});","new_string":"  assert(snap(game).scene === 'title', 'left class to ' + snap(game).scene + ' err=' + JSON.stringify(game.errors));\n});\n\nadd('rules', 'class seats', () => {\n  const game = boot();\n  game.go('class', {}, { fade: 0 });\n  game.advance(1 / 120);\n  assert(game.players.length >= 2, 'players ' + game.players.length);\n  game.input.tap('confirm');\n  game.advance(1 / 120);\n  let guard = 0;\n  while (guard++ < 200 && (!G.session || G.session.phase !== 'play')) game.advance(1 / 120);\n  assert(G.session && G.session.phase === 'play', 'phase ' + (G.session && G.session.phase));\n  const seats = G.session.seats;\n  assert(seats.length >= 2 && seats[0].human && seats[1].human, 'seats ' + seats.map(function (q) { return q.name + ':' + q.human; }).join(','));\n  assert(!seats[0].skill && !seats[1].skill, 'skills ' + seats[0].skill + ' ' + seats[1].skill);\n  game.players[1].press('ArrowRight');\n  game.advance(1.2);\n  assert(Math.abs(seats[1].bal.px) > Math.abs(seats[0].bal.px) + 0.08, 'px ' + seats[0].bal.px + ' ' + seats[1].bal.px);\n  guard = 0;\n  while (guard++ < 8000 && G.session && G.session.phase !== 'results') game.advance(0.25);\n  assert(G.session && G.session.phase === 'results', 'no results');\n  assert(seats[0].score !== seats[1].score, 'scores ' + seats[0].score + ' ' + seats[1].score);\n  assert(seats[0].score >= 0 && seats[0].score <= 1000 && seats[1].score >= 0 && seats[1].score <= 1000, 'range');\n  game.players[1].release('ArrowRight');\n});"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3baf457-69ff-4277-9975-648c5cba55aa-94","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"    assert(sent.length > 0, 'no ghosts');\n    assert(progress.length > 0, 'no progress');\n    (handlers['time-up'] || []).forEach(function (fn) { fn(); });","new_string":"    assert(sent.length > 0, 'no ghosts');\n    assert(progress.length > 0, 'no progress');\n    game.advance(8);\n    const live = G.session;\n    assert(live && live.seats[0] && !live.seats[0].skill, 'hub skill ' + (live && live.seats[0] && live.seats[0].skill));\n    assert(G.driver == null, 'hub driver ' + G.driver);\n    const humanPct = live.pct;\n    const lean = { ux: G.lean.ux, uy: G.lean.uy, breath: G.lean.breath };\n    const ref = new G.Session({ id: live.act.id, tier: 1, limit: 40, skipToPlay: true, trial: true, driver: 'good', seed: live.seed });\n    const nStep = Math.max(1, Math.round((live.playTime + 0.45) * 120));\n    for (let i = 0; i < nStep; i++) ref.update(1 / 120);\n    G.lean.ux = lean.ux; G.lean.uy = lean.uy; G.lean.breath = lean.breath;\n    assert(Math.abs(humanPct - ref.pct) > 0.02, 'still posted the good bot ' + humanPct + ' vs ' + ref.pct + ' on ' + live.act.id);\n    const before = live.seats[0].bal ? live.seats[0].bal.px : 0;\n    game.input.press('KeyD');\n    game.advance(0.5);\n    const after = live.seats[0].bal ? live.seats[0].bal.px : 0;\n    assert(Math.abs(after - before) > 0.02, 'held lean px ' + before + ' -> ' + after + ' on ' + live.act.id);\n    game.input.release('KeyD');\n    (handlers['time-up'] || []).forEach(function (fn) { fn(); });"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3baf457-69ff-4277-9975-648c5cba55aa-95","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"add('rules', 'data lint', () => {","new_string":"add('rules', 'hub ghosts', async () => {\n  const handlers = {};\n  ctx.AIHub = {\n    active: true,\n    connect() { return Promise.resolve({ players: [{ name: 'Red Fox', color: '#ff4a4a' }] }); },\n    ready() { ctx.AIHub._ready = true; },\n    time() { return 0; },\n    answer() {},\n    send() {},\n    progress() {},\n    result() {},\n    rng() { return E.rng(3); },\n    on(ev, fn) { (handlers[ev] = handlers[ev] || []).push(fn); }\n  };\n  try {\n    const game = boot({ draw: true });\n    await new Promise(function (r) { setImmediate(r); });\n    game.advance(0.5);\n    assert(scenesEi(game) === 0, 'event ' + scenesEi(game));\n    (handlers.message || []).forEach(function (fn) {\n      fn({ t: 'g', a: 0, l: [0.42, -0.25], w: [0.1, 0.05], s: 10 }, 'seat-2');\n      fn({ t: 'g', a: 1, l: [0.9, 0.9], w: [0.2, 0.2], s: 1 }, 'seat-3');\n    });\n    const seen = [];\n    const orig = game.r.actor;\n    game.r.actor = function (x, y, z, fn, o) {\n      seen.push(o || {});\n      return orig.apply(this, arguments);\n    };\n    game.advance(1 / 120);\n    game.r.actor = orig;\n    const faded = seen.filter(function (o) { return o && o.alpha === 0.5; });\n    assert(faded.length >= 1, 'ghost alpha calls ' + seen.length);\n    const mine = G.ghosts.filter(function (q) { return q.from === 'seat-2'; })[0];\n    const other = G.ghosts.filter(function (q) { return q.from === 'seat-3'; })[0];\n    assert(mine && mine.rig, 'matching ghost was not drawn');\n    assert(Math.abs(mine.rig.wob[1] - 0.52) < 1e-6 && Math.abs(mine.rig.wob[0] - -0.2) < 1e-6, 'wob ' + mine.rig.wob);\n    assert(other && !other.rig, 'wrong event drew a rig');\n    assert(!game.errors.length, 'draw errors');\n  } finally {\n    ctx.AIHub = realAIHub;\n  }\n});\n\nfunction scenesEi() { return G.scenes && G.scenes.round ? G.scenes.round.ei : null; }\n\nadd('rules', 'data lint', () => {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1821,"output_tokens":2846,"cache_read_input_tokens":192896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"a1a30661-1b67-46e8-9084-3d3cea7601d8"}
