{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_649","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The squat bead is a triangle wave from 0 to 1 over four seconds.\n\nThe mean error over a cycle is 0.5, which exceeds the 0.35 threshold. Both still and full-down players score zero.\n\nSquat fails the same way as stork. Noise cannot push the mean error under 0.35, so both forms score zero. Step class is the next candidate if audio and note judging are implemented.\n\nStep class should work. A still player misses every note, while a player holding ArrowDown hits only down-lane notes. I need to verify that the step chart has down notes, that Rhythm.hit registers held inputs each frame, that audio advances in headless mode, and that seat 0 reads P1 input exclusively.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-05ba4def-47ed-4b29-b3de-bedbb6ae275f-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Rhythm\\.prototype|this\\.accuracy|hit\\(lane|prototype\\.update|prototype\\.start","glob":"**/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1647,"output_tokens":742,"cache_read_input_tokens":59520,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"278b598c-d4de-4141-960d-da3aec7d4db1"}
