0,105,100,32,110,111,116,32,115,116,97,114,116,46,10,51,52,58,45,32,91,120,93,32,70,101,116,99,104,32,116,104,101,32,104,97,110,100,111,102,102,44,32,104,117,98,32,99,108,105,101,110,116,44,32,97,110,100,32,99,108,105,112,32,115,101,116,59,32,97,100,100,32,116,104,101,32,98,117,105,108,100,32,97,110,100,32,96,116,101,115,116,115,47,114,117,110,46,109,106,115,96,59,32,98,111,111,116,32,97,32,102,105,108,101,58,47,47,32,112,97,103,101,32,119,105,116,104,32,116,104,101,32,115,101,115,115,105,111,110,32,119,114,97,112,112,101,114,44,32,116,104,101,109,101,100,32,115,104,101,108,108,44,32,97,110,100,32,109,117,115,105,99,32,97,116,32,48,46,49,46,10,52,48,58,45,32,91,120,93,32,70,105,110,105,115,104,32,97,116,116,114,97,99,116,44,32,102,117,108,108,32,100,101,118,32,109,111,100,101,44,32,65,98,111,117,116,44,32,116,104,101,32,115,105,110,103,108,101,32,72,84,77,76,44,32,97,110,100,32,96,101,120,105,116,45,105,110,116,101,114,118,105,101,119,46,106,115,111,110,96,59,32,114,117,110,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,116,101,115,116,115,47,114,117,110,46,109,106,115,32,97,108,108,96,32,97,110,100,32,107,101,101,112,32,116,104,101,32,116,119,111,32,108,97,117,110,99,104,32,108,111,103,115,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":8,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e%2Fwork/01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\"5. `node tests/run.mjs` with `rules`, `browser`, `hub`, and `all` is the only test command, prints failures plus one count line, and `all` finishes with 0 failed. Those tests drive the shipped game from its real start (not a reimplementation or a mocked Lean): section 3’s bot bands land within ±10 on 12 seeds; every activity and tier meets the star gates (tier 1 passive under 1★, average at least 1★, good at least 2★; tier 2 passive under 1★, good at least 1★, expert at least 2★); a scripted playthrough and a passive run reach the ending with the day-3 plateau and unlocks; saves round-trip and a damaged save does not crash; the same seed and input hash the same twice; attract, dev sliders/reset/jumps, class, and a fake hub (one report on time-up, end stops input) behave as above; data references resolve and game sources contain no TODO, placeholder, or stub. The browser group loads the built file from `file://` with no page errors, a gamepad stub, keyboard and mouse, the touch notice,  [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"1. gating: From the dev subfolder, run `node tests/run.mjs all` once after browsers are free. Capture stdout and stderr to `{SCRATCH}/tests-all.log`. Pass only if the log’s final line is a count with 0 failed and no failure block. Read the test sources and confirm they load the shipped scripts, advance the real game, and assert every outcome named in criterion 5 (bands, both playthroughs, saves, determinism, attract at 10s not 9.9s, dev, class, fake hub, data lint, file:// browser checks, engine check, and the five hub harness URLs including `__hubCheck.pass`). A runner that only prints a count, or tests that never call the shipped game, does not pass.\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\"3. gating: Static hand-in, no browser. Confirm the HTML, matching dev subfolder, `PROGRESS.md`, and `exit-interview.json` names and JSON shape in criterion 1; confirm the built page inlines its scripts, injects the same About text as the JSON, lists the hub meta tags, keeps session.js first and unmodified, and contains no TODO/placeholder/stub and no audio-file loads. Capture `{SCRATCH}/handoff-static.log`.\"},{\"line_number\":24,\"content\":\"- Extra engines or libraries beyond the handoff engine, its mocap clips, and the hub client.\"},{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"- New dev subfolder only: engine from `https://github.com/michaelcrosato/my-3d2dge` `dist/handoff`, hub client and harness from `https://github.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub` `lib/hub`, mocap clip build inputs from the engine repo, game scripts, `tests/run.mjs`, and the one build script. Playwright 1.63.0 is already installed; do not run `playwright install`. Do not read or write sibling agent folders, `/tmp`, or processes you did not start.\"},{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\"- [x] Fetch the handoff, hub client, and clip set; add the build and `tests/run.mjs`; boot a file:// page with the session wrapper, themed shell, and music at 0.1.\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"- [x] Finish attract, full dev mode, About, the single HTML, and `exit-interview.json`; run `node tests/run.mjs all` and keep the two launch logs.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c5ac0578-f5ba-4c90-b097-a49486eccb15-47","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle: **Spine Wee**\\n\\nChosen with Node `crypto.randomBytes` (4 bytes `92846675`, uint32 `2458150517`, index `17` of 50 silent riffs). The list of 50 is not recorded. The product name \\\"Wii Fit\\\" was not a candidate.\\n\\nDev folder: `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108`\\n\\n## Milestones\\n10→\\n- [x] M0 fetch, build, tests, boot\\n- [x] M1 Lean + Stork Stand\\n- [x] M2 day loop\\n- [x] M3 stillness + strength\\n- [x] M4 cardio\\n- [x] M5 balance games\\n- [x] M6 story, ending, audio\\n- [x] M7 class + hub\\n- [x] M8 attract, dev, about\\n20→- [x] M9 bundle + exit interview\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle: **Spine Wee**\\n\\nChosen with Node `crypto.randomBytes` (4 bytes `92846675`, uint32 `2458150517`, index `17` of 50 silent riffs). The list of 50 is not recorded. The product name \\\"Wii Fit\\\" was not a candidate.\\n\\nDev folder: `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108`\\n\\n## Milestones\\n10→\\n- [x] M0 fetch, build, tests, boot\\n- [x]