lint: every line, pose, clip name, activity and unlock referenced exists; no `TODO` or placeholder strings in `game/`.\"},{\"line_number\":653,\"content\":\"- [ ] No TODOs, placeholders or stubs anywhere\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":81,\"content\":\" *  from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07');\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108.html\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":597,\"content\":\" *  from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07');\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/tests/hub/game.html\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":597,\"content\":\" *  from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07');\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/API-INDEX.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"- `E.build: \\\"dev-build\\\"`: the commit this copy was built from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07')\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f8014acd-0834-456c-bcca-d5f686b858be-54","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"6. Testing caught six issues. Four were game bugs: Tray Service scoring, Laundry Line scoring, tier-2 expert reps, and every screen draw throwing because engine 0.89 has no E.px.round. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\\\",\\n    \\\"4. Four were game-breaking. The three scoring bugs finished under their star gates, and the missing rounded rect meant the pills, the scale, and the activity card never appeared. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"10. Testing caught ten issues. Eight were game bugs: Tray Service scoring, Laundry Line scoring, tier-2 expert reps, every screen draw throwing because engine 0.89 has no E.px.round, Local Class giving both humans the same score, Morning Class posting the good bot's score, hub ghosts drawn as names only, and the dev panel ignoring keyboard confirm, jump, bot play, tray friction, and rope stiffness. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\\\",\\n    \\\"6. Six were game-breaking. The three scoring bugs finished under their star gates, the missing rounded rect meant the pills, the scale, and the activity card never appeared, Local Class copied one score onto every seat, and Morning Class reported the bot instead of the seated human. Hub ghosts and the dev panel were real, and a solo retreat could still finish. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"6. Testing caught six issues. Four were game bugs: Tray Service scoring, Laundry Line scoring, tier-2 expert reps, and every screen draw throwing because engine 0.89 has no E.px.round. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\\\",\\n    \\\"4. Four were game-breaking. The three scoring bugs finished under their star gates, and the missing rounded rect meant the pills, the scale, and the activity card never appeared. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\\\",\",\"old_line\":20,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"10. Testing caught ten issues. Eight were game bugs: Tray Service scoring, Laundry Line scoring, tier-2 expert reps, every screen draw throwing because engine 0.89 has no E.px.round, Local Class giving both humans the same score, Morning Class posting the good bot's score, hub ghosts drawn as names only, and the dev panel ignoring keyboard confirm, jump, bot play, tray friction, and rope stiffness. Two were mistakes in the test harness: the section 3 check required every seed, and the Local Class test tapped confirm while the previous tap was still held.\\\",\\n    \\\"6. Six were game-breaking. The three scoring bugs finished under their star gates, the missing rounded rect meant the pills, the scale, and the activity card never appeared, Local Class copied one score onto every seat, and Morning Class reported the bot instead of the seated human. Hub ghosts and the dev panel were real, and a solo retreat could still finish. The two harness failures were not bugs in the shipped game.\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"Reading the built page's pixels. The rules suite stayed green while every draw threw on E.px.round and the picture was only the room. The star-gate matrix was the other check that mattered: it showed Tray Service, Laundry Line, and the tier-2 expert reps scoring too low.\\\",\\n    \\\"Asserting each of the 12 section 3 seeds on its own. Single seeds swing past the band while the mean of those seeds stays inside it, and the Lean was left as shipped.\\\"\\n  ],\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"9e339cb1-a3ad-4766-abeb-43ef13d7ab81"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_672","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The engine contains a placeholder comment, so the HTML will include that word.\n\nThe engine's placeholder comment is an upstream stamp, not a game stub. I will scan game sources for TODOs and inline stubs.\n\nI will write a solid checker for the old handoff-static.mjs content.\n\nThe build must replace /*ABOUT*/null with raw JSON. The HTML should contain the testing feedback string.\n\nsession.js must match vendor/session.js exactly after unescaping script tags.\n\nNo audio files should load from .mp3, .ogg, or .wav sources.\n\nHub meta tags must be present.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-359da84c-b8d2-4812-9cbb-94309e7634cc-55","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ABOUT|exit-interview|testingFeedback","glob":"**/tests/run.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-359da84c-b8d2-4812-9cbb-94309e7634cc-56","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/PROGRESS.md","old_string":"- [x] M9 bundle + exit interview","new_string":"- [x] M9 bundle + exit interview\n\nVerifier fixes, still on this computer: each Local Class seat scores its own lean, Morning Class leaves the seated human in charge, hub ghosts draw at half alpha from the lean they send, and the dev panel's jump, bot, tray friction, and rope stiffness run from the keyboard and the pad."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3418,"output_tokens":532,"cache_read_input_tokens":104704,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"ff9b1c74-d800-4cd1-9b95-c5c804325aa9"}
