{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_688","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking whether G.leans is populated per player in boot.js readLean.\n\nChecking whether class seats receive pi assignments. Verifying if stepHold uses different leans. Investigating hub driver null handling and ghost drawing. Reviewing dev panel keyboard confirm and jump behavior. In class mode, seat 0 uses the shared rh while seats 1+ get individual charts. Need to confirm P1 hits register correctly. Noted that stepStep skips skill hits in class mode.\n\nP1's hits may not reach fam.rh for seat 0. The old code only called rh.hit inside the skill branch. If E.Rhythm auto-listens to game.input, P1 steps work via rh.update(). Otherwise P1 gets zero accuracy unless a bot hits. In class mode headless players are bots with skill good.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0af2fa0c-4fe1-4e33-b32e-559b29abc563-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/boot.js","offset":28,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0af2fa0c-4fe1-4e33-b32e-559b29abc563-73","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/tests/run.mjs","offset":320,"limit":330}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0af2fa0c-4fe1-4e33-b32e-559b29abc563-74","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":820,"limit":260}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9258,"output_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":166528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c"