{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_689","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Verifying the class seats test is honest and produces different scores.\n\nChecking if player 2's input map includes ArrowRight as 'right'. The test asserts seat 1's position exceeds seat 0's by 0.05 before advancing to results.\n\nThe test passed, confirming the seat positions differed. Because it drives a real session and asserts distinct scores, it is honest. Now examining the hub test.\n\nThe hub test compares a human session against a reference good-bot session after two seconds of play. It asserts the human percentage differs by more than 0.02 and holds KeyD to verify movement.\n\nA potential bug was spotted: the reference session might mutate shared game state like G.lean or G.driver during update, even though it starts with driver 'good'. This could corrupt the test baseline.\n\nThe hub test passed, confirming the human and good-bot sessions diverged during held activities. The ghost test advances one frame after injecting messages and checks alpha 0.5 and wob values. The wob calculation yields [-0.2, 0.52].\n\nThe ghost test passed with no errors. The wrong event correctly receives no rig.\n\nThe dev panel test drives keyboard input for the new jump path and pose viewer, while the old pose viewer still uses toolAct(11). It verifies bot input, tray friction on olives, and rope s application.\n\nVerifying that tray friction and ropeS are applied in the actual code paths, not just test mocks. The dev panel test asserts olives[0].friction > 0.12 and rope.set.s exceeds the family value.\n\nNow examining stepHoop for class mode with multiple seats and stepStep to confirm seat 0 human input reaches the chart. Class activities include step, so a broken seat 0 chart would break player 1's step input.\n\nConfirmed Session.update does not overwrite skill when G.driver is null, so the hub and class scenes remain isolated. The dev bot test verifies arm() correctly sets bal.skill to good.\n\nThe dev bot overrides all local seats, including class mode, which is acceptable.\n\nTray friction is not merely a load-time value. The test increases the slider after jumping to the tray and advances 0.6 seconds before checking friction. Because the assertion passes, stepTray must update friction each frame.\n\nThe jump mode keyboard path for stork tier 2 day 3 is confirmed working. A potential bug remains: stepStep class seat 0 may not read human input if Rhythm does not auto-hit.\n\nNeed to verify whether rh.update reads input for class Step. Also checking if stepHoop steps all seats in class mode.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ee481268-37ee-41a1-b6d5-e060f11575c8-75","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","offset":137,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ee481268-37ee-41a1-b6d5-e060f11575c8-76","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js","offset":520,"limit":160}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ee481268-37ee-41a1-b6d5-e060f11575c8-77","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/ui.js","offset":180,"limit":130}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11200,"output_tokens":1901,"cache_read_input_tokens":175744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"d1a6b566-559b-4eed-87b7-230cf42c78ee"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ee481268-37ee-41a1-b6d5-e060f11575c8-75","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"137→  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n140→      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n150→    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n160→      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n170→      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n180→    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n190→    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n200→    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n210→    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\\n220→    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\\n    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\\n    const gx = glass.x, gy = glass.y;\\n    /* The drawn glass is small. The catch spans the tray's height so a sideways tilt lands every lane. */\\n    const sensor = world.circle(gx, gy, 72, { type: 'static', sensor: true });\\n    sensor._glass = true;\\n230→    if (spec.gecko) fam.gecko = world.circle(78, gy, 7, { type: 'kinematic', bounce: 0.05, friction: 0.05 });\\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.12, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02, bullet: true });\\n      b._olive = true;\\n    });\\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\\n      other._caught = true;\\n      fam.got++;\\n240→      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    };\\n    fam.world = world;\\n    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\\n250→    if (!fam) return;\\n    fam.t += dt;\\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\\n    if (act.family === 'hold') stepHold(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'sun') stepSun(sess, dt);\",\"content_concise\":\"137→  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n140→      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n150→    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n160→      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n170→      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n180→    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n190→    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n200→    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n210→    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\\n220→    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\\n    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\\n    const gx = glass.x, gy = glass.y;\\n    /* The drawn glass is small. The catch spans the tray's height so a sideways tilt lands every lane. */\\n    const sensor = world.circle(gx, gy, 72, { type: 'static', sensor: true });\\n    sensor._glass = true;\\n230→    if (spec.gecko) fam.gecko = world.circle(78, gy, 7, { type: 'kinematic', bounce: 0.05, friction: 0.05 });\\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.12, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02, bullet: true });\\n      b._olive = true;\\n    });\\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\\n      other._caught = true;\\n      fam.got++;\\n240→      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    };\\n    fam.world = world;\\n    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\\n250→    if (!fam) return;\\n    fam.t += dt;\\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\\n    if (act.family === 'hold') stepHold(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'sun') stepSun(sess, dt);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/play.js\",\"offset\":137,\"limit\":120,\"raw_output\":\"  function beadOf(t, tier) {\\n    if (tier >= 2) {\\n      const u = t % 5;\\n      if (u < 3) return u / 3;\\n      if (u < 4) return 1;\\n      return 1 - (u - 4);\\n    }\\n    const u = t % 4;\\n    return u < 2 ? u / 2 : 1 - (u - 2) / 2;\\n  }\\n\\n  function guideOf(t) {\\n    const u = (t % 8) / 4;\\n    return u < 1 ? u : 2 - u;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---- families ---- */\\n  function beginFamily(sess) {\\n    const act = sess.act, tier = sess.tier, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const gentle = !!(G.game && G.game.settings && G.game.settings.gentle);\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    const fam = { kind: act.family, t: 0, fx: 0, fy: 0 };\\n    if (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle' || act.family === 'laundry') {\\n      const set = act.family === 'rep' ? repSet('y') : setOf(act, tier, gentle);\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        const sk = skillName(q);\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(set, (sess.seed + i * 17) >>> 0, { skill: (act.family === 'laundry' ? sk : (act.family === 'hold' || act.family === 'sun' || act.family === 'candle') ? sk : null), cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'rep') {\\n      fam.axis = act.axis || 'y';\\n      fam.reps = act.reps[tier - 1];\\n      fam.planned = fam.reps;\\n      fam.doneReps = 0;\\n      fam.scores = [];\\n      fam.err = 0; fam.samples = 0; fam.form = 0;\\n      fam.bead = 0; fam.prevBead = 0; fam.beadVel = 0; fam.side = 1;\\n      fam.cycle = tier >= 2 ? 5 : 4;\\n      sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) {\\n        q.bal = new G.Balance(repSet(fam.axis), (sess.seed + i * 19) >>> 0, { cheat: !!sess.cheat });\\n      });\\n      sess.limit = fam.planned * fam.cycle + 1.5;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'sun') { fam.poseI = 0; fam.guide = 0; fam.match = 0; fam.matchN = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'candle') { fam.flame = 1; fam.flameSum = 0; fam.relit = false; fam.dead = false; fam.untouched = 0; fam.thought = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'step') fam.rh = null;\\n    if (act.family === 'hoop') { fam.omega = 0; fam.ang = 0; fam.band = 0; fam.out = 0; fam.hoops = 1; fam.caught = 0; fam.drops = 0; fam.score = 0; fam.otherWay = false; fam.toss = null; fam.tossT = 2; }\\n    if (act.family === 'jog') { fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.cad = 0; fam.hist = []; fam.zone = 0; fam.cups = 0; fam.cupN = 4; fam.stitch = 0; fam.sprint = 0; fam.steps = 0; fam.lastStep = 0; }\\n    if (act.family === 'slalom') {\\n      fam.x = 0; fam.z = 0; fam.pen = 0; fam.missed = {}; fam.tumble = 0; fam.done = false;\\n      fam.half = tier >= 2 ? 26 : 40;\\n      fam.finish = G.GATES[G.GATES.length - 1].z + 500;\\n    }\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') { fam.trayI = 0; fam.got = 0; fam.total = 0; fam.world = null; fam.cleared = 0; G.TRAYS.forEach(function (t) { fam.total += t.olives.length; }); }\\n    if (act.family === 'laundry') { fam.x = 0; fam.falls = 0; fam.post = 0; fam.len = 55; fam.done = false; fam.gustT = 2.2; fam.gust = 0; fam.air = 0; }\\n    sess.fam = fam;\\n    if (act.family === 'step') startStep(sess);\\n    if (act.family === 'tray') loadTray(sess);\\n  }\\n\\n  function startStep(sess) {\\n    const tier = sess.tier;\\n    const chart = G.CHARTS[tier >= 2 ? 't2' : 't1'];\\n    const song = tier >= 2 ? G.SONGS.stepB : G.SONGS.stepA;\\n    const lanes = sess.classMode ? ['left', 'down', 'up', 'right'] : ['stepL', 'stepD', 'stepU', 'stepR'];\\n    const scale = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.rhythm : 1;\\n    const rh = new E.Rhythm(G.game, {\\n      song: song, chart: chart, lanes: lanes, life: 4,\\n      windows: { perfect: 45 * scale, great: 90 * scale, good: 135 * scale }\\n    });\\n    try { rh.start(); } catch (e) { /* the clock still moves once music has a song */ }\\n    try { G.game.audio.onBeat(function () { try { G.game.audio.sfx('tick'); } catch (err) { /* quiet */ } }); } catch (e) { /* no bus yet */ }\\n    sess.fam.rh = rh;\\n    const parts = String(chart.order).trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length;\\n    const bpm = tier >= 2 ? 120 : 100;\\n    sess.limit = Math.min(sess.limit, parts * 16 * (60 / bpm / 4) + 0.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function loadTray(sess) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam;\\n    const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n    if (!spec) { fam.world = null; return; }\\n    const world = new E.Physics({ gravity: [0, 0], sleep: false, substeps: 2, iterations: 6 });\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [250, 16]);\\n    world.segment([8, 184], [250, 184]);\\n    world.segment([8, 16], [8, 184]);\\n    world.segment([248, 16], [248, 184]);\\n    spec.bumps.forEach(function (b) { world.circle(b.x, b.y, b.r, { type: 'static', bounce: 0.4, friction: 0.2 }); });\\n    const glass = spec.glasses[0];\\n    const gx = glass.x, gy = glass.y;\\n    /* The drawn glass is small. The catch spans the tray's height so a sideways tilt lands every lane. */\\n    const sensor = world.circle(gx, gy, 72, { type: 'static', sensor: true });\\n    sensor._glass = true;\\n    if (spec.gecko) fam.gecko = world.circle(78, gy, 7, { type: 'kinematic', bounce: 0.05, friction: 0.05 });\\n    spec.olives.forEach(function (o) {\\n      const b = world.circle(o.x, o.y, 6, { friction: 0.12, damping: 1.6, bounce: 0.05, density: 0.02, bullet: true });\\n      b._olive = true;\\n    });\\n    world.on.enter = function (sensorBody, other) {\\n      if (!other || !other._olive || other._caught) return;\\n      if (!sensorBody || !sensorBody._glass) return;\\n      other._caught = true;\\n      fam.got++;\\n      try { other.off = true; } catch (e) { /* it has arrived */ }\\n      try { G.game.audio.sfx('plop'); } catch (e) { /* quiet */ }\\n    };\\n    fam.world = world;\\n    fam.trayOlives = spec.olives.length;\\n    fam.trayGot0 = fam.got;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepFamily(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, act = sess.act;\\n    if (!fam) return;\\n    fam.t += dt;\\n    const seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    drive(seat, fam, dt);\\n    sess.seats.forEach(function (q, i) { if (i > 0) drive(q, fam, dt); });\\n    if (act.family === 'hold') stepHold(sess, dt);\\n    else if (act.family === 'sun') stepSun(sess, dt);\\n\",\"total_lines\":905}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ee481268-37ee-41a1-b6d5-e060f11575c8-76","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"520→      box.toss.eta -= dt;\\n      const hit = box.toss.side < 0 ? seat.catchL : seat.catchR;\\n      if (hit && Math.abs(box.toss.eta) <= 0.25) { box.caught++; box.hoops = Math.min(6, box.hoops + 1); box.toss = null; }\\n      else if (box.toss.eta < -0.25) box.toss = null;\\n    }\\n    const best = sess.limit * 1.4;\\n    const pct = clamp(box.score / best, 0, 1);\\n    if (primary) {\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.fam.omega = box.omega;\\n530→      sess.fam.otherWay = box.otherWay;\\n    }\\n    if (sess.classMode) seat.pct = pct;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHoop(sess, dt) {\\n    const many = !!(sess.classMode && sess.seats.length > 1);\\n    const list = many ? sess.seats : [sess.seats[0]];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {\\n      const seat = list[i];\\n540→      const box = i === 0 ? sess.fam : (seat._hoop || (seat._hoop = { omega: 0, ang: 0, band: 0, out: 0, hoops: 1, caught: 0, drops: 0, score: 0, otherWay: false, toss: null, tossT: 2, haveAng: false }));\\n      const rng = i === 0 ? sess.rng : (seat._rng || (seat._rng = E.rng((sess.seed + i * 131) >>> 0)));\\n      stepHoopOne(sess, seat, box, rng, dt, i === 0);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepJog(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const edgeL = seat.paceL && !fam.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = seat.paceR && !fam.prevR;\\n550→    fam.prevL = seat.paceL; fam.prevR = seat.paceR;\\n    if (edgeL || edgeR) { fam.steps++; fam.hist.push(fam.t); }\\n    while (fam.hist.length && fam.t - fam.hist[0] > 1) fam.hist.shift();\\n    fam.cad = fam.hist.length;\\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogLo : 2.6;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogHi : 3.4;\\n    const zoned = fam.cad >= lo && fam.cad <= hi && fam.stitch <= 0;\\n    if (zoned) fam.zone += dt;\\n    if (fam.cad > 4.2) fam.sprint += dt; else fam.sprint = 0;\\n    if (fam.sprint > 2 && fam.stitch <= 0) fam.stitch = 3;\\n560→    if (fam.stitch > 0) fam.stitch -= dt;\\n    const speed = (G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogSpeed : 1) * (zoned ? 8 : 3);\\n    fam.z += speed * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 1.6 * dt;\\n    const cups = [12, 28, 44, 58];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) {\\n      if (fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= cups[i] && fam.z - speed * dt < cups[i]) {\\n        const cx = (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8);\\n        if (Math.abs(fam.x - cx) < 0.45) { fam.cups++; fam.gotCup = fam.gotCup || {}; fam.gotCup[i] = true; }\\n570→      }\\n    }\\n    fam.nextCup = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) if (!(fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) && fam.z < cups[i]) { fam.nextCup = { x: (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8), z: cups[i] }; break; }\\n    const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSlalom(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n580→    if (fam.done) return;\\n    if (fam.tumble > 0) { fam.tumble -= dt; return; }\\n    const base = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiSpeed : 220;\\n    const turn = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiTurn : 1.6;\\n    let spd = base;\\n    if (seat.uy > 0.3) spd *= 1.35;\\n    if (seat.uy < -0.3) spd *= 0.6;\\n    fam.z += spd * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 78 * turn / 1.6 * dt;\\n    const gates = G.GATES;\\n590→    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) {\\n      const g = gates[i];\\n      if (fam.missed[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= g.z && fam.z - spd * dt < g.z) {\\n        fam.missed[i] = Math.abs(fam.x - g.x) > fam.half;\\n        if (fam.missed[i]) fam.pen += 3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < G.OBSTACLES.length; i++) {\\n      const o = G.OBSTACLES[i];\\n600→      if (fam.hitO && fam.hitO[i]) continue;\\n      if (Math.abs(fam.z - o.z) < 80 && Math.abs(fam.x - o.x) < 16) {\\n        fam.hitO = fam.hitO || {}; fam.hitO[i] = true; fam.tumble = 1.2; fam.pen += 1.2;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    let next = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) if (gates[i].z > fam.z - 20) { next = gates[i]; break; }\\n    fam.nextGate = next;\\n    if (fam.z >= fam.finish) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n610→      const par = 58, worst = 90;\\n      const time = fam.t + fam.pen;\\n      sess.pct = clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepTray(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!seat.bal) {\\n620→      seat.bal = new G.Balance({ k: 14, c: 8, s: 1, A: 0.5, nf: 0.8, R: 0.4, push: null }, sess.seed, {});\\n    }\\n    const sk = skillName(seat);\\n    if (sk) {\\n      const aim = sk === 'poor' ? 0.25 : sk === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    }\\n    seat.bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const Gv = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayG : 420;\\n    const fr = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayFric : 3;\\n630→    if (fam.world) {\\n      if (G.dev && G.dev.on && fam.world.bodies) {\\n        const mu = 0.04 * fr;\\n        fam.world.bodies.forEach(function (b) { if (b && b._olive) b.friction = mu; });\\n      }\\n      if (fam.gecko) fam.gecko.moveTo(78, 100 + Math.sin(fam.t * 0.55) * 36, 0, 22, 0);\\n      fam.world.gravity = [seat.bal.px * Gv, -seat.bal.py * Gv];\\n      fam.world.wake();\\n      fam.world.step(dt);\\n      const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n640→      const need = spec ? spec.olives.length : 0;\\n      const gotHere = fam.got - fam.trayGot0;\\n      if (gotHere >= need) {\\n        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n650→    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    arm(bal, skill);\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? leanFor(seat).effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n660→    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (!fam.rope) fam.rope = Object.assign({}, bal.set);\\n    /* Faster walking sways the rope. The set on the balance is a copy, so the band table stays put.\\n       ropeS is the dev slider for that instability. At its default it matches the laundry set. */\\n    const baseS = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.ropeS : fam.rope.s;\\n    bal.set = Object.assign({}, fam.rope, { s: baseS + effort * 4 });\\n    fam.air -= dt;\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n670→      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0.04) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    /* One jump per pin, long enough to land past it. Air freezes the plate, not the walker. */\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0 && ahead && fam.cleared !== ahead.x && ahead.dist < 0.95) {\\n      fam.air = Math.min(0.85, ahead.dist / Math.max(0.45, spd) + 0.12);\\n      fam.cleared = ahead.x;\\n    }\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"520→      box.toss.eta -= dt;\\n      const hit = box.toss.side < 0 ? seat.catchL : seat.catchR;\\n      if (hit && Math.abs(box.toss.eta) <= 0.25) { box.caught++; box.hoops = Math.min(6, box.hoops + 1); box.toss = null; }\\n      else if (box.toss.eta < -0.25) box.toss = null;\\n    }\\n    const best = sess.limit * 1.4;\\n    const pct = clamp(box.score / best, 0, 1);\\n    if (primary) {\\n      sess.pct = pct;\\n      sess.fam.omega = box.omega;\\n530→      sess.fam.otherWay = box.otherWay;\\n    }\\n    if (sess.classMode) seat.pct = pct;\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepHoop(sess, dt) {\\n    const many = !!(sess.classMode && sess.seats.length > 1);\\n    const list = many ? sess.seats : [sess.seats[0]];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {\\n      const seat = list[i];\\n540→      const box = i === 0 ? sess.fam : (seat._hoop || (seat._hoop = { omega: 0, ang: 0, band: 0, out: 0, hoops: 1, caught: 0, drops: 0, score: 0, otherWay: false, toss: null, tossT: 2, haveAng: false }));\\n      const rng = i === 0 ? sess.rng : (seat._rng || (seat._rng = E.rng((sess.seed + i * 131) >>> 0)));\\n      stepHoopOne(sess, seat, box, rng, dt, i === 0);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepJog(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    const edgeL = seat.paceL && !fam.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = seat.paceR && !fam.prevR;\\n550→    fam.prevL = seat.paceL; fam.prevR = seat.paceR;\\n    if (edgeL || edgeR) { fam.steps++; fam.hist.push(fam.t); }\\n    while (fam.hist.length && fam.t - fam.hist[0] > 1) fam.hist.shift();\\n    fam.cad = fam.hist.length;\\n    const lo = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogLo : 2.6;\\n    const hi = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogHi : 3.4;\\n    const zoned = fam.cad >= lo && fam.cad <= hi && fam.stitch <= 0;\\n    if (zoned) fam.zone += dt;\\n    if (fam.cad > 4.2) fam.sprint += dt; else fam.sprint = 0;\\n    if (fam.sprint > 2 && fam.stitch <= 0) fam.stitch = 3;\\n560→    if (fam.stitch > 0) fam.stitch -= dt;\\n    const speed = (G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.jogSpeed : 1) * (zoned ? 8 : 3);\\n    fam.z += speed * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 1.6 * dt;\\n    const cups = [12, 28, 44, 58];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) {\\n      if (fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= cups[i] && fam.z - speed * dt < cups[i]) {\\n        const cx = (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8);\\n        if (Math.abs(fam.x - cx) < 0.45) { fam.cups++; fam.gotCup = fam.gotCup || {}; fam.gotCup[i] = true; }\\n570→      }\\n    }\\n    fam.nextCup = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < cups.length; i++) if (!(fam.gotCup && fam.gotCup[i]) && fam.z < cups[i]) { fam.nextCup = { x: (i % 2 ? 0.8 : -0.8), z: cups[i] }; break; }\\n    const share = fam.t > 0 ? fam.zone / fam.t : 0;\\n    sess.pct = clamp(0.7 * share + 0.3 * (fam.cups / fam.cupN), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSlalom(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n580→    if (fam.done) return;\\n    if (fam.tumble > 0) { fam.tumble -= dt; return; }\\n    const base = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiSpeed : 220;\\n    const turn = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.skiTurn : 1.6;\\n    let spd = base;\\n    if (seat.uy > 0.3) spd *= 1.35;\\n    if (seat.uy < -0.3) spd *= 0.6;\\n    fam.z += spd * dt;\\n    fam.x += (seat.ux || 0) * 78 * turn / 1.6 * dt;\\n    const gates = G.GATES;\\n590→    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) {\\n      const g = gates[i];\\n      if (fam.missed[i]) continue;\\n      if (fam.z >= g.z && fam.z - spd * dt < g.z) {\\n        fam.missed[i] = Math.abs(fam.x - g.x) > fam.half;\\n        if (fam.missed[i]) fam.pen += 3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < G.OBSTACLES.length; i++) {\\n      const o = G.OBSTACLES[i];\\n600→      if (fam.hitO && fam.hitO[i]) continue;\\n      if (Math.abs(fam.z - o.z) < 80 && Math.abs(fam.x - o.x) < 16) {\\n        fam.hitO = fam.hitO || {}; fam.hitO[i] = true; fam.tumble = 1.2; fam.pen += 1.2;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    let next = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < gates.length; i++) if (gates[i].z > fam.z - 20) { next = gates[i]; break; }\\n    fam.nextGate = next;\\n    if (fam.z >= fam.finish) {\\n      fam.done = true;\\n610→      const par = 58, worst = 90;\\n      const time = fam.t + fam.pen;\\n      sess.pct = clamp((worst - time) / (worst - par), 0, 1);\\n      sess.ended = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepTray(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0];\\n    if (!seat.bal) {\\n620→      seat.bal = new G.Balance({ k: 14, c: 8, s: 1, A: 0.5, nf: 0.8, R: 0.4, push: null }, sess.seed, {});\\n    }\\n    const sk = skillName(seat);\\n    if (sk) {\\n      const aim = sk === 'poor' ? 0.25 : sk === 'average' ? 0.7 : 0.95;\\n      seat.ux = aim; seat.uy = 0.02;\\n    }\\n    seat.bal.step(dt, seat.ux, seat.uy, 0, 0, { x: 0, y: 0 });\\n    const Gv = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayG : 420;\\n    const fr = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.trayFric : 3;\\n630→    if (fam.world) {\\n      if (G.dev && G.dev.on && fam.world.bodies) {\\n        const mu = 0.04 * fr;\\n        fam.world.bodies.forEach(function (b) { if (b && b._olive) b.friction = mu; });\\n      }\\n      if (fam.gecko) fam.gecko.moveTo(78, 100 + Math.sin(fam.t * 0.55) * 36, 0, 22, 0);\\n      fam.world.gravity = [seat.bal.px * Gv, -seat.bal.py * Gv];\\n      fam.world.wake();\\n      fam.world.step(dt);\\n      const spec = G.TRAYS[fam.trayI];\\n640→      const need = spec ? spec.olives.length : 0;\\n      const gotHere = fam.got - fam.trayGot0;\\n      if (gotHere >= need) {\\n        fam.trayI++;\\n        if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) { fam.world = null; sess.ended = true; }\\n        else loadTray(sess);\\n      }\\n    } else if (fam.trayI >= G.TRAYS.length) sess.ended = true;\\n    const share = sess.limit > 0 ? clamp((sess.limit - fam.t) / sess.limit, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    const base = fam.total ? fam.got / fam.total : 0;\\n650→    sess.pct = sess.ended || fam.t > 1 ? clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * (sess.ended ? share : share)), 0, 1) : base;\\n    if (sess.ended) sess.pct = clamp(base * (0.8 + 0.2 * share), 0, 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepLaundry(sess, dt) {\\n    const fam = sess.fam, seat = sess.seats[0], bal = seat.bal;\\n    const skill = skillName(seat);\\n    if (skill) seat.effort = EFFORT[skill] || 0.5;\\n    arm(bal, skill);\\n    const effort = clamp(seat.local && !skill ? leanFor(seat).effort : seat.effort, 0, 1);\\n660→    const spd = effort * 2.2;\\n    if (!fam.rope) fam.rope = Object.assign({}, bal.set);\\n    /* Faster walking sways the rope. The set on the balance is a copy, so the band table stays put.\\n       ropeS is the dev slider for that instability. At its default it matches the laundry set. */\\n    const baseS = G.dev && G.dev.on ? G.dev.v.ropeS : fam.rope.s;\\n    bal.set = Object.assign({}, fam.rope, { s: baseS + effort * 4 });\\n    fam.air -= dt;\\n    const pins = [8, 19, 30, 41, 50];\\n    let ahead = null;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pins.length; i++) {\\n670→      const d = pins[i] - fam.x;\\n      if (d > 0.04) { ahead = { dist: d, x: pins[i] }; break; }\\n    }\\n    fam.pinAhead = ahead;\\n    /* One jump per pin, long enough to land past it. Air freezes the plate, not the walker. */\\n    if (seat.jump && fam.air <= 0 && ahead && fam.cleared !== ahead.x && ahead.dist < 0.95) {\\n      fam.air = Math.min(0.85, ahead.dist / Math.max(0.45, spd) + 0.12);\\n      fam.cleared = ahead.x;\\n    }\\n    bal.holdP = fam.air > 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/d