{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_707","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" simulation does not affect the comparison. The subsequent KeyD test is unaffected.The tests-all.log shows 19 passed tests but only contains three lines.\n\nThe reference session only mutates shared globals like `G.lean` and `G.subtitle`, not the live session object itself.\n\nA timing bug was spotted in the Morning Class test: `now` is set to 0, but `game.advance(2)` and later `game.advance(8)` advance the clock while `now` remains frozen at 0. The hub time calculation may be using stale values.\n\nThe log format is correct for a clean run. I need to verify it was generated after the fixes by checking timestamps and test source alignment.\n\nThe frozen `now` value does not break the Morning Class test. `api.time()` returns that stale timestamp, so `tms` stays at zero during `game.advance`. The session still advances because `local` remains below 45 and `s.update(dt)` runs every frame. `playTime` increases correctly.\n\nThe test file contains the new cases, so 19 passes would include them. The log is too brief to satisfy the verification plan's requirement for captured\n\nThe Morning Class  stdout and stderr.assertion is reasonable if the human's percentage is not coincidentally close to the good bot's. I will check tests-all.log to confirm the test passed. Next, I am examining Gap 3: Ghosts.\n\nThe tests appear honest because they call real game functions like boot() and advance(). I am now hunting for genuine bugs. In class mode, seat 0's rhythm chart updates via rh.update(), but hit detection is gated by skill && !classMode. Other seats use stepSeatChart which reads seatInput.\n\nChecking the Ghosts test math. The test sends two ghost messages and asserts the matching ghost rig wob equals [0.52, -0.2]. The wob formula sums l[1]+w[1] for the first component and l[0]+w[0] for the second. With the provided values this produces","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-637c0986-77cc-43ff-b570-5ee78c82f328-16","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Rhythm\\s*=|prototype\\.update|this\\.hit|pressed\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/modules/rhythm.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-637c0986-77cc-43ff-b570-5ee78c82f328-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/boot.js","offset":260,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-637c0986-77cc-43ff-b570-5ee78c82f328-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":860,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3875,"output_tokens":786,"cache_read_input_tokens":70912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"90bf2cca-f712-4ba3-b0eb-3549c1da50b1"}
