{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_712","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" intent, per-seat balances, and an assertion that two different inputs produce two different scores. If `stepStep` still copies seat 0's shared chart onto seat 0 while giving others their own charts, the test only passes if seat 0's input is properly isolated.\n\nThe candle test already validates two different inputs, so the root cause is fixed for all activities using leanFor. Extra seats in stepStep use seatInput rather than lean. Seat 0's shared rhythm chart may read global game.input, which would only work if it is bound to player 0. I will also checkVerifying whether actor() uses the alpha option. whether finish still incorrectly zeros human scores.\n\nThe `finish` method preserves local human scores by keeping `q.pct` when `q.local` is true. Non-scoring bots correctly","signature":"eMFs8xumf9OWzlkXY2lanWCPTJalRVH1ne1S2HpliKJTNEVPy1yH0UHIZf0jtxoJ571wLsiJK+Gb7T1R45yG565cQAdOwpl6d+aStcKmIR82S83jJJ7XX+hPPA2SDYXkz28FpbAAFuywOGT79Xy1U4gMHdQUGNb1bdyjFt7vFBBGBsCv3YYQi5wtFpbjbgmjAPoXtFtfBu0cvipP4oERI6JjinqKeXU5Hnc"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b55d3eaa-db52-420c-a0c0-3cd4b41f1154-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":2000,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b55d3eaa-db52-420c-a0c0-3cd4b41f1154-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":1020,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b55d3eaa-db52-420c-a0c0-3cd4b41f1154-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/implementer/tests-all.lo