{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_725","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" of expensive re-runs. I may run one cheap spot-check if I suspect a bug. I am looking harder for a real bug first. The stepSeatChart notes are fresh on first creation, so the started flag is harmless.\n\nA potential mismatch between `CLASS_INPUT` and `game.input` for player 0 in class step mode needs verification. The `dev.update` keyboard path for slider presses","signature":"vHPWsGq95NFyroBKe8QpYcU+mSUQBEyR5UL7jhAiIgk5JspeMEEm+MNo/lDKch8"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-93eae821-b75e-4a46-8165-4b0f77461c0f-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","offset":3680,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-93eae821-b75e-4a46-8165-4b0f77461c0f-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"up:\\s*\\[|DEFAULT\\s*=","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1908,"output_tokens":193,"cache_read_input_tokens":111232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"c60b726b-5682-4e29-a8ad-32a991a30969"}
