{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_727","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" shown by passing tests. Enter-to-confirm mapping is also confirmed functional.\n\nPad0 maps to confirm, so the bot flag assertion passed. The bot activation test advances 0.6 secondsListing CLASS_INPUT  after stork; the session likely remains active because the activity time limit is shorter than that interval, keeping seats[0].bal valid.actions in order.\n\nThe ghost wob test passed, so stepRig does not overwrite the wob value. The code computes wob from l and w before stepRig runs, and the assertion checks after the full\n\nDirectional actions advance including draw. Exact wob values were map to halfKeys. Non-directional preserved. actions use left and right buttons in order. Breath maps to F or Period. CatchL maps to G or Slash.\n\nCatchR maps to H or Comma. More maps to R or L. Retry maps to T or Semicolon. The half-keyboard layout matches the world.js comment. Step uses WASD for both players. Jump is excluded from CLASS_INPUT. The candle test now balances correctly","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b03f8cfd-a7ac-4f48-b961-8fc252e207b9-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"G\\.driver\\s*=","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b03f8cfd-a7ac-4f48-b961-8fc252e207b9-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":1,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b03f8cfd-a7ac-4f48-b961-8fc252e207b9-25","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":1120,"limit":80}},