oves `bal.px`.\\n- Ghosts: `drawGhostRigs` poses from `l`+`w` and calls `r.actor` with `alpha: 0.5` only when `gh.a` matches the event (`world.js:954`). Engine `actor` composites when `alpha < 1`. The hub-ghosts test checks the call, the wobble, and that the other event is not drawn.\\n- Dev tools: Jump, Bot: good (Pad0), tray friction, and rope stiffness are driven by keys/pad and applied in `stepTray` / `stepLaundry`. The dev-sliders test reaches them through input, not `toolAct()`, except the pre-existing pose viewer.\\n\\nLaunch logs agree: title Spine Wee, canvas 1920×1080 (buffer 480×270, diff 32160), music 0.1, PlayStation glyphs, Enter to slots, no page errors, no network. `title-1920x1080.png` is a filled title. `handoff-static.log` is PASS.\\n\\n## Defect\\n\\n`G.dev.update` (`ui.js:277`) does:\\n\\n```js\\nif (input.repeat && (input.pressed('up') && (input.held.has('ArrowUp') || input.lastDevice === 'gamepad'))) this.i = (this.i + keys.length - 1) % keys.length;\\nif (up && input.pressed('up')) { this.i = (this.i + keys.length - 1) % keys.length; eat(input, 'up'); }\\n```\\n\\n`Input.prototype.repeat` is a function (`engine/my-3d2dge.js:1049`), so the first condition is true whenever Up is pressed. `pressed` is not consumed until `eat` on the next line, so both run. Input: dev panel open, cursor on slider 0, one ArrowUp (or Pad12). Expected: index wraps to the last slider. Actual: index moves two rows. Down is single-step, which is why `sliderTo` still passes.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-2-skeptic-1.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-2-skeptic-1.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-2-skeptic-1.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"Prior gaps are fixed and the gating runs hold. One new defect in the dev-panel input path remains.\\n\\n## Prior gaps\\n\\n- Local Class: `stepHold` / `stepCandle` / `stepRep` / `stepHoop` step every seat when `classMode`, and `finish` keeps each seat's `pct` (`play.js:281`, `play.js:804`). `readLean` fills `G.leans[i]` (`boot.js:115`). `tests/run.mjs` `class seats` holds P2 ArrowRight on candle and asserts different `px` and different scores. `19 passed, 0 failed`.\\n- Morning Class: the round builds the session with no driver and sets `G.driver = null` unless attract (`world.js:1012`). The fake-hub test asserts a still human is not the good-bot pct and that KeyD moves `bal.px`.\\n- Ghosts: `drawGhostRigs` poses from `l`+`w` and calls `r.actor` with `alpha: 0.5` only when `gh.a` matches the event (`world.js:954`). Engine `actor` composites when `alpha < 1`. The hub-ghosts test checks the call, the wobble, and that the other event is not drawn.\\n- Dev tools: Jump, Bot: good (Pad0), tray friction, and rope stiffness are driven by keys/pad and applied in `stepTray` / `stepLaundry`. The dev-sliders test reaches them through input, not `toolAct()`, except the pre-existing pose viewer.\\n\\nLaunch logs agree: title Spine Wee, canvas 1920×1080 (buffer 480×270, diff 32160), music 0.1, PlayStation glyphs, Enter to slots, no page errors, no network. `title-1920x1080.png` is a filled title. `handoff-static.log` is PASS.\\n\\n## Defect\\n\\n`G.dev.update` (`ui.js:277`) does:\\n\\n```js\\nif (input.repeat && (input.pressed('up') && (input.held.has('ArrowUp') || input.lastDevice === 'gamepad'))) this.i = (this.i + keys.length - 1) % keys.length;\\nif (up && input.pressed('up')) { this.i = (this.i + keys.length - 1) % keys.length; eat(input, 'up'); }\\n```\\n\\n`Input.prototype.repeat` is a function (`engine/my-3d2dge.js:1049`), so the first condition is true whenever Up is pressed. `pressed` is not consumed until `eat` on the next line, so both run. Input: dev panel open, cursor on slider 0, one ArrowUp (or Pad12). Expected: index wraps to the last slider. Actual: index moves two rows. Down is single-step, which is why `sliderTo` still passes.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"4457864b-b2e3-4faf-9f67-1db1f6a7c5b3"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_736","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" input while seat 1+ use stepSeatChart.\n\nstepSeatChart sets `started` without calling `start()`, but `hit()` checks that flag so it remains safe. The shared clock and audio position are synchronized across charts. Player","signature":"Z3yi3b9f7TpbTZBlPv+d0d+M4nn7Vwp06bq3cYVpATbTipsgCmOSOHZQO+mnGsHAW4TSSKsPRuCwUoHCT9lstmeJBrNwiQR0wSr8L1YgTYT4qKdGHnKlMdaSa2l4"},{"type":"text","text":"Refuted"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5692,"output_tokens":16,"cache_read_input_tokens":121856,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"cbc98997-522f-44cc-aeb0-0e1c5766ee4f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_737","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" 2's stepSeatChart also binds to the same left/down/up/right lanes on `players[1]`.\n\nThe shared step chart only reads player 0's input, so player 2 keys cannot trigger it and scores stay separate. A manual `started` flag on seat charts is safe because they still use the shared audio position. Another bug was found: the finish logic copies percentage when `q.pct` is undefined.\n\nSeat percentages are populated correctly during step and hoop. The finish logic is sound. This issue is not refuted.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b49449b9-903b-4193-ab11-3132d41625f8-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"get input\\(\\)|this\\.players|addPlayer","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b49449b9-903b-4193-ab11-3132d41625f8-35","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"keys:\\s*'right'|half|split","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2480,"output_tokens":2418,"cache_read_input_tokens":104960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"4344c467-df91-42a5-9ab5-30554dd588ea"}
