{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_743","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Reading STAGE.md to continue the goal.\n\nThe verifier rejected completion due to a bug in game/ui.js:277. A stray line causes one ArrowUp press to move the slider cursor by two instead of one. I will remove that line and add a test asserting a single up press changes the index by exactly one. Then I will run targeted tests and re-run verification.\n\nThis bug is real but not game-breaking. The solo retreat can still finish. I will update the interview counts honestly after the fix lands and tests pass.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The dev panel treats `input.repeat` as a value, so one Up press moves the slider two rows. I’ll drop that stray line and assert a single press moves one row."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0ba6810d-774b-428a-9b6f-76c1d386712c-74","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"c6","content":"Fix dev panel up moving two rows","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"c7","content":"Retest, update interview, re-run verification","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0ba6810d-774b-428a-9b6f-76c1d386712c-75","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/ui.js","offset":230,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":118175,"output_tokens":633,"cache_read_input_tokens":6656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"63402b2a-7777-4bbb-bfb4-7ae64a7d90f0"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0ba6810d-774b-428a-9b6f-76c1d386712c-74","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [completed] c1: Per-seat Class lean and distinct scores\\n- [completed] c2: Morning Class human driver, not good bot\\n- [completed] c3: Draw translucent hub ghosts from lean\\n- [completed] c4: Dev panel jump, bot, trayFric, ropeS via input\\n- [completed] c5: Targeted tests then full suite and hand-in\\n- [in_progress] c6: Fix dev panel up moving two rows\\n- [pending] c7: Retest, update interview, re-run verification\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Per-seat Class lean and distinct scores\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Morning Class human driver, not good bot\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Draw translucent hub ghosts from lean\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Dev panel jump, bot, trayFric, ropeS via input\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Targeted tests then full suite and hand-in\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Fix dev panel up moving two rows\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"content\":\"Retest, update interview, re-run verification\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"}],\"state\":{\"todos\":{\"c1\":{\"content\":\"Per-seat Class lean and distinct scores\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"c2\":{\"content\":\"Morning Class human driver, not good bot\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"c3\":{\"content\":\"Draw translucent hub ghosts from lean\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"c4\":{\"content\":\"Dev panel jump, bot, trayFric, ropeS via input\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"c5\":{\"content\":\"Targeted tests then full suite and hand-in\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"c6\":{\"content\":\"Fix dev panel up moving two rows\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},\"c7\":{\"content\":\"Retest, update interview, re-run verification\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"}}}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0ba6810d-774b-428a-9b6f-76c1d386712c-75","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"230→    if (input.pressed('cancel')) {\\n      eat(input, 'cancel');\\n      if (this.poseMode) { this.poseMode = false; return; }\\n      if (this.jumpMode) { this.jumpMode = false; return; }\\n      this.close();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.poseMode) {\\n      const names = this.clipNames();\\n      const n = names.length || 1;\\n240→      if (input.pressed('up')) { this.poseI = (this.poseI + n - 1) % n; this.poseT = 0; eat(input, 'up'); }\\n      if (input.pressed('down')) { this.poseI = (this.poseI + 1) % n; this.poseT = 0; eat(input, 'down'); }\\n      const dur = (this.currentClip() && this.currentClip().dur) || 2;\\n      if (input.pressed('left') || input.repeat('left')) { this.poseT = Math.max(0, this.poseT - 0.05); eat(input, 'left'); }\\n      if (input.pressed('right') || input.repeat('right')) { this.poseT = Math.min(dur, this.poseT + 0.05); eat(input, 'right'); }\\n      if (input.pressed('confirm')) { this.printPose(); eat(input, 'confirm'); }\\n      void dt;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.jumpMode) {\\n250→      const row = this.jumpRow;\\n      if (input.pressed('up')) { this.jumpRow = (row + 3) % 4; eat(input, 'up'); }\\n      if (input.pressed('down')) { this.jumpRow = (row + 1) % 4; eat(input, 'down'); }\\n      const dir = (input.pressed('right') || input.repeat('right')) ? 1 : (input.pressed('left') || input.repeat('left')) ? -1 : 0;\\n      if (dir) {\\n        eat(input, dir > 0 ? 'right' : 'left');\\n        if (this.jumpRow === 0) this.jumpDay = Math.max(1, Math.min(5, this.jumpDay + dir));\\n        else if (this.jumpRow === 1) this.jumpSceneI = (this.jumpSceneI + dir + this.jumpScenes.length) % this.jumpScenes.length;\\n        else if (this.jumpRow === 2) this.jumpActI = (this.jumpActI + dir + this.jumpActs.length) % this.jumpActs.length;\\n        else this.jumpTier = this.jumpTier === 1 ? 2 : 1;\\n260→      }\\n      if (input.pressed('confirm')) {\\n        eat(input, 'confirm');\\n        const act = this.jumpActs[this.jumpActI];\\n        const o = { day: this.jumpDay, tier: this.jumpTier };\\n        if (act) o.activity = act;\\n        else o.scene = this.jumpScenes[this.jumpSceneI];\\n        this.jumpMode = false;\\n        this.jump(o);\\n      }\\n270→      void dt;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const up = input.held.has('ArrowUp') || input.held.has('Pad12');\\n    const down = input.held.has('ArrowDown') || input.held.has('Pad13');\\n    const left = input.held.has('ArrowLeft') || input.held.has('Pad14');\\n    const right = input.held.has('ArrowRight') || input.held.has('Pad15');\\n    if (input.repeat && (input.pressed('up') && (input.held.has('ArrowUp') || input.lastDevice === 'gamepad'))) this.i = (this.i + keys.length - 1) % keys.length;\\n    if (up && input.pressed('up')) { this.i = (this.i + keys.length - 1) % keys.length; eat(input, 'up'); }\\n    if (down && input.pressed('down')) { this.i = (this.i + 1) % keys.length; eat(input, 'down'); }\\n280→    const k = keys[this.i];\\n    if ((left && (input.pressed('left') || input.repeat('left'))) ) { this.adjust(k, -1); eat(input, 'left'); }\\n    if ((right && (input.pressed('right') || input.repeat('right')))) { this.adjust(k, 1); eat(input, 'right'); }\\n    if (input.pressed('retry')) this.reset();\\n    if (input.pressed('confirm')) { eat(input, 'confirm'); this.toolAct(this.tool); }\\n    void dt;\\n  };\\n  G.dev.toolAct = function (i) {\\n    const p = G.profile;\\n    if (i === 0 && G.finishNow) G.finishNow(3);\\n290→    else if (i === 1 && G.finishNow) G.finishNow(1);\\n    else if (i === 2 && G.grantAll) G.grantAll();\\n    else if (i === 3 && p) { p.minutes += 10; if (G.refreshUnlocks) G.refreshUnlocks(); }\\n    else if (i === 4 && p) { p.spine = 40; p.forceAge = 40; }\\n    else if (i === 5 && G.freshProfile) { G.profile = G.freshProfile(); }\\n    else if (i === 6) this.bot = 'good';\\n    else if (i === 7) this.bot = null;\\n    else if (i === 8) this.trace = !this.trace;\\n    else if (i === 9) { this.frame = !this.frame; if (G.game) G.game.timeScale = this.frame ? 0 : this.v.timeScale; }\\n    else if (i === 10 && G.startAttract) G.startAttract();\\n300→    else if (i === 11) { this.poseMode = !this.poseMode; if (this.poseMode) { this.poseT = 0; this.printed = ''; } }\\n    else if (i === 12 && G.game && G.game.debug) { try { console.log(JSON.stringify(G.game.debug.snapshot())); } catch (e) { /* keep playing */ } }\\n    else if (TOOLS[i] === 'Jump') { this.jumpMode = !this.jumpMode; if (this.jumpMode) this.jumpRow = 0; }\\n  };\\n  G.dev.drawPose = function (r) {\\n    const lib = G.lib && G.lib();\\n    const clip = this.currentClip();\\n    if (!lib || !clip || !G.makeRig || !r.actor) return;\\n    if (!this._rig) this._rig = G.makeRig(G.playerOpts(null, 2.1));\\n    const rig = this._rig;\\n310→    try {\\n      rig.mocap = lib.sample(clip, this.poseT || 0);\\n      rig.wob = [0, 0];\\n      rig.body = null;\\n      rig._tgt = 1.57;\\n      G.stepRig(rig, 1 / 60, 0, 0);\\n      r.actor(8, 6, 0, function (g, ox, oy) { rig.draw(g, ox, oy, r.view); });\\n    } catch (e) { /* the name and the row still show */ }\\n  };\\n  G.dev.draw = function (r) {\\n320→    if (!this.panel || !r) return;\\n    if (this.poseMode) this.drawPose(r);\\n    const self = this;\\n    r.overlay(function (g) {\\n      const w = Math.round(r.W * .33);\\n      E.px.rect(g, 0, 0, w, r.H, 'rgba(247,251,251,.92)');\\n      text(g, 'DEV', 8, 6, '#14a8c8', 1);\\n      const start = Math.max(0, self.i - 8);\\n      for (let n = 0; n < 12 && start + n < self.keys.length; n++) {\\n        c