b1-6ed014b14610"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_765","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The patch file does not include ui.js.\n\nThe patch contains only matrix configuration and run results, not the game source. The game folder may be gitignored. Direct verification of ui.js and tests on disk is the reliable source. The verdict is Not Refuted.\n\nThe deviations section shows no new weakening of plan.md criteria. The only edits are cumulative deviations and checklist ticks from prior rounds. No self-serving criterion changes were introduced.\n\nDrafting the JSON verdict file now. The markdown details will be embedded as a properly escaped string inside the JSON object.\n\nThe prior gap was caused by `input.repeat` being truthy, which triggered a second decrement on the same `ArrowUp` or `Pad12` press. The fix in `game/ui.js:273-278` now steps the slider once per `pressed` event and removes the `input.repeat` guard entirely.\n\nThe built HTML also enforces a single step per press. The test suite validates this: it presses and releases ArrowUp or Pad12 once, asserts the index advances by exactly one, and confirms two downward presses return to zero.\n\nThe handler only runs while the dev panel is open, and the test asserts `G.dev.panel && G.dev.on` first. The source files and test logs both show a successful run on 2026-11-05 with 19 passed tests and zero failures.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The stray double-step is gone, and the suite that ran after that edit asserts one row per press. I am writing the verdict."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-13ea00de-660a-43f8-9ddf-2680365a9626-23","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-3-skeptic-0.md","content":"# Skeptic round 3\n\nPrior gap: one ArrowUp or Pad12 press on the dev panel moved the slider cursor by two rows. `input.repeat` is a function, so a truthy check always ran and decremented `G.dev.i` on the same `pressed('up')` as the real line.\n\n## Fix\n\n`game/ui.js:273-278` steps once. Up is held ArrowUp or Pad12, and the index changes only inside `if (up && input.pressed('up'))`. Down is the same single step. A search of the game tree finds no remaining `input.repeat &&`. The built HTML inlines that same handler at lines 19610-19615.\n\n`engine/my-3d2dge.js:1049` makes `repeat(action)` return true on the press frame. Left and right still combine `pressed` and `repeat` with OR (`ui.js:280-281`), so one side press still adjusts the value once. Up and down do not call `repeat`.\n\n## Test\n\n`tests/run.mjs:326-345` opens Dev Mode, asserts the panel is on, then `rowStep` does one `input.press`, one `advance(1/120)`, and one `release`. It requires `(beforeI - G.dev.i + n) % n === 1` for `ArrowUp` and for `Pad12`. The old double decrement would leave `moved === 2`. Two `ArrowDown` presses then require `G.dev.i === 0` (`run.mjs:346-354`), so down is one row as well. `world.js:1170` calls `G.dev.update` only while the panel is open, which the test checks first. `press` (`my-3d2dge.js:1018-1024`) maps ArrowUp and Pad12 onto action `up` (`my-3d2dge.js:1310`).\n\n## Evidence\n\n`ui.js` and `tests/run.mjs` were written at 2026-11-05 02:29:21 -0700. `suite-progress.txt` then records `RUN rules dev sliders 2026-11-05T09:29:29.529Z` / `OK dev sliders`, then `RUN all 2026-11-05T09:29:43.843Z` with every group OK, including dev sliders, class, hub, and both browser launches. `tests-all.log` (02:31:10 -0700) is `19 passed, 0 failed`.\n\n`buildHtml()` runs before `launchOnce` (`run.mjs:844-853`). `launch-1.log` and `launch-2.log` (02:30:12 and 02:30:13 -0700) show title Spine Wee, canvas 1920×1080, painted diff 32160, music 0.1, PlayStation glyphs, Enter leaving the title for the save slots, and no page errors. The HTML mtime 02:30:24 is the hub case calling `buildHtml()` again (`run.mjs:920`) after those launches.\n\n## Plan\n\nThe plan diff only checks off the existing task list and keeps the three deviations already on record: tier-2 good is at least 1 star, laundry rewinds only on a missed pin, and section 3 bands are the mean of 12 seeds. No gating sentence was removed or loosened.\n\nNot refuted.\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-13ea00de-660a-43f8-9ddf-2680365a9626-24","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-verdict-0c0bba67d95a-3-0.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"ui.js:277 steps once on pressed('up'); run.mjs:334-345 asserts ArrowUp and Pad12 each move G.dev.i by 1; suite-progress RUN all 2026-11-05T09:29:43Z and tests-all.log 19 passed, 0 failed after the edit; launch-1/2 title 1920x1080 diff 32160 music 0.1 Enter to slots.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"# Skeptic round 3\\n\\nPrior gap: one ArrowUp or Pad12 press on the dev panel moved the slider cursor by two rows. `input.repeat` is a function, so a truthy check always ran and decremented `G.dev.i` on the same `pressed('up')` as the real line.\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\n`game/ui.js:273-278` steps once. Up is held ArrowUp or Pad12, and the index changes only inside `if (up && input.pressed('up'))`. Down is the same single step. A search of the game tree finds no remaining `input.repeat &&`. The built HTML inlines that same handler at lines 19610-19615.\\n\\n`engine/my-3d2dge.js:1049` makes `repeat(action)` return true on the press frame. Left and right still combine `pressed` and `repeat` with OR (`ui.js:280-281`), so one side press still adjusts the value once. Up and down do not call `repeat`.\\n\\n## Test\\n\\n`tests/run.mjs:326-345` opens Dev Mode, asserts the panel is on, then `rowStep` does one `input.press`, one `advance(1/120)`, and one `release`. It requires `(beforeI - G.dev.i + n) % n === 1` for `ArrowUp` and for `Pad12`. The old double decrement would leave `moved === 2`. Two `ArrowDown` presses then require `G.dev.i === 0` (`run.mjs:346-354`), so down is one row as well. `world.js:1170` calls `G.dev.update` only while the panel is open, which the test checks first. `press` (`my-3d2dge.js:1018-1024`) maps ArrowUp and Pad12 onto action `up` (`my-3d2dge.js:1310`).\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n`ui.js` and `tests/run.mjs` were written at 2026-11-05 02:29:21 -0700. `suite-progress.txt` then records `RUN rules dev sliders 2026-11-05T09:29:29.529Z` / `OK dev sliders`, then `RUN all 2026-11-05T09:29:43.843Z` with every group OK, including dev sliders, class, hub, and both browser launches. `tests-all.log` (02:31:10 -0700) is `19 passed, 0 failed`.\\n\\n`buildHtml()` runs before `launchOnce` (`run.mjs:844-853`). `launch-1.log` and `launch-2.log` (02:30:12 and 02:30:13 -0700) show title Spine Wee, canvas 1920×1080, painted diff 32160, music 0.1, PlayStation glyphs, Enter leaving the title for the save slots, and no page errors. The HTML mtime 02:30:24 is the hub case calling `buildHtml()` again (`run.mjs:920`) after those launches.\\n\\n## Plan\\n\\nThe plan diff only checks off the existing task list and keeps the three deviations already on record: tier-2 good is at least 1 star, laundry rewinds only on a missed pin, and section 3 bands are the mean of 12 seeds. No gating sentence was removed or loosened.\\n\\nNot refuted.\\n\"\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7001,"output_tokens":2875,"cache_read_input_tokens":66816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"7313179d-d944-4aec-84da-c19ded0a75e5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-13ea00de-660a-43f8-9ddf-2680365a9626-23","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic round 3\\n\\nPrior gap: one ArrowUp or Pad12 press on the dev panel moved the slider cursor by two rows. `input.repeat` is a function, so a truthy check always ran and decremented `G.dev.i` on the same `pressed('up')` as the real line.\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\n`game/ui.js:273-278` steps once. Up is held ArrowUp or Pad12, and the index changes only inside `if (up && input.pressed('up'))`. Down is the same single step. A search of the game tree finds no remaining `input.repeat &&`. The built HTML inlines that same handler at lines 19610-19615.\\n\\n`engine/my-3d2dge.js:1049` makes `repeat(action)` return true on the press frame. Left and right still combine `pressed` and `repeat` with OR (`ui.js:280-281`), so one side press still adjusts the value once. Up and down do not call `repeat`.\\n\\n## Test\\n\\n`tests/run.mjs:326-345` opens Dev Mode, asserts the panel is on, then `rowStep` does one `input.press`, one `advance(1/120)`, and one `release`. It requires `(beforeI - G.dev.i + n) % n === 1` for `ArrowUp` and for `Pad12`. The old double decrement would leave `moved === 2`. Two `ArrowDown` presses then require `G.dev.i === 0` (`run.mjs:346-354`), so down is one row as well. `world.js:1170` calls `G.dev.update` only while the panel is open, which the test checks first. `press` (`my-3d2dge.js:1018-1024`) maps ArrowUp and Pad12 onto action `up` (`my-3d2dge.js:1310`).\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n`ui.js` and `tests/run.mjs` were written at 2026-11-05 02:29:21 -0700. `suite-progress.txt` then records `RUN rules dev sliders 2026-11-05T09:29:29.529Z` / `OK dev sliders`, then `RUN all 2026-11-05T09:29:43.843Z` with every group OK, including dev sliders, class, hub, and both browser launches. `tests-all.log` (02:31:10 -0700) is `19 passed, 0 failed`.\\n\\n`buildHtml()` runs before `launchOnce` (`run.mjs:844-853`). `launch-1.log` and `launch-2.log` (02:30:12 and 02:30:13 -0700) show title Spine Wee, canvas 1920×1080, painted diff 32160, music 0.1, PlayStation glyphs, Enter leaving the title for the save slots, and no page errors. The HTML mtime 02:30:24 is the hub case calling `buildHtml()` again (`run.mjs:920`) after those launches.\\n\\n## Plan\\n\\nThe plan diff only checks off the existing task list and keeps the three deviations already on record: tier-2 good is at least 1 star, laundry rewinds only on a missed pin, and section 3 bands are the mean of 12 seeds. No gating sentence was removed or loosened.\\n\\nNot refuted.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-3-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-3-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-3-skeptic-0.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic round 3\\n\\nPrior gap: one ArrowUp or Pad12 press on the dev panel moved the slider cursor by two rows. `input.repeat` is a function, so a truthy check always ran and decremented `G.dev.i` on the same `pressed('up')` as the real line.\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\n`game/ui.js:273-278` steps once. Up is held ArrowUp or Pad12, and the index changes only inside `if (up && input.pressed('up'))`. Down is the same single step. A search of the game tree finds no remaining `input.repeat &&`. The built HTML inlines that same handler at lines 19610-19615.\\n\\n`engine/my-3d2dge.js:1049` makes `repeat(action)` return true on the press frame. Left and