{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_781","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe left and right slider logic is confirmed safe. The OR condition between pressed and repeat ensures adjust fires exactly once per press.\n\nThe up slider intentionally uses only pressed, not repeat. This prevents auto-repeating while holding the key.\n\nThe original bug was caused by treating input.repeat as a truthy function rather than calling it properly. The fix removed that stray line entirely.\n\nThe fix is confirmed as Not Refuted. The prior repeat logic was never correctly implemented, so removing it does not regress working behavior. The test uses input.press and asserts G.dev.i, ruling out a dishonest setup.19 tests passed. I need to count registered tests to see if the suite is complete or missing some.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The double-step is gone in source and the inlined page, and the captured suite asserts one press moves one row. I'll record that the prior gap is fixed."},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nChecking add() registrations to verify the full suite. The code looks correct, but I need to confirm one frame equals one update and that ArrowUp press does not trigger double stepping.\n\nConfirmed the input logic prevents double stepping. Up uses only `input.pressed`, so one press triggers exactly one step. Left and right use a single if condition combining pressed and repeat, which also prevents duplicate calls.\n\nThe test asserts exactly one step per press. If `G.dev.update` were called twice, the second call would not see the key as pressed because `eat()` suppresses it globally. I also need to verify that the 'rules' group is included in the `all` suite.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9f1ffb9a-040e-4c30-bad7-b6ddc445a1ad-16","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-verdict-0c0bba67d95a-3-2.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"ui.js:277 and the inlined HTML step G.dev.i once on pressed('up'); tests/run.mjs:334-345 asserts ArrowUp and Pad12 each move the index by 1; tests-all.log shows 19 passed, 0 failed after that source was saved.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"The prior gap is fixed. `G.dev.update` no longer treats `input.repeat` as a boolean. One `ArrowUp` or `Pad12` press decrements the slider index a single time (`game/ui.js:273-278`), and the same lines are in the inlined `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108.html` (around 19610). The rules test boots the real game, opens Dev Mode, presses each code once through `input.press` plus `advance`, and requires the index to change by exactly 1 (`tests/run.mjs:334-345`). Captured `tests-all.log` is newer than those files and records `19 passed, 0 failed`, including `OK dev sliders`.\"\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9f1ffb9a-040e-4c30-bad7-b6ddc445a1ad-17","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-3-skeptic-2.md","content":"# Skeptic 2 — prior gap fixed\n\nThe prior gap is fixed. `G.dev.update` no longer treats `input.repeat` as a boolean. One `ArrowUp` or `Pad12` press decrements the slider index a single time (`game/ui.js:273-278`), and the same lines are in the inlined `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108.html` (around 19610).\n\nThe rules test boots the real game, opens Dev Mode, presses each code once through `input.press` plus `advance`, and requires the index to change by exactly 1 (`tests/run.mjs:334-345`). A second step on the same press would fail that assertion.\n\nCaptured `tests-all.log` is newer than `game/ui.js`, `tests/run.mjs`, and the inlined HTML, and records `19 passed, 0 failed`, including `OK dev sliders`.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1289,"output_tokens":2677,"cache_read_input_tokens":46208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"8494f6c7-f74a-4865-9f07-b4670023bf82"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9f1ffb9a-040e-4c30-bad7-b6ddc445a1ad-16","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": false,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"ui.js:277 and the inlined HTML step G.dev.i once on pressed('up'); tests/run.mjs:334-345 asserts ArrowUp and Pad12 each move the index by 1; tests-all.log shows 19 passed, 0 failed after that source was saved.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"The prior gap is fixed. `G.dev.update` no longer treats `input.repeat` as a boolean. One `ArrowUp` or `Pad12` press decrements the slider index a single time (`game/ui.js:273-278`), and the same lines are in the inlined `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108.html` (around 19610). The rules test boots the real game, opens Dev Mode, presses each code once through `input.press` plus `advance`, and requires the index to change by exactly 1 (`tests/run.mjs:334-345`). Captured `tests-all.log` is newer than those files and records `19 passed, 0 failed`, including `OK dev sliders`.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-verdict-0c0bba67d95a-3-2.json has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-verdict-0c0bba67d95a-3-2.json has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-verdict-0c0bba67d95a-3-2.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": false,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"ui.js:277 and the inlined HTML step G.dev.i once on pressed('up'); tests/run.mjs:334-345 asserts ArrowUp and Pad12 each move the index by 1; tests-all.log shows 19 passed, 0 failed after that source was saved.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"The prior gap is fixed. `G.dev.update` no longer treats `input.repeat` as a boolean. One `ArrowUp` or `Pad12` press decrements the slider index a single time (`game/ui.js:273-278`), and the same lines are in the inlined `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108.html` (around 19610). The rules test boots the real game, opens Dev Mode, presses each code once through `input.press` plus `advance`, and requires the index to change by exactly 1 (`tests/run.mjs:334-345`). Captured `tests-all.log` is newer than those files and records `19 passed, 0 failed`, including `OK dev sliders`.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9f1ffb9a-040e-4c30-bad7-b6ddc445a1ad-17","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic 2 — prior gap fixed\\n\\nThe prior gap is fixed. `G.dev.update` no longer treats `input.repeat` as a boolean. One `ArrowUp` or `Pad12` press decrements the slider index a single time (`game/ui.js:273-278`), and the same lines are in the inlined `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108.html` (around 19610).\\n\\nThe rules test boots the real game, opens Dev Mode, presses each code once through `input.press` plus `advance`, and requires the index to change by exactly 1 (`tests/run.mjs:334-345`). A second step on the same press would fail that assertion.\\n\\nCaptured `tests-all.log` is newer than `game/ui.js`, `tests/run.mjs`, and the inlined HTML, and records `19 passed, 0 failed`, including `OK dev sliders`.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-3-skeptic-2.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-3-skeptic-2.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/tmp/grok-goal-0c0bba67d95a/goal-classifier-0c0bba67d95a-3-skeptic-2.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic 2 — prior gap fixed\\n\\nThe prior gap is fixed. `G.dev.update` no longer treats `input.repeat` as a boolean. One `ArrowUp` or `Pad12` press decrements the slider index a single time (`game/ui.js:273-278`), and the same lines are in the inlined `Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108.html` (around 19610).\\n\\nThe rules test boots the real game, opens Dev Mode, presses each code once through `input.press` plus `advance`, and requires the index to change by exactly 1 (`tests/run.mjs:334-345`). A second step on the same press would fail that assertion.\\n\\nCaptured `tests-all.log` is newer than `game/ui.js`, `tests/run.mjs`, and the inlined HTML, and records `19 passed, 0 failed`, including `OK dev sliders`.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"fb7e163c-65b4-47ee-abd0-e3a00497237e"}
