{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_786","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"ui.js and run.mjs were modified at 09:29:21 UTC.\n\nSuite progress and the all-run completed eight seconds after the code change. The HTML rebuild at 09:30:24 UTC occurred during that run, likely from a build step triggered by the browser tests.\n\nThe HTML contains the fix. The test passed after the source change. The test itself is being re-examined for potential theatricality.\n\nThe test is honest. It presses real input keys through the game loop and asserts the dev menu index advances by exactly one step. A stray double-decrement would produce a two-step jump and fail the assertion.\n\nThe test passed, so `G.dev.update` must execute on the title scene. The index is only assigned in ui.js, ruling out world.js as the source of the stray decrement.\n\nThe test presses a key and advances the game loop, then releases it and advances again. If the release also triggered a step, the total movement would be two instead of one. The fact that the assertion passed confirms this double-step is not happening.\n\nThe prior gap is genuinely fixed. The focus should remain on verifying that each prior gap is truly resolved, rather than raising new objections or nitpicks.\n\nA quick scan of the fix for remaining defects is underway. The current focus is a potential edge case where `input.pressed('up')` might fire for multiple keys simultaneously, such as both KeyW and ArrowUp, which could cause unexpected behavior.\n\nThe PadAxisUp edge case is being examined. The old code likely decremented unconditionally on every input.repeat, which would explain why the slider moved even when only a pad axis was held.\n\nThe new code requires both held ArrowUp or Pad12 and pressed('up'). KeyW would not trigger the slider. The test only covers ArrowUp and Pad12. WASD is likely excluded intentionally because the game stays live.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6db9d4dc-8c9a-4c0b-8e1b-63ff95edeb51-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/ui.js","offset":140,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6db9d4dc-8c9a-4c0b-8e1b-63ff95edeb51-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/game/world.js","offset":1140,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6db9d4dc-8c9a-4c0b-8e1b-63ff95edeb51-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pressed\\(a\\)|press\\(code\\)|held\\.add|this\\.held","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-220108__x61bd7e/work/Spine Wee-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-220108/engine/my-3d2dge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1548,"output_tokens":1703,"cache_read_input_tokens":51968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa15-0d43-7de2-87b2-754e4acb611c","uuid":"a5248c40-32f4-4e1f-ab30-502da99a4f06"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6db9d4dc-8c9a-4c0b-8e1b-63ff95edeb51-21","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"140→        const t = trail[i];\\n        E.px.disc(g, cx + t.x * rad, cy - t.y * rad, 1, 'rgba(44,198,230,' + (i / trail.length) + ')');\\n      }\\n      const px = cx + bal.px * rad, py = cy - bal.py * rad;\\n      E.px.disc(g, px, py, 3, '#ff7a59');\\n      E.px.disc(g, px, py, 1.4, '#ffffff');\\n      if (o.trace && G.dev && G.dev.panel) text(g, bal.px.toFixed(2) + ',' + bal.py.toFixed(2), cx - 20, cy + rad + 2, '#20404c', 1);\\n    });\\n  };\\n  G.drawStars = function (g, x, y, n) {\\n150→    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) text(g, i < n ? '★' : '·', x + i * 12, y, i < n ? '#14a8c8' : '#5f7f8a', 2);\\n  };\\n  G.DEV_DEFAULTS = {\\n    k: 1, c: 1, s: 1, A: 1, nf: 1, ring: 1, push: 1, stumble: 1, reach: .33, nudge: 2.2,\\n    star1: .35, star2: .65, star3: .90, repTol: .08, rhythm: 1, fatigue: 1.5,\\n    hoopLo: 7, hoopHi: 11, jogLo: 2.6, jogHi: 3.4, jogSpeed: 1,\\n    skiSpeed: 220, skiTurn: 1.6, trayG: 420, trayFric: 3, ropeS: 16, gust: 9,\\n    timeScale: 1, minutesMul: 1\\n  };\\n  const DEV_HELP = {\\n160→    k: 'spring', c: 'damping', s: 'instability', A: 'noise', nf: 'noise rate', ring: 'ring scale', push: 'push', stumble: 'stumble at',\\n    reach: 'mouse reach', nudge: 'nudge rate', star1: '1 star', star2: '2 stars', star3: '3 stars', repTol: 'rep tolerance',\\n    rhythm: 'window scale', fatigue: 'fatigue', hoopLo: 'hoop low', hoopHi: 'hoop high', jogLo: 'jog low', jogHi: 'jog high',\\n    jogSpeed: 'jog speed', skiSpeed: 'ski speed', skiTurn: 'ski turn', trayG: 'tray gravity', trayFric: 'tray friction',\\n    ropeS: 'rope instability', gust: 'gust', timeScale: 'time scale', minutesMul: 'minutes'\\n  };\\n  function copyDev(src) { const o = {}; for (const k in src) o[k] = src[k]; return o; }\\n  G.dev = {\\n    on: false, panel: false, v: copyDev(G.DEV_DEFAULTS), i: 0, keys: Object.keys(G.DEV_DEFAULTS),\\n    tool: 0, pose: 'stork', poseI: 0, poseT: 0, poseMode: false, printed: '', frame: false, bot: null, trace: false, noStumble: false,\\n170→    open() {\\n      this.panel = true; this.on = true;\\n      if (G.game) { G.game.live = true; if (G.game.paused) G.game.resume(); }\\n    },\\n    close() { this.panel = false; this.on = false; if (G.game && !G.inSession) G.game.live = false; },\\n    adjust(key, delta) {\\n      if (!(key in this.v)) return;\\n      const d = G.DEV_DEFAULTS[key];\\n      const step = Math.abs(d) > 20 ? Math.abs(d) * 0.05 : Math.abs(d) > 2 ? 0.1 : d > 0.2 ? 0.05 : 0.01;\\n      this.v[key] = Math.round((this.v[key] + delta * (step || 0.05)) * 1000) / 1000;\\n180→      if (key === 'timeScale' && G.game) G.game.timeScale = this.v.timeScale;\\n    },\\n    reset() {\\n      this.v = copyDev(G.DEV_DEFAULTS);\\n      if (G.game) G.game.timeScale = 1;\\n    },\\n    jump(o) {\\n      o = o || {};\\n      if (!G.game) return;\\n      if (o.day) { G.profile.day = o.day; G.profile.sessions = 0; }\\n190→      if (o.activity) G.game.go('play', { id: o.activity, tier: o.tier || 1, trial: true, driver: o.driver || null, skipToPlay: true }, { fade: 0 });\\n      else if (o.scene) G.game.go(o.scene, o.data || {}, { fade: 0 });\\n    },\\n    jumpMode: false, jumpRow: 0, jumpDay: 1, jumpSceneI: 0, jumpActI: 0, jumpTier: 1,\\n    jumpScenes: ['bungalow', 'island', 'title', 'plate', 'bed', 'ending'],\\n    jumpActs: ['', 'stork', 'candle', 'squat', 'step', 'hoop', 'sun', 'push', 'lunge', 'jog', 'slalom', 'tray', 'laundry']\\n  };\\n  const TOOLS = ['Finish 3 stars', 'Finish 1 star', 'Unlock all', '+10 minutes', 'Spine Age 40', 'Reset member', 'Bot: good', 'Bot: off', 'Trace', 'Frame step', 'Force attract', 'Pose viewer', 'Log snapshot', 'Jump'];\\n  G.dev.tools = TOOLS;\\n  G.dev.clipNames = function () {\\n200→    const lib = G.lib && G.lib();\\n    if (lib && lib.names && lib.names.length) return lib.names;\\n